window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1101,"title":"Chapter 1101 The Federation Goes Crazy for the Divinity Nourishment Pills","paragraphs":["1101 The Federation Goes Crazy for the Divinity Nourishment Pills","It was not impossible to deal with the existence of a Core Stage expert, but it was difficult for the Federation to do anything to them now.","At this time, Chu Yunfan could already confirm that the mastermind behind the scenes was probably the person known as “lord” in the Divine Servant organization.","It was no wonder that even a master at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage had to submit to this person. Compared to the Divine Abilities Stage, the strength of the Core Stage was overwhelming. It was similar to the difference between the Innate Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage, or even greater.","However, Chu Yunfan could also deduce that this lord probably couldn’t wait to come out and stir up trouble as soon as he broke through to the Core Stage.","The reason was simple. If he had been in the Core Stage since the beginning, he would have come out a long time ago based on his way of doing things.","It was because of this that Chu Yunfan said that there was still a way. If it was a veteran Core Stage expert, then it would really be a big problem.","But he needed time.","Chu Yunfan immediately felt a sense of urgency after hearing about this lord. He returned with Great Ancestor Chu and the others. However, he did not return to Maple Leaf City but went straight back to Kunlun City.","The Federation was in a state of panic. In fact, ever since they had entered the Kunlun Realm, there had not been a day when the Federation had not been in a state of panic. After all, there were endless monsters outside the base cities. It meant that the Federation was surrounded by endless monsters.","If they were not careful, they would be annihilated by the monsters.","Under such circumstances, the Federation felt a sense of anxiety, and now that anxiety had turned into reality.","On the Internet, some people denounced the Federation Government’s inhumane methods. Some worried that city after city would be conquered in the future, and they hoped that the Federation Government could come up with a better solution.","For a time, it could be said that demons were dancing wildly and discussions were everywhere.","As for the higher-ups of the Federation, the real sensation came from the news that Chu Yunfan had released. He could make a pill called the Divinity Nourishment Pill, and the only use of this pill was to help people enter the Divine Abilities Stage.","This pill required the inner core of a Divine monster as the main ingredient, and Chu Yunfan had more than two hundred of them, which meant that he could make more than two hundred Divinity Nourishment Pills.","However, even though there were many pills, they paled in comparison to the many peak Innates of the Federation. The price of each pill was 20 billion Federation dollars, but the premise was that they had to collect the supplementary ingredients of the Divinity Nourishment Pill themselves.","Chu Yunfan was only responsible for providing the inner cores of Divine monsters and making the pill. He was not responsible for anything else.","As soon as the news came out, it immediately caused a stir among the higher-ups of the Federation. There were not many Divines in the Federation. However, in fact, the number of experts stuck at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage was ten times. Or even a hundred times more.","Not to mention the Innates. The number of Innates was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","The price of 20 billion for one pill was definitely not cheap, not to mention that they were responsible for the collection of supplementary herbs. It was enough to make a lone Innate go bankrupt.","However, there were still countless people who went crazy, because a mere 20 billion paled in comparison to the benefits they could reap after breaking into the Divine Abilities Stage.","It could even be said that it was not worth mentioning at all.","Moreover, in the past, they couldn’t even buy the opportunity to enter the Divine Abilities Stage with money. But now, Chu Yunfan was providing such an opportunity. It was easy to imagine what kind of commotion this caused.","Everyone went crazy. After Chu Yunfan announced the list of supplementary herbs, the prices of these herbs skyrocketed at an alarming rate. Many Divines who were not as wealthy could not afford them. They could only look down at the list and sigh.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about this. What he wanted was for the strength of the Federation to increase rapidly, but he didn’t care who among these people would be able to step into the Divine Abilities Stage.","In fact, not many lone wolves could afford that much money.","This was also why his instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, had said that he owed him a huge favor.","Just the purchase of the supplementary herbs had made Jeang Yuanbin go bankrupt, not to mention the price of a Divine monster’s inner core. There was also the fee that they had to pay to Chu Yunfan, which made many people flinch.","Chu Yunfan had caused such a big commotion that it naturally alerted the higher-ups of the Federation. His grandfather, Yang Feiyang, did not even recuperate from his injuries and immediately took a plane to Kunlun City to find Chu Yunfan.","“Yunfan, what are you trying to do? Do you want the Federation to be flooded with Divines?” Yang Feiyang immediately asked.","For the Federation Government, Divines were unruly existences and were extremely difficult to control. Chu Yunfan wanted to create more than two hundred Divines in one go. Many of the higher-ups of the Federation went crazy, but even more, the people were going crazy.","If the Federation had more than 200 Divines in the future, how were they going to manage them? With the addition of more than 200 Divines from the Holy Land, it would make the Federation even more difficult to manage.","“That’s right, Grandpa. You’ve seen the current situation. Facing the double attack of the marine folks and the demons, the Federation has too few human experts. Although the Holy Land has integrated into the Federation, they’re not as reliable as our own people, right?” Chu Yunfan said, “Besides, I didn’t say that only outsiders can buy it. In fact, the Federation Government and the Federation Army can buy it too, can’t they?”","Chu Yunfan’s real big customers were still the Federation Government and the Federation Army.","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately made Yang Feiyang’s eyes light up. That’s right, they can also buy it. Why can only outsiders buy it? Compared with the financial resources of the Federation Government and the Federation Army, even the behemoths like the Chu clan outside were far inferior.","This was actually a good thing for them. The Federation Government and the Federation Army could use this opportunity to cultivate a large number of their own masters. By then, they wouldn’t have to be afraid of those Divines.","Bringing Divines under the Federation’s control was one of the Federation’s greatest ambitions. It was just that they didn’t dare to think about it in the past. After all, it was already very difficult to rope in just that limited number of Divines, not to mention controlling these experts.","And now, Chu Yunfan was giving them such an opportunity.","“You’re right. I’ll order 100—no, 200 pills on behalf of the Federation Army,” Yang Feiyang said heroically."]},{"number":1102,"title":"Chapter 1102 Secluded Cultivation, Race Against Time","paragraphs":["1102 Secluded Cultivation, Race Against Time","“That won’t do.” Chu Yunfan refused.","Chu Yunfan understood that the Federation Government needed a strong power to control the overall situation, but if the power of the Federation Government was too strong, it would not be a good thing.","“I’ll give 50 pills to the Federation Government and 50 to the Federation Army,” Chu Yunfan said.","“All right.”","!!","Yang Feiyang thought for a moment. He could see that Chu Yunfan was determined, but to be able to get 50 of the pills would prove a fundamental improvement in the strength of the Federation Army.","To the Federation Government and Federation Army, occupying half of the 200 Divinity Nourishment Pills was already an unprecedented good situation.","It should be known that the Divines working for the Federation Government was less than half of the Divines in the Federation. Not even one-third.","Chu Yunfan had more than two hundred monster cores in his possession. Now, it was decided that he would give half of them to the Federation Army and the Federation Government. The rest would be distributed to the various forces that were known throughout the Federation.","Among these forces, the lowest was to spend all their efforts to buy one, and the highest was the Chu clan and the Tang clan, who spent all their efforts to buy ten. All parties had suffered great losses and even sold a lot of their properties at a cheap price to gain so much cash.","The Huangfu and Li clans also bought a few pills each, and the major forces of the Holy Land joined forces to buy a few dozen. Although they only took up about a quarter of the total, they were already very satisfied and had nothing to say.","Basically, all parties were happy, and the funds from all parties were quickly transferred into Chu Yunfan’s account. He immediately exchanged most of the money for low-grade spirit stones.","Money was like floating clouds to Chu Yunfan. He worked so hard to earn money only for the sake of having enough for his cultivation.","In Chu Yunfan’s Mountain River Diagram, a divine tree was growing rapidly in the herb mountain. Countless roots grew out of the ground and pierced into the corpses of Divines that covered the mountain and plains, absorbing their essence.","At the same time, each of its branches was constantly absorbing the spirit energy from the sky. This energy was constantly being supplied by a large formation. The countless spirit stones that Chu Yunfan had bought were constantly being absorbed and turned into powder, drifting away with the wind.","The spirit energy within the spirit stones was absorbed by the Brahma Tree.","Chu Yunfan was racing against time. At the moment, he was already at the peak of tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage. If he wanted to break through to tier seven, it was just a matter of pushing the boat with the current.","However, what Chu Yunfan wanted to pursue was not a breakthrough in cultivation stage. Just breaking through to tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage under normal conditions would not have a fundamental increase in his combat power.","As long as his combat power was still locked in the Divine Abilities Stage, it would be meaningless for him to break through a few more tiers.","What Chu Yunfan wanted was to break through the Divine Abilities Stage and his combat strength would also break through to the Core Stage. It was impossible for ordinary people to do this because breaking through to the Core Stage was a breakthrough in all aspects. It was not only about condensing divine power into one point, but also reaching an incredible level of control.","His physical body had undergone earth-shaking changes, and Chu Yunfan was confident that the strength of his physical body was no less than that of a Core Stage expert. He could even destroy Divine magic weapons with ease.","He wanted to achieve a breakthrough in his divine power, and a quantitative change would lead to a qualitative change. All of his hopes were pinned on the Brahma Tree.","Tang Siyu had also consumed the Brahma Fruit that the tree had previously borne. Normally, it would take a very long time for a Brahma Fruit to grow. It took a tremendous amount of energy to grow.","But now, Chu Yunfan was using an unconventional method. With the herb mountain as the foundation and the corpses of the Divines as the nourishment, he had forcefully catalyzed the growth of a Brahma Fruit.","Although these Divines had died a long time ago, their bodies looked as if they had just died. Their energy had not dissipated, and they had now become nutrients for the Brahma Tree.","This was a very extreme method of nurturing heavenly treasures that Chu Yunfan found from the memories of the Alchemy Emperor. However, this method actually had some losses that outweighed the gains. If it was allowed to grow slowly, it would not need to consume so many resources. It might not even be one-third of the resources that Chu Yunfan was currently consuming.","In the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, this was also an unconventional method that could not be used frequently. However, Chu Yunfan couldn’t care less about that at this time. Compared to these resources, what he lacked the most was time.","The lord had already made his move, and three base cities had been taken down in one go. The initial count of casualties was over a hundred million. It had been many years since the Federation had suffered such a great loss.","Previously, even if a base city’s defense line was breached, it would usually be stopped after only a portion of it was captured.","But now, entire cities had fallen. The losses were so great that it was impossible to estimate.","Although there were many base cities in the Federation, with the speed of this lord’s attack, Chu Yunfan was afraid that it would not last long. So he had no other choice. For him, time was the most precious right now. It was worth it to exchange these resources for time.","However, Chu Yunfan was afraid that he would not have enough time.","Compared to when it had first fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands, the Brahma Tree had already grown a whole circle. Normally, it would take at least a hundred years to grow to this extent.","But now, he had done it in such a short time.","On the largest branch in the center of the Brahma Tree, a Brahma Fruit was slowly growing, emitting a faint fragrance.","‘Time. I just need a little bit of time. Just give me a little bit more time!’","Chu Yunfan’s heart was filled with desire. However, he knew that this matter could not be rushed.","All kinds of medicinal herbs from various families had already been sent over. They were sent over at lightning speed, afraid that they would be too slow and fall behind others, and the pills would be taken away by others first.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan began his long seclusion, crazily making the Divinity Nourishment Pills. Even with his strength, refining more than two hundred Divinity Nourishment Pills in one go was still a very deadly matter.","In the blink of an eye, more than a month had passed. During this period, many alchemy grandmasters of the Federation had personally come to find Chu Yunfan, hoping to be able to help. However, Chu Yunfan did not accept. He even rejected the Alchemy King’s personal visit.","Ordinary pills were fine, but these were Divinity Nourishment Pills. If one failed, it would mean the loss of a Divine. To the current Federation, this was a loss that they could not afford.","Even the legendary Alchemy King, who had always been elusive, had appeared."]},{"number":1103,"title":"Chapter 1103 The Alchemy King Is Convinced","paragraphs":["1103 The Alchemy King Is Convinced","Alchemy King was a middle-aged man who looked to be in his forties. He was dressed in simple clothes but had an air of authority.","Although the Alchemy King’s cultivation wasn’t the highest in the Federation, he had always been the leader of the Federation in the field of alchemy before Chu Yunfan’s appearance. He was the king of kings.","The arrival of the Alchemy King gave the alchemy grandmasters who had been rejected by Chu Yunfan a new pillar of support.","“Alchemy King, it’s great that you’re here. Chief Chu is too reckless. How can he make so many pills on his own? Since he has so many monster cores, he shouldn’t have kept them for himself. The Federation is in urgent need of a large number of combat forces now. How long will it take for him to make them all by himself?”","“That’s right, he’s too conceited. How long will it take him to make more than two hundred pills?”","“We were being kind and wanted to help him, but he rejected us!”","These alchemy grandmasters were all talking at the same time. Although Chu Yunfan’s cultivation of martial arts was unquestionable in the Federation, it was a different story when it came to alchemy.","Everyone only knew that Chu Yunfan had also done profound research on alchemy, but that was all. At most, he was on the same level as them.","In the field of alchemy, these alchemy grandmasters from all over the Federation were not afraid of Chu Yunfan.","These people had come to help out for both public and personal reasons. After all, the Federation was in a precarious situation right now. Whether it was the marine folks or the demons, both posed a fatal threat to the survival of the Federation.","The earlier the pills were finished, the more useful they would be for the improvement of the Federation’s strength.","However, they also had their own selfish motives. That was, a pill on the level of the Divinity Nourishment Pill was definitely not something that could be come into contact with normally.","If the alchemy grandmasters wanted to improve further and one day reach the level of the Alchemy King, they needed a lot of opportunities to practice. And the best opportunity was now right in front of them. Although Chu Yunfan had made Divinity Nourishment Pills before, the quantity was too small. How could it compare to this time, where there were more than two hundred of them in one go?","Everyone realized that their opportunity had come.","If they could successfully make this pill, not only would their exploration of alchemy have rapid progress, but more importantly, they would be able to form a good relationship with the owner of the pill, a future Divine.","For alchemy grandmasters, the number of experts they knew was of utmost importance. However, they couldn’t do anything when Chu Yunfan ignored them.","After all, although Chu Yunfan had the intention to promote the development of the Federation’s alchemy path, this matter was different. Although these alchemy grandmasters were prominent in front of the people, their success rate in making the Divinity Nourishment Pills was not high.","Chu Yunfan would feel extremely heartbroken to see such a high failure rate.","However, when they sought out Chu Yunfan, they were stopped at the door by Bai Wen, the current deputy chief of Special Ops.","“Alchemy King, it’s not that we don’t want to give way to you, but Chief Chu has explicitly said that he won’t see anyone,” Bai Wen said with some difficulty.","Regardless of whether it was the Alchemy King or the other alchemy grandmasters, they were all well-known existences in the Federation. Each of them had a wide circle of friends and couldn’t be offended. However, even if all of them were added together, they still didn’t have as much weight as Chu Yunfan’s words.","“Deputy Chief Bai, it’s not that we want to disturb Chief Chu. I believe that he is helping everyone to make the pills at this time out of good intentions. He wants to improve the strength of the Federation,” the Alchemy King said, “But he can’t do it alone. How long will it take him to make more than 200 pills?”","“That’s right, we want to help!”","“We’re doing this out of good intentions. How can Chief Chu handle all this by himself?”","“Time is of the essence right now. Do we still have time to be prejudiced against each other?”","At this point, Bai Wen could only say with a cold face, “Everyone, please return to your homes. Chief Chu has already said that he can make these pills alone and doesn’t need the help of others.”","“Impossible! How can he handle all of this by himself?”","The alchemy grandmasters didn’t believe it at all.","Suddenly, a man walked out of the alchemy room with a plate in his hand. On the plate were dozens of porcelain bottles, each containing a pill.","“Is the chief done?” Bai Wen quickly asked.","“Yes,” the person quickly replied, “The chief said that this is the first batch of thirty-six Divinity Nourishment Pills. There will be more sent out later. It is estimated that all the pills will be finished within a month.”","“That’s good. Quickly send the pills to the various parties,” Bai Wen instructed.","The representatives of the forces who were waiting outside quickly surrounded the person and asked if they had a share of the first batch of 36 pills.","As for those alchemy grandmasters, they were completely dumbfounded. They had previously said that Chu Yunfan couldn’t make so many pills by himself, but now, in just a few days, Chu Yunfan had already made thirty-six Divinity Nourishment Pills.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan didn’t mention anything about a wastage rate, which meant that all of the pills he made were successful without a single failure.","At this time, they felt a burning pain on their faces. They realized that they had underestimated Chu Yunfan. The laws of alchemy that they knew couldn’t be applied to Chu Yunfan.","If it was them, they could only make one pill at a time and couldn’t guarantee a high success rate. But Chu Yunfan could make thirty-six pills in one go and could guarantee a 100% success rate. This simply subverted their world view.","It was a ruthless slap to their faces. They were so-called grandmasters of alchemy, and they didn’t live up to their names.","However, the one who was really affected was the Alchemy King. He was always out looking for precious herbs and rarely came back. He didn’t feel much about Chu Yunfan’s rapid rise in the past few years.","He thought that even if Chu Yunfan was the number one martial artist in the Federation, Chu Yunfan would still have to respect him in the field of alchemy.","It was because of this thought that he had rushed over, but reality had given him a tight slap.","His so-called number-one alchemist of the Federation was just a frog at the bottom of a well. Even with his alchemy skills that were improving day by day, he didn’t dare to say that he could have a 100% success rate in refining the Divinity Nourishment Pill, let alone refining 36 in one go. That was simply a fantasy.","“Forget it, forget it. I’ve underestimated the people of this world. Since Chief Chu can handle it alone, I’ll take my leave.”","In the end, the Alchemy King could only turn around and leave. If even the Alchemy King was like this, then there was no need to mention the others. All of a sudden, they no longer had any other thoughts, and could only sigh at Chu Yunfan’s monstrous talent.","Chu Yunfan’s martial arts and alchemy skills had both reached an unprecedented and unparalleled level."]},{"number":1104,"title":"Chapter 1104 The President Returns","paragraphs":["1104 The President Returns","Chu Yunfan naturally didn’t know that the thirty-six Divinity Nourishment Pills he produced in one go had shocked those alchemy grandmasters and even the Alchemy King.","To him, this wasn’t his best effort. Back then, when he was refining the pill for his instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, it could be said that he had done his best and spent a long time to make it.","However, things were different now. His cultivation level had undergone a tremendous change from before. He could even cultivate a kind of alchemic fire, which was a special technique of alchemists.","Many heavenly treasures were treasures that contained the essence of nature, and ordinary flames would not be able to burn them.","!!","At this time, it was necessary to use the alchemy fire that alchemists specially cultivated to make these pills. With the alchemic fire, many parts that required a lot of time to slowly boil with the fire could save a lot of time.","Therefore, an alchemy expert must also be a martial arts expert. If an alchemy expert’s martial arts cultivation was too weak, it would be impossible for him to produce this alchemic fire, which was extremely important to an alchemist.","This was also the reason why Chu Yunfan was able to refine thirty-six Divinity Nourishment Pills in a few days. But his cultivation was still not enough. If he was an Alchemy Emperor, he could refine tens of thousands of pills like the Divinity Nourishment Pills in one sitting, truly achieving mass production.","That kind of grand occasion was simply not something that these alchemy grandmasters could imagine. From the beginning, the two sides were not on the same level. Chu Yunfan’s starting point was the end-point that many people looked up to but could not reach.","To him, this wasn’t a big deal. Although 200 over Divinity Nourishment Pills seemed like a lot, he could easily deal with it. The only thing he lacked was time.","In the beginning, the various forces were afraid that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be able to handle so many cultivation pills without divine powers. After all, many forces could be said to have gone bankrupt. Just by borrowing a large amount of money from the bank, they were all betting on Chu Yunfan’s success.","Once Chu Yunfan failed, it might just be a light sentence to him, but to them, it would be the end of their family, with no possibility of turning things around.","Fortunately, as furnace after furnace of pills came out, thirty-six pills were produced each time. Only then did they all let out a sigh of relief. Chu Yunfan really had complete confidence. The experts looked at the skill, while the outsiders watched the fun. Those alchemy grandmasters were all shocked by Chu Yunfan’s amazing accuracy.","Ordinary people didn’t understand how difficult it was. They only felt that Chu Yunfan was indeed worthy of being the number one person in the Federation, and he didn’t let them down on this matter.","In the blink of an eye, a month had passed. Chu Yunfan had also successfully refined the two hundred Divinity Nourishment Pills he promised.","The Federation’s higher-ups were in an uproar. Chu Yunfan had succeeded, which meant that the Federation was really going to gain about two hundred Divines in one go.","In addition to the experts from the Holy Land and the original experts from the Federation, the number of Divines in the Federation would probably exceed 500. It could be said to be an unprecedented Golden Age.","The Federation had never been so powerful before. It seemed like it was about to enter an all-out situation.","Even though three cities had been taken down and hundreds of millions of people had died, the confidence of the higher-ups of the Federation was greatly boosted by Chu Yunfan’s good news.","At least, it didn’t look like a fallen nation.","In the Federation, Chu Yunfan’s voice was getting louder and louder, especially now that the president had disappeared for so many years, the Federation had always been at a stage of being without a leader.","Besides the original president, there was no one else in the Federation who could completely convince the people. It wasn’t until Chu Yunfan’s appearance that they finally had a candidate that people would be convinced of.","However, just as the noise was about to rise, an unexpected piece of news came.","The president had returned.","The president, who had disappeared for several years, had suddenly reappeared. Another famous Divine of the Federation, Jeang Yuanbin, had returned with him.","As soon as the news came out, the Federation was in an uproar, especially when three base cities had been destroyed by the demons and the marine folks. This news had greatly roused the hearts of the Federation.","“What? The president is back?”","Many people couldn’t believe it. In fact, in the years that the president had disappeared, people had already assumed that he had been killed. Otherwise, why would he have made it back and not even have a single piece of news?","The president’s return was beyond everyone’s expectations.","However, for the ordinary people of the Federation, his return could be said to be good news.","“Now that Mighty Chu is here and the president has returned, the Federation can be said to be unprecedentedly powerful!”","“A month ago, we were a destroyed country. Now, it seems that it’s a blessing and a curse!”","The ordinary people of the Federation were extremely excited, and Chu Yunfan also received the news at the first moment. He ended his seclusion and rushed to the capital city.","Over the years, he had asked Special Ops to pay attention to any news about Jeang Yuanbin, but there had been no news. He had lost all hope. In that situation, the chances of Jeang Yuanbin surviving were too small.","In particular, Chu Yunfan had just truly come to understand the strength of the Divine Servant organization. Not to mention the mysterious so-called lord, even the Divine Servants were extraordinary. Except for the Seventh Divine Servant, any one of them was far stronger than Jeang Yuanbin, who had just stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage at that time.","Jeang Yuanbin’s chances of escaping from the pursuit of the Divine Servant organization were too low.","Who would have thought that his instructor would return with the president?","With Chu Yunfan’s status, he was quickly granted permission to see the president and Jeang Yuanbin.","In the back garden of the capital city’s presidential palace, Chu Yunfan, the president, and Jeang Yuanbin were sitting opposite each other, looking very relaxed.","“Hahahaha, Jeang Yuanbin, you’ve got a good eye for disciples!” The president laughed out loud, his voice bright and clear.","Only then did Chu Yunfan have the time to carefully look at the president.","He was a little different from the images Chu Yunfan had seen on television. In reality, the president was tall and straight and had the air of a soldier, but he was very kind and didn’t put on any airs.","“Chu Yunfan is my first batch of students, and he’s also the most powerful,” Jeang Yuanbin said in relief as he looked at Chu Yunfan. After he came back, he heard about Chu Yunfan’s affairs.","Chu Yunfan had become a legend within the Federation."]},{"number":1105,"title":"Chapter 1105 The President’s Secret","paragraphs":["1105 The President’s Secret","Jeang Yuanbin only found out about Chu Yunfan’s deeds after he returned. In the years that he was away, Chu Yunfan had grown at an astonishing speed. While the president was not around, he became known as the number one expert of the Federation.","This was not something that could be compared with just stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage. In fact, there were so many Divines, but there were only a few who could be called the best.","There were only two people who could convince the Federation. One was the president, and the other was Chu Yunfan.","As an instructor, Jeang Yuanbin had no more regrets in his life for being able to teach such a student. He had no greater ambition.","!!","“President, you’re too kind,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","In his opinion, although the president had hidden his cultivation very well, the president could not hide it from him.","The president was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. This was completely different from Chu Yunfan’s previous guess. Based on the strength of the Divines of the Federation in the past, he had estimated that the president’s cultivation was only at tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage at most. To be able to reach that level, the president was very impressive.","Now, Chu Yunfan realized that all his previous predictions and estimations were wrong. The president’s cultivation was far beyond his imagination.","He immediately felt that it was inconceivable. Unless one had obtained an incredible inheritance like Chu Yunfan, under normal circumstances, no matter how strong a person was, it was difficult to completely transcend this stage and the limitations of this group.","The martial arts of the Federation, which had only been developed for a few hundred years, were indeed limited. One could see this just by looking at Great Ancestor Chu and the others. Even Chu Yunfan had not exceeded this limit.","However, the president was completely different.","Chu Yunfan recalled the information about the president. Compared to others, the president’s reappearance was very sudden. It could even be said that he had appeared out of thin air.","Ever since the president stepped out of the Dao, he was already very strong. It didn’t take long for the president to become a master in the Divine Abilities Stage. Later on, he advanced by leaps and bounds, defeating many masters and becoming the number one master of the Federation.","Later on, he even became the Federation’s president. After becoming the president, it was the beginning of his legendary life. Before him, there had never been a president who was so powerful.","Not long ago, the Federation’s previous president had been targeted and successfully assassinated.","In that era, it was not impossible for the president to be a Divine, but he was still assassinated. However, when this current president took over, the situation was completely reversed.","He would fight whoever he wanted to fight. In his post, he sorted out the internal and external conflicts of the Federation and evaluated the conflicts between all parties.","All these methods were almost the same as Chu Yunfan’s recent methods of sorting out the internal and external contradictions of the Federation. He would beat up whoever was not convinced, and once they were, everything would be fine.","However, this policy required one to have an extremely strong cultivation base. And from the looks of it, the president indeed had such strength.","A master at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage was indeed at the top of the world. Judging from the strength of the masters inside and outside the Federation at that time, there was indeed no master who could compete with the president.","In this case, there was an explanation for the president’s power. With his strength, there was no need for him to pretend to be nice to the villains inside and outside the Federation. Just like Chu Yunfan, he would not pretend to be nice to these villains. His usual strategy was to kill whoever jumped out.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know how the president had cultivated to this level, but it was clear that there was something unknown behind it.","“I’m not overpraising you. Tsk, tsk. I didn’t expect that you would grow to this extent one day,” the president lamented, “Although you haven’t reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, in terms of combat power, I’m afraid that ordinary peak Divines are no match for you.”","Chu Yunfan simply smiled and did not deny it.","“I have a question. Mr. Jeang, why are you with the president?” Chu Yunfan asked straightforwardly.","Jeang Yuanbin said, “When I was being hunted down, it was the president who saved me. If it wasn’t for him, I’m afraid I would have died long ago. In fact, there hasn’t been any news from us in the past few years because we were busy.”","Chu Yunfan suddenly realized that his instructor had been saved by the president. Looking at his shoulder, he saw that Jeang Yuanbin’s arm which had been cut off had been cloned and replaced with biotechnology.","Compared to the other arm, Chu Yunfan could sense that the energy level was much lower in the biomechanical arm.”","“That’s right. We’ve been hunting down an extremely dangerous person all these years,” the president said with a serious expression. “To be more precise, we both want to kill each other, but we just haven’t found the opportunity.”","“Is it the man who calls himself ‘God?’” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s right, it’s him. I didn’t expect you to know,” the president said in surprise.","Chu Yunfan immediately told them about the few times he had fought with the Divine Servant organization in the past few years.","“Hahaha, well done!” The president clapped his hands and laughed. “I’m sure you’ve made him very angry. Those Divine Servants were personally selected by him. They were extremely talented people who were trained for many years. And you killed them just like that. That old man is definitely going to jump up! You’ve done well.”","Chu Yunfan smiled. He finally understood why the Divine Servant organization had only been looking for trouble with him in the past few years, instead of taking revenge as he had expected.","After all, with the Divine Servant organization’s current strength, it would have been almost effortless to destroy him at that time. However, the Divine Servant organization did not make a move.","Chu Yunfan also didn’t believe that they were soft-hearted, and judging from the ruthlessness of the Divine Servant organization, it was definitely not the case.","Now he understood that the Divine Servant organization had been entangled with the president. No wonder they had no time to deal with him.","However, the other party must not have expected that he would be able to grow to this extent in just a few years.","Jeang Yuanbin, who was standing at the side, also looked at Chu Yunfan in amazement. He had fought with the Divine Servant organization more than once with the president, so he naturally understood how terrifying those Divine Servants were. But now, those Divine Servants had fallen at Chu Yunfan’s hands one after another.","His disciple’s achievements were far from what the rumors were saying.","“However, it doesn’t matter how many Divine Servants I’ve killed. I was still taken advantage of by that so-called God. This self-proclaimed god has already entered the Core Stage. In this world, it’s not impossible to call himself a god.” Chu Yunfan sighed."]},{"number":1106,"title":"Chapter 1106 The President’s and the God’s Origin","paragraphs":["1106 The President’s and the God’s Origin","For the Divine Servant, it was useless no matter how many people Chu Yunfan killed. If he couldn’t kill the God, then everything would be meaningless.","This was because the God could promote a few more Divine Servants at any time, and the most important one was still the God himself.","With Core Stage strength, he was invincible in this world. It was not impossible for him to call himself a God. At least, they could not fight against him.","“That’s right. The real key is that old man.” The president nodded with a serious expression. “And I’ve returned to get rid of him!”","He then muttered, “I’ll personally deal with the trouble I’ve caused.”","Chu Yunfan sighed. Although the president had disappeared for several years, he had also held back the God for the Federation for several years. If the God had suddenly launched an attack a few years ago, Chu Yunfan would probably not have had any hope at all.","“Sir, you can deal with the God?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up.","“I’m trying my best. Before I came back, I was worried about the future of the Federation. Now that I see such an outstanding junior like you, I’m relieved.” The president sighed.","“Sir, did you just say that the God is related to you?” Chu Yunfan recalled what the president had just said.","The president nodded. “Now that things have come to this, there’s nothing to hide. I’ll quickly tell you what happened.”","Chu Yunfan could feel that in the president’s eyes, he had already been called a successor in some sense, so some secrets that were originally not wanted to be announced to the public were now willing to be announced to him.","“The truth is, the God and I are not from Kunlun Realm.” The president calmly announced this shocking news. “He and I both came from the Spirit Realm. I was still young at that time, and I accidentally found a teleportation array that had been sealed for many years. I modified it into a reverse teleportation array and was sent to the Kunlun Realm. That old man also came with me.","“He and I were sworn enemies back in the Spirit Realm. Now, our feud has extended to the Kunlun Realm. I’ve fought him many times over the years. I learned about him a few years ago and went hunting him down. I then fell into his trap and was trapped,” the president continued. “I’ve been looking for him since then, but he stepped into the Core Stage before me.”","Suddenly, the president looked at Chu Yunfan with a faint smile and said, “There aren’t many people in the Kunlun Realm who know about the Core Stage. It seems that you’ve had your own fortuitous encounter.”","However, the president had no intention of asking further, because everyone had their secrets. To be able to enter the Divine Abilities Stage, everyone had to have many adventures.","“It’s because he’s the trouble that I’ve caused that I have to solve this problem. Although the Federation isn’t my real home, I’ve been the Federation’s president all these years. In my eyes, the Federation is my home. That old man wants to destroy the Federation. Even if I die, I’ll stop him!”","The president gritted his teeth, but his will was firm. His eyes flashed with the desire to kill.","“I was worried about the Federation’s future, but now that you, Chu Haoyue, and Tang Siyu have all grown up to be amazing, I can finally relax.”","“Sir, it’s not that I don’t have a way to deal with the God, but I need time. Just give me a little more time and I’ll have a way to fight him!” Chu Yunfan said.","The president looked at Chu Yunfan and there was a hint of surprise in his eyes.","“If that’s the case, that’s great!” Jeang Yuanbin said hurriedly.","When the president told him the secret, he didn’t exclude Jeang Yuanbin. Obviously, he regarded him as a complete confidant.","“By the way, sir, what kind of place is the Spirit Realm?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Chu Yunfan was different from ordinary people. After obtaining the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he knew that the planes in this world were far from just the Kunlun Realm. In the era when the Ancient Zenith Civilization was at its most prosperous, the Kunlun Realm was once used as the core to conquer all the realms.","The president paused and said, “It’s a long story, but at your level, you should be able to come into contact with some of the secrets behind the destruction of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, right? And in these secrets, there’s always a word mentioned—ascension.”","“Yes, I know all of it, but could the so-called world ascension mentioned in those ancient books be true?” Chu Yunfan said in surprise. It might not be too difficult for a person to ascend after breaking through the limit. However, it was an extremely terrifying thing for an entire civilization to ascend. It was not something that the current Federation could imagine.","“Because it’s been too long, I don’t know what exactly happened that year. But I can tell you that it did happen.” The president looked at Chu Yunfan and nodded with a serious expression. “But clearly, it failed. At least, as far as I know, they didn’t succeed. The Spirit Realm was born at that time. I accidentally found an ancient teleportation array in the Spirit Realm and reversed it. That’s how I came to the Kunlun Realm. I’m sure there must be some connection between the Kunlun Realm and the Spirit Realm.”","Chu Yunfan nodded after hearing this. The shock in his heart was indescribable. The worldwide ascension actually happened back then. Although he didn’t know why it had failed in the end, there was no doubt that this was an amazing feat. It was because he had seen the grand occasion of the Ancient Zenith Civilization from the memories of the Alchemy Emperor that he felt that it was simply unbelievable.","On the contrary, Jeang Yuanbin, who was standing at the side, didn’t think much of it. He only had a concept of the so-called world ascension, but he didn’t know the specifics.","“Is the teleportation array still there?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That teleportation array was broken after we came here. It was not very stable to begin with. After I modified it into a reverse teleportation array, it was broken.” The president shook his head. “However, from what I know, that old god has been repairing it all these years. I think he wants to return to the Spirit Realm.”","The president thought for a moment, then looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “This teleportation array is on an island in the depths of the Infinite Sea. I think it’s very important to you.”"]},{"number":1107,"title":"Chapter 1107 The Ambition to Cut off the God","paragraphs":["1107 The Ambition to Cut off the God","“You can’t raise a true dragon in water. With your cultivation, you’re already at the top of the world. If you continue to cultivate, you might be able to enter the Core Stage one day, but that doesn’t suit you,” the president continued, “Ever since I came back, I’ve learned a lot about you. In terms of talent and inheritance, you’re probably the type that I’ve never seen before. Even I couldn’t compare to you when I was your age.”","The president spoke frankly. He knew that Chu Yunfan must have inherited an extraordinary legacy, which was why he had undergone such a tremendous change in his third year of high school. But that was not important. What was important was that Chu Yunfan had displayed such amazing talent.","“That’s why I’ve determined that the Spirit Realm is the most suitable place for you to develop,” the president said with a sigh.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He was very excited when the president told him about the Spirit Realm. He already felt that the Kunlun Realm was not big enough for him. Here, even Core Stage experts were invincible.","!!","Perhaps in a few hundred or a thousand years, this place would recapture the glory of the Ancient Zenith Civilization, but for Chu Yunfan, that time was too long—so long that he couldn’t wait.","The Spirit Realm would undoubtedly provide Chu Yunfan with an even bigger stage, allowing him to go one step further and follow in the footsteps of his predecessors.","He had thought that he would be able to find out about the worldwide ascension from the president, but it was obvious that the president did not know about it either. The ascension had happened too long ago, and when the president was still in the Spirit Realm, he was still young and not even in the Divine Abilities Stage. How could he have come into contact with such secrets?","As for the secret of the ascension, Chu Yunfan had to personally go to the Spirit Realm to explore it.","“Yunfan, I’ve made my decision. I’m going to call for a Divine Conference and summon all the Divines from the Holy Land and the Kunlun Realm,” the president said.","“What?” Chu Yunfan was shocked. “Sir, I’m afraid that the God won’t let go of this opportunity so easily.”","The president wanted to call for a Divine Conference using his name and gather the Divines from all over the Federation. This was also a great opportunity for the demons and the marine folks. It was a chance to capture all the experts from all over the Federation in one fell swoop.","If Chu Yunfan was that so-called God, he probably wouldn’t let go of this great opportunity. If the God had the intention to unify the Kunlun Realm, this was the best opportunity.","This was because he had overwhelming power. Divines were nothing in front of him. Capital City was the best place in the world, where many large-scale weapons could not be used, let alone nuclear bombs. They had to be extremely cautious.","Fighting in such a place was no different from tying one’s own hands and feet. From the previous battles in Binhai and the other two cities, Chu Yunfan could tell that the God had the ability to break through the city’s defenses. Although the defense of Capital City far surpassed that of Binhai City, Chu Yunfan was not confident that he could stop the God’s attack.","Without a doubt, it would be a dangerous moment.","“That’s right. I know that it will be a great opportunity for him. But for me, it’s also a great opportunity,” the president said, “Yunfan, do you know that a base city has a population of more than a hundred million or even two hundred million? Three base cities have been destroyed, and hundreds of millions of people have died in their sleep.","“I can’t wait for him to make his next move before I decide. Every time he does, hundreds of millions of people die or are injured. How many people in the Federation are to be tormented by him like this?","“I have to attract his attention. I understand his way of doing things. This attack is only the prelude. When he attacks again, it won’t be just three base cities. With his cultivation level, it’s very easy for him to do this,” the president said, “When that time comes, there might be a billion casualties. I can not let him have the chance to attack again. I will cut off his ambition here.”","Chu Yunfan could feel the president’s firm will, and even his determination even in the face of death.","“You said just now that you are confident, but you need time, right?” The president looked at Chu Yunfan. “I can help you buy time.”","Chu Yunfan understood that the president was planning to sacrifice himself to delay the God.","However, just as the president had said, someone had to slow him down. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable. A base city with a lost of hundreds of millions of people could not be allowed to happen again.","“Don’t worry. If I’m lucky, I can kill him without you. I’ve not wasted my time all these years.” The president stood up and patted Chu Yunfan’s shoulder.","The Federation was in an uproar. The president, who had disappeared for a long time, had returned. This was great news for the Federation.","However, just as everyone was still immersed in the president’s sudden return, he suddenly announced to the public that he was going to hold a Divine Conference, and all Divines were to attend.","He sent out the invitations and all the Divines received one. The Divine Conference would be held in ten days.","The Federation was in an uproar, especially the experts from the Holy Lands. They had never really come into contact with the Federation’s president before, so they only knew about him from various legends.","If they wanted to integrate into the Federation, the president was someone they couldn’t avoid. Without his approval, it was simply impossible for them to integrate into the Federation even if they had Chu Yunfan’s approval.","Therefore, very quickly, all the Divines expressed that they would go to Capital City in person to participate in the conference.","And this conference was without a doubt the focus of everyone’s discussion for the next few days. What kind of agreement could be reached at the conference?","The return of the president, in particular, undoubtedly greatly boosted the Federation’s morale and united the people.","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t do something like this.","Ten days passed in the blink of an eye. One after another, Divines gathered in Capital City to visit the president who had disappeared for a long time.","On this day, everyone’s attention was also attracted to the place.","The president’s Divine Conference was finally being held."]},{"number":1108,"title":"Chapter 1108 Capital City Is Attacked, the Mastermind Is Here!","paragraphs":["1108 Capital City Is Attacked, the Mastermind Is Here!","This was the president’s first time holding a meeting after his return.","All the Divines came in person to give him face. The president’s house had not been this lively for many years. With his return, the presidential palace once again became the core of the Federation.","Outside the president’s house, countless reporters from various base cities were making all sorts of reports and live broadcasts. Many reporters were also invited to the venue for interviews.","In the venue, Divines came one after another dressed in luxurious clothes. Many of the reporters were extremely excited as they took pictures of what might have been an unprecedented scene.","!!","And among these people, Chu Yunfan, who was in the front row, was naturally the focus of countless reporters.","Today, he had come in a hurry as if he had just finished something and arrived. Once he was there, he quickly became the focus of everyone’s attention, and his seat was right below the president’s.","Everyone understood that Chu Yunfan was now the second-in-command of the Federation. He even had a great chance of becoming the next president of the Federation.","After all, it was impossible for the president to be the president forever, and the probability of Chu Yunfan taking over the position in the future was very high. Therefore, in many people’s eyes, this was a meeting between the current president and the next president.","The president slowly walked over to the crowd. He walked up to the stage and looked at the hundreds of Divines below. He could not help but sigh. When had the Federation ever had such a glorious time? Not to mention, this was not the end of it.","When Chu Yunfan’s two hundred or so Divinity Nourishment Pills had been used to their full potential, the Federation would have another two hundred or so Divines.","To some extent, his achievements over the years as the president of the Federation might not be as outstanding as Chu Yunfan’s achievements in the past years.","The president looked at everyone and said, “Good afternoon, everyone. Welcome to this year’s Divine Conference. This year’s conference—”","Before the president could finish his sentence, the entire presidential palace suddenly shook. Or rather, the entire Capital City was shaking violently.","The crowd could only see an incomparably huge hand in the distant sky. It descended from the sky and slapped down fiercely. At the same time, a defensive barrier suddenly appeared above Capital City and began to completely envelop the city.","Boom!","Capital City trembled violently and dense cracks appeared on the barrier. The attack almost collapsed the defense system.","The various defense systems of Capital City were instantly activated. In the sky, missiles were launched into the void with long tails of flames trailing behind them.","Boom, boom, boom!","One by one, the missiles exploded in mid-air, forming a terrifying barrage that covered the entire sky.","Everyone realized that something was wrong and that someone was planning to cause trouble. Many people couldn’t help but take a deep breath. There were so many Divines present, yet someone chose to attack Capital City at this time. That person was simply courting death.","However, someone actually did it. Everyone was dumbfounded.","Boom!","The huge hand descended from the sky again and the barrage of bullets that covered the entire sky seemed to be unable to hurt the person behind it.","Capital City’s defense system was shattered by this terrifying attack.","This terrifying power made everyone shiver in fear. The ground of the entire city shook violently.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","With a series of loud explosions, everyone saw that all the hidden military bases in the city had been turned into ashes by this huge hand. The city’s defensive measures were completely useless in the face of this person.","Everyone finally realized that this person was no stranger to them. He was probably the one who had attacked Binhai City the other day. However, they had never seen the person with their own eyes before.","Now, they were.","And this scene actually happened in Capital City. This was the heart of the Federation—the core of the core.","After the initial anger, everyone immediately fell into a state of panic. Hundreds of millions of people had died in Binhai City and the other two base cities. The current Capital City was probably even larger than the three base cities combined.","If Capital City was captured, the entire world would be shaken.","In the sky, countless aerial monsters pounced over. Countless monsters appeared on the outskirts of the city.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. The Divines reacted the fastest.","“A teleportation array.”","That’s right, only a teleportation array could launch such an unexpected attack. In fact, the three cities were taken down because of a teleportation array.","Otherwise, such a large-scale gathering of monsters would not have been able to escape the notice of the Federation’s man-made satellites.","No one knew how many man-made satellites the Federation had in the sky. Probably only the higher-ups of the Federation had some idea. Most people had no idea at all.","Under such circumstances, the Federation’s surveillance and control over the Kunlun Realm were comprehensive. It was almost impossible to catch the Federation off guard.","If it weren’t for the hundreds of millions of monsters that came after them, it wouldn’t have caused such a huge loss. Countless people would have been killed or injured, and the people wouldn’t have been in so much misery.","And now, that person was trying to do the same thing. He wanted to replicate what had happened in Binhai City and the other three base cities in Capital City.","Everyone started to panic when they thought of this.","Countless aerial monsters came in a dense mass.","As for the president, Chu Yunfan, and the others, their expressions were grave, but they were not surprised. They had long been prepared for this scene.","Now that all the experts had gathered in Capital City, it was an opportunity to kill the higher-ups of the Federation in one fell swoop.","The president took a step forward and released his aura, which soared into the sky.","“Where are you going, sir?” someone asked.","“To slay the monsters and break the teleportation array.”","“What if you don’t return?”","“Then I’ll leave and never return!”"]},{"number":1109,"title":"Chapter 1109 An Arrow That Surpasses the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1109 An Arrow That Surpasses the Divine Abilities Stage","Chu Yunfan raised his head and saw that the sky was densely packed with aerial monsters. In his divine will’s perception, he could sense that there were countless monsters coming from the distance.","“As expected, he came.”","Although Chu Yunfan already knew that this day would come sooner or later, when that God appeared again, his heart was filled with complicated feelings.","If it wasn’t for the fact that this Divine Conference was about to be held, it was very likely that the God wouldn’t have waited until now to make a move.","Beside him, Tang Siyu’s expression was solemn. She had already heard about the God from Chu Yunfan and knew that today’s battle would be extremely crucial.","One wrong move and the Federation would be destroyed.","They had no way out. Although the world was big, there was no room for them to retreat.","If they didn’t come back, then they wouldn’t come back.","Among the countless monsters, there were also many Divines mixed in. Hundreds of millions of monsters were heading in the direction of Capital City.","“Everyone, victory or defeat depends on this one move. It’s time to fight!” Zhu Buping shouted and took the lead in flying into the sky.","The Divines looked at each other. Even the people of the Holy Land were determined. The other party wanted to destroy the entire human civilization. If the Federation was destroyed, no eggs would remain intact under the destroyed nest.","In the sky, a terrifying figure, like a demon god, descended on the world and looked coldly at the people below inside Capital City. His entire body was shrouded in a ball of light and his face could not be seen clearly.","The God’s eyes were fixed on the president, and everyone could feel his gaze.","The president looked at the other party fearlessly. Just as he was about to take form, Chu Yunfan stopped him and said, “Sir, this is a pill that I’ve been making over the past few days. It might be of use to you. It’s called the Heavenly Heart Protection Pill. It can protect your mind. Within three days, no matter what kind of injury you suffer, you won’t die. However, the sequelae will be very serious. After three days, you will lose all your cultivation. Perhaps it will come in handy to you.”","Chu Yunfan could feel that the president was determined to die. The after-effects of the Heavenly Heart Protection Pill were too severe. Even he would not consider using it under normal circumstances.","However, the president was different now. No matter what, he wanted to preserve his life. Even if he lost all his cultivation, it was still better than dying in battle.","“Thank you.” The president glanced at Chu Yunfan, then took the pill and flew straight into the sky.","Boom!","A terrifying blood-red energy burst out of the president’s body and wrapped him up. The president’s aura rose to the extreme, and the peak Divine aura burst out. The entire Capital City could feel his divine powers boiling.","After a short pause, the president’s aura once again rose to a terrifying level, and his strength increased by several times.","Chu Yunfan could see that the president’s face was completely red, and his skin was cracking. It was obvious that he was enduring great pain. It was clear that the president had used a secret technique to make his combat strength break through to the Core Stage, but the burden it inflicted on his body was also very shocking.","At this point, the president was clearly determined to die. Even if he had to die, he would kill the God.","“Do you think that you can compete with me with your strength, which has barely entered the Core Stage?”","The God’s roar shook the entire universe.","“We’ll see!”","The president walked forward step by step. He felt as if the entire world was about to collapse. Every step he took was difficult as if he was enduring the terrifying pain of his body being torn apart.","The Divines were all stunned. They could not imagine what kind of power this was. The terrifying power that burst out from the president’s body made them feel a little scared. It was not a power that they could compare to at the moment.","The leaders of the Holy Land’s three superpowers looked at each other. They could feel that the mana fluctuations released by the president were the power of the Core Stage that they had been dreaming of.","‘Is that the Core Stage recorded in the ancient books?’ the sect master of Moonfall thought. Her expression was one of complete disbelief.","The existence of the Core Stage was recorded in many ancient books in the Holy Land. However, it was only mentioned. The method to break through to the Core Stage had been lost for a long time. After all, the Holy Land had experienced too much time.","Too many things had been lost in the process.","As for the Core Stage, it was undoubtedly a legendary stage for ordinary people. However, for them, it was a stage that they could not reach even if they worked hard.","Although they could tell that the president must have used some kind of secret technique to force his cultivation level into the Core Stage, it was a different world when he really stepped into it.","Even just looking at it from a distance, they could feel their hearts palpitate.","“Hahaha, what a joke. If you’re not in the Core Stage, you’re not. Do you think you can do this?”","The God laughed out loud. Even though the president had also stepped into this level, he still believed that victory was his.","At this time, Chu Yunfan flew high up into the sky and stretched out his hand. A bronze longbow appeared in his hand.","“Sir, let me help you!” Chu Yunfan shouted loudly.","All the divine power in the bow began to boil. With a “boom,” a terrifying martial arts concept was released. At this moment, Chu Yunfan seemed to have transformed into a terrifying expert from an ancient civilization, the Bow Emperor.","His body and mind had completely fused with the Sun Shooter, and all his divine power was rapidly drawn into the bow.","As the Sun Shooter endured the increasingly powerful force, the cracks on the bow continued to become larger.","A golden crow was forming on the terrifying bronze longbow, and a terrifying martial intent was released.","At first, the God didn’t take Chu Yunfan seriously. A mere Divine wasn’t enough to move him. However, when the Sun Shooter in Chu Yunfan’s hand became more and more brilliant, everything changed.","He could even feel the lethality of the Sun Shooter. This broken bronze longbow was enough to pose a threat to him. If it was not damaged, how terrifying would it be?","“Take this!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and poured all his energy into the arrow. His essence, Qi, and spirit had reached an unprecedented limit, and the power of the arrow had completely exceeded the Divine Abilities Stage.","This attack had actually reached the power of the Core Stage."]},{"number":1110,"title":"Chapter 1110 The God Injured in One Arrow","paragraphs":["1110 The God Injured in One Arrow","All the muscles in Chu Yunfan’s body were tearing apart. He had never released all his internal energy to this extent.","Condensing all the power in one’s body for a moment and releasing it completely was not something that could be done even by those in the Divine Abilities Stage. Only those in the Core Stage could do it.","A Core Stage expert’s entire body’s power would be condensed into a golden core. As the saying goes, once a golden core is formed, one’s life would be in their own hands, not in the hands of the heavens.","The difference between a Core and a Divine was that a Divine’s divine power was as vast as the ocean but it could not be fully mobilized.","A Core was different. Their divine power was not only more robust and condensed, but most importantly, they could use all their strength in a casual attack.","It was like two people fighting. One person could only use a part of his strength, while the other person could use all his strength every time he punched. What kind of difference was this?","What was even more terrifying was that, because of the existence of the golden core, even more divine magic power would surge out of it.","The speed at which a Core replenished their expended divine power was not something a Divine could compare to.","To be precise, the difference between the Divine Abilities Stage and Core Stage was that Divines filled their entire body with divine power. The capacity of their body determined how much divine power they could hold.","As for Cores, they were able to continuously compress more divine power into golden cores. Therefore, the amount of divine power in each Core’s body was beyond the imagination of Divines.","Compared to Divines, Cores had improvements in almost all aspects.","With the help of the Sun Shooter, Chu Yunfan was able to release all his inner energy for the first time. The skin all over his body started to crack open and fresh blood spurted out, soaking him from head to toe. This attack had exceeded his body’s limits.","This terrifying attack streaked across the sky, and everyone seemed to see a golden crow flapping its wings and flying in the direction of the God with astonishing speed.","The God immediately felt the terrifying threat that the golden crow posed to him. His first reaction was to dodge, but he felt as if his entire soul had been locked on. If the folden crow didn’t hit him now, it would chase him to the ends of the earth.","In that moment of hesitation, the golden crow arrived before him.","“Go to hell!”","The God exploded. All the divine power in his body burst out. Endless divine power gathered in the sky and instantly transformed into a huge shield that fell from the sky and shielded him.","Boom!","As soon as the shield was summoned, it was pierced through by the golden crow and exploded in mid-air. The golden crow’s momentum didn’t slow down and it continued to attack the God.","Boom!","An extremely terrifying explosion rang out. The God let out a blood-curdling screech as he was sent flying. A large hole had been punched through his waist and abdomen by the golden crow.","He didn’t have the might that had shaken the world before and he looked extremely embarrassed.","“Rrrrragh!”","God let out an angry roar. He was in a sorry state and was extremely angry, like an injured beast.","“I’m going to kill you!”","The gaze of the God pierced through thousands of meters and fixed on Chu Yunfan.","Everyone was dead silent.","Chu Yunfan’s arrow was too terrifying. Wherever it passed, not to mention the God, even the monsters in the sky that were swept by this arrow were not shattered but instantly evaporated. Even Divines would die if they tried to block such a terrifying attack.","No one had expected that Chu Yunfan would be able to unleash such a terrifying attack. Even that demonic god-like, unparalleled existence was seriously injured.","“Hahahahaha, old man, you’re going to die today!” The president laughed.","Chu Yunfan’s attack seriously injured the God and it also removed a big obstacle for him.","The God was not in very good condition and had been seriously injured.","The president’s eyes flashed with shocking killing intent. Even if he had to go and never return, he had to kill this old man.","All of a sudden, Chu Yunfan’s body seemed to have lost all its strength and he fell from the sky. Just as he was about to hit the ground, a snow-white figure flashed past like a ray of light and caught him in the nick of time.","Chu Yunfan was caught by someone, and he could smell a faint fragrance. He looked up and saw that it was Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu’s eyes were filled with tears. She looked at Chu Yunfan with resentment. She opened her red lips and said, “Why did you do that?”","Chu Yunfan instinctively wanted to caress Tang Siyu’s delicate face, but then he realized that he was bleeding all over.","“Ack, ack!”","Chu Yunfan coughed up another mouthful of blood before he felt much better. The backlash from this attack was too severe, and he felt as if his heart and lungs were about to explode.","To shoot that arrow, he had forcibly achieved resonance with the Sun Shooter and truly unleashed a part of the bow’s power. However, the price he paid was that he almost died. If it were someone else, their physical cultivation base would not be as strong as his.","With just that one strike, he would have died from the backlash.","“Don’t worry, I’m fine. It’s just that the backlash is a little heavy,” Chu Yunfan said.","As he spoke, he could feel his injuries healing bit by bit. The power of the Imperial Physique was evident.","Tang Siyu could also feel that Chu Yunfan’s breath was gradually recovering, and she let out a sigh of relief.","At this time, after Chu Yunfan’s stunning attack, the defense of Capital City finally began.","Although many defense bases had been destroyed by the God, there were still many more defense bases in Capital City. In addition, the garrison troops in the capital were the elites of the Federation Army.","Even though the endless wave of monsters had appeared and caught everyone off guard, they did not panic. They quickly reorganized the defense line.","The Divines also joined the battle.","The effect of hundreds of Divines was clear. They were invincible on the battlefield. However, the marine folks and the demons were obviously well prepared this time. Similarly, hundreds of Divine monsters charged out from the endless army of monsters, which was only a little more than the experts of the Federation.","Suddenly, at this moment, a furious roar came from the sky.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you hurt my lord! I’m going to kill you!”"]},{"number":1111,"title":"Chapter 1111 The Might of a Half-Step to Core Stage, Invincible","paragraphs":["1111 The Might of a Half-Step to Core Stage, Invincible","A figure flew down from the sky at an astonishing speed along with the roar. The person’s terrifying roar shattered the clouds in the sky.","Everyone could feel a shocking aura descending from the sky.","In mid-air, the sect leader of Longevity Faith was the first to react. He slashed his sword at the monster in the Divine Abilities Stage that was entangled with him. Then, he slashed at the figure with his sword.","Boom!","The sword and the spear collided in mid-air, erupting with a terrifying boom.","The violent wave spread out in all directions. In the vicinity, whether it was the monsters or the mechas that were in the air, they were all swept away.","Arrgh!","Longevity Faith’s sect master let out a blood-curdling screech and spat out a mouthful of blood. He was sent flying more than a hundred meters away.","Everyone was stunned because they all knew the strength of Longevity Faith’s sect leader. He was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. Although he might not be as strong as Chu Yunfan, he was by no means an ordinary person.","Yet, he was still blown away by a spear strike. The strength of that person could also be seen from this.","The figure was also stunned for a moment. Only then did everyone see clearly that it was a general in bronze armor. He looked like an ancient general.","He held a long spear in his hand, and his body exuded a terrifying killing intent that could be seen with the naked eye. It had condensed into a physical form, and one could imagine how astonishing it was.","“A top-tier expert of the battlefield dao!”","The Divine Abilities Stage experts felt their pupils contract. This person’s strength could be said to be extremely terrifying. He had severely injured Longevity Faith’s sect leader with one attack.","He also cultivated the battlefield dao. This type of expert was almost invincible in a head-on attack. It was almost impossible to confront him head-on.","The killing intent on his body was visible to the naked eye, and it affected the real world.","“The First Divine Servant,” Chu Yunfan said with blood at the corner of his mouth. This person’s identity was obvious. He was the first of the seven Divine Servant, who had not shown himself until now.","Chu Yunfan could feel the boiling divine power in his body. It was far beyond the Divine Servants that Chu Yunfan had killed before. It was not something that ordinary people could be compared with.","It was even above the ordinary peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. Longevity Faith’s sect leader could not even block one blow, which was evident. Even if Chu Yunfan was at his peak, the outcome was still uncertain.","At this point, the First Divine Servant had almost stepped into the Core Stage. Although he was not a complete Core, he already had some abilities of that level.","For example, he could unleash his divine powers in an instant and destroy his opponent. If Chu Yufnan wanted to defeat him, he had to go one step further.","If it was the previous Chu Yunfan, he probably wouldn’t have had much confidence in defeating the other party. But now, it was different. He had already touched some of the rules and techniques of the Core Stage with the help of that terrifying arrow.","Although Chu Yunfan couldn’t make any further progress without the Brahma Fruit, the control of his divine power had already reached another level. As long as he recovered, his combat strength would be stable enough to enter the half-step to Core Stage and master some of the combat techniques of the Core Stage.","Time. Chu Yunfan still needed time to recover from his injuries. The Sun Shooter in his hand broke into two with a loud bang. It was already full of cracks. When Chu Yunfan shot that arrow earlier, the bow broke into two with a loud bang.","Chu Yunfan could feel that the power in his body was recovering faster and faster. As his strength recovered, he saw that he could use divine power and his recovery speed increased even more.","But the First Divine Servant clearly wasn’t about to let go of this opportunity. He could see that Chu Yunfan was in an unprecedented state of weakness.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve ruined my lord’s plans many times. I’ll kill you today!” The First Divine Servant looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. He walked on the battlefield as if no one was there.","The terrifying blow just now had also frightened everyone. No one dared to step forward to stop him. The Divines were aware of how terrifying the First Divine Servant was.","“Come on. If you have the ability, come at me, idiot!” Chu Yunfan sneered and stared at the First Divine Servant.","“You’re looking for death!” The First Divine Servant’s eyes flickered with sharp killing intent. He instantly began to sprint. The light under his feet boiled with his killing intent, turning the battlefield into a large area.","On the battlefield, he was the supreme ruler. When he charged forward, he faintly transformed into an army of thousands. With a thrust of his spear, the martial arts concept gushed out madly and turned into thousands of cavalry that charged toward Chu Yunfan.","He alone had the ability to dominate the battlefield and sweep through everything.","Although it was still a little different from the battle between the President and the God at the edge of the atmosphere, no one could stop him on this battlefield.","“Block the attack and buy time for Chu Yunfan to recover! Fire!” Zhu Buping roared. Countless missiles flew into the air, turning into a metal screen that covered everything.","Boom, boom, boom!","A series of terrifying explosions rang out, and everyone’s eyes widened, wanting to see what was going on.","Then, they saw thousands of soldiers and horses rushing out from the endless tide of explosions. The spear of the First Divine Servant swept away all the missiles and then continued to fly toward Chu Yunfan.","At this time, a figure soared into the sky and a shocking sword light swept out a terrifying frost that was thousands of meters long. Wherever it passed, the galloping army was frozen and shattered.","Boom!","This sword light created a world of ice and snow, and it collided fiercely with the battlefield where thousands of soldiers and horses were galloping. It was as if two worlds had collided in the sky, sweeping away everything.","When all the smoke dispersed, the First Divine Servant hadn’t moved an inch, but his face showed a hint of surprise. He didn’t hold back this attack, but it was actually blocked.","On the other side, the figure was forced to take more than a dozen steps back before she managed to stop. It was Tang Siyu.","Tang Siyu quickly calmed down from the backlash caused by the collision and a sharp look flashed through her eyes. The First Divine Servant was indeed as powerful as Chu Yunfan had said.","With her special physique, she was invincible among the peak Divines. However, she was still at a disadvantage when facing the First Divine Servant.","But it was not the time to think about this. Tang Siyu held her sword in the air and stared at the First Divine Servant.","“Don’t even think about approaching!”","After the First Divine Servant’s initial shock, a cruel smile appeared on his face. “Fine. Since you want to die, I’ll send you on your way!”"]},{"number":1112,"title":"Chapter 1112 Everyone Retreated in Defeat, Chu Yunfan Finally Makes His Move","paragraphs":["1112 Everyone Retreated in Defeat, Chu Yunfan Finally Makes His Move","The First Divine Servant’s face revealed a sinister smile, and his eyes were filled with killing intent. The spear in his hand trembled violently. It was extremely terrifying. He thrust the spear directly in Tang Siyu’s direction.","His skill was extremely powerful. With a casual thrust of the spear, it made the world tremble violently. In an instant, it turned into an army of thousands of soldiers and horses, charging in Tang Siyu’s direction again.","Tang Siyu took a deep breath and all the mana in her body flew out. The horror of the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique was manifested, and the density of her mana far exceeded that of an ordinary peak Divine.","She slashed out with her sword, turning the world into a world of ice and snow.","Boom!","There was another shocking collision. Thousands of soldiers and horses rushed into this world of ice and snow and launched crazy destruction. Just this collision had caused the whole world to boil, turning the nearby area into nothingness. Even the fiercest aerial monsters had to take a detour, not daring to approach.","Hundreds of millions of rays of light burst out, turning into a beautiful but extremely dangerous auspicious color.","Swoosh, swoosh, swoosh.","Tang Siyu hurriedly retreated, feeling the qi and blood in her chest churning. The First Divine Servant was more powerful than her current self. She had already grasped some fighting methods of the Core Stage. In terms of skill, the First Divine Servant might not be stronger than Tang Siyu.","The Arcane Sky Spirit Physique was also an extremely rare art in the Ancient Zenith Civilization. It was extremely powerful, so it was naturally not that simple. Even if it was not as powerful as Chu Yunfan’s fusion of the Thunderclap Physique and the Imperial Physique, it was still very easy for her to be the top among experts of the same level.","Even though the First Divine Servant had cultivated for many more years than Tang Siyu, he could not surpass Tang Siyu’s power after she had consumed the Brahma Fruit.","However, he had glimpsed a part of the techniques of the Core Stage. Every time he burst out with divine power, it was much more than Tang Siyu’s, and he immediately suppressed her.","The First Divine Servant saw that his attack had not been able to seriously injure Tang Siyu and had only repelled her. His eyes suddenly flashed with a terrifying light. After the attack, there was almost no pause. The First Divine Servant once again stabbed straight at Tang Siyu.","The martial arts phenomenon of the army of thousands of men and horses appeared once again, pouncing straight for Tang Siyu.","Suddenly, at this moment, a few figures rushed out and joined forces to resist this terrifying attack.","These people were the sect leaders of Longevity Faith, Infinity Camp, and Moonfall. Longevity Faith’s sect leader, in particular, rushed forward even though he had just been severely injured.","They understood very well that this person’s terror reminded them of Chu Yunfan.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had wiped out hundreds of Divines single-handedly. How shocking was that?","The only one who could stop him was Chu Yunfan. The only thing they could do now was stop the First Divine Servant until Chu Yunfan recovered from his injuries. Otherwise, the whole situation would be turned around.","Although an expert of this level couldn’t decide the outcome of a battle by himself, he had the ability to change the situation.","Boom!","The three of them broke through the attack together, but they still felt the blood Qi in their bodies shaking.","They were shocked. An expert of this level was too terrifying. It was also shocking that Tang Siyu had taken two attacks by herself and was not injured.","There were many experts in the Federation. Not only Chu Yunfan, but Tang Siyu was also stronger than them, not to mention the president who could compete with a Core when he used all his strength.","“Let’s stop him together!” Moonfall’s sect leader said as she looked at Tang Siyu.","“Okay!”","Tang Siyu flew forward. With the help of the other three Divines, she was more confident in holding back the First Divine Servant.","“Hahahaha, stall me? Just you guys?” The First Divine Servant burst into laughter. He murmured in a low voice and the divine power in his body seemed to be boiling under the vibration of a spell.","This was a secret skill. Tang Siyu and the others wanted to stall him, and he wanted to get rid of them as soon as possible.","In an instant, the spear turned into a long black dragon, heading straight in the direction of Tang Siyu and the other three.","The four of them attacked at the same time as if they had a telepathic connection. The four peak-stage Divines attacked together. What a terrifying realm it was. It shattered the air and the boiling qi and blood suppressed the entire world.","Boom!","There was another terrifying collision between the two sides. However, everyone saw that the joint attack of the four peak Divines was completely broken. The long black dragon formed by the spear destroyed the joint attack.","“You guys are nothing!” The First Divine Servant roared and the black dragon continued to attack the four of them.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The battle between Divines was extremely fast. In an instant, they had already exchanged more than a hundred moves. Everyone was horrified to find that the four of them, who were considered the top combat forces of the Federation, were being beaten back.","With every collision, everyone was forced to take a few steps back.","Spurt!","Finally, Longevity Faith’s sect leader couldn’t hold on any longer. He coughed up a mouthful of blood and was flung away.","He had just been severely injured and was barely holding his breath. Now, he had been hit more than a hundred times. Even if the others joined forces to share the pressure, he could not hold out any longer.","After Longevity Faith’s sect leader, Moonfall’s and Infinity Camp’s sect leaders could not hold out any longer either. Soon, they coughed up blood and retreated in defeat.","Disbelief flashed in the three’s eyes. Was this the strength of a half-step to Core Stage?","They weren’t his match even when they joined forces.","The First Divine Servant’s control over his strength had undergone a tremendous change.","Even Tang Siyu, who was the most persevering, was forced to retreat under the attack of the First Divine Servant. The divine power in Tang Siyu’s body surged, trying her best to support her attacks.","“Go to hell!”","The First Divine Servant let out a roar. The spear in his hand swept across the world, shattering the world of ice and snow that Tang Siyu had created. The spear’s momentum was not reduced and it hit Tang Siyu head-on.","Spurt!","Tang Siyu, who had been holding on for so long, finally spat out a mouthful of blood. She flew out like a kite with a broken string. Just as she was about to fall to the ground, a figure suddenly flew out and caught Tang Siyu in his arms.","The man was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Seeing Tang Siyu spit blood, Chu Yunfan’s heart burned with anger.","“You’ve recovered?” Tang Siyu looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise.","...","“I haven’t fully recovered, but it’s enough to deal with him,” Chu Yunfan said slowly, his eyes full of killing intent."]},{"number":1113,"title":"Chapter 1113 Combat Strength Entering Half-Step to Core Stage","paragraphs":["1113 Combat Strength Entering Half-Step to Core Stage","Chu Yunfan gently placed Tang Siyu on the ground.","Tang Siyu quickly sat cross-legged and began to heal her injuries. She didn’t care that they were on the battlefield and she believed that Chu Yunfan could protect her.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re finally not hiding behind a woman anymore? Are you here to die?” the First Divine Servant said in a loud voice as he pointed at Chu Yunfan.","“If I wasn’t injured earlier, killing you would have been as easy as flipping my hand,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","“Hahahaha, this is ridiculous. You’re going to die today. How dare you hurt my lord! I’ll let you know that this is the biggest mistake you’ve ever made in your life!” The First Divine Servant thundered.","Chu Yunfan shook his head and said, “What a pity. Even with your cultivation level, you can actually be brainwashed. Do you really think he’s a god? He’s just a Core. A real god can kill him with one finger. Isn’t it ridiculous for a frog at the bottom of the well to call himself a god?”","For Chu Yunfan, who had received the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, the so-called God was just a joke. Even the emperors of that year had never dared to call themselves a god because they would be the laughingstock.","“You’re courting death!”","The First Divine Servant’s face instantly turned extremely ugly. Chu Yunfan was clearly mocking the god in his heart. This was simply intolerable.","“I’ll kill you!”","The black spear in his hand streaked across the sky, lighting up the entire world.","“He’s too strong. The power of a half-step Core is not something we can fight against!” A look of disbelief appeared on the sect leader of Moonfall’s mature and exquisite face.","Many people were praying in their hearts, hoping that Chu Yunfan would be able to resist the First Divine Servant.","The so-called president was holding back the God who had been severely injured by Chu Yunfan, so he was not the focus of everyone’s attention.","Swish!","When the spear pierced through the sky and earth, a terrifying explosive sound burst out. The spear was like a black dragon, baring its fangs and brandishing its claws as it pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","He was determined to kill Chu Yunfan, so he didn’t show any mercy.","Clang!","Chu Yunfan turned his hand around and punched the spear. They were evenly matched, and the scale of the collision was far greater than the battle between the First Divine Servant and the four Divines.","Everyone was shocked. The four peak Divines were defeated by the First Divine Servant, but Chu Yunfan alone was able to stop the First Divine Servant’s attack.","One must know that Chu Yunfan had just been seriously injured. There were still terrifying injuries on his body and blood was flowing out. However, he was able to block the First Divine Servant and not fall to a disadvantage.","The First Divine Servant’s face suddenly revealed an extremely shocked expression. He had not held back in his attack just now, but he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan.","“You’re nothing.” Chu Yunfan sneered and arrogantly looked at the First Divine Servant. “So what if you’ve touched upon some techniques of the Core Stage? Your foundation is too weak.”","Chu Yunfan looked down on the First Divine Servant, which made the First Divine Servant completely furious. He had been strong all his life and had defeated countless strong enemies. After a long time, he was able to reach the half-step to Core Stage.","“In that case, let’s see how long you can keep this up,” the First Divine Servant said coldly. In the midst of the terrifying clanking sounds, countless divine powers turned into rays of light and burst out. The spear rushed over horizontally, turning into a long black dragon and rushing toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s reaction wasn’t slow either. He didn’t even give in. He threw out a punch and his entire body turned into a golden roc, fighting against the black dragon.","The martial arts phenomenon obscured everything and distorted the sky and earth. In the eyes of the crowd, they could only see a black dragon and a golden roc fighting in the air.","Everyone understood that this was a battle between the martial wills of both parties.","Compared to the First Divine Servant, everyone was even more shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength. The First Divine Servant had glimpsed some means and laws of the Core Stage. Each strike could release almost all the divine power in his body, and each strike had the power to destroy the world","However, Chu Yunfan was completely different. He hadn’t glimpsed the methods and rules of the Core Stage and could output a part of his divine power, but it was still comparable to the First Divine Servant.","This meant that the First Divine Servant’s divine power, which was as vast as the ocean, was no match for Chu Yunfan’s. Then how much divine power was hidden in Chu Yunfan’s body?","Many people were shocked.","Soon, they found that the situation had completely changed. Chu Yunfan and the First Divine Servant, who originally seemed to be on par with each other, had now completely reversed the situation. Chu Yunfan kept increasing his output, and his combat strength kept soaring.","Chu Yunfan gradually gained the upper hand. The First Divine Servant was actually being suppressed by Chu Yunfan before he knew it.","“Impossible! How is he doing this?!” Many people were very curious about how Chu Yunfan had become stronger and stronger.","But soon, they understood. The reason was very simple. Chu Yunfan had comprehended during the battle and made a breakthrough.","Chu Yunfan had touched the threshold of the half-step to Core Stage through that terrifying arrow shot earlier, but he had not fully mastered it. Now, through such an intense battle, his potential had been forced out.","With his enormous cultivation power, an extra bit of divine power meant an unimaginable increase in battle power for ordinary people.","Slowly, Chu Yunfan’s output of divine power was approaching 100%. This was a technique that belonged to the Core Stage.","After reaching this level, Chu Yunfan broke free from some of the shackles that bound him.","The more the First Divine Servant fought, the more fearful he became. He couldn’t take down Chu Yunfan immediately, but instead, gave Chu Yunfan the capital to keep improving.","If this went on, the consequences would be unimaginable. He could even feel an extremely strong pressure now. At first, he could casually block Chu Yunfan, but now, he was feeling a strong backlash even after using all his strength.","If he had not seen it with his own eyes, he would not have believed that someone could improve to this level in such a short time. It was simply a miracle.","Bam!","Once again, the black dragon and the golden roc collided in the sky. In the terrifying martial arts phenomenon of both sides, the figures of the two people were revealed. Chu Yunfan didn’t move at all, while the First Divine Servant was staggering forward, and blood spurted out of his body.","In that moment of exchange, Chu Yunfan had injured the First Divine Servant.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had finally entered the half-step to Core Stage."]},{"number":1114,"title":"Chapter 1114 The Death of the First Divine Servant","paragraphs":["1114 The Death of the First Divine Servant","At that moment, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength finally rushed into the half-step to Core Stage, which was no different from the First Divine Servant’s. He had mastered some rules of combat strength of the Core Stage.","“You’re using pressure from me to train yourself?”","The First Divine Servant suddenly came back to his senses. He finally understood everything. He thought he could kill Chu Yunfan if he used all his strength, but it was not the case. All of this was an illusion that Chu Yunfan gave him, using him to complete the process of his combat strength breaking through to the half-step to the Core Stage.","“That’s right. If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have been able to enter the half-step to Core Stage so quickly.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","!!","He could feel endless energy boiling in his body. After truly taking this step, he realized that there was still room for his combat strength to improve.","In reality, the abundance of divine power in his body had already reached its peak. Unless he consumed the Brahma Fruit to reform his body, it was already at its limit.","However, the half-step to Core Stage was different. In essence, it was because they had mastered a more efficient output of divine power that their combat power had soared to another level. Although they had not reached the level of the Core Stage, it was the realm that peak Divines dreamed of.","“Impossible!” The First Divine Servant couldn’t believe it. “Have you been cultivating since you were in your mother’s womb? It’s only been twenty years. How could you have reached this step? I’ve spent more than twenty years just to take this step from the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage!”","Compared to the fact that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had entered the half-step to Core Stage, what the First Divine Servant couldn’t believe was that Chu Yunfan had actually done it in such a short time. After understanding some laws, it only took Chu Yunfan less than half an hour to finish walking the path that he had spent more than twenty years to finish.","This was the most unbelievable part.","Although The First Divine Servant had spent more than twenty years completing the journey, he was already unparalleled in this world. After all, the sect leaders Moonfall and the others had never stepped into this realm in their lives.","When it came to the usage of laws, it was either understood or not.","However, what he didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan had memories from the Alchemy Emperor, so he was already at the height of his cultivation. It wasn’t that he didn’t understand a lot of things, but he just lacked personal experience.","Previously, the arrow shot from the Sun Shooter had allowed Chu Yunfan to truly come into contact with some of the operating laws of the Core Stage. After having personal comprehension, coupled with the various key points in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan’s speed of mastering it was like a rocket.","“That’s because you’re stupid.” Chu Yunfan looked at the First Divine Servant with a sneer. “You’re so proud just because you’re a half-step to Core Stage? That’s the limit of your vision. What’s the big deal about your so-called God? As long as I have enough time, I’ll even behead him for you to see!”","At the mention of his lord, the First Divine Servant’s expression began to twist. A terrifying killing intent burst out from his eyes and he said, “I can’t let a scourge like you live!”","He had already realized that the scariest thing about Chu Yunfan wasn’t his current cultivation level, but his terrifying cultivation speed. The things that he had spent more than twenty years to achieve, Chu Yunfan had done in half an hour. The things that he had spent more than a hundred years to achieve, Chu Yunfan had achieved in his twenties.","If this continued, perhaps one day, Chu Yunfan would be able to stand shoulder to shoulder with the great god in his heart. That was absolutely not allowed.","“Can you do it?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer, “I’ve said it before. Your vision has limited your future!”","“Rrrraggh!” The First Divine Servant shouted. In an instant, all the divine power in his body burst out. It was as if everything in the world had been frozen, turning the surroundings into a battlefield. Countless shouts of killing rang out, and a terrifying army of thousands of soldiers and horses appeared and pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan instantly felt as if he was completely enveloped in this battlefield. He couldn’t move an inch forward as if he was trapped in a swamp.","This was the First Divine Servant’s martial intent, and it instantly enveloped Chu Yunfan.","But at the same time, Chu Yunfan’s body turned into a boundless sea of thunder. His divine power was instantly transformed into thunder energy, and in an instant, the entire battlefield was filled with lightning and thunder. Countless lightning bolts shot out like lightning dragons, bombarding the thousands of soldiers and horses.","In the blink of an eye, the battlefield that had gathered thousands of soldiers and horses was shattered.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move an inch and the entire battlefield collapsed. The First Divine Servant’s half-step to Core Stage combat strength, which he was so proud of, couldn’t even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","However, in the blink of an eye, a long spear pierced through the sky and was about to reach Chu Yunfan’s forehead.","All the previous martial arts techniques were just to restrain Chu Yunfan. This attack was the real killing move.","“Die!”","The First Divine Servant finally appeared before Chu Yunfan. His eyes were filled with unimaginable killing intent.","Chu Yunfan drew out terrifying thunder energy from the void and turned it into a long saber. The saber slashed at the spear that was coming at him.","Clang!","In the nick of time, the saber struck the spear, stopping it from advancing.","Swoosh!","The First Divine Servant instantly felt a strange and terrifying force being transmitted from the spear. In an instant, the web between his thumb and forefinger exploded, turning his palm into a bloody mess. This was the result of the shock from this huge force.","‘What great strength!’","This was the first time the First Divine Servant felt how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. After truly understanding some Core Stage combat techniques, the control of his power had reached a peak. Chu Yunfan’s power hadn’t changed, but the power he released had increased by severalfold.","However, he didn’t have time to think about this, because Chu Yunfan’s saber had already appeared in front of him. He didn’t even have the chance to react before Chu Yunfan’s saber had already slashed down.","The saber tore the sky apart and turned into a sea of thunder, instantly enveloping the First Divine Servant.","Bam!","The First Divine Servant let out a blood-curdling screech as he was sent flying backward. His armor began to crack inch by inch. This blow had shattered his armor.","He finally realized the gap between him and Chu Yunfan. Fear rose in his heart, and he kept retreating, trying to avoid the battle with Chu Yunfan.","But Chu Yunfan had no intention of letting him go. He followed the First Divine Servant like a shadow and instantly caught up to him. He released all of his divine power and slashed down.","Slice!","The First Divine Servant’s body was cut in half and exploded in mid-air."]},{"number":1115,"title":"Chapter 1115 A God on the Battlefield, Annihilating the Demon Fleet","paragraphs":["1115 A God on the Battlefield, Annihilating the Demon Fleet","All of this dazzled everyone. In almost an instant, everything had already happened.","The First Divine Servant, who seemed to be invincible and could sweep the battlefield, was killed by Chu Yunfan so easily.","Facing Chu Yunfan, the First Divine Servant had no power to fight back, which was completely beyond everyone’s expectations.","No one had thought that Chu Yunfan would be so powerful after his combat strength had reached the half-step to Core Stage.","The First Divine Servant, who had been able to fight him to a standstill before, now had no power to fight back against Chu Yunfan.","When everyone saw this scene, they began to shout crazily.","“Mighty Chu!”","“Mighty Chu!”","“Mighty Chu!”","Although the people who were shouting were ordinary people, they all had powerful cultivation, especially in Capital City, which was the best area in the world and the place where the world’s elites gathered the most.","Many of the aerial monsters that swooped down from the sky were fish that slipped through the net. They were able to fly down through the layers of defensive fire power.","However, they were facing the elite masters of Capital City. Many masters were eager to try and flew into the air to kill these aerial monsters.Now that they had seen Chu Yunfan kill the First Divine Servant with lightning speed, their confidence suddenly increased.","After killing the First Divine Servant with one strike, Chu Yunfan was relieved. With the dense defensive net of firepower in Capital City, even a Divine would not be able to break through it easily.","Only an expert at the level of the First Divine Servant could ignore this firewall.","Martial arts and technology were like two spiraling lines. Places with powerful technology were like nuclear bombs that could easily kill powerful martial arts experts.","However, when a martial arts expert was powerful enough, they would have a way to ignore these technological weapons.","And it was obvious that Chu Yunfan had already reached the critical point of these two spiraling upwards lines.","After killing the First Divine Servant, Chu Yunfan immediately began to clear out the endless number of aerial monsters in the sky. After his combat strength had reached the half-step to Core Stage, his killing efficiency had also reached a whole new level.","The control of his mana had also reached the peak of perfection as if he could control his hands and feet.","This time, the people of Capital City witnessed Chu Yunfan’s methods for the first time, which were different from all the previous Divines.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand and countless thunderbolts surged out of his body, turning into a sea of thunder. Behind him, the thunderbolts turned into weapons one after another, forming a dense wall of weapons. Then, the countless weapons swept out like a storm with lightning speed.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","The thunderbolts directly pierced through the aerial monsters, and a large number of them exploded in mid-air. Wherever Chu Yunfan’s gaze landed, a large number of aerial monsters were cleared out.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan discovered a Divine monster among them.","Chu Yunfan just let out a loud shout and grabbed at the air, pulling out a thunder spear. Wherever the spear passed, hundreds of aerial monsters were vaporized. The Divine aerial monster was directly pierced by the thunder spear, and its huge body fell to the ground. It was nailed to death, and after struggling for a while, it stopped moving.","It was as if Chu Yunfan had turned into a huge mobile arsenal, and his extremely rich divine power had become his greatest support.","Wherever they passed, the attacks of the aerial monsters immediately collapsed. Coupled with the defense network of Capital City, they carried out an amazingly efficient killing.","Those Divine aerial monsters were the focus of Chu Yunfan’s attack, and under Chu Yunfan’s special care, the Divines among these aerial monsters were all killed not long after.","They were not Chu Yunfan’s match at all. They were not even able to last one round.","After clearing out more than half of the aerial monsters, Chu Yunfan flew out of Capital City. Outside the city, a huge fleet of demons was being teleported over through the teleportation array.","Many ferocious cannons were aimed at Capital City. Once they were allowed to attack, they would definitely pose a huge threat to the city.","Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate. A pair of thunder wings formed on his back and he flew directly into the fleet of demons.","The demon fleet discovered Chu Yunfan’s presence almost immediately. One by one, their main cannons with the power to destroy a city swept toward him.","However, it couldn’t hurt Chu Yunfan in the slightest. He pointed out a finger and a thousand-meter-long sword light swept out, slashing down along with Chu Yunfan’s falling arm.","Boom!","A huge warship was cut in half and exploded violently.","But Chu Yunfan wasn’t done yet. He continued to slaughter, and one battleship after another was cut in half. The hard metal shell couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan’s sword light.","The commander of the demon fleet was furious, but he couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan. Those Divine monsters tried to stop him, but the result was the same.","Chu Yunfan was able to single-handedly stop the assault of the demon fleet, and they were forced to retreat again and again.","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan had become a terrifying god of death. Their main cannons could not lock onto him, who was flying through the fleet like a bolt of lightning. Even the dense crossfire net that they usually used against Divines could not even touch the corner of Chu Yunfan’s clothes.","Even if they were willing to pay any price to attack Chu Yunfan, even if they hit their allies, it still proved useless.","In just fifteen minutes, the entire demon fleet had been defeated.","Chu Yunfan had easily destroyed the fleet of hundreds that was originally intended to bombard Capital City. In terms of technology, there was still a big gap between the demon and the Federation.","After taking care of this fleet, Chu Yunfan went deep into the hundreds of millions of monsters. He ignored the endless monsters and killed them wherever he went as if he was walking on flat ground. He killed hundreds of millions of monsters and made them tremble in fear.","The endless waves of monsters couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan’s advance, and he finally killed his way to the teleportation array.","There were more than twenty Divine marine beasts and monsters around the huge teleportation array. They were all top experts above tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","When they saw Chu Yunfan approaching, they quickly flew forward to intercept him."]},{"number":1116,"title":"Chapter 1116 The President’s Tragic Victory","paragraphs":["1116 The President’s Tragic Victory","These were the experts of the two races who were guarding the teleportation array. They were shocked when they saw Chu Yunfan.","After all, the teleportation array was in the depths of the endless monster army. They had never thought that someone would be able to launch a surprise attack here.","However, they immediately pounced on Chu Yunfan. More than twenty Divines with astonishing momentum sealed off all the space around Chu Yunfan.","However, they underestimated Chu Yunfan’s strength. In the face of these people’s joint attack, Chu Yunfan’s hand burst out with a terrifying sword light. The sword light swept out like a storm.","These Divines seemed to be no different from the ordinary monsters that Chu Yunfan had killed before. They were all quickly killed.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage was nothing.","After killing these Divine monsters, Chu Yunfan casually destroyed the teleportation array. The monster tide that was constantly rushing out was finally contained.","Chu Yunfan flew back into Capital City. At this time, the Federation’s real counterattack had finally arrived. The missile base in Capital City had been completely destroyed by the God and had not played any role.","However, Capital City wasn’t the only one with a guided missile base. One after another, guided missiles with the symbol of a nuclear bomb flew across the sky and bombarded the monsters.","Boom, boom, boom!","Along with a series of deafening booms, huge mushroom clouds rolled up and brought up boundless heat waves, devouring all the monsters.","Even a Divine would die if they were hit by a nuclear bomb, let alone an ordinary monster. Even if they were swept by the aftermath of the nuclear bomb, they would still die.","Every nuclear bomb that fell could take away millions of monsters. Although it was outside Capital City, the Federation had been forced to this point. They began to act ruthlessly and used siege nuclear bombs to wipe out hundreds of millions of monsters on a large scale.","All kinds of terrible explosions were heard. The mushroom clouds were like small suns, devouring almost everything. The densely packed monsters were the best targets. As long as the nuclear bomb exploded on the monsters, the shockwave would kill millions of them.","Hundreds of millions of monsters were completely annihilated just like that. The terrifying shockwave blew at Chu Yunfan’s face, causing his clothes to flutter loudly in the air.","This was the true ultimate power of the Federation.","It wasn’t convenient to use them in their own city, but the Federation was very decisive in using them in the wild. Without their Divines, the monster army was simply powerless in the face of these nuclear bombs.","Soon, this sudden battle ended. The endless monsters outside the city were finally annihilated under the bombardment of the Federation. The aerial monsters in the sky were also killed under the countless defensive fire and the joint clearing of many Divines.","At this time, everyone finally breathed a sigh of relief, especially the experts of the Holy Land. This scene that involved hundreds of millions of monsters attacking the city was something they might not be able to encounter in their entire lives back in the Holy Land.","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan. Fortunately, he acted in time and stopped the advance of the monster army. If the monster army had broken into Capital City, it would not be so easy to use the nuclear bombs. They might even not use it because they were afraid of the consequences.","After all, Capital City was not Binhai City. If it was flattened by a nuclear bomb, one could completely imagine how much of an uproar it would cause.","As for Chu Yunfan, he didn’t think too much about it. His eyes were looking at the depths of the sky. There was an astonishing battlefield at a place that had almost surpassed the atmosphere and entered the edge of the universe.","And this battlefield was the key to victory and defeat. If the president lost on that battlefield, even though Chu Yunfan had won, it would be meaningless.","Compared to an expert of that level, Chu Yunfan was far too weak.","The others also realized this immediately, and they all turned their eyes away from Chu Yunfan and looked at the edge of the universe.","However, their vision couldn’t reach that far, so they couldn’t see the situation above. They could only occasionally feel the residual energy of the battle above sweeping over to the nearby area.","All of a sudden, a deafening boom was heard. It was as if a nuclear bomb had exploded in the depths of the sky.","Everyone understood that the victor had been decided, but it was not certain who had won.","Then, everyone saw the president stagger down from the sky on a beam of light. Compared to the high-spirited way he had attacked earlier, the president now looked extremely pathetic.","To be more precise, it was extremely tragic. His entire body was soaked in blood—the blood of his enemies and his own.","There was a huge wound on his chest. It started at his chest and ended at his lower abdomen. It was a wound that had almost cut his entire body into two halves. Blood was dripping, and the wound was so deep that his bones could be seen. It even made people wonder if his body would fall apart in the next moment.","One of his arms had been cut in half and almost the entire palm had been cut off. There was a crack on his head so deep that his skull could be seen.","The president must have gone through an astonishing battle.","At this moment, countless people in Capital City had tears in their eyes. The president had almost died for them.","With such a serious injury, it was almost certain death. There was no possibility of survival.","However, the president persevered.","“Sir, are you all right?”","In a flash, Chu Yunfan had already arrived beside the president and supported him. He could feel that the president was at the end of his life, and a gust of wind could blow him off the stage.","Soon, his instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, also appeared in the air and held up the president from the other side.","“I’m fine. Hahaha, I thought I was dead for sure. I didn’t expect your Heavenly Heart Protection Pill to be so useful. I thought I couldn’t hold on and was surely going to die.” The president was still in the mood to laugh, but it affected his wounds and he couldn’t help but grimace.","The president was extremely shocked. He thought he was dead for sure. After suffering such a heavy injury, even a Divine of the great all-embracing heaven would die.","However, it was under such circumstances that a burst of vitality emerged from the depths of his body, forcefully supporting his body.","It was the Heavenly Heart Protection Pill that Chu Yunfan had prepared for him that had saved him from dying on the spot."]},{"number":1117,"title":"Chapter 1117 Dispatch the Army and Annihilate Infinite Demon Mountain","paragraphs":["1117 Dispatch the Army and Annihilate Infinite Demon Mountain","Originally, he didn’t have much confidence in the Heavenly Heart Protection Pill that Chu Yunfan had given him. He was just trying to make a last-ditch effort, so he swallowed the pill at the most critical moment.","Originally, his internal organs were about to be shattered and he felt that his life force had been cut off. Who knew that after his life force was cut off, a life force was forcibly derived from his body and held onto him.","Although this life force wasn’t much, it was very strong. Unless one’s entire head or heart was shattered, one wouldn’t die.","This reminded the president of what Chu Yunfan had said before. No matter how serious the injury was, it could be treated. However, at the same time, the price was that his cultivation would be reduced to nothing. He could already feel his power was gradually disappearing. To be more precise, the energy in his cells was gradually turning into life force, hanging on to his injuries.","He was able to survive in such a situation.","With Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level, he could see the president’s true condition. The president’s life force was still present, and it was obvious that the Heavenly Heart Protection Pill had taken effect. He out a sigh of relief.","“Sir, what about that old man?” Jeang Yuanbin asked after making sure that everything was fine.","“I didn’t manage to kill him. He ran away.” The president suddenly sighed.","Not being able to kill the God was probably the thing he regretted most. He had prepared so long for this battle, even risking his life to kill the God. Chu Yunfan even exhausted all his inner energy to shoot an arrow at him, severely injuring the God. It was a good start.","Even so, the God managed to escape. This made the president deeply realize the gap between them. The gap between the Core Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage was too big.","He had forcefully raised his combat strength to that level, but it was not the true Core Stage. If Chu Yunfan had not injured the God in the beginning, the consequences would have been unimaginable. It could even be said that he had no chance of winning at all.","“But I’m sure that if I’m not feeling good, he isn’t faring much better either. I almost killed him.” The president’s face revealed a depressed expression, and then he looked at Chu Yunfan. “No matter what, you have a long time. He shouldn’t appear again for at least three months.”","“Understood,” Chu Yunfan said.","The president had almost used his life to buy Chu Yunfan three months.","With the president risking his life and severely injuring the God, this sudden battle finally came to an end.","The result of this battle shocked the Federation. As it was during the Divine Conference, many media outlets had gathered in Capital City, and the terrifying scene of countless monsters attacking the city was unintentionally broadcasted live.","This was by far the second largeest attack by the demons and the marine folks, and their target was Capital City.","If it weren’t for the countless masters present, and if it weren’t for Chu Yunfan and the president’s astonishing strength, the city would have been killed by the teleportation array. The city would have been captured before the Federation Army could react.","Everyone panicked, and then they were extremely angry. The demons and the marine folks were really planning to exterminate the humans. There was no longer any doubt about this. For the first time, the people of this era felt the aura of destruction approaching.","In an instant, the Internet was in an uproar.","“Revenge! My heart won’t rest easy until the demons and marine folks are dead!”","“We can’t be so passive anymore. We have to launch all our nuclear bombs. Since they want to destroy us humans, we’ll show them the bloodthirstiness of us humans!”","“Kill these b*stards!”","For a time, the public’s emotions were stirred up. As more and more details were revealed, although most of the monsters were blocked out, there were still many casualties.","After that, news of the president’s death spread. With the president’s status within the Federation, one could imagine what kind of commotion this caused.","Countless people roared and wanted revenge. Since the demons and marine folks were going to exterminate the human race, they didn’t have to worry about anything.","“We’ll take revenge on them. Since they’ve invaded Capital C, we’ll kill our way up the Infinite Demon Mountain!”","Countless people were roaring in anger.","In Capital City’s presidential palace, the president was dressed in white and sitting in the back garden. If not for his pale face, no one would have thought that he had just been through a life and death situation and had just escaped from hell.","The person beside him was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“If I hadn’t experienced it personally, I wouldn’t believe that I could have survived,” the president said with a smile.","Although it had been three days, it was still a novel experience for him to be able to survive. “This Heavenly Heart Protection Pill is really powerful. I’ve read some information about you before. You’ve made many different kinds of pills. If I’m not wrong, you obtained an alchemy inheritance.”","Chu Yunfan just smiled and did not say anything.","At this moment, the president’s body had no cultivation power at all. His cultivation power had been crippled. However, if others thought that the president was a soft persimmon, they would be gravely mistaken. Even if his cultivation power had been crippled, his body’s many years of tempering had made him extraordinary.","While his combat power was incomparable to when he was at his peak, killing ordinary Divines was still as easy as eating and drinking for him.","If they were deceived by his appearance that seemed to have no cultivation at all, then they would not be far from death.","The president didn’t ask any more questions and just confirmed his initial judgment.","“Although the effects of this pill are powerful, sir, I’m afraid your cultivation is now crippled,” Chu Yunfan lamented.","“I’m already satisfied that I’m alive. After all, I thought that I would not be able to escape death.”","The president was very open-minded.","In just three days, his injuries had completely healed. If not for the fact that he had lost all his power, one would not be able to tell that he had experienced life and death.","Then, the president raised his eyebrows and said, “”Is the army ready?”","Chu Yunfan said, “It is. We must pacify Infinite Demon Mountain this time around. The demons has cooperated with the marine folks many times. If this continues, it will definitely become a thorn in the side of the Federation. Now, while the God is injured, it’s time to wipe out the demons.”","No one knew that Chu Yunfan and the president had agreed to send troops to pacify Infinite Demon Mountain as the Internet had called for. They wanted to solve the problem that had plagued the Federation for many years in one fell swoop and cut off one of the God’s arms."]},{"number":1118,"title":"Chapter 1118 Thousands of Troops Locking on to Infinite Demon Mountain","paragraphs":["1118 Thousands of Troops Locking on to Infinite Demon Mountain","To the current Federation, they had to face the demons and the marine folks at the same time, which proved to be an extremely troublesome situation.","This was especially so when there was a mysterious God standing behind the marine folks. This made the situation of the Federation even worse.","Now, the president had finally managed to buy three months for the Federation. Within three months, the Federation would be able to completely wipe out Infinite Demon Mountain.","The Federation’s basic strength was already above that of the demons. Now that their high-end combat power had the addition of the Holy Land experts and the 200 Divinity Nourishment Pills that Chu Yunfan had produced, it was now time to harvest.","More than 200 Divines emerged one after another. Although they were all elementary Divines, they were enough to sweep away ordinary monsters.","There were more than 600 Divines in total. It could be said that the Federation was unprecedentedly powerful. This was a good opportunity to completely eliminate the demons.","Infinite Demon Mountain was different from the marine folks. The marine folks was a clan that was scattered and had been in a state of disunity all these years. It was only when the God united the marine folks that they truly posed a fatal threat to the Federation.","And Infinite Demon Mountain was opposite of that. It was the true core and royal court of the demon race. There were billions of monsters in the Kunlun Realm, and it was impossible for the Federation to kill all of them with its strength.","It was meaningless. The development of human martial arts could not do without those monsters. However, Infinite Demon Mountain was a malignant tumor to the Federation. Without it, the demons would be like a plate of loose sand, just like the marine folks. It was impossible for them to gather so many monsters to attack human base cities.","Without the interference of Infinite Demon Mountain, it would be impossible for them to pose a threat to the Federation.","Now was the best opportunity to wipe them out—while the God was not around.","“That’s right. I’ve long had the idea of subduing Infinite Demon Mountain. Unfortunately, my strength was not enough to completely subdued them. However, you are different. Your current strength is above mine. Unless there is Core Stage expert within the demons too, no one will be your opponent.” The president sighed. “Compared to us, the strongest in the demons are of course Divines, who far surpass us. But now, we are stronger than them, and it is time for Infinite Demon Mountain to be destroyed!”","“Yes, sir!” Chu Yunfan nodded. He didn’t feel anything in his heart. This was a species war. The Federation could dominate the Kunlun Realm with this move.","As the military orders were passed down, elite troops of the Federation began to mobilize. Tens of millions of elite troops were mobilized from all over the world and gathered in Capital City.","In the city, a huge teleportation array had been set up. The demons were not the only ones who knew how to use a teleportation array. The Federation was definitely not weak in this aspect.","However, the energy consumption of the teleportation array was large. Under normal circumstances, the Federation would not be willing to use a teleportation array to teleport troops. After all, the transportation speed of battleships was very fast.","However, this time was different. It was a battle to destroy the demons, and the purpose was to catch them off guard, just like how the demons and the marine folks had joined forces to attack Capital City.","It was only when they were about to set off that everyone was told that their target was the Infinite Demon Mountain. Only the marshal-level soldiers knew about the target beforehand. The others had only received military orders to assemble.","“Today is the day we suppress Infinite Demon Mountain. For hundreds of years, countless ancestors have fought for us and won us a large territory. But in the process, many ancestors have stained the battlefield with their blood. Now, the demons has dared to attack Capital City. This is a disgrace to us soldiers. Now, we will use the blood of the demons to wash away this shame. Let them all tremble and show them who the master of the Kunlun Realm is!”","The military was in the midst of their final mobilization. Capital City had been attacked, and the president had been severely injured. It was undoubtedly a disgrace to the military, not to mention how many people had been killed or injured by the demons over the years. Now, they were finally going to launch a war of revenge against the demons.","They didn’t even need to mobilize much of their forces. Everyone knew about the blood debts that the demons had committed over the years, and many of their ancestors had even been killed by the demons.","One by one, the battleships entered the ancient teleportation array and disappeared from Capital City. No one spoke, but they all felt their blood boiling. A world-shaking battle was about to happen.","These were the best of the best in the Federation Army, so they were naturally not afraid of battle. A major battle with tens of millions of troops, and that was only the number of troops sent by one side. This would have been an unimaginably terrifying number in the Common Era.","In the Kunlun Era, this too was a rare battle, not to mention that they were all elite soldiers. The best of the best.","In the depths of the vast Kunlun Realm, there was a mountain chain among the mountains. They were not formed naturally, but were carved out by a powerful cultivator using divine power. This mountain chain was the base camp of the demons, Infinite Demon Mountain.","Countless monster tribes lived in these mountains. Unlike what many people imagined, there were tall buildings everywhere on Infinite Demon Mountain, and many demons who had taken on human form lived in them.","In the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain, there were countless humans working in shackles, and even more were imprisoned in underground chambers. However, their memories had been removed and they had been raised in cultivation chambers like walking corpses. When they reached the age of eighteen, they would be sent to the tables of the powerful demons on Infinite Demon Mountain and become their delicious food.","This was the purgatory of the human race, where countless people lived in misery. No one had ever been able to reach this place, and no one had ever thought that this place would be invaded.","However, at this moment, a battleship appeared out of thin air outside the mountain chain. Then, more battleships appeared one after another. The hatch of the battleships opened, and countless mechas came swarming out like bees leaving their nests, covering the sky and earth.","These battleships were like giant war beasts that covered the entire sky.","This was a blood-red world. The entire mountain chain was desolate and the boundless demonic energy was so dense that it could be seen with the naked eye. Everyone who came here felt extremely uncomfortable.","Immediately after, hundreds of Divines appeared out of thin air. Each of them had an overbearing aura. The Federation had mobilized all its troops and decided the outcome of the battle.","Chu Yunfan appeared, with Tang Siyu beside him, riding Ebony Dragon King. The Thunder Winged Beast on his other side also spread its wings and shot out as fast as lightning."]},{"number":1119,"title":"Chapter 1119 The Nuclear Bombs Open the Way, the War Begins","paragraphs":["1119 The Nuclear Bombs Open the Way, the War Begins","The Federation Army gathered outside Infinite Demon Mountain at an astonishing speed.","A shocking battle was about to break out, and it was destined to have a far-reaching impact and shake the world!","Even the demons had never thought that the Federation’s revenge would come so quickly. This was because in the history of the Federation, there had never been an attempt to take revenge on the demons.","The Federation was conservative in this aspect. In the beginning, they did not have the ability to take revenge, but later on, they did not have the confidence. For a behemoth like the demons, the consequences would be unimaginable if they were not killed.","!!","But now, everything was completely different. The era had changed. The Federation’s strength had skyrocketed.","For hundreds of years, the Federation had fought against the demons while exploring the Kunlun Realm. The casualties were in the billions, or even tens of billions. The humans had almost been exterminated.","Now, it was time to pay with blood.","Such a big movement naturally attracted the demons’ attention, and the battleships of the demon race also rose into the air.","Suddenly, at this moment, thousands of guided missiles with the symbol of a nuclear bomb flew across the sky, leaving long trails of flames behind them and covering the sky.","“A nuclear bomb!”","A furious roar was heard from the demons. If the previous wave of nuclear bombs was a warning from the Federation to the demons and the marine folks for plotting against the Federation’s Divines, then these thousands of nuclear bombs were more than just a warning.","If thousands of nuclear bombs were to hit the demons, it would be over for them.","Nuclear bombs were great killing weapons, even in the Kunlun Era, because of their terrifying power. Needless to say, the power of thousands sweeping down was terrifying to the extreme.","However, Infinite Demon Mountain was not completely unguarded. It was the core of the entire demon race. In terms of defense, it was even higher than that of Capital City.","Immediately, missiles, lasers, and various experts of the demons took action at the same time to intercept the thousands of nuclear bombs.","Boom, boom, boom!","A series of explosions rang out and the entire sky was engulfed by endless light. It was like the end of the world, and the thousands of nuclear bombs covered the entire mountain in an instant.","Although he was flying high in the sky, Chu Yunfan could feel the air vibrating. The light of the nuclear explosion that countless people didn’t dare to look at was not a problem for him.","This was not the first time that he had led an army in the past few years, so he naturally understood that using nuclear bombs to open up a path was a common method used by the Federation. When they encountered tough opponents, using nuclear bombs to open up a path was the most direct method, which could reduce the number of casualties.","After this wave of thousands of nuclear bombs cleared the way, the rest would be up to them.","In Chu Yunfan’s divine will, he could sense that most of the thousands of nuclear bombs had been intercepted, and only a hundred of them managed to land on Infinite Demon Mountain.","However, just these hundreds of them were enough to shake the demons’ defense system.","There were countless barriers and formations on Infinite Demon Mountain, and it was possible that even those on the mountain themselves didn’t know exactly how many, but they had been constantly strengthening and increasing the number of defensive barriers and formations over the years.","Especially after the humans had entered the Kunlun Realm, the demons had been constantly strengthening its defense system to prevent them from using all kinds of killing weapons.","But even so, when the hundreds of nuclear bombs landed on the defensive barrier, it was unknown how many defensive barriers were instantly destroyed.","Chu Yunfan could even see that above the mountain, many battleships were vaporized into thin air. Even the power of the aftermath swept across Infinite Demon Mountain. Many mountain peaks were razed to the ground, and countless high-rise buildings collapsed. It was a terrible scene of the end of the world.","However, Chu Yunfan knew that this was far from over. If the demons could be destroyed so easily, the Federation would have already destroyed the demons with nuclear bombs.","The real battle was coming up next.","The Federation Army was fully equipped and waiting for the aftermath of the nuclear bomb to dissipate. At the same time, they were waiting for the rest of the troops to join the army through the teleportation array.","Suddenly, a huge ship that was over 10000 meters long appeared in the sky. It was like a huge cloud that blocked out all the light. This was the trump card of mankind. Chu Yunfan had known about it since he was in school.","It was the pinnacle of human technology—the Star Destroyer.","This warship was developed for interstellar warfare, and it fought in outer space all year round. Even Chu Yunfan had only heard of its name and had never seen it in person.","The cost of such a giant warship was over a trillion federal dollars. Even with the strong financial resources of the Federation, they could not afford to produce too of them, so they only had a few.","And now, there was one here!","Suddenly, at this moment, a huge laser beam that was hundreds of meters wide swept out from the Star Destroyer. In an instant, it swept into Infinite Demon Mountain and flattened several peaks.","Many Divines’ faces changed when they saw the laser. If they were the ones who were hit, they would probably die.","After the initial probing, the rest of the firepower on the Star Destroyer was released. Lasers, missiles, and cannons were all fired at the same time. The firepower of a Star Destroyer was comparable to an elite army.","It was a real moving arsenal!","The faces of the Holy Land’s experts turned pale. At this time, they felt extremely lucky. If they hadn’t agreed to Chu Yunfan’s request, they might have been greeted by such a warship.","After the Star Destroyer launched the first attack, the army finally moved out. One by one, the battleships burst out with their strongest firepower. They were going to take down the whole of Infinite Demon Mountain in one go.","With Chu Yunfan’s vision, he could see that although these attacks were terrifying, most of them were blocked by layers of barriers.","In fact, the vanguard’s attack was meant to break through the countless layers of enchantments, and only at the end would it be the time to attack.","After a round of bombarding, all the energy shields of Infinite Demon Mountain were almost completely destroyed, and the fleet and defense system in the mountain began to fight back.","The battle between the two sides had truly begun. the Federation’s Army had truly begun to charge toward Infinite Demon Mountain.","Countless mechas—millions of them—flew through the sky and pounced toward the mountain. Powerful auras emerged from the military formation. The Divines took the lead and attacked first."]},{"number":1120,"title":"Chapter 1120 Killing Their Way Into Infinite Demon Mountain and Crushing Everything in Their Path","paragraphs":["1120 Killing Their Way Into Infinite Demon Mountain and Crushing Everything in Their Path","The Federation and Infinite Demon Mountain had shown a certain degree of restraint against each other before this. They had not completely fallen out with each other. Otherwise, it would have been a situation where both sides would have suffered.","However, at this point, there was no way out for either side. If the Federation could not destroy Infinite Demon Mountain in one go, the demon’s revenge would probably cause heavy human casualties.","The battle of species extermination was earth-shattering, and the sounds of fighting rang out.","From the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain, countless angry roars could be heard. The loud roars sounded like the roars of powerful beasts.","In the endless depths of Infinite Demon Mountain, powerful monsters rose into the air. These were all aerial monsters. On the ground, there were many monsters galloping. Although they couldn’t fly, they could jump up forcefully with the help of their strong bodies. They flew into the air and stopped for a short while to fight with the human mechas in the sky.","The densely packed monsters were all at the Innate Stage, which made people’s scalps tingle. One should know that on earth, an ordinary satellite city’s monster swarm only had a few Innate monsters, and that was enough to give the defense forces a headache.","But now, all of them were Innate monsters, which clearly showed how terrifying Infinite Demon Mountain was.","A Divine monster pounced out, but before it could show its might, a light arrow streaked across the sky like a shooting star, instantly piercing it.","Stab!","Blood splattered everywhere as the arrow pierced through its throat. Its huge body instantly fell to the ground.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan was holding a bow made of thunder energy. He was the one who had shot the arrow. His control over the thunder energy in his body had become smoother. Even now, he sighed in his heart. A special physique like the Thunderclap Physique was indeed extraordinary.","He was now able to control the thunder energy in his body as if he was born with it. It was as easy as moving his arms and legs.","It was just like how Tang Siyu’s control and usage of ice and snow energy were far beyond the imagination of ordinary people after she had cultivated the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique.","Next to him, Tang Siyu took a step, and an ice lotus appeared. Her figure was extremely fast, and she rushed into the group of monsters and began to kill.","One after another, astonishing sword lights transformed into a storm, sweeping away these monsters that were at least at the Innate Stage.","Chu Yunfan smiled. He was not worried at all. During this period, Tang Siyu had mastered her own power, especially after the battle with the First Divine Servant. She had even figured out some of the mechanics of the Core Stage. It was only a matter of time before she entered the half-step to the Core Stage.","The Arcane Sky Spirit Physique was indeed a special technique that had been famous since the Ancient Zenith Civilization era. There was once an empress with this extraordinary physique.","On this battlefield, Tang Siyu’s combat power was the mightiest. As long as she was careful, she was invincible.","If one were to look down from the universe, one would be able to see that the two sides were like a terrifying torrent that had collided.","The flood of steel and the flood of monsters collided in the air.","The millions of mechas were the elites of the human race, but the countless monsters were also the best of the demon race. In an instant, beautiful blood flowers burst out, and blood splattered everywhere.","On the battlefield, all kinds of terrifying killings broke out. In an instant, thousands of people from both sides died tragically.","The Federation’s arrival was too sudden, and they intended to take revenge. Therefore, even though the demons on Infinite Demon Mountain were the elites of the elites, they were caught off guard and were instantly penetrated.","The monsters tried to stop them, but they were quickly trampled by the flood of steel.","Infinite Demon Mountain had been peaceful for too long and was protected by countless barriers. Under normal circumstances, it would be impossible to attack it even if millions of troops besieged it. They had never thought that the Federation’s revenge would come so quickly.","After all, it wasn’t the first time that Infinite Demon Mountain had plotted against the Federation, and the Federation had always swallowed their anger. This time, it was different. The Federation really wanted revenge and launched a war to exterminate their entire race.","The human mecha army quickly rushed past the edge of Infinite Demon Mountain. The monster army was simply too weak to withstand a single blow. Wherever the mecha army passed, the monsters were trampled into a bloody paste. In the face of such an amazing army, even Divines had to avoid them.","Chu Yunfan was also in the army, and he could feel that the blood and qi of the entire army gradually merging into one with the battle, and a terrifying aura was erupting.","Ordinary people could only feel that the momentum was overwhelming, but powerful cultivators could clearly feel it. It was like a fishbone in their throat, and the Divines in the ordinary military formation did not take this fishbone seriously.","Even if tens of thousands or even hundreds of thousands of people came, Divines would kill them every time.","However, the millions of elites at this level were enough to drown any Divine who dared to charge at them.","The battle’s murderous aura rose and it bombard the primordial spirits of the Divines. Even Cores would have to temporarily avoid the sharp edge in the face of such an army.","This was also the reason why even though there were nuclear bombs, Star Destroyers, and extremely powerful martial arts experts, the ultimate deciding factor was the elite troops of both sides.","Chu Yunfan’s divine will could even sense a faint layer of blood-red energy boiling over the bodies of these bloodthirsty elite soldiers.","Fortunately, the large army was on their side. The elites that the Federation had accumulated over the years exploded in one move.","And under Chu Yunfan’s feet was Ebony Dragon King. At this time, Ebony Dragon King was flying at full speed, so those attacks couldn’t land on him. They would be easily blown away by Chu Yunfan, and it wouldn’t even hurt him.","Clang, clang, clang!","On Infinite Demon Mountain, alarms went off. The sound spread for thousands of miles. The real bloody battle was coming. The monsters in Infinite Demon Mountain generally had high intelligence, but they had never thought that one day they would be killed and wounded.","How could the defense line that they had temporarily gathered be able to stop the Federation’s Army that had long planned for this? Wherever the front line went, the defense lines were completely destroyed one after another.","The Federation wanted to beat the slow with speed. Before the other monsters in the vicinity could come to rescue, they would take down Infinite Demon Mountain in one fell swoop. The demons had been a thorn in the side of the Federation for many years.","With Chu Yunfan and the other Divines as the arrowhead, they charged into the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain. Chu Yunfan could clearly see the blood pools, in which countless human corpses floated, becoming the blood food of the monsters.","Chu Yunfan stared with wide eyes. He was extremely angry, and his killing intent boiled."]},{"number":1121,"title":"Chapter 1121 Tier Nine of the Divine Abilities Stage? Cut Him Down!","paragraphs":["1121 Tier Nine of the Divine Abilities Stage? Cut Him Down!","“Infinite Demon Mountain will be destroyed today!”","Chu Yunfan’s loud shout shook the entire mountain.","In the mountain, many powerful monsters were shocked. Chu Yunfan’s power was too terrifying. A casual roar from him was like a lion’s roar.","“Kill them! Let’s end this hundred-year-old feud today! We’ll wipe out Infinite Demon Mountain!”","This was a magnificent feat that the Federation had never achieved in the past hundreds of years. The sky was filled with blood, and the sounds of killing could be heard everywhere. There were flashes of blades and shadows of swords everywhere. The bloody massacre was in the midst of continuous outbreak.","From Infinite Demon Mountain, many Divine monsters attacked. A figure emerged from within the mountain. It was a majestic flood dragon, and in an instant, it turned into a tall middle-aged man.","He was from the powerful royal family of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. His cultivation was extremely terrifying, and his qi and blood were abundant. In terms of cultivation, he had already entered tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage. If he was given time, it was very possible for him to reach the peak.","Every time he attacked, it was extremely terrifying. He posed a great threat to the Federation Army.","Chu Yunfan glanced at him, but he didn’t recognize this powerful royalty of Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom. Neither did he know anything about this royal family from the Federation’s intelligence network. It was easy to imagine how deep Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom’s foundation was.","The middle-aged man spotted Chu Yunfan. His eyes turned red, and he flew toward Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The middle-aged man threw out a punch, and the whole world trembled violently. His fist intent condensed and turned into a huge flood dragon. It opened its jaws and was about to swallow Chu Yunfan in one bite.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward and used his hand as a saber, cutting the terrifying flood dragon into two halves. His saber intent didn’t slow down and flew toward the middle-aged man.","The middle-aged man’s expression changed when he saw this. Chu Yunfan’s hand saber was clearly just a very simple technique and didn’t contain any complicated martial intent. But it was this simple move that posed a fatal threat to him.","When did such a terrifying existence appear among the humans?","The middle-aged man had never been recorded in the Federation because he had never left the mountain. He had been painstakingly cultivating and had never participated in the attack on the Federation.","Although the Federation had been trying to record the Divines who had attacked the Federation, this demon had never appeared, so the Federation naturally did not know about him.","He was in charge of another expedition. Although Infinite Demon Mountain was known as the country of demons, there were many other monster clans that were unwilling to submit. The Federation was only one direction for the three royal tribes to join forces to attack the Kunlun Realm.","It was just like how the Federation had to deal with Infinite Demon Mountain, the marine folks, and the monster clans on earth. There were many other troubles.","For Infinite Demon Mountain, the Federation was a major threat, but it was not the only problem. In addition, Infinite Demon Mountain had been deliberately hiding some experts, so even the Federation had not noticed them.","He had never participated in the attack on the Federation, so he didn’t know about Chu Yunfan. He had probably heard of the name, but he had never seen him in person.","As soon as they started fighting, he realized that something was wrong. This was completely different from the previous situation. His understanding of the Federation was still in the same level as it was decades ago. Even if there were some experts, he could kill them all by himself.","What he was truly afraid of was the Federation’s high-tech weapons. As for the so-called experts of the Federation, they were simply too weak to withstand a single blow.","A tier-nine Divine. The Federation would not even dare to think of such an existence.","However, he now realized that his previous speculations were outdated. This time, the Federation had come prepared. Just this terrifying expert alone was enough to make him feel terrified.","At this critical moment, the middle-aged man made a decision. He quickly set up a barrier in front of himself. However, this barrier was easily cut through by Chu Yunfan’s hand saber as if it was made of paper. In an instant, the hand saber was right in front of the middle-aged man.","The middle-aged man used his arms to block and finally managed to dispel Chu Yunfan’s hand saber. However, with a crisp sound of bones breaking, the middle-aged man’s arms were cut off and blood splattered everywhere. He looked extremely miserable.","Many of the monster experts saw this scene and cried out one after another. They flew over, wanting to stop Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even glance at them. Ebony Dragon King under his feet spat out columns of black flames, burning those monsters to death. Although many of those monsters were at the peak of the Innate Stage and were only one step away from the Divine Abilities Stage, they were simply vulnerable in the face of Ebony Dragon King who had already entered tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan chopped off the middle-aged man’s hands with a hand saber. He didn’t stop and directly shot out another sword light from between his hands. As he waved his arms, the middle-aged man’s neck was instantly cut off.","Before the middle-aged man died, his eyes were filled with disbelief as if he had seen a ghost. Chu Yunfan’s strength was beyond his imagination. An expert like him was already considered one of the top experts in the world, but he was still unable to withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","At that moment, Tang Siyu, the sect leaders of Longevity Faith, Moonfall, and Infinity Camp, and a few other masters encountered the top masters of Infinite Demon Mountain. There were even demon masters at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage who flew over and stopped them in their tracks.","Infinite Demon Mountain’s heritage was indeed terrifying. They were not at a disadvantage even when the human experts went all out. There were many Divine and Innate monsters scattered all over the Kunlun Realm who had not had time to come to their rescue. Otherwise, once they all gathered, it would be a terrible bloody battle.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan’s plan was to catch Infinite Demon Mountain off guard and completely destroy this scourge.","After Chu Yunfan killed the middle-aged man, Ebony Dragon King beneath his feet flapped his wings and flew toward the depths of the mountain at an even more astonishing speed.","Countless monsters pounced at Chu Yunfan, but he didn’t even spare them a glance. With a loud shout, the terrifying sound waves swept out in all directions from his body.","In the sky, countless monsters exploded in mid-air and turned into clouds of blood mist. They were unable to stop Chu Yunfan’s footsteps and were killed by him.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re courting death!”"]},{"number":1122,"title":"Chapter 1122 Silver Moon King Dies!","paragraphs":["1122 Silver Moon King Dies!","Chu Yunfan killed without restraint. Every moment, hundreds of monsters died at his hands. To these ordinary monsters, he was too powerful. Even a loud shout from him was enough to kill or injure large groups of monsters.","His killing speed alone was equivalent to that of an army. It was extremely terrifying.","Especially after he had peeked into the secret of the Core Stage and his combat strength had successfully broken through to the Core Stage, Chu Yunfan’s killing efficiency had reached an extremely terrifying level.","If gods and Buddhas were in his way, he would kill them all.","!!","At this time, Chu Yunfan finally alerted the beings in the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain.","A loud roar was heard, and then a figure controlled thousands of terrifying war behemoths that were hundreds of meters tall and rushed out. It was like a terrifying flood of behemoths. The mecha army that had followed Chu Yunfan in was completely turned into a mass of minced meat by these thousands of war behemoths and were sent flying.","These war behemoths were truly terrifying. Each of them was like a huge battleship, and thousands of them were like thousands of terrifying battleships that were charging around. Almost no one could stop them on the battlefield.","This was the scariness of a species war. If they hadn’t reached Infinite Demon Mountain, no one would have known that there was such a terrifying combat power among the demons. Usually, a beast swarm of an extremely terrifying scale would have dozens of demons participating in the siege.","Now, thousands of them had appeared in one go. Each of these war behemoths was incomparably huge, covered in black scales. Their heads were liket tigers, but their bodies were like elephants. Many of them even had human remains at the corners of their mouths.","Many humans went into the belly of these war behemoths. These war behemoths had to eat a large number of humans every day to survive.","Above these war behemoths, a figure pounced forward and shot a bow. In an instant, thousands of terrifying arrows shot out like comets streaking across the sky. They instantly pierced through the mechas and exploded them in mid-air.","Chu Yunfan coldly looked at the figure. It was a middle-aged man in a silver robe. He had the aura of a king as if he was going to rule the world.","Chu Yunfan knew who this person was. He was one of the top few people on the various wanted lists of the Federation. He was the current Silver Moon King of the Howling Silver Moon Wolves.","He was a terrifying master. Ever since he stepped out of the Dao, he had been active in the battle with the humans. For hundreds of years, countless humans had died at his hands, including many Divines.","They were known as the mortal enemies of mankind.","“The king is invincible!”","“The king is invincible!”","“The king is invincible!”","The Silver Moon King’s appearance greatly encouraged the monsters on the battlefield, driving them crazy. Although these monsters were ferocious, they were not truly fearless of death. Under the attack of the Federation regardless of the cost, they also nderstood that the Federation had come with the intention of annihilating them. If they were not careful, Infinite Demon Mountain could really be annihilated in their generation.","However, the Silver Moon King’s appearance had caused the Federation’s Army, which had already charged into the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain, to feel a sense of defeat.","If there was no one who could match him, with his speed of slaughter, he could single-handedly wipe out the entire Federation Army.","All kinds of heavy weapons were useless against these martial arts masters because they were too agile and it was very difficult to lock on to them. Even if a nuclear bomb was used, he would quickly sense it and avoid it. Even if they were to disregard the losses and perish together, it would not be of much use.","“Silver Moon King, you’ve killed so many human experts in the past. It’s time to pay!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","“Hahahaha, what a joke. Chu Yunfan, this is the battlefield of the final battle between the two species. What do you think the two species are fighting for? There’s no right or wrong. It’s either live or die,” Silver Moon King said bluntly. “Don’t you humans also skin us and extract our tendons to make pills when you catch us?”","“Yes, you’re right.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","The hero of the other side was one’s enemy, but since Chu Yunfan was born in the Federation, everything was already destined.","“Hmph!” Silver Moon King sneered, and the bow in his hand lit up again. In an instant, light arrows burst out like a storm, aimed directly at the mechas that were pouncing over.","“You dare to play this trick in front of me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly. He had been caught off guard earlier, which allowed Silver Moon King to injure a large number of people. But this time, he was prepared.","He used the power of thunder to form a thunder longbow in the air, and in an instant, he shot out an arrow. This arrow split into countless arrows in the air, completely covering Silver Moon King’s arrow rain.","Boom, boom, boom!","Countless arrows intertwined in mid-air, bombarding each other, forming a terrifying explosion zone nearby. All of them were actually blocked by Chu Yunfan.","Whoosh!","Amidst the countless explosions, a long arrow was shot at Chu Yunfan at lightning speed.","In that instant, Silver Moon King’s attack arrived once again.","“Petty tricks!”","Chu Yunfan used his hand to block the arrow.","Although Chu Yunfan managed to block the arrow with a flip of his hand, he could feel that Silver Moon King was strong. He was stronger than ordinary peak Divines and could even stand shoulder to shoulder with Tang Siyu, which meant that he was about the same as Chu Yunfan who had not broken through to the next level.","Although Chu Yunfan was only in tier six of the Divine Abilities Stage, his combat power had actually reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","He was much more powerful than ordinary peak Divines.","Silver Moon King’s strength was not inferior to his. If he had encountered Silver Moon King back then, it would have been very troublesome. However, things were different now. The difference between his combat strength and that of a half-step to Core Stage expert was too great.","Silver Moon King, on the other hand, was shocked. He had used up all his strength in that arrow just now. Even if Chu Yunfan was at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, there was no way he would be able to take it.","Facing Chu Yunfan, he had never held back, nor would he have held back. Who knew that the arrow that he thought was amazing would end up like this?","“Silver Moon King, is that all you’ve got? Then, I shall take your life!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","The thunder longbow in his hand burst out with a shocking light, and a lightning arrow shot out. It pierced through the sky, and in an instant, struck Silver Moon King.","Bam!","Silver Moon King let out a blood-curdling screech as the arrow pierced through his body."]},{"number":1123,"title":"Chapter 1123 Infinite Demon Mountain’s Three Great Kings Are Nothing!","paragraphs":["1123 Infinite Demon Mountain’s Three Great Kings Are Nothing!","Silver Moon King was killed by Chu Yunfan’s arrow!","The experts from the Howling Silver Moon Wolves and its subsidiary clans were dumbfounded.","Silver Moon King, who was almost invincible in Infinite Demon Mountain, was killed by Chu Yunfan’s arrow just like that.","In Infinite Demon Mountain, Silver Moon King’s strength and status were both outstanding. The Howling Silver Moon Wolves was also one of the three royal tribes of Infinite Demon Mountain, and was even more terrifying than ordinary peak Divines.","However, it was destroyed by an arrow. For many people, this was simply a world-shaking situation. It made them realize that Infinite Demon Mountain might really fall.","Without Silver Moon King obstructing him, Chu Yunfan’s slaughter truly began. Those was behemoths that were as large as battleships were completely unable to fight back against Chu Yunfan.","Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t even as tall as their toes, killing them was as easy as cutting grass.","The longbow in Chu Yunfan’s hands, which was formed from the power of thunder, continuously shot out arrow after arrow that pierced through the sky and bombarded the bodies of these war behemoths. One arrow for one and never missing their mark.","In a short time, hundreds of war behemoths had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Their huge bodies fell to the ground and piled up like a mountain.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change and his eyes were extremely cold.","Suddenly, another two figures flew over from the distance, bringing with them a shocking aura. They were like a dragon and a lion.","The morale of the demon experts who were being massacred by Chu Yunfan was greatly boosted.","The two of them were none other than Flood Dragon King and Lion King. Both of them weren’t at Infinite Demon Mountain earlier. They had been discussing with the marine folks on how to launch the next wave of fatal attacks on the Federation.","Who knew that before they could complete their fatal blow to the Federation, the Federation’s fatal blow would come?","Their eyes turned red when they saw the Federation’s Army massacring their kin. Almost all the elites of the three races were in Infinite Demon Mountain. Such a large-scale massacre made their hearts bleed.","The two of them roared at Chu Yunfan in anger.","“I want you dead!”","Lion King let out a loud roar and charged toward Chu Yunfan like a mountain.","Chu Yunfan was at the center of the attack, but the attacks at other places were not smooth. Even Tang Siyu and the others were entangled with the peak Divines of Infinite Demon Mountain. Without the Divine as the arrowhead, the Federation’s offensive was delayed.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He swept his way through everything. Even the Silver Moon King couldn’t stop him and was easily shot to death by him.","In an instant, Lion King punched out with both fists. There was a thick layer of boxing gloves wrapped around his arms. This boxing glove was gilded with extremely profound runes. It was also a rare magic weapon. When combined with Lion King’s invincible sweeping fist technique, almost no one could block it.","The two fists shattered the sky and earth, and hundreds of mechas were blown into pieces. Then, the fists suddenly charged toward Chu Yunfan.","But at this time, Chu Yunfan’s aura was released. It was a supreme aura, and a terrifying power spread out like the sea.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan threw out a punch. It was a simple punch, but it blocked Lion King’s fists that were filled with anger.","A terrifying blast wave swept out like a stormy sea.","Lion King immediately felt a terrifying force coming back at him. It was as if his fist had landed on a piece of steel, unable to shake Chu Yunfan’s body in the slightest.","“How is this possible?!”","Lion King couldn’t believe it. He had always been known for his strong physical body. Coupled with his punch technique, he had reached the peak of his fierce path. Even the other two king-level experts who were on his side didn’t dare to fight him head-on, but used other methods to resist him.","However, Chu Yunfan was completely different. He was fighting head on, and the most terrifying thing was that he wasn’t at a disadvantage. No, to be precise, he was probably even above him.","And on the other side, Flood Dragon King had already pounced toward Chu Yunfan with a roar. A silver-white halberd appeared in his hand, and with a mighty display, he pounced in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Boom!","The halberd seemed to be able to cut a huge hole in the heavens and earth, and it instantly came down on Chu Yunfan’s forehead.","Chu Yunfan sent out a slap. Without even looking, this slap seemed to have some magical power as it hit the halberd that was slashing down.","Clang!","With a deafening sound that sounded like the clanging of metal, Flood Dragon King’s fury seemed to have been doused by a basin of cold water.","His furious attack was slapped back by Chu Yunfan’s palm. What was even more terrifying was that he almost felt the halberd fly out of his hand. It was simply too terrifying.","A terrifying force was surging through his arm, and he could feel the muscles on his arm splitting open. He was instantly shocked.","Although he did not specialize in physical cultivation like Lion King, the Horned Dragon tribe had strong physical bodies. Even if he did not specialize in physical cultivation, his physical cultivation was not bad.","But now, he had been blasted away so easily. It was simply shocking.","He and Lion King looked at each other and immediately had an idea. The two of them began to surround Chu Yunfan from the left and right.","The two of them had realized that Chu Yunfan was a very difficult opponent to deal with and decided to join forces to deal with him.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. He immediately attacked both sides. Facing the two experts ‘attacks, he didn’t panic. He used one hand to fight against Lion King with unparalleled fist techniques, while the other hand shot out sword lights to display astonishing sword techniques to fight against Flood Dragon King. He wasn’t at a disadvantage at all.","The battle between the three experts in the sky attracted the attention of countless people. Everyone’s eyes were drawn to them. They understood that the outcome of the battle between these three experts would directly affect the outcome of the war.","“Chu Yunfan, I will make sure you die without a burial place today!” Flood Dragon King roared in anger. His eyes were bloodshot, and he wanted nothing more than to tear Chu Yunfan into a thousand pieces.","On the other side, Lion King was also doing the same. His fists were like missiles, constantly blasting out extremely terrifying fist forces, each time aiming at Chu Yunfan’s vital points. His intention to kill Chu Yunfan was clear.","“You want to kill me? Do you think you can do it? The three great kings of Infinite Demon Mountain are just so-so. The warm-up is over. If this is all you have, then you’re doomed!”","Chu Yunfan burst into laughter."]},{"number":1124,"title":"Chapter 1124 Killing Lion King","paragraphs":["1124 Killing Lion King","“You dare to look down on us?” Lion King’s voice was like muffled thunder that resounded throughout Infinite Demon Mountain.","“Silver Moon King didn’t believe me either, but he still died at my hands. How much longer can you guys last?” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","“What?!” Extreme shock flashed through Lion King’s and Flood Dragon King’s eyes.","Silver Moon King was an existence that stood side by side with them, and it didn’t mean that Silver Moon King was impossible to kill. However, it had been less than half an hour since Infinite Demon Mountain was attacked, and they had rushed back immediately upon receiving the news.","Could it be that Silver Moon King couldn’t even hold the humans back for a short half an hour?","This was simply inconceivable. With Silver Moon King’s strength, there were not many people in the world who could compare to him. Moreover, it was absolutely impossible to kill Silver Moon King in such a short time.","However, they couldn’t see Silver Moon King on the battlefield. Everything seemed to be just as Chu Yunfan had said, and the two of them immediately felt a sense of danger.","But before they could think further, Chu Yunfan suddenly moved. A terrifying energy was boiling and surging out of his body. It exceeded the limit of Chu Yunfan’s previous burst of strength.","The two kings looked at each other and immediately knew that something was wrong. Chu Yunfan was still hiding his strength in this battle. From this, it could be seen that his true strength was probably above the two of them, which was the most terrifying thing.","“Go to hell!”","The two kings decided to strike first. With a loud shout, Flood Dragon King slashed out with his halberd, which had transformed into countless flood dragons. They flew in the air and then pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","The momentum shook the heavens and the earth and was extremely terrifying.","At the same time, Lion King also punched out with both fists. His fist intent turned into a terrifying lion that pounced at Chu Yunfan.","“I’ll start with you!”","Chu Yunfan immediately locked onto Lion King as his target. He shot out a sword light, which turned into a long sword qi. With a sudden slash, the entire sky was cut into two halves, and all the flood dragons in the sky were turned into nothingness.","And at this time, Chu Yunfan’s true attack had begun. He was fast, and in the blink of an eye, had already dissolved Flood Dragon King’s attack. Then, he still had the time to deal with the huge lion that Lion King had thrown down.","Chu Yunfan was naturally not someone to be trifled with. He threw a punch and his whole body seemed to turn into a golden roc. He suddenly streaked across the vast sky and blasted toward the huge lion.","Boom!","At the moment of collision, the lion that was as big as a hill was cut in half by the golden roc’s wings. The lion turned into spirit energy in the air and dispersed.","Chu Yunfan’s golden roc’s momentum didn’t decrease as it pounced toward Lion King.","“Impossible!”","Lion King let out a loud roar. His all-out attack was so easily broken by Chu Yunfan. This made him feel extremely embarrassed. However, he had no other choice. He punched out like a cannon and aimed at the roc like a lion’s fangs.","Bam!","Finally, they collided with each other. The truly terrifying collision happened.","The collision, which was like a comet hitting the Earth, erupted in an instant. It formed a terrifying tide that swept out in all directions. Whether it was Infinite Demon Mountain or the Federation Army, there were people who couldn’t dodge in time and were sucked into it.","Anyone who was caught in it would be turned into a bloody mist.","After this collision, a miserable cry came from Lion King. Everyone looked over and saw that Lion King’s arms were bleeding. The gloves on his hands were completely shattered. Although the quality of this magical weapon seemed very high, it failed to protect Lion King’s arms.","Chu Yunfan had smashed Lion King’s hands into pieces with a single punch. It was impossible to imagine what kind of terrifying attack Lion King’s hands had suffered.","Lion King retreated continuously, screaming as he tried to protect his body. However, the impact of the collision made him feel as if his muscles were about to break.","He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan’s full strength would be so difficult for him to resist.","“How is this possible? This is the combat strength of a half-step to the Core Stage. You’re not even at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage yet. How could you have reached this level?!”","Lion King was a knowledgeable man, so he immediately recognized Chu Yunfan’s current state. He felt that it was unbelievable. Even he had been trying to figure out some things about the Core Stage for so many years, but he had never been able to do it.","This was impossible!","There were very few people at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage who could do it. Not crossing that line was not crossing that line, but in the end, Chu Yunfan did it.","“That’s right, this is the Core Stage. It seems that you know quite a lot.”","Chu Yunfan laughed heartily. He would not let Lion King have a chance to recover. In an instant, he had already arrived in front of Lion King. Then, he casually threw a punch.","Lion King was shocked and immediately retreated. But how could his speed match Chu Yunfan’s? He could only use his already injured fists to try and stop Chu Yunfan’s advance.","Chu Yunfan’s simple punch contained great power. Lion King’s fists also turned into a cloud of blood mist after the collision.","Lion King let out a blood-curdling screech, but before he could recover, Chu Yunfan’s fist had already landed on his chest.","Bam!","Lion King let out a blood-curdling screech as he was sent flying like a kite with a broken string. He crashed into a mountain peak before finally coming to a stop. At this time, everyone could see that he was already dead. His chest had been shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch, and his internal organs had all turned into a cloud of blood mist. In this situation, even the gods of the great all-embracing heaven could not save him.","It was just a simple feat. Chu Yunfan had killed another of the three great demon kings of Infinite Demon Mountain, Lion King.","The morale of the Federation was greatly boosted when they saw this scene. It was a huge blow to Infinite Demon Mountain. Their king, the most powerful existence among them, was actually so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","He was easily killed by Chu Yunfan, and this was the second king to fall."]},{"number":1125,"title":"Chapter 1125 Slaying Flood Dragon King","paragraphs":["1125 Slaying Flood Dragon King","The demons only had a total of three kings, and Chu Yunfan had easily killed two of them.","It was easy to imagine how much of a blow this had dealt to the morale of Infinite Demon Mountain. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have dared to imagine that their three kings would be so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","On the other side, Flood Dragon King had just blocked Chu Yunfan’s sword qi. But before he could react, Chu Yunfan had already killed Lion King with lightning speed.","He felt a chill down his spine and all the hair on his body stood on end. He finally understood why Silver Moon King had not been able to hold on for such a short time.","It wasn’t that Silver Moon King was too weak. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan was too terrifying.","The strength of the three great kings was similar. They were all well-known figures among those at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. However, none of them had entered the half-step to Core Stage.","Now, Lion King couldn’t even block a few simple moves from Chu Yunfan. If he were in Lion King’s place, the result would probably be the same.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan turned his gaze over, Flood Dragon King felt as as if he was being stared at by a terrifying beast.","His first reaction was to flee, but then he suddenly realized that he was at Infinite Demon Mountain. Where could he run to?","This was a war of genocide. The Federation was not here to kill a few monsters and forget about it. Their goal was to completely annihilate Infinite Demon Mountain.","Under such circumstances, he had no other choice but to fight with all his might.","“It’s your turn next!”","Chu Yunfan looked at Flood Dragon King. Even when facing the attacks of two kings at the same time, he was not afraid. In his opinion, Flood Dragon King and Lion King were very strong, but they were only about the same level as Silver Moon King. Compared to him, they were far too weak.","Without truly grasping some of the fighting abilities of the Core Stage, there was no chance of winning against him.","Flood Dragon King did not retreat. Behind him was Infinite Demon Mountain, so there was no way for him to retreat. All he did was roar, “Chu Yunfan, you think you can do whatever you want today?! Great Ancestor, please kill the strong enemy!”","Flood Dragon King bellowed and deep bugle horns sounded from the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain as though they were calling out to someone.","“Who are you trying to invite? No one can save you!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He could sense that a powerful aura was awakening in the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain as if someone had been forcibly awakened from a deep slumber.","He knew that the true power of Infinite Demon Mountain was about to come. The demons had been in the Kunlun Realm for so many years, so how could they not have any trump cards?","This aura was so strong that even he had to cast a sidelong glance.","“Hahahaha, Chu Yunfan, do you think you can still do whatever you want? You’ll die when the Great Ancestor gets here!” Flood Dragon King laughed. At the thought of the Great Ancestor, he seemed to have found his backbone.","It had been a long time since he had felt this. At the same time, it had also been a long time since he had encountered such a terrifying and troublesome enemy that he did not have the power to resist.","“I don’t care who that is. If they dare to appear in front of me, I’ll kill them too. But before that, I’ll kill you first!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","He was already ready to move. The thunder wings behind him unfurled and his speed was so fast that many people did not even have time to see him clearly. They only saw him grab a thunder sword in his hand, and the sword light was hundreds of feet long. It shot straight into the sky and slashed down at Flood Dragon King.","Flood Dragon King couldn’t match up to Chu Yunfan’s speed. It was simply beyond his dynamic vision. He could only rely on his instinct to attack, and the halberd blocked in front of him.","Clang!","As the sword light came down, it was blocked by the halberd. However, it was not completely blocked. The sword light sliced off a large piece of flesh from Flood Dragon King’s shoulder. It looked like he was covered in blood as it splattered, dyeing the entire sky red.","Flood Dragon King let out a blood-curdling screech, but he did not launch any counterattacks at Chu Yunfan. At this moment, he no longer had the heart to continue fighting. After just a few moves, Chu Yunfan had already made him feel what true terror was, beating him until he could no longer fight back.","At this time, waiting for the Great Ancestor’s arrival was the best solution. He kept retreating, trying to avoid Chu Yunfan’s attack.","Flood Dragon Kign was growing anxious. He never thought that the process of awakening the Great Ancestor would be so complicated.","It must be known that it had only been a short time. However, Chu Yunfan was too terrifying. Flood Dragon King felt like every second was as long as a century.","“Trying to leave?”","Chu Yunfan naturally wouldn’t let Flood Dragon King get away. Flood Dragon King had planned countless attacks on the Federation over the years, and he had killed at least hundreds of millions of people. He was also at the top of the Federation’s wanted list.","However, in the past, no one had been able to do anything to Flood Dragon King. Even the president was only on par with him and had no way of doing anything to him.","And now that Chu Yunfan had such a good opportunity, he naturally wouldn’t let him run away.","Rays of sword light shot out from Chu Yunfan’s fingertips. The sword light swept out and turned into a terrifying storm. With Chu Yunfan as the center, it flew toward Flood Dragon King.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","With a series of loud booms, Chu Yunfan’s simple sword light left huge wounds on Flood Dragon King’s body. Each wound was so deep that the bones could be seen.","In fact, if not for the protection of Flood Dragon King’s armor, he would have already been turned into minced meat by Chu Yunfan’s sword light.","It was only now that Flood Dragon King truly felt how sharp Chu Yunfan’s sword light was. It had reached a level that no one had ever reached before.","He never knew that someone’s sword light could be so terrifying that it could force him to this extent. Chu Yunfan didn’t even use any divine techniques or magic weapons and he was already extremely terrifying.","“Who are you?! How dare you act so impudently in Infinite Demon Mountain!”","Suddenly, an ancient and furious roar came from the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain, shaking the entire world.","Flood Dragon King’s face immediately revealed a look of joy. The opportunity he had been waiting for had finally arrived. He didn’t even care about being cut by Chu Yunfan’s sword light and was bleeding.","“You think you can leave? You’re too naive!” Chu Yunfan shouted coldly, and a sword light flashed out. Flood Dragon King, who thought he was saved, was beheaded by the sword light."]},{"number":1126,"title":"Chapter 1126 Infinite Demon Mountain’s Heritage — A Core Stage Expert","paragraphs":["1126 Infinite Demon Mountain’s Heritage — A Core Stage Expert","Flood Dragon King’s head that had been sent flying had an expression of disbelief on its face. He was clearly just one step away from escaping.","However, at this critical moment, Chu Yunfan’s sword cut off his head and killed him.","A terrifying aura spread out. Just the aura alone was enough to make the Federation’s Army stop in their tracks.","“I never thought that a day would come when weak humans would fight their way here!”","In the depths of Infinite Demon Mountain, a figure slowly walked out. Every step he took shook the earth.","The crowd finally saw that it was a hunched old man. His hair and beard were extremely sparse as if he would die of old age in front of everyone in the next moment.","However, unlike his appearance, his steps were extremely firm. Each step was sonorous and powerful and his voice was like a great bell. His body was filled with an unimaginably terrifying aura. He alone was enough to suppress the experts of the Federation who were fighting.","“The Core Stage!”","Chu Yunfan’s pupils contracted. This man was actually a Core.","But Chu Yunfan wasn’t surprised. With the foundation of Infinite Demon Mountain, it wasn’t strange for them to have a Core Stage expert.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan remembered a record from the Federation. Hundreds of years ago, when the Federation had just entered the Kunlun Realm, they were attacked by Infinite Demon Mountain and were almost wiped out.","At that time, there was a demon-like existence who single=handedly defeated the millions of Federation soldiers.","At that time, the Federation did not have any martial arts experts. There were only a few Innate experts. The development of science and technology could not be compared to the present. At that time, they almost had no power to fight back.","Under those circumstances, the Federation had no choice but to use a large number of nuclear bombs to kill the other party. From start to finish, that existence alone had caused hundreds of millions of deaths and injuries.","The other party also seemed to be very arrogant and did not seriously protect themselves, so they were destroyed by the nuclear bomb.","Chu Yunfan recalled the figure recorded in the document. It was very similar to the old man in front of him. People grew old, but their energy would not be different.","Chu Yunfan quickly recognized that this old man was the terrifying demonic god who almost annihilated the Federation. Counting the time, he was indeed in his prime hundreds of years ago.","According to the records of the Federation at that time, one person had defeated an army of millions, directly and indirectly causing hundreds of millions of casualties. Even the current Chu Yunfan couldn’t do this, so the only possibility was that he was a Core.","And if there was no one else, then this should be the expert from back then.","Looking at the intertwining life and death energy in the Core’s body, Chu Yunfan immediately made a judgment. This was indeed the same person from back then. The Federation thought that they had destroyed the other party with nuclear bombs, but in fact, the other party did not die.","However, it was obvious that the nuclear bomb back then did not let him off easily. In fact, even if it was a nuclear bomb from hundreds of years ago, a Core would have been seriously injured or even killed if he was not prepared.","The old man in the Core Stage was clearly severely injured, and it was possible that he had been left with inerasable injuries. This was why the Federation had not seen him for so many years. In the official records, it was recorded that he was dead.","“Old Flood Dragon King! It’s Old Flood Dragon King!” an expert from Infinite Demon Mountain cried out in surprise. Many demons felt their spirits lift. They had not expected Old Flood Dragon King would still be alive in this world after the three great kings had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","After the battle hundreds of years ago, Old Flood Dragon King had returned with serious injuries. Not long after that, the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom announced to the public that Old Flood Dragon King had perished. Since then, the current Flood Dragon King had taken over the throne of the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom.","For hundreds of years, no one knew that Old Flood Dragon King was still alive. But now, there was no doubt that this was a huge trump card.","With such an expert, they had the hope of turning the tables and killing the elites of the Federation. If they could do it, the destruction of the Federation would only be a matter of time.","In this battle, both sides were staking everything on one throw.","“You didn’t expect that the weak humans could kill their way here. We also didn’t expect that the Core Stage expert we should have killed hundreds of years ago is still alive,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“That’s right. I didn’t expect that with the lifespan of humans and your age, you would know the secret of hundreds of years ago.” Old Flood Dragon King sneered at Chu Yunfan.","“This isn’t a secret, but I’m curious. It’s been hundreds of years. How much of your original strength can you still use?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","If Old Flood Dragon King was in the Core Stage at his peak, Chu Yunfan would have no choice but to fight with his life on the line. However, Old Flood Dragon King was different. Although he was also in the Core Stage, it was obvious that he was no longer in his peak condition.","He was old and weak, and he had suffered a fatal injury before. Not much of his power was left.","Chu Yunfan was even a little excited. It was rare to have the experience of fighting with a Core, especially before fighting that God. This was undoubtedly a valuable experience.","“It’s enough to kill you!” Old Flood Dragon King’s divine will had already covered the entire battlefield, and he could see the entire situation clearly. The one who was in real danger was Chu Yunfan’s group. The other groups were being held back by many experts, and only Chu Yunfan’s group was advancing by leaps and bounds, and no one could stop them.","Even the three great kings had been killed by Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan was stopped, the offense of the Federation Army would be contained.","“Rrrraaagh!”","Old Flood Dragon King let out a long roar and spat out an astonishing saber light from his mouth. It tore a huge crack in the sky and then slashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Although it was just a simple attack, it had great power. Whether it was the monsters or the Federation’s mecha army, they were all suppressed and were unable to move. It was as if someone was suppressing them on a spiritual level.","Everyone knew that this was all because of Old Flood Dragon King.","But just as the saber light was about to land on Chu Yunfan’s body, he suddenly took a step forward and broke through Old Flood Dragon King’s pressure.","His entire body was glowing, and countless streams of sword qi gushed out from his body. They turned into a terrifying sword light in the air, and slashed down toward the saber light."]},{"number":1127,"title":"Chapter 1127 Fighting a Core Stage With All His Might","paragraphs":["1127 Fighting a Core Stage With All His Might","Boom!","The attacks from both sides collided, and the sky exploded. This was even more shocking than when Chu Yunfan had killed the three great kings.","They were not on the same level.","Although Chu Yunfan’s actions when he killed the three great kings were shocking, he didn’t actually use his full strength.","It was only now that Chu Yunfan finally unleashed his terrifying combat power as a half-step to Core Stage expert.","And he was even more terrifying than an ordinary half-step to Core Stage expert. Previously, the First Divine Servant couldn’t even withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","Old Flood Dragon King’s eyes were filled with disbelief when he saw that Chu Yunfan had easily blocked his attack. It was clear that Chu Yunfan’s strength had also exceeded the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage and was even a half-step to Core Stage.","A terrifying killing intent flashed through Old Flood Dragon King’s eyes.","With his insight, he could see that Chu Yunfan was very young. At such a young age, his cultivation had actually reached such a level. If he was given more time, Chu Yunfan would reach an extremely shocking level in the future.","The current Federation was no longer the same as it was hundreds of years ago. It had the ability to continue developing. Hundreds of years was just a generation for Infinite Demon Mountain, but for the Federation, it could develop to an earth-shaking extent.","Hundreds of years ago, Old Flood Dragon King had almost wiped out the Federation single-handedly. Now, Infinite Demon Mountain was about to be destroyed by the Federation. They found out that Infinite Demon Mountain was planning to destroy the Federation, which led to the Federation’s crazy counterattack.","However, Old Flood Dragon King didn’t think there was any problem. If it were him, he would have made the same decision. In the past, Infinite Demon Mountain had always been stronger than the Federation. However, in just a few hundred years, the strength of the two sides had become balanced. If the humans continued to develop, with their speed of scientific and technological development, it would not take long for them to completely surpass Infinite Demon Mountain.","At that time, Infinite Demon Mountain would not even have the ability to counterattack. Rather than being killed like a frog being boiled in hot water, it would be better to fight to the death.","At the end of the day, the civilization of Infinite Demon Mountain was far too different from that of the Federation. There were many demons in Infinite Demon Mountain who had taken human form, and many of them were as intelligent as humans. Some of them were even much smarter than ordinary humans.","However, they existed in the form of tribes and could not be considered a mature civilization. Although they had captured many talents from the Federation through various means, they were unable to form a unified civilization, which was the biggest disadvantage while facing the Federation.","Thinking of this, the killing intent in Old Flood Dragon King’s eyes became even more terrifying.","“Human, your strength is indeed far beyond the average half-step to Core Stage. However, it’s useless to have combat strength of half-step to Core Stage. You can’t understand the scariness of Core Stage,” Old Flood Dragon King said coldly. His divine will had completely locked onto Chu Yunfan.","Waves of terrifying pressure enveloped Chu Yunfan and the air around him began to tremble violently.","“Can you do it?” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “With your current state, you will die if you dare to make ten moves.”","Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid of Old Flood Dragon King. He could clearly see that although Old Flood Dragon King looked terrifying, it was impossible for him to unleash all of his battle prowess, because that would lead to his death.","The injuries from hundreds of years ago were still tormenting him, forcing him to use all his combat strength to suppress the injuries in his body. Once it was fully released, Old Flood Dragon King would immediately self-destruct and die on the battlefield.","“Ten moves? That’s enough. Can you withstand ten of my moves?” Old Flood Dragon King snorted coldly.","“Come and try me.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Old Flood Dragon King took another look at Chu Yunfan, and in the blink of an eye, he moved. A pair of dragon wings appeared behind him, and after he released his full combat power, his aura instantly filled the entire sky.","The sky was filled with silhouettes. In an instant, they had split into thousands of them and swept across the entire battlefield.","Under this attack, many mechas that were unable to dodge in time exploded in mid-air. Although they were made with the Federation’s most advanced technology, they were useless against Old Flood Dragon King. They were blown up in just one attack.","In the end, these tens of millions of figures turned into one figure in the void and bared down on Chu Yunfan.","Old Flood Dragon King’s speed was fast, and his figure filled the sky, making it impossible for anyone to catch his figure.","Chu Yunfan took a step forward. In an instant, without any fear, he charged forward. Around his body, countless blood-red energy boiled up and formed a blood-red skeleton in the air, protecting him.","Then, he threw a punch at the palm that was falling from the sky.","Boom!","The huge energy cyclone formed into a terrible energy storm that spread across the entire battlefield. Whether it was the experts of Infinite Demon Mountain or the marine folks, they all retreated in all directions at this time. Many of them were even blown away. Those who didn’t have time to dodge spurted out a mouthful of blood, suffering from the extremely terrible impact.","However, before everyone could react, a few loud explosions were heard in the endless tide of explosions.","It was as if huge cannonballs had collided and exploded.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Every time a collision occurred, the violent sound waves seemed to tear the sky apart.","Even a Divine could only vaguely capture the two violent figures bombarding each other with their divine power.","Their eyes were blinded by the energy tide, but they knew that even if they could see it, it was most likely that they couldn’t see it at all. The speed of the two had clearly exceeded the scope of the Divine Abilities Stage, reaching a level that made them tremble in fear.","Any one of them had unimaginable power.","“Human, let’s see how long you can last!” Old Flood Dragon King’s furious roar could be heard amidst the explosion.","“I’ll definitely last longer than you!” Chu Yunfan’s loud and clear voice came.","Boom!","There was another huge explosion, and then everyone saw two figures, one in front and one behind, crisscrossing and flying out.","When they saw the scene of the two, everyone was shocked beyond belief."]},{"number":1128,"title":"Chapter 1128 The Old Dragon at the Core Stage","paragraphs":["1128 The Old Dragon at the Core Stage","The two of them were covered in blood.","Though Old Flood Dragon King was a little hunched, he was still more than two meters tall. The crowd could easily pick him out of the two.","Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan did not look too good at the moment. After taking on several full-force attacks from Old Flood Dragon King, all the muscles in his body had been torn apart, and cracks had appeared on his skin. It was a rather terrifying sight.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed it.","!!","Opposite him, Old Flood Dragon King wasn’t doing any better. To be more precise, he was also bleeding all over. However, compared to Chu Yunfan, all the blood in his body seemed to have burst out.","There was a terrifying light in his eyes. He had used all his strength in the previous few attacks, but Chu Yunfan not only didn’t dodge, but also fought back, trading injury for injury, fighting speed with speed.","Each time, he would severely injure Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan’s counterattacks would also shake his injuries, causing his whole body to ooze blood. It was a terrifying sight.","Old Flood Dragon King was suppressing the injuries from hundreds of years ago but it did not mean that they had been cured. He had been too arrogant back then, and now, this had become his fatal injury.","He could feel his life force draining away at an alarming rate. If this continued, he might really explode and die.","Old Flood Dragon King saw through Chu Yunfan’s purpose. Chu Yunfan wanted to fight with him and trade injury for injury. Chu Yunfan could afford to be injured. He was young, his physical cultivation was terrifyingly strong, and his recovery ability was also stronger than his.","A look of extreme shock flashed through Old Flood Dragon King’s eyes. Chu Yunfan was extremely fast, especially when he was using the golden roc punch technique. Coupled with the thunder wings on his back, his speed had reached an extremely shocking level.","Old Flood Dragon King was sure that even though he had entered the Core Stage, he was still slightly inferior to Chu Yunfan. It was because of this that he had no choice but to exhaust all his energy to use a wide-range attack to force Chu Yunfan into a corner.","If they did not respond, the Federation Army on the battlefield would suffer heavy casualties.","However, even so, he failed to gain any advantage. Chu Yunfan shook his injuries, and he couldn’t suppress them anymore. His life force was rapidly flowing away.","He had never thought that he would one day be forced into such a state by a Divine. It was simply too illogical.","Spurt!","Old Flood Dragon King coughed up out a mouthful of blood. He sighed in his heart. Had he really become so old?","However, the killing intent in his heart deepened even further. The more it was like this, the more he couldn’t let Chu Yunfan go. If he could kill Chu Yunfan, there was a chance to redeem himself.","In front of him, Chu Yunfan’s figure was ramrod straight. Although he was covered in blood, he looked like a god of war.","“I’d like to see how long you can last!” Old Flood Dragon King said through gritted teeth.","“Old man, you’d better take care of yourself first. How many moves can you still afford to maske?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. His entire body was bleeding, and even his Imperial Physique had been severely injured by Old Flood Dragon King.","One could easily imagine how terrifying Old Flood Dragon King’s combat strength was.","Facing such a powerful opponent, Chu Yunfan didn’t have the slightest bit of fear. On the contrary, he used this to measure the combat power of that God.","Now, Chu Yunfan had touched the edge of the Core Stage. He had a real understanding of its combat strength and it was not just from the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","The memories of the Alchemy Emperor were just that—memories. Only what one truly understood could become their own.","Chu Yunfan was in a terrible state, but Old Flood Dragon King was probably in an even worse state.","“One move is enough. If you want to kill you and destroy Infinite Demon Mountain, you’ll have to get past me first!” Old Flood Dragon King roared.","“What makes you think you can sotp me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Rrrragh!”","Old Flood Dragon King roared and transformed into a terrifying thousand-meter long flood dragon. It coiled up like a huge mountain and sat on Infinite Demon Mountain, looking extremely terrifying.","The flood dragon’s body was full of wounds. It was only at this moment that everyone could see clearly that the wounds were rotten beyond compare.","For hundreds of years, Old Flood Dragon King had barely suppressed his injuries, but the wounds were still rotting and devouring his life. Otherwise, according to the lifespan of a flood dragon and the fact that he was a Core, it would be far more than this.","The trauma left behind by that battle back then was extremely shocking now.","Chu Yunfan didn’t need to do anything. All he needed to do was trigger his old injuries.","Chu Yunfan’s expression started to turn serious. He knew that this was probably Old Flood Dragon King’s last attack. His life or death would be decided in this one move.","“Rrrraaagh!”","Old Flood Dragon King pounced. His entire body emitted waves of light. At this moment, a terrifying light burst out.","Everyone was dazzled, as if they could see the entire world shaking violently.","Chu Yunfan also rose into the air, and the divine power in his body was also urged to the extreme. In an instant, it exploded out. His left hand and right hand respectively performed the asura punch and the garuda punch, which turned into an asura and a golden roc.","A man and a dragon collided in mid-air. It was like a collision of comets.","Boom!","The sky exploded, and endless energy waves spread in all directions.","As this astonishing collision resounded, the experts of both sides opened their eyes wide, wanting to see the outcome of the clash. The outcome would effect the outcome of the war. No one else had the ability to determine the outcome.","If Chu Yunfan won, the Federation would destroy Infinite Demon Mountain. If Old Flood Dragon King won, the Federation retreat and would probably have to face the counterattack of Infinite Demon Mountain.","Both sides had no room for retreat. They had no other choice.","Old Flood Dragon King’s huge body was the first to appear in front of everyone.","“We won?” The experts of Infinite Demon Mountain were all overjoyed. It seemed like Old Flood Dragon King had won.","However, before they could celebrate, Old Flood Dragon King’s huge body exploded. His flesh and blood turned into a rain of blood that rained down on Infinite Demon Mountain as if the heavens were crying.","This sealed the fate of Infinite Demon Mountain and the demon race.","And in this endless rain of blood, a huge hand reached out and grabbed Old Flood Dragon King’s inner core that was about to fly away.","“Everyone, Old Flood Dragon King is dead. Infinite Demon Mountain will be destroyed today. Follow me and kill the enemy!”"]},{"number":1129,"title":"Chapter 1129 The Curtain Falls, Infinite Demon Mountain Is Destroyed","paragraphs":["1129 The Curtain Falls, Infinite Demon Mountain Is Destroyed","A figure rushed out from the rain of blood. Although he was also covered in blood, he had a soaring aura!","Everyone knew who it was. It was Chu Yunfan!","“How is this possible?! The old king is dead!” one fod the Divine monsters said in disbelief. The Federation might not know, but he knew it all too well. In Infinite Demon Mountain, Old Flood Dragon King was a legend. For so many years, he might be the only monster king who had entered the Core Stage in thousands of years.","To Infinite Demon Mountain, it was a sign that they were moving toward a new level. Although Infinite Demon Mountain’s speed of progress was not as fast as the Federation, it was still constantly improving.","!!","In the war hundreds of years ago, the Federation had suffered heavy casualties, but Infinite Demon Mountain did not end up well either.","And now, the legendary figure from hundreds of years ago had come to an end. His body turned into a rain of blood, falling on Infinite Demon Mountain. Every drop of blood was like a big stone falling on a wall, leaving a deep pit.","He did not even have the time to lament before he was killed by a Divine from the Federation.","And this was only a miniature version of it. Old Flood Dragon King’s defeat was the result of him burning his own life for Infinite Demon Mountain in a battle to the death with Chu Yunfan.","However, Old Flood Dragon King would never have expected that Chu Yunfan, who he thought would die in three moves, would turn out to be his gravedigger.","However, he had no other choice. Even if he knew this result, he couldn’t escape. Infinite Demon Mountain had been destroyed, and no egg could remain intact under a destroyed nest.","Countless monsters on Infinite Demon Mountain were crying. They seemed to be crying for Old Flood Dragon King, but at the same time, they were crying for Infinite Demon Mountain and their own fate.","On the other hand, the people from the Federation were overjoyed. Chu Yunfan’s performance had far exceeded their expectations. Even those who had been looking forward to it would never have thought that Chu Yunfan could single-handedly kill three demon kings, and even kill the legendary Old Flood Dragon King who was in the Core Stage.","“Mighty Chu!”","“Mighty Chu!”","“Mighty Chu!”","Chu Yunfan’s nickname began to echo on the battlefield, and the morale of countless people was greatly boosted.","The sect leader of Moonfall glanced at the sect leaders of Longevity Faith and Infinity Camp. They could see the shock in each other’s eyes and understood what the other was saying. Chu Yunfan was simply too strong.","It could even be said that Chu Yunfan was even stronger than before. Half a year ago in the Holy Land, Chu Yunfan was definitely not this strong. Half a year later, Chu Yunfan had made great progress. Regardless of whether he had reached the same realm or not, his combat strength had indeed entered the half-step to Core Stage. Even Old Flood Dragon King, who was in the Core Stage, had died at his hands.","Although Old Flood Dragon King had his own problems and wasn’t in his peak state, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan’s strength had exceeded the ordinary half-step to Core Stage, reaching a level that no one had ever reached before, and no one would be able to come after.","Chu Yunfan was immersed in the feeling of killing Old Flood Dragon King. Although it could be said that Old Flood Dragon King had died because of his own injuries, he had also performed beyond his usual level in the last attack, and had truly touched the essence of the Core Stage.","The experience of this battle was not something that could be understood by words alone. In that critical moment, Chu Yunfan had learned much from Old Flood Dragon King.","He had not been completely confident before, but after this battle, he was completely confident. When he broke through to tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage, his combat strength would also break through to the Core Stage.","This battle was extremely important to him. It was the whetstone before the final battle.","“Follow me and kill the enemy!”","Chu Yunfan let out a loud shout, and the morale of the millions of elite soldiers of the Federation was greatly boosted. They followed Chu Yunfan and charged forward.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan was flying in the air. Everyone could see that his body was faintly emitting waves of heat. The blood on his body began to evaporate, gradually revealing his original appearance.","In a short period, Chu Yunfan’s injuries had gradually recovered. The power of the Imperial Physique was evident from this, especially to the Divines. They could understand how terrifying Chu Yunfan was in this state.","If it were them, they would need at least a few days to recuperate from such injuries. The body of a Divine was very strong, but it was not untouchable.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan had recovered in a short time. Even if their strength was similar, they would still be slowly dragged to death by such a person, not to mention that their strength was far from Chu Yunfan’s.","Ebony Dragon King flew over to Chu Yunfan’s side and helped him block all kinds of attacks from Infinite Demon Mountain. Now that Infinite Demon Mountain’s defense system had been broken, the scattered attacks could no longer pose much of a threat to Ebony Dragon King.","He, who was at tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage, was extremely powerful on the battlefield.","Although Ebony Dragon King was born in Infinite Demon Mountain, he didn’t show any mercy. He even had an incomparable hatred for Infinite Demon Mountain. After he surrendered, the Ebony Dragon tribe he was from was slaughtered by Infinite Demon Mountain. Only a few of them managed to escape and find him.","Overnight, his tribe was left with only a few members.","It could be said that Ebony Dragon King hated Infinite Demon Mountain to the core, and the enmity between the two sides was irreconcilable. Therefore, he didn’t feel sad about the destruction of Infinite Demon Mountain. He only felt extremely happy.","Soon, Chu Yunfan had already recovered, and at this time, the recovered Chu Yunfan truly felt how terrifying he was. The power of thunder surged out from his body and turned into a thunder bow.","On the other hand, Chu Yunfan was like a fixed cannon on the battlefield. Even a Divine couldn’t dodge an arrow from him and would be instantly killed.","Chu Yunfan’s current strength was already on a completely different level from the Divine Abilities Stage. He was not someone they could resist at all.","As Chu Yunfan continued to shoot down the Divines of Infinite Demon Mountain, who posed a huge threat to the Federation’s Army, the Federation’s Army could be said to have entered no man’s land.","Chu Yunfan didn’t only target these Divine monsters. It should be said that wherever there was a large-scale resistance, Chu Yunfan’s arrow would destroy the line of defense there.","The war behemoths that had once posed a huge threat to the Federation were also killed in droves by Chu Yunfan and the endless firepower of the Star Destroyer.","The Federation Army continued to break through Infinite Demon Mountain’s defensive lines one after another. The experts of Infinite Demon Mountain who were forced into a dead end fought with all their might. They had been surrounded in all directions and had no way to escape. The reinforcements outside were also blocked. This was a dead end.","During the war, the Federation fought a bloody battle for three days and three nights. Most of the monsters on Infinite Demon Mountain were exterminated. The war finally came to an end."]},{"number":1130,"title":"Chapter 1130 The Federation Is in an Uproar","paragraphs":["1130 The Federation Is in an Uproar","The bloody battle lasted for three days and three nights. The once-insufferably arrogant behemoth that had almost destroyed the Federation was destroyed in the hands of the Federation Army.","The last bit of resistance had been wiped out.","Of course, this didn’t mean that the demons only had these experts. The strength and heritage of the demons were far more than that. However, for the Federation, the destruction of Infinite Demon Mountain had great significance.","The demons were still very powerful. It could even be said that they were still very dangerous to ordinary people. However, without the link of Infinite Demon Mountain, they did not have the possibility of challenging the Federation and becoming a real threat.","Just like the marine folks in the past, they were now a pile of loose sand and posed no threat at all. Even if there was another powerful expert among the demons after that, if they wanted to unify the demons, they would have to ask if the Federation was willing.","After all, the existence of Infinite Demon Mountain was longer than the history of the Federation. The Federation couldn’t do anything about it. However, from now on, as long as such a sign appeared among the demons, it would naturally be suppressed until the strength of the Federation grew enough to truly dominate the Kunlun Realm and no one could rival it.","Without the core of Infinite Demon Mountain, and without the leviathan of the demons living within the Federation, even if a few Divine monsters joined forces to launch a monster swarm, it would be impossible to shake the overall situation of the Federation.","A few nuclear bombs would be enough to turn the monster swarm into nothing.","It was basically certain that in the foreseeable future, the demons would no longer be a major threat to the Federation.","To the Federation, it was easy to imagine how much pressure it was under to face two behemoths at the same time. Now that they had finally gotten rid of their long-standing enemy, they could finally heave a long sigh of relief.","As soon as the news was released, the Federation was in an uproar. The higher-ups had kept this matter a secret. Even until the very last moment, no one knew that the Federation had launched a large-scale attack to take revenge on Infinite Demon Mountain. Only the high ranking officers of the marshal level would know the ultimate purpose of the battle. No one else knew.","If the internal department of the Federation had kept it so strictly confidential, then it was even more so for the ordinary people. They had not even received any news of it.","The ordinary people were even discussing the joint attack of Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks on Capital City almost a week ago.","There were still many people clamoring for revenge on the Internet. When had the Federation ever suffered such a great humiliation? They had been beaten to a pulp. The destruction of three base cities and hundreds of millions of deaths had caused a huge uproar. Even now, on the Interneet, countless people were mourning the heavy losses.","Many people even criticized the Federation Government for its inaction. The citizens of the Federation had suffered heavy casualties, but the Federation had not taken any action. No one had expected that such a piece of news would be transmitted at this time.","In an instant, this news exploded throughout the Federation. Everyone was completely dumbfounded. In the beginning, they didn’t dare to believe it. No one thought that the Federation could really destroy Infinite Demon Mountain. After all, it was already good enough that the Federation wasn’t destroyed. For hundreds of years, this notion had been deeply embedded in the bones of the Federation. Such a behemoth was stronger than the current Federation.","It was impossible to destroy them just like that.","When this plan was first proposed, almost everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had gone crazy. But it was only because Chu Yunfan insisted on it, and with the support of the president, that the extermination of the demons was carried out.","This was because no one had truly discovered that the Federation had already surpassed Infinite Demon Mountain in terms of heritage and foundation. The only thing they lacked was the number of top experts that could not be compared to Infinite Demon Mountain.","After the Holy Land integrated into the Federation and hundreds of Divines were born because of the Divinity Nourishment Pills, this problem was completely solved. Not only did the Federation catch up, but it even surpassed Infinite Demon Mountain.","Of course, the most important thing was Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan’s existence, it wouldn’t have been so easy for the Federation to destroy Infinite Demon Mountain, and they would have to face a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood.","At that time, the losses might be dozens of times that of this operation. It was even possible that the whole team would be wiped out and both sides would suffer heavy losses.","Chu Yunfan’s existence was like a stabilizing needle, stabilizing all the waves.","As time passed, more information and details were revealed. The citizens of the Federation finally believed that the Federation had truly eliminated a major threat that had been plaguing them for hundreds of years.","For hundreds of years, the humans had been living in fear, afraid that Infinite Demon Mountain would attack them at any time. They did have the strength and the will to do so.","And now, they could finally heave a sigh of relief.","This was especially so when the marine folks had also stood on the opposite side of the Federation some time ago. This had made countless people feel suffocated.","In addition, the three behemoths had always been restless and wanted to conquer the Federation. They suppressed the Federation until it was breathless. Many people were afraid that when they woke up, the Federation would have already been destroyed.","Or, like the people in Binhai City and the other three base cities, they were killed by monsters in their sleep.","And obviously, the key person in this situation was Chu Yunfan. In the eyes of many people, he was undoubtedly the key to solving this chaotic situation.","First, he resolved the issue of the Holy Land, which had wanted to take over the Federation. He even took in the power of the Holy Land for his own use, turning it from an opponent of the Federation to a power of the Federation.","Now, he had led a team to destroy Infinite Demon Mountain in one fell swoop. At this time, Chu Yunfan’s achievements was a brilliant story for the history books. Even the illustrious president of the Federation had not been able to do this.","Chu Yunfan’s reputation in the Federation rose sharply. No one doubted that as long as he was willing to participate in the election, he would definitely become the next president of the Federation.","After all, although the term of office of the Federation’s president was long, it was not a lifetime term. With Chu Yunfan’s strength and current prestige, it was reasonable for him to be the next president.","As of now, Chu Yunfan had already led the way to destroy two of the three great mountains above the Federation. The only ones left were the marine folks and the legendary God.","The shocking battle between the God and the president still left the Divines in fear. If not for the president’s sacrifice to stop the God, Capital City would not have been able to defend itself.","The God alone was enough to turn the Federation upside down.","As the news spread, not only did it cause a sensation throughout the Federation, but it also shocked the marine folks, who had been constantly clamoring."]},{"number":1131,"title":"Chapter 1131 The Collapse of the Marine Folks and the Frenzied Killing of the Federation","paragraphs":["1131 The Collapse of the Marine Folks and the Frenzied Killing of the Federation","Ever since the Internet had been used, many marine folks had been stirring up trouble on the Internet, constantly shouting and provoking.","The marine folks and Infinite Demon Mountain had destroyed three base cities in a row. They had even attacked Capital City and severely injured the president of the Federation.","During this period of time, Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks had the upper hand, and they were clamoring. When the news first came out, no one among the marine folks believed it. They thought that the Federation Goverment was faking the news to restore morale.","However, as time passed, more and more details were revealed. More and more videos were revealed. Everyone saw that Infinite Demon Mountain had been taken down. The strength of the Federation was truly revealed. Millions of elite mechas flew through the sky in the videos. It was an extremely terrifying scene.","The marine folks’s channels quickly received the news. This was actually not fake. The Federation had truly taken action and cleaned up Infinite Demon Mountain.","The nuclear bombs opened up a path, and what followed was an extremely shocking and earth-shattering battle, especially when Chu Yunfan killed the three demon kings and then fought and killed the Core Stage Old Flood Dragon King.","The views of these videos increased at a rate of hundreds of millions per minute. In fact, many people were watching to their heart’s content and wanted to watch it over and over again. Chu Yunfan was like a true god of war. The famous demon kings of the three great demon kingdoms were completely vulnerable in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","The battle with Old Flood Dragon King after that was even more shocking. Everyone could tell at a glance that it was impossible to fake. The scene and scale were beyond the imagination of current movie-makers.","Many people guessed that Chu Yunfan had already entered the Core Stage.","After the battle of Capital City, the God who mysteriously appeared made the general public aware of the existence of the Core Stage. It turned out that the Divine Abilities Stage was not the end. There was still the legendary Core Stage above the Divine Abilities Stage.","Many people did not know how terrifying the Core Stage was, but after this battle, they understood it a little more. Even if Chu Yunfan had not reached the Core Stage, even though Old Flood Dragon King was seriously injured and was not at his peak, they would still be able to fight in the Core Stage.","The two of them were enough to sweep across the entire battlefield. No one could stop them. Many people who didn’t have time to dodge were swallowed by the aftermath.","These two people were so powerful, not to mention the real masters of Core Stage. It was not an exaggeration to call them gods.","Many people had been worried about the God. Although the president had risked his life to repel him, those with discerning eyes could see that the president would not have a second chance to use life-risking strike. Who would be able to stop that God next time?","And now that Chu Yunfan had displayed such astonishing combat strength, perhaps he could contend against that God.","After confirming that Infinite Demon Mountain had indeed been destroyed, the marine folks were jittery and were on edge.","They could see that the demons and the marine folks had really angered the Federation. They were going to annihilate the two races even if they had to pay a huge price. Infinite Demon Mountain had been uprooted, and the marine folks would be the next to face the Federation’s wrath.","In the coastal areas, many tribes ruled by Divine marine folks were frantically evacuating from the coastal areas, afraid of being struck by the Federation’s nuclear bombs.","Infinite Demon Mountain had developed some technological weapons, possessed a considerable number of nuclear bombs, and had a huge fleet.","However, the marine folks relied on their tyrannical strength. When their strength did not have the upper hand, they would appear very fragile when facing an opponent like the Federation.","And sure enough, after Infinite Demon Mountain, the Federation’s Army didn’t take much time to recuperate before they launched an attack on the marine folks. Because of Chu Yunfan’s existence, they didn’t suffer too many losses in the battle at Infinite Demon Mountain, so they were able to support the next battle.","Although the material consumption was extremely huge, it was the least of the problems for the rich and overbearing Federation. They had not even entered the wartime mobilization system. The military system of the Federation alone was enough to cope with the consumption.","Of course, for the many forces inside and outside the Federation that were involved in the production of firearms, this was a feast of gluttony. Many forces of the Federation were involved. With the support of these forces, the Federation launched a clean-up of the marine folks.","One by one, nuclear bombs were produced on the production line. One by one, mechas were sent to the battlefield. One by one, battleships were launched for trial flights. The Federation, the huge war machine, was finally fully mobilized.","Under such circumstances, the marine folks quickly retreated. Without the God’s support, the marine folks was simply a plate of loose sand.","Although the marine folks was endless and seemed to be a more terrifying force than the demons, it was because the Infinite Sea was too large that these marine folkss were scattered all over the place. It was not easy to gather them.","There were basically no new tricks. Nuclear bombs would open up a path, followed by all kinds of heavy weapons bombarding the area, and finally, the elites would clean up the battlefield.","The marine folks couldn’t resist the attacks and retreated in defeat. The marine folks who had participated in the attack against the Federation were eliminated one by one.","The Federation was most afraid of the surprise attack of Divines in the past, but it was no longer a problem now. Hundreds of human Divines were stationed at the front line, and all of them were looking for marine folk Divines to kill.","Every time the marine folk Divines launched a surprise attack on the Federation Army to retaliate, they would be surrounded by a group of human Divines and then beaten to death.","This was because Chu Yunfan had said that as long as they could provide the inner core of a Divine monster, in addition to the other supplementary ingredients that they had prepared, Chu Yunfan could help them make the Divinity Nourishment Pill.","This stimulated the Divines. Although the Federation had gained hundreds of Divines out of thin air, there were still many peak Innates who wanted to go bankrupt to buy the Divnity Nourishment Pill.","Every extra Divine was an extra layer of protection for a force, and its importance went without saying.","In the past, they had been afraid of the marine folk Divines. However, the marine folks Divines had now turned into Divinity Nourishment Pills in the eyes of the human Divines. There were even many times when the Federation’s experts almost broke out in conflicts after killing the marine folk Divines."]},{"number":1132,"title":"Chapter 1132 The Marine Folk Alliance? Useless Trash!","paragraphs":["1132 The Marine Folk Alliance? Useless Trash!","After all, there were too few Divines among the marine folks. Even if they were killed, only one inner core would be seized. On the other hand, there were often many experts from the Federation who besieged them. All kinds of conflicts were inevitable. If it were not for the strong suppression of the Federation Army, there was no guarantee that the human Divines would not fight first.","As for Great Ancestor Chu, the Heavenly Dragon Elder, and the other Divines of the Federation, they were all in tears when they saw this scene.","After all, it had always been the Divines who were besieged by Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks. Since when was it the other way around?","This had happened in just a few years. It had happened so quickly that it felt like a dream. The increase in the Federation’s strength was evident from this.","!!","With these Divines who had gone berserk, the Federation Army was almost invincible. The marine folks did not have a leader who could make a decision and their power could not be gathered.","Especially this time, the Federation raised the banner of revenge for the countless compatriots who had died. Their target was the tribes who had participated in the attack against the Federation, not all the marine folks.","This divided the marine folks into two groups. Those who had not participated in the attack on the Federation were naturally unwilling to stand up for those who had. They did not want to be killed by the Federation and were the first to stand out.","They could all see that the Federation had gone all out. Whoever stood in their way would die.","Although many smart people could also see that this was the Federation’s way of disintegrating them, they had no other choice. They couldn’t just die for others.","Moreover, the Infinite Sea was too vast. The Federation could not really occupy the Infinite Sea even if they had eyes and hands everywhere. They had plenty of living space and there was no need to risk their lives for others.","Under this clearly divided policy, the marine folks were divided into two factions.","The person who came up with this idea was naturally Chu Yunfan. He had never thought of completely annihilating the marine folks, because that was simply unrealistic. What he needed to do now was to capture the leader first and shoot the horse before shooting the man. Just like how he destroyed Infinite Demon Mountain, he had to first eliminate all the marine folk tribes that were the most ambitious about the Federation.","These tribes were wiped out by the Federation one by one, which finally caused the tribes that had participated in the attack on the Federation to panic. These tribes joined forces one by one to fight against the Federation Army.","In addition, many of the marine folk experts were recruited by them. Under the pressure of death, an alliance was quickly formed.","To fight against the Federation, the marine folk alliance had even invited a terrifying existence who was half a step to the Core Stage. This person’s existence curbed the momentum of the Federation Army’s sweep.","He was able to withstand the attacks of many human Divines. Each punch and kick contained great power, and it was not something that the current experts of the Federation could withstand.","To the current human Federation, a half-step to the Core Stage was still an unsolvable situation. Such an expert was enough to defy the heavens, just like Chu Yunfan.","In the deep sea of the Infinite Sea, in a luxurious palace, many powerful auras were dormant like hidden dragons. Each of them was actually a Divine. On the thrones, there were Divines of the marine folks who had taken human form.","Among these existences, two of them were the leaders, and everyone’s eyes fell on them. The marine folk experts were more or less related to these two.","The Deep Sea Crocodile Great Ancestor and the Deep Sea Whale Great Ancestor were two great figures with great reputations in the Infinite Sea. They were also considered as powerful beings in the Infinite Sea.","In the matter of dealing with the Federation, it was the Deep Sea Crocodile Great Ancestor and the Deep Sea Whale Great Ancestor who took the lead. The others were just following them.","Previously, the Federation had not dared to take revenge on them even though they were angry. However, the final reality had given them a big slap in the face. Not only did the Federation dare to do it, but they also had no scruples at all.","The people who could appear in this underwater palace were all leaders of large tribes among the marine folks. Even ordinary Divines were not qualified to participate in this alliance meeting.","“The Federation is trying to force us to our deaths. We can’t just sit back and wait to be captured. We have to let them know that if they completely anger the marine folks, they will also be buried with us!” The Deep Sea Crocodile Great Ancestor sneered, and a terrifying cold light burst out of his crocodile eyes.","Even Divines felt a chill run down their backs.","The Deep Sea Crocodile Great Ancestor was not famous in the Federation, but he was well-known in the Infinite Sea. He had killed countless marine folks.","Many people had even seen him twist off the head of a Divine with their own eyes. Now that they suddenly recalled that scene, they could not help but feel a little overwhelmed.","“That’s right. This time, the Federation has gone too far. Do they want to destroy us after destroying Infinite Demon Mountain?” said the Deep Sea Whale Great Ancestor coldly. He had completely forgotten about the hundreds of millions of casualties they had caused in the three base cities.","In their eyes, the deaths of ordinary marine folks were nothing. They would not even bat an eye no matter how many ordinary marine folks died. Only Divines could be recognized as equal existences.","And now, the Federation had launched such a tragic revenge on them for the deaths and injuries of these ants. In a short time, more than ten Divines had been surrounded and killed by human experts.","Although it was common for Divines to die in the battle of the marine folks, it was the first time that so many had died at the hands of the Federation.","“That’s right. This time, the Federation has gone too far in their bullying!”","Many people were filled with righteous indignation and even felt a little terrified. They could feel that the Federation was really here to destroy them.","“Tthat’s right. We can’t let the Federation look down on us. We have to let them know the consequences of looking down on us!”","“Let’s work together to face the enemy!”","Many people were clamoring to encourage themselves.","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure slowly walked in. He looked at them with a cold smile and said, “You’re all a bunch of trash. You’ve actually been forced to this point by a group of humans!”"]},{"number":1133,"title":"Chapter 1133 You Want to Kill Me? Let’s See if You Can!","paragraphs":["1133 You Want to Kill Me? Let’s See if You Can!","This figure slowly walked in and went straight to the main seat. However, no one dared to stop him from sitting above the crowd.","Even the Deep Sea Crocodile and the Deep Sea Whale Great Ancestors lowered their heads in front of this figure.","Many of the marine folks who were sitting were red in the face, but they didn’t dare to say anything. Following their gazes, everyone saw an old man in his sixties or seventies. However, his figure was extremely tall and straight, like a mountain peak.","The old man had a pale face and no beard. His eyes were extremely cold. He looked at the crowd and sneered, “Are you guys trash? You’ve been forced to this point by some mere humans!”","“Elder Sea, it’s not our fault. The Federation really has gone too far!” said the Deep Sea Whale Great Ancestor.","“You guys are useless. How many years have you guys been cultivating? Which one of you hadn’t lived for a few hundred years? That little human kid has only cultivated for twenty years.” Elder Sea sneered. Everyone’s expression was extremely ugly, but they had nothing to say since he had hit their weak spot.","It was true that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation years were only one-tenth of theirs, but he had forced them to this extent. If it was before, they would never have believed it.","It could only be said that the human race was too terrifying. Although their lifespans could not be compared to theirs, their cultivation speed was far beyond their imagination.","However, they had nothing to say. After all, it was a fact that they were being beaten and forced to retreat. In the end, they were saved by Elder Sea.","In fact, during this period, it was Elder Sea who came forward to stop the Federation Army. If it wasn’t for him, they wouldn’t be able to sit here and form the marine folk alliance.","“Elder Sea, don’t underestimate Chu Yunfan. According to the information I’ve received, even Old Flood Dragon King died at his hands. This man is truly terrifying!” the Deep Sea Crocodile Great Ancestor said. Even he felt his hair stand on end when he thought of the news he had just received.","The Federation was not very clear about the existence of Old Flood Dragon King. However, to an old man like him who had also lived for many years, it was no secret. Old Flood Dragon King had been one of the first to the reach the Core Stage.","That kind of person had already made a name for himself a hundred years ago, but now he had died at the hands of Chu Yunfan. This made them extremely afraid.","At the mention of Old Flood Dragon King, Elder Sea’s expression changed slightly. However, he immediately sneered and said, “There’s no need to mention that old man. He was very strong. If he was at his peak, even ten Chu Yunfan’s combined wouldn’t be a match for him. But he was seriously injured, and I know a little about his situation. He was not at his peak and could only make a few moves at most.","“So, rather than saying that he died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, it would be better to say that he died at his own hands. If you hadn’t come looking for me, I would’ve entered the Core Stage in no time. He’s nothing compared to me. He’s been cultivating since he was in his mother’s womb, and he’s only been cultivating for a few years. How can he compare to me?”","Elder Sea’s expression was full of confidence. He didn’t take Chu Yunfan seriously at all. Even if Chu Yunfan was lucky enough to enter the half-step to the Core Stage, there was still a huge gap between them. Elder Sea had entered the half-step to the Core Stage for more than a hundred years, while Chu Yunfan had only cultivated for a few years.","“If he doesn’t come out, I’ll be in trouble. After all, the defense of every city in the Federation is very strong. Even a Core will suffer if he doesn’t pay attention to the nuclear bombs. Old Flood Dragon King is an example. But if he dares to appear in the Infinite Sea, I’ll let him know how high the sky is and how thick the earth is!”","“Elder Sea is right. He’s just a porcelain doll!”","“That’s right. With Elder Sea here, the Federation can forget about having an easy time this time!”","“As long as we can hold on until that one comes out of seclusion, the Federation will be finished!","The crowd immediately began to discuss. Elder Sea’s words gave them a lot of courage. Indeed, what they were most afraid of was not the Federation Army, but Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s existence was like a sharp sword hanging over their heads, ready to fall at any moment. Now that Elder Sea was here, and he was also a half-step to the Core Stage, he shouldn’t be any weaker than Chu Yunfan. They didn’t even need to defeat Chu Yunfan, they just needed to stall him.","If they delayed until that person came out of seclusion, they would be able to launch a counterattack on the Federation. Now that Infinite Demon Mountain had been destroyed, they would be able to dominate the Kunlun Realm after destroying the Federation. This would save them a lot of trouble.","Elder Sea looked at the crowd and said, “If that person hand’t promised to teach me the secret of breaking through to the Core Stage, do you think I’d care about this mess?”","In fact, he didn’t intend to care at all. The marine folks was not a single entity to begin with. They were even divided into many different races. They were not the same as the Federation. There were even much enmity and killing between them.","At his level, his perspective of problems was completely different from that of ordinary marine folks. He was not interested in participating in the killing of various races. Only by breaking through to the Core Stage and exploring the great Dao of cultivation could he truly enjoy the great Nirvana.","However, that person had sent a messenger to pass on a message some time ago. As long as he delayed Chu Yunfan, he would teach him the secret of breaking through to the Core Stage after he finished his treatment.","Although Elder Sea did not want to care about the many things involved, he could not resist the temptation of entering the Core Stage. At his level, he understood that although he was only half a step away from the Core Stage, the difficulty of this was much greater than the difficulty of cultivating from scratch to the half-step to the Core Stage.","Without someone to guide him, he might never have the chance to enter the Core Stage in his life.","This was the fundamental reason why he agreed to help in the end. After all, he was old. Although he had not entered the final stages of his life, he was not far away.","“The human army is nothing to be afraid of. I can deal with them by myself. But you guys have to hurry up and find that Chu Yunfan. I’m going to break his bones one by one. He has such a cultivation level at such a young age, so he must have had some amazing fortuitous encounters, hmph!” Elder Sea said coldly.","Before everyone could agree, a clear voice was heard.","“Tsk, tsk, I was going to find you. I didn’t expect you to come find me as well. That’s good, then we won’t have to hide from each other anymore. I’d like to see what you’ve got!”"]},{"number":1134,"title":"Chapter 1134 Don’t Even Think About Leaving, I’ll Capture All of You","paragraphs":["1134 Don’t Even Think About Leaving, I’ll Capture All of You","A figure slowly walked out and looked at the marine folks coldly.","These experts turned around and saw a young man in black. He had an imposing demeanor as he strode in.","Even though there were many experts here, they couldn’t scare him in the slightest and simply ignored them.","“Chu Yunfan, you actually dare to appear here?!” A fierce gaze was directed at the person who had arrived.","!!","“Why wouldn’t I?” Chu Yunfan sneered. The Divines present all exuded a terrifying aura, but he didn’t take them seriously.","He could sense that the original appearances of the marine folk experts who had taken on human forms. They were ferocious beasts of the deep sea. However, they had all concealed their aura at this time.","However, under Chu Yunfan’s perception, none of them could hide.","There were also many at the scene who reacted quickly. Chu Yunfan was able to track them to this extremely secret underwater palace, so one of them must have been followed.","Otherwise, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have known about the existence of this underwater palace. It was more than 100,000 meters down in the sea, and even human’s high-tech detectors didn’t have the ability to detect such a deep place.","Moreover, the Infinite Sea was so big that it was impossible for him to search every single place. Therefore, it was obvious that Chu Yunfan had followed one of them since he was able to appear here.","No one knew who he had come with, but now that he had appeared, everything was clear.","They had all heard of Chu Yunfan’s battle records. From the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage to the Core Stage, there were records of him killing people. This man’s fierceness was rare throughout history.","Even the Deep Sea Crocodile and Deep Sea Whale Great Ancestors were extremely nervous. Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s shocking battle record, the two quaked. But soon, they remembered that Elder Sea was sitting next to them and they relaxed.","“You’re Chu Yunfan?” Elder Sea spoke and looked at Chu Yunfan.","“That’s right. I originally wanted to follow to see if that self-proclaimed God would appear. I wasn’t expecting him to, but then, you appeared. And you seem to carry some weight around here,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","His gaze was directed at Elder Sea. As for the others, he didn’t even put them in his eyes. They were just lambs waiting to be slaughtered.","The marine folk experts could see the contempt in Chu Yunfan’s eyes. They felt extremely aggrieved, but they didn’t dare to act rashly.","However, the Deep Sea Whale and Deep Sea Crocodile Great Ancestors’ hearts were in turmoil. They had all said that Chu Yunfan was bold and reckless, and now they saw it with their own eyes.","A Core was known as a god in this world. Other people would try their best to hide from a Core, but Chu Yunfan actually dared to follow them here, and his purpose was to find the God.","Chu Yunfan’s intention was clear to everyone. He wanted to kill the God before he fully recovered.","Just the thought of it made people gasp. Even if the God was a Core who was seriously injured, he was still a Core. He still had a terrifying strength that ordinary Divines couldn’t compare to.","They didn’t even dare to think about such a thing.","They had truly experienced the majesty of that divine sea, and they simply couldn’t muster up the thought of resisting.","“You sure are bold to appear before me. Do you think you can escape unscathed?” Elder Sea said coldly. A hint of fear flashed through his eyes. He no longer looked down on Chu Yunfan like he did before. He didn’t even notice when or how Chu Yunfan had appeared just now.","Just this alone made him not dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan.","“Retreat safely? Hahaha, do you think I just want to get out of this unscathed?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I’m here to kill today. None of you are leaving this place!","“Such arrogance!”","“You’re too ruthless!”","“You’re looking for death!”","The marine folk Divines roared in anger.","“Such great courage!”","Elder Sea roared angrily. Countless dharmic powers surged out of his body, forming a huge vortex. At this moment, he looked like a god and was extremely terrifying.","The terrifying combat strength of a half-step to the Core Stage was released all of a sudden. Compared to the First Divine Servant, he was stronger and not weaker. He had entered the half-step to the Core Stage much longer than the First Divine Servant. Naturally, the First Divine Servant could not compare to him.","“Just in time!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and all the divine power in his body also began to boil. It was like a golden light as if a big sun had risen in the depths of the Infinite Sea.","As for the Divines, they felt as if the sky was falling down. A terrifying pressure was released. Although the hall was huge, it was like a cage for the two people who were fighting.","Everyone’s first reaction was to flee and not get involved in the battle between these two. Otherwise, just the aftermath of the battle was enough to kill them.","However, at this moment, an ancient scroll flew out of the void. It shook violently and turned into a blood-red skeleton, blocking the entrance of the hall. A pair of blood-red hollow eyes stared at the retreat path of everyone in the hall.","That was Chu Yunfan’s magic weapon, the Demon Descends Illustration. Of course, the power that Chu Yunfan displayed now was completely different from before. Even if he didn’t control the illustration directly, its power was close to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","“D*mn it!”","These marine folks all began to curse. Seeing this, how could they not understand that Chu Yunfan was planning to lock them in here and not let them escape?","His goal was very clear, which was to deal with Elder Sea before dealing with them. He intended to capture all of them in one fell swoop. Then, the so-called marine folk alliance would become an empty shell—a joke.","How could Chu Yunfan just watch the marine folk alliance stir up trouble? It was like another Infinite Demon Mountain was stirring up trouble.","“Let’s fight it out with him!”","The marine folks roared and launched their terrifying attacks toward the bloody skeleton. However, the bloody skeleton simply slapped out a huge bloody hand and shattered all the attacks, preventing them from approaching.","It was impossible for these people to break the Demon Descends Illustration in such a hurry.","At this time, Chu Yunfan and Elder Sea, who were confronting each other in the field, made their moves."]},{"number":1135,"title":"Chapter 1135 Tell Me the Whereabouts of the God and I’ll Spare Your Life","paragraphs":["1135 Tell Me the Whereabouts of the God and I’ll Spare Your Life","Elder Sea was the first to move. Around his body, a terrifying mana vortex blew up. He began to grow green scales from head to toe, shining with a dark light, looking extremely terrifying.","Then, he launched a series of terrifying attacks at Chu Yunfan like lightning, suppressing him with lightning speed.","The palm fell down like a divine mountain. He had a terrifying attainment in palm techniques that ordinary people couldn’t imagine, and his comprehension was almost materialized.","This wasn’t like the Mantis Divine Kick that was only the manifestation of a living creature. This palm strike was the manifestation of nature. This was the most difficult martial Dao concept to manifest in history.","One could only imagine how terrifying Elder Sea was.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, didn’t give in and fought against Elder Sea. All the divine power in his body turned into a golden divine sea and was released. In an instant, it was released toward Elder Sea.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan turned into a golden asura and shattered the divine mountain with a punch. Elder Sea’s palm technique was indeed shocking, but Chu Yunfan was not simple. He was almost unrivaled in this world.","His punch shattered everything and headed for Elder Sea.","At this moment, Elder Sea finally realized the seriousness of the problem. He had previously judged Chu Yunfan based on the situation of the other half-step to the Core Stage experts, but now, he realized that he had made a huge mistake. They could not be compared.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. A casual punch from him was almost impossible to block.","Elder Sea hurriedly retreated and formed a hand seal. In an instant, countless waves appeared in front of him and stacked on top of each other, turning into an unrivaled force that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan could also see that Elder Sea’s martial arts were indeed shocking. He had integrated the great Dao of nature into his martial arts, and his power was infinite. Whether it was the mountain momentum or the water momentum, they were all terrifying means that were difficult to resist.","If it was the First Divine Servant, he would have been beaten up. But unfortunately, Elder Sea met Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had no fear. Whether it was the mountain or the water, they were all equally vulnerable in front of him.","Chu Yunfan broke through the monstrous waves and directly hit Elder Sea.","Bam!","Elder Sea was hit by the punch and was forced to retreat. He hit the wall of the palace. The huge palace shook violently from the impact. One could imagine how terrifying the punch was.","A palace that could exist in the deep sea was naturally not an ordinary palace. It looked ordinary, but in reality, it was layered with countless barriers. Now, it was destroyed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","The marine folk Divines were shocked. They knew how strong the palace was, so they had never thought of breaking it from the side. They could only break through the entrance guarded by the bloody skeleton formed from the Devil Descends Illustration.","They had never thought that they would one day be forced to this extent. It was simply miserable.","Everyone looked over and saw that the scales on Elder Sea’s chest had completely shattered. The scales on half of his body had split open and blood was flowing out.","In the head-on confrontation with Chu Yunfan, Elder Sea suffered a huge loss.","Elder Sea spat out a mouthful of blood. At this time, he really realized how big the gap between his physical body and Chu Yunfan’s was. The truth was always right. He was not afraid of ordinary people, because although he was old, his divine power was more profound. With his profound divine power, he could suppress any powerful enemy in the world.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. Not only was his physical cultivation invincible and his qi and blood soaring, but more importantly, the density of Chu Yunfan’s divine power was actually not inferior to his. In fact, the quality of his divine power was also not inferior to his. This was the most terrifying part.","Elder Sea didn’t know what kind of secret technique Chu Yunfan cultivated to be so terrifying.","“You’re pretty good at taking hits!” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly, then walked toward Elder Sea step by step.","In this narrow space, Elder Sea had nowhere to run to. Although the hall was big, compared to their speed, it was a pitifully small cage.","Elder Sea looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. Chu Yunfan was like a cat toying with a mouse, and he was the mouse. The grievance in his heart was indescribable. Now that he thought about all the big talk he had just said, it was simply ridiculous.","He didn’t even know Chu Yunfan’s strength before he dared to take on this guy.","“I’ll give you a chance. As long as you tell me where that God is, I’ll spare your life,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly as he looked at Elder Sea.","His true goal was to find the God’s location. As for Elder Sea, he was just doing it in passing. It did not matter at all.","In his eyes, the real threat was the God. If possible, Chu Yunfan wanted to find him and kill him before he recovered from his injuries to prevent any future trouble.","“I don’t know where he is,” Elder Sea said through gritted teeth.","“In that case, what’s the use of having you?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","In the blink of an eye, his entire person changed. He turned into a golden roc and flew in Elder Sea’s direction.","A terrifying fist intent streaked across the sky and arrived before Elder Sea.","“Heaven and Earth! “Elder Sea shouted. A map with four figures appeared in front of him. They were the vermillion bird, the black tortoise, the azure dragon, and the white tiger.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan felt as if the entire space had been locked down.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re too arrogant. Do you really think I don’t have any trump cards?” Elder Sea burst into laughter. He had tricked Chu Yunfan into coming here. He had not thought of using the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, but he had not expected Chu Yunfan to be so powerful, which was why he had been forced into this situation.","However, this was also his trump card. It was a treasure he found in an ancient cave in the Infinite Sea. It was not easy for him to get this Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. He spent decades to refine it and use it for himself.","It was just that he didn’t usually use it. With his level of cultivation, this item was considered rare. Other than the occasional Core, he had no other opponents. In fact, this was the first time he had used it.","Chu Yunfan felt the power of the four symbols lock down the space around him, and there was an extremely powerful restrictive force.","“That is one great treasure, but in your hands, you can’t even use one-tenth of its power!”"]},{"number":1136,"title":"Chapter 1136 Easily Slaying Elder Sea","paragraphs":["1136 Easily Slaying Elder Sea","At this time, Chu Yunfan was no longer panicking. He simply stared at Elder Sea.","In this world, there was a saying that there were the powers of the four guardians. The black tortoise in the North, the vermillion bird in the South, the white tiger in the West, and the azure dagon in the East. These four guardians represented the four poles of the world.","Legends has it that the black tortoise, the vermillion bird, the white tiger, and the azure dragon existed back in ancient times. These four divine beasts suppressed the chaos of the world and created the world today.","However, that was only a legend. In the Ancient Zenith Civilization, the power of the four guardians was only a legend. But at the level of an Alchemy Emperor, it naturally wouldn’t be like what ordinary people understood.","From the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan could understand that there were indeed four extreme powers in the world. The Alchemy Emperor had never seen the so-called legendary divine beasts, but there were indeed people in the world who could borrow the power of the four extreme powers. Generally speaking, they would form extremely terrifying techniques such as formations and seals.","He was no stranger to the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. It was a technique that was extremely popular during the Ancient Zenith Civilization to borrow the power of the four guardians of heaven and earth.","Because he had seen this many times, Chu Yunfan did not panic.","“You’re at death’s door, yet you’re still so stubborn!”","Elder Sea felt that Chu Yunfan was being stubborn and trying to quibble. The power of the foud heavenly guardians was something that even opponents of the same level would find difficult to break free from.","This was because it wasn’t the user’s power. In a sense, they were borrowing the power of heaven and earth. Although it was only a small portion of the full power, it was not something that ordinary people could break.","As the saying goes, there’s a limit to human strength, but the power of heaven and earth is endless.","“You’ll find out in a moment whether I’m stubborn or not. If I’m not wrong, your Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array has yet to be completed,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly, “It’s an incomplete product.”","“How did you know?” Elder Sea was a little shocked and could not help but lose his composure.","Because he had never used this Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, no one noticed any problems with it. However, he knew that when he obtained the sealing array, it was actually an incomplete product. It was like someone had been refining the sealing array, but for some reason, had hurriedly given up.","So after a long time, it was still an incomplete item.","Even so, what could he do? He was desperate. The power of the four guardians was an extremely profound use of the laws of nature, and it was not something that a person of his level could do.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the person who had forged it had left behind some records regarding the sealing array, he wouldn’t even know how to refine it.","From the Ancient Zenith Civilization to the present, it was not only the human civilization that had a gap in heritage. The marine folks and the demons also had a gap. It was just that they had stepped into the path of martial arts earlier than the humans.","“It’s obvious. The sealing array only has a form but no spirit,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “To refine this Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, it requires the blood of four creatures with the bloodlines of the four divine beasts. This item has only been made and is only half complete. The most important half, which is the bloodlines of the four divine beasts, have not been collected and refined into it, so this is only a semi-finished product.”","“I see, I see.” Elder Sea suddenly felt enlightened. He could not help but reveal a ferocious smile on his face and said, “So that’s it. If you hadn’t said it, I wouldn’t have known that there was such a method. With your age and knowledge, you shouldn’t know about this. It seems that your inheritance is extremely impressive. Since you’ve told me as much, I’ll leave your corpse intact when I kill you.”","“You want to kill me with a half-finished product?” Chu Yunfan sneered. The true power of the sealing array was extremely terrifying. Those who could really activate it were all emperors who had dominated the world. Compared to those people, Elder Sea was just a piece of trash.","“Why can’t a semi-finished product kill people?” Elder Sea laughed out loud. He even affected his wound and coughed a few times. “I’ve been refining it for so many years, how could it be ordinary?”","Elder Sea kept forming hand seals and his divine power kept surging out.","Chu Yunfan could feel that the power of the sealing array getting stronger and stronger. It was as if someone was using a large hand to slowly grab him to death.","Just as Elder Sea had said, even if it was only a half-finished product, it was still extremely terrifying to an ordinary half-step to Core Stage.","Having a magic weapon or not was simply a matter of heaven and earth.","“Go to hell!”","Elder Sea’s face revealed an extremely sinister expression.","The marine folks didn’t leave either. Their faces were full of hope. If Elder Sea could kill Chu Yunfan, then they wouldn’t have to run away.","To them, the person the Federation feared the most was naturally Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan died here, in their eyes, the Federation would be half crippled.","They could also feel that the power of heaven and earth was slowly shrinking, because they could even hear some clanking sounds. When this force fell on Chu Yunfan’s body, it let out a series of metal clanking sounds.","They all hoped that Chu Yunfan would be caught and killed.","“Is that all you can do?”","All of a sudden, Chu Yunfan made his move. He casually threw out a punch, which hit the formation that had appeared.","Then, a shocking scene appeared. The Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, which had been extremely terrifying and could trap everything, began to crack inch by inch in front of everyone.","This formation that seemed incomparably powerful earlier had completely crumbled in a short period of time.","“Impossible!”","Elder Sea hastily retreated. He couldn’t believe it. Chu Yunfan’s punch didn’t use much force, but it was as if he had hit a node. He borrowed the force to break his sealing array.","This was the most terrifying part!","He suddenly realized that something was wrong. He wanted to retreat, but it was too late. Chu Yunfan took a step forward and was right in front of him. In order to trick Chu Yunfan into coming over, he had gotten too close.","At this time, Chu Yunfan turned his hand and chopped down. The saber light was so bright that it tore the sky apart and instantly landed on Elder Sea’s body.","Elder Sea let out a blood-curdling screech as his entire head was sliced off. He died at Chu Yunfan’s hands before he could even unleash his full cultivation."]},{"number":1137,"title":"Chapter 1137 Destroying the Marine Folk Alliance","paragraphs":["1137 Destroying the Marine Folk Alliance","With Elder Sea’s death, the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array was about to break free. But Chu Yunfan’s eyes and hands were quick, and he grabbed the sealing array in his hands.","He could see that Elder Sea’s eyes were still wide open in disbelief after his head was cut off.","Only Chu Yunfan himself knew that the sealing array was not a secret to him. Or rather, for the Alchemy Emperor, they more or less involved the power of the four guardians, but their uses were different. Some people used it to seal the heaven and earth, and some people used the power of the four symbols to suppress and kill strong enemies. Their understanding of the power of the four guardians had been different.","There were many records of the marvels of the four guardians’ power in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. No formation was perfect. They all had a formation key. If the formation eye was broken, the entire formation would collapse on the spot. If it was a complete sealing array, the power of the four symbols would constantly flow and merge into one. Although there was a formation key, it was constantly changing, making it difficult for people to catch it.","However, this sealing array couldn’t even be considered to be alive because it was an incomplete product. It could only activate some of the four guardians’ power. The formation key was right in front of Chu Yunfan, and with his understanding of the four guardians’ power, he could easily find the key and break the sealing array.","To deal with this kind of formation, one could use force or skill to break it.","Whether it was breaking the formation with force or skill, Chu Yunfan had the ability to do so. Elder Sea thought that victory was in his hands, but in reality, everything was under Chu Yunfan’s control.","“What?!” the marine folk experts reacted one after another. They were in disbelief and were completely dumbfounded.","The speed at which Chu Yunfan killed Elder Sea was too fast. With Elder Sea’s cultivation level, it should not have been easy for Chu Yunfan to kill him. But because Elder Sea had believed too much in the power of the sealing array, he was not prepared and was killed by Chu Yunfan.","Before they could even react, Elder Sea was already dead.","“How could Elder Sea be killed?!”","“Impossible! With his strength, how could he not defeat Chu Yunfan?!”","Everyone’s eyes were wide open, still immersed in disbelief. Then, they suddenly realized how dangerous the situation was for them now that Elder Sea had been killed.","After killing Elder Sea, Chu Yunfan slowly walked toward the real leaders of the marine folk alliance.","The cultivation of these marine folks was very strong, and most of them were even above tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage. They could decide the direction of the marine folk alliance.","But at this moment, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, they were like lambs waiting to be slaughtered.","Everyone looked at each other and immediately understood the meaning in each other’s eyes. Chu Yunfan had forced them to this point, so they could only fight to the death.","These experts didn’t even need to communicate with each other. They immediately made the same decision, and all kinds of terrifying attacks were launched without any scruples.","In fact, at this time, they no longer had the possibility of holding back. Chu Yunfan was too terrifying for them. If they didn’t use their full strength, they would die here.","Chu Yunfan simply glanced at them. Then, the sealing array in his hand suddenly flew up. Suddenly, those marine folk experts who were attacking with full force felt as if the air had solidified. This was not a feeling, but a real solidification.","The Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array!","These words suddenly flashed through their minds. They had seen Elder Sea use this move to deal with Chu Yunfan earlier, but now, they were actually locked down by Chu Yunfan using this move.","Around them, the azure dragon, white tiger, vermilion bird, and black tortoise were faintly visible. Although they were only illusionary images, they were much more powerful than when they were in Elder Sea’s hands.","“How is this possible? How long has it been? How did you manage to cultivate it to such a level?”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with disbelief. It hadn’t been long since Chu Yunfan obtained the sealing array, but he had already refined it to a level that surpassed Elder Sea’s decades of refining.","Chu Yunfan sneered. Although Elder Sea had been cultivating it for decades, his method was not appropriate. He was basically groping around in the dark, and did not refined it much at all. Chu Yunfan easily erased his primordial spirit and branded his own primordial spirit into the sealing array.","And with Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the sealing array, he could naturally refine it to an extremely profound level with ease.","The Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array that he used naturally far surpassed Elder Sea’s. The power of the four guardians was revealed, faintly sealing the four directions.","These marine folks experts seemed to be stuck in a pool of mud. It was difficult for them to move and couldn’t advance or retreat.","It was as if a terrifying force had bound them tightly, not allowing them to move. This feeling was too oppressive. They could even feel that this force was gradually compressing them as if a huge hand was squeezing them bit by bit until they were about to explode.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Sensing that something terrible was about to happen, these masters all burst out with the most terrible power, even to the extent of hurting their own source to enhance their own divine power, trying to break through the sealing array.","Unfortunately, if the sealing array could be dealt with so easily, it would not have become Elder Sea’s ultimate trump card. If Elder Sea had not encountered Chu Yunfan, he would have won against any other half-step to the Core Stage expert.","Of course, the collective backlash of so many people was a huge pressure on the sealing array. However, Chu Yunfan’s divine power far exceeded Elder Sea’s. It was like the ocean, deep and bottomless, and the terrifying divine power kept spreading in all directions.","The sealing array was shrinking its range bit by bit, and the experts were feeling more and more uncomfortable. Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, had a leisurely expression on his face. While constantly suppressing the experts trapped in the sealing array, he also had the time to constantly refine the sealing array.","Using the sealing array to comprehend the power of the four guardians was an extremely high-level power and application of the rules of nature. Although it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to completely comprehend it, even if he could only borrow a part of its power, it was still very powerful.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In just a moment’s time, these experts finally let out a series of miserable screams, as their bodies exploded. They were killed by the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array."]},{"number":1138,"title":"Chapter 1138 Ruthlessly Exterminating the Marine Folk Alliance","paragraphs":["1138 Ruthlessly Exterminating the Marine Folk Alliance","In the face of Chu Yunfan, who had mastered the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, these marine folks had no power to fight back. He had integrated the power of the four guardians into this scroll in the form of a formation, so its power was unimaginable.","Chu Yunfan used his divine power to draw out the power of the four symbols of heaven and earth, which played the role of lifting a thousand Jin with little strength. He only used a very small amount of divine power to kill these strong enemies.","He put away the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array and collected all the corpses of these experts. They were all buried under the Brahma Tree, and their inner cores fell into Chu Yunfan’s hands, which could be used to refine many Divinity Nourishment Pills.","Of course, for the current Chu Yunfan, he needed to use those pill to exchange for spirit stones. If the Brahma Tree wanted to grow, it naturally could not do without sufficient spirit energy irrigation, especially with Chu Yunfan’s method of pulling up seedlings to help them grow.","!!","After Chu Yunfan put away the Demon Descends Illustration, he flew out of the palace and quickly left this sea area. After this wave of experts died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, although the marine folk alliance still had some Divines, they were all insignificant.","The marine folk alliance, which had come with a menacing momentum and illustrious reputation, now existed in name only.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left, the news that the higher-ups of the marine folk alliance had been wiped out by him quickly spread. Chu Yunfan did not hide anything about this matter. For the current Federation, they needed such good news.","It caused another huge sensation in the Federation. After the incident at Infinite Demon Mountain, even the marine folk alliance was wiped out by Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s strength also made people look at him in a new light.","In the Federation, Chu Yunfan’s popularity soared, and the marine folks experts who were still clamoring before were completely silent now. They didn’t dare to say anything more. Previously, they said that Chu Yunfan couldn’t do this and that, but Chu Yunfan quickly used his actions to ruthlessly slap their faces.","Their faces were burning in pain!","In particular, the active experts of the marine folks who were clamoring on the Internet were basically all members of the marine folk alliance. Now, the real experts of the alliance had all been captured by Chu Yunfan in one fell swoop.","At this moment, they were all in a deep state of fear. They felt that Chu Yunfan was as powerful as a god, and there was no way they could fight against him.","They were afraid that Chu Yunfan would kill them all at any time.","In fact, Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to do anything. After getting the exact news from Chu Yunfan that the higher-ups of the marine folk alliance, including Elder Sea who was a half-step to the Core Stage expert, had been wiped out, the Federation Army immediately launched a large-scale attack on the marine folk alliance.","Previously, the marine folk alliance still had a large number of experts that made the Federation cautious. But now, those experts were all captured by Chu Yunfan in one fell swoop, and they lost their only existence that could deter the Federation.","Elder Sea, who was a half-step to the Core Stage, was also killed by Chu Yunfan. His head was separated from his body. The entire marine folk alliance was scared out of its wits. Under the attack of the Federation Army, it quickly fell apart. It could be said that the monkeys would scatter when the tree falls.","In the process of retreating, they were chased by the Federation Army and suffered heavy casualties. In the face of the Federation’s rampant pursuit of the marine folk alliance in the Infinite Sea, the other marine folks who had not participated in the attack of the Federation did not dare to say anything. When they saw the Federation Army approaching, they hid far away for fear of being implicated. Some even personally took action and chased the marine folk alliance who fled to other places.","For a moment, the entire Infinite Sea was in a state of despair. The situation had changed so quickly that it was beyond everyone’s imagination.","The marine folk expert in the Infinite Sea who were still observing and deciding whether to join the marine folk alliance were completely dumbfounded.","That large-scale alliance, which was rarely seen even among the marine folks, had been completely destroyed by Chu Yunfan in one night.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they wouldn’t have believed that someone could be so strong.","Everyone knew that the Infinite Sea had changed. It was no longer the battlefield for the marine folks to fight for hegemony. From now on, there would be one more powerful competitor in the Infinite Sea.","And this competitor was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“Times have changed. I never thought that such a person would appear in the Federation. This is rare indeed.”","“That’s right. I’ve lived for so many years, but I’ve never seen such a terrifying person. This kid is only in his twenties. Even if we consider the lifespan of a human, he still has more than one or two hundred years to live. I can’t imagine what level he will reach in the future.”","“From now on, there will be another overlord in the Infinite Sea—the Federation.”","Many marine folk experts communicated in private and sighed with emotion. Previously, the marine folks wanted to launch a counterattack on the land and fight for the land under the sun for the marine folks. However, who knew that they would be chased back to the Infinite Sea by the Federation in such a short time?","All of their previous plans had been ruined, and the marine folks’ hand that had extended to the land had been ruthlessly cut off by the Federation. Even though the marine folks usually had a relationship of killing each other, many people still felt a sense of sympathy when they saw this scene.","Many marine folks suddenly felt the pressure of the Federation, especially without the behemoth of the marine folk alliance in front of them. Any single tribe among them was nothing compared to the behemoth of the Federation. If they said that they would be destroyed today, they would not be able to drag it out until tomorrow. Uprooting the roots was as easy as lifting a finger.","Even if they gathered together and formed an alliance, they might not be able to defeat the Federation. As long as that demonic god-like existence existed, they would not be able to stand out.","Unless that person comes out and annihilate the Federation!","After being reminded by some people, many people remembered that the marine folks was not completely helpless. In fact, they had one more trump card that they had not used yet.","The God was the marine folks’ greatest trump card. Once the God’s injuries were healed and he came out of seclusion, it would be easy for him to form another marine folk alliance.","And that would be the real opportunity for the marine folks to make a comeback!"]},{"number":1139,"title":"Chapter 1139 Refining the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, the Brahma Tree Finally Ripened","paragraphs":["1139 Refining the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, the Brahma Tree Finally Ripened","“The marine folk alliance still wants to rise? They’re delusional!”","In the president’s office in Capital City, the president was reading the information sent by the Intelligence Department. There was a rumor among the marine folks that as long as the God recovered from his injuries, he would be unstoppable once he reappeared. That would be the time for the marine folks to launch a real counterattack.","Therefore, the marine folk experts were all lying low. Even if they saw that the Federation Army was pursuing their kin with all their might, they would pretend not to see it.","There were many monster clans in the Infinite Sea. Even the marine folk alliance only occupied a small part of it. There were still a large number of marine folk experts lying in wait, waiting for the situation to change.","The total number of these people was extremely terrifying. In addition to the hidden demon experts on the continent, there were at least more than a thousand Divines.","However, in the president did not care about these people. To him, as long as they did not have a core like Infinite Demon Mountain, these creatures were just a bunch of loose sand—a motley crew.","The Federation didn’t need to exterminate them all. As long as they saw a trend of rising, they would uproot them.","With the current strength of the Federation, it indeed had the ability to do so.","Just like what the Federation had done in the past, as long as they did not unite, they were just a motley crew.","“Although they’re a motley crew and won’t be a match for the Federation Army in a head-on battle, I’m afraid that the God will appear again. That’s the most terrifying thing,” Jeang Yuanbin said worriedly.","Now, Jeang Yuanbin had been restored to his military position as the Chief of Staff of the Federation Army and the Deputy President.","“Mobilize all the military satellites and investigate all suspicious places in the Kunlun Realm. No, even Earth must be investigated,” the president quickly ordered. He didn’t know if the God had gone to hide on Earth.","“It’s best if we can find him before he recovers. Our chances of winning would be higher!”","Speaking of the God, the president felt a headache coming on. A Core was already terrifying enough, not to mention that the president had lost all his power. He was basically a disabled man. Although he was far more terrifying than the average Divine, he was still vulnerable in the face of a Core.","If he were to meet the God again, he probably wouldn’t even be able to withstand a single move before being killed.","However, his greatest hope laid with Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan broke through, he would have the power to fight the God. But if Chu Yunfan didn’t break through, it would be very difficult for the Federation to deal with a Core. Other than wildly shooting nuclear bombs, there was no good way for the Federation to deal with him.","It was not easy for both sides to suffer heavy losses. Old Flood Dragon King of Infinite Demon Mountain had never encountered a nuclear bomb before, which was why he had fallen for it. However, that God would clearly not follow in Old Flood Dragon King’s footsteps.","The president felt that it was a pity. He had the chance to kill the God. He was so close. He was ready to sacrifice himself to take the God down with him. Who knew that he would fail at the last step and cause this current trouble?","“How’s Chu Yunfan’s preparation coming along?” the president asked.","Jeang Yuanbin thought of Chu Yunfan and couldn’t help but reveal a bitter smile. “He’s not in a hurry. He’s still making Divinity Nourishment Pills for others right now.”","During this period, Chu Yunfan was still busy making Divinity Nourishment Pills. Although the price of each pill was sky-high, it was still selling like crazy. All the major forces, even peak Innates, wanted to buy it. As long as they bought it, they would have a bright future ahead of them.","No matter how much money they had to borrow now, it would be easy for them to repay the debt after they broke through.","In the end, Chu Yunfan announced that he would collect half of the fees in cash and the other half in spirit stones. During this period, only Chu Yunfan himself knew how many spirit stones he had collected.","The president was silent for a moment. Of course, he knew what Chu Yunfan was up to. He had asked Chu Yunfan before, and Chu Yunfan said that they were still waiting for a good opportunity, so there was no point in being anxious.","However, more than a month had passed. According to his calculations, the God’s recovery time would at most be another month. There was not much time left for Chu Yunfan, and it was also because of this that the president was so nervous.","“All right. Help me pass down the order. Expand the search area and find a way to find that God’s whereabouts. Once you find him, inform me immediately,” the president finally said after some thought. “Also, if there’s any news about Chu Yunfan, inform me immediately as well.”","“Yes, sir.” Jeang Yuanbin received the order and went to arrange the search for the God.","“The final battle is coming. Old man, I’ll make sure you die in the next battle!” the president muttered to himself, but the more he spoke, the more determined his eyes became.","The Federation was his second home. To him, there was no way out. The only way out was to fight.","At the same time, in Kunlun City, Chu Yunfan had just finished making the last thirty-six Divinity Nourishment Pills and sent off the last group of people that had been waiting on him.","He then entered the Mountain River Diagram to continue refining the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. This was a good treasure, but Elder Sea had not been able to unleash its true potential.","In front of him, the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array rose and fell continuously. The power of the four guardians began to appear, turning into an azure dragon, a white tiger, a vermillion bird, and a black tortoise. In the middle, the image of the azure dragon gradually solidified. Above the image of the azure dragon, a ball of blood essence was slowly merging into the image of the azure dragon.","As the blood essence continued to merge, the dragon’s shadow emitted a dazzling light. It devoured the blood essence bit by bit, and a faint dragon’s roar was heard from the image.","This was the blood essence that Chu Yunfan had extracted from the bodies of the experts from Infinite Demon Mountain and the Hallowed Wyrm Kingdom whom he had killed.","People who practiced martial arts would condense blood essence in their hearts. The more powerful an expert was, the more prominent the effect of their blood essence.","Even though flood dragons were only sub-dragons, they still had some dragon’s blood in them. Now that Chu Yunfan had used the refining techniques recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book to remove the weeds and keep the fine ones, all the flood dragons, including Old Flood Dragon King, had been refined into a ball of true dragon blood essence.","The blood essence finally merged with the azure dragon image and became the first power of the four guardians on the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array.","Chu Yunfan felt the power of the four guardians through the azure dragon on the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. He felt that he had gained a great understanding of the great Dao of heaven and earth in just a short time.","Suddenly, on the herb mountain in the distance, the Brahma Tree burst out with rays of light that soared to the sky. Then, a waft of strange fragrance filled the Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan’s mind was jolted. The Brahma Tree had finally ripened."]},{"number":1140,"title":"Chapter 1140 Two Months of Secluded Cultivation, the God Is Here!","paragraphs":["1140 Two Months of Secluded Cultivation, the God Is Here!","The Brahma Tree finally bloomed and bore fruit once again. A fruit about the size of a fist hung on the largest branch of the tree.","After so many days, Chu Yunfan had no idea how much blood and sweat he had poured onto the Brahma Tree, and how much spirit energy it had absorbed.","Compared to a few months ago, the size of the Brahma Tree had at least doubled. It was clear how much it had grown during this period. The Brahma Tree was more mature, and the fruit it bore would be more amazing than the one Tang Siyu had consumed.","Chu Yunfan made a grabbing motion, and the Brahma Fruit immediately turned into a stream of light and flew into his hand. With just a whiff, he felt all the pores on his body open up as if a powerful energy was trying to enter his body.","“It’s finally mature!” Chu Yunfan was overjoyed. With the Brahma Fruit in his hands, he could break through to tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage in no time. He might even be able to break through to the peak of tier seven in one go. By then, even the God would be no match for him.","And after waiting for so long, the time had finally come.","After the Brahma Fruit finally ripened, Chu Yunfan immediately spread the word that he would be going into seclusion for a period of time and would not see anyone.","When the president heard this news, he was overjoyed. He knew that Chu Yunfan was waiting for a so-called opportunity, and now it was obvious that the opportunity had finally came. This meant that they finally had the ultimate method to fight against the God.","The president immediately ordered a level-one alert. A large number of elite experts were dispatched to Kunlun City, and all kinds of heavy artillery were also deployed into the city.","All kinds of high-end weapons developed by the Federation were deployed to Kunlun City. There were also masters from all walks of life. Many Divines were gathered in Kunlun City, but they didn’t know why. Since the Federation Government had given this order, they naturally wouldn’t disobey.","After all, the Federation Government was the limelight at the moment. No one was willing to confront the Federation Government head-on. After all, it was as powerful as Infinite Demon Mountain, and the marine folk alliance had been uprooted overnight.","Soon, even the president personally came to Kunlun City to take charge of Special Ops. He knew that Chu Yunfan was their greatest hope. Without him, the Federation might not be able to do anything to the God.","“Pass down my order. During this time, no one is allowed to approach. If you discover a trespasser, shoot them down without warning!”","The president was in the official residence of the chief of Special Ops as he gave an order to the officer beside him.","The official accepted the order and left. When he looked up, he saw a beautiful figure striding in. It was a young woman. She was dressed in white. She was tall and slender and her pretty face had a stern dignity that could not be lightly offended. There was a kind of otherworldly aura about her that was getting stronger and stronger.","“Clan Leader Tang, why have you come as well? I heard that you entered secluded cultivation,” the president asked curiously.","He naturally recognized who the girl in front of him was. She was the leader of the Tang clan, who was now famous throughout the Federation. In the Federation, she was the second most powerful person—only second to Chu Yunfan.","However, he had received news that Tang Siyu was in seclusion to break through, so he was a little surprised to see her here.","“Greetings, president!” Tang Siyu cupped her hands in greeting. “I’ve just come out of seclusion.”","“Just came out?” The president glanced at Tang Siyu, and shock flashed through his eyes. “You’ve entered the half-step to the Core Stage?”","He knew that Tang Siyu was already at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. She had gone into seclusion to break through to the half-step to the Core Stage. Now that she had come out of seclusion, the result was obvious.","The president had also been involved in this field, so he could naturally see Tang Siyu’s current level. He was happy. Tang Siyu had broken through, and for the current Federation, there was no doubt it had gained another high-end combat force.","“You are perceptive, sir.” Tang Siyu nodded with a smile. She had not participated in the Federation’s attack on the marine folk alliance. Instead, she had been focusing on breaking through to the half-step to the Core Stage.","With Chu Yunfan’s summary of the many key points and secrets of breaking through to the half-step to the Core Stage and even the Core Stage itself, coupled with her profound Arcane Sky Spirit Physique, there was no bottleneck at all in her cultivation. As long as she understood it, she could break through. The speed of cultivation was simply unimaginable for ordinary people.","“Well done, well done indeed!” The president couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. When he saw Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu, he felt as if the waves in the Yangtze River had surpassed the waves in the past. Not long ago, he had also been so high-spirited and young.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan and the rest of the younger generation had grown up. Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu, and Chu Haoyue were not the only young Divine in the Federation. Every force had young peak Innates. With the help of the Divinity Nourishment Pills, they had all entered the Divine Abilities Stage one after another. It would not be long before they became the pillars of the Federation.","The future of the Federation was equally limitless.","“Since you’re here to guard, I’m relieved. I’ll go and check the defense status of various places. This time, it concerns the life and death of the Federation, so we can’t be careless,” the president said.","“Don’t worry, sir. He won’t fail.” Tang Siyu smiled. Her smile was as beautiful as a flower, and her eyes were full of determination. She had full confidence in Chu Yunfan.","“I believe in him too, but I’m afraid time waits for no one.” The president sighed and left to check on the defenses of various places. With Tang Siyu, a half-step to the Core Stage expert, overseeing the place, he naturally had nothing to worry about.","Kunlun City entered a state of martial law, but it was loose on the outside and tight on the inside. To ordinary people, they didn’t notice any changes at all. These transfers and deployment were carried out in secret.","Even the higher-ups of the Federation did not know why Kunlun City was under martial law. Only a small number of people could guess anything from this sudden deployment.","Time flew by. The sun rose and the moon set, and two months passed in the blink of an eye.","For ordinary people, it was any other ordinary day. Suddenly, a terrifying aura enveloped the entire city.","All of the experts were jolted awake at the first moment. They would never forget that terrifying aura.","The God had come!"]},{"number":1141,"title":"Chapter 1141 Today, if You Want to Approach, You’ll Have to Go Over My Dead Body!","paragraphs":["1141 Today, if You Want to Approach, You’ll Have to Go Over My Dead Body!","Very quickly, everyone in Kunlun City reacted. This era was the era of cultivation. Everyone cultivated, and everyone was like a dragon. Everyone had cultivation, and the only difference was the level of cultivation.","Everyone felt as if a huge hammer had struck their hearts, causing their hearts to skip a beat. They realized that the situation was dire.","A super powerful existence had appeared!","This feeling made them feel extremely depressed. It was a difference in the level of life.","The suppression of high-level life forms on low-level life forms came from the source of life.","The terrifying existence that had once single-handedly destroyed the defense systems of three base cities had returned.","In this way, he announced his return!","At the same time as this terrifying pressure appeared, the alarms of Kunlun City rang wildly in every corner of the city.","It turned out that countless monsters had appeared around the city. They had used a teleportation array to continuously appear. Countless aerial monsters occupied the sky. There were also many terrifying giant sea beasts that existed in the deep sea running on the land. They were equally terrifying.","These monsters were like mountains and seas, and no one knew exactly how many there were. With a rough estimate, there were already hundreds of millions of terrifying beasts covering the sky and earth.","All the city’s alarms sounded, and everyone ran out of the buildings. Ordinary people, with the help of the police and military, entered the underground fallout shelters that were spread throughout the city to take refuge.","At this time, in the headquarters of Special Ops, the president suddenly stood up. The officials and guards around him were nervous.","“Sir, let’s hurry into the sanctuary,” Jeang Yuanbin quickly advised.","“I’m not going. If this place is not safe, is there any place in Kunlun City that will be safe?” the president rejected firmly, “Although I have lost my cultivation, I’m not a cripple!”","The president rejected Jeang Yuanbin and the others. With his current cultivation, although he no longer had his cultivation base, it did not mean that his combat power was completely crippled. Ordinary Divines were still no match for him.","“I was wondering when he would appear. Looks like he went to contact the demons and the marine folks.”","The president quickly received intelligence from all over the world and saw the satellite images on the screen.","He finally understood that,the God that should have recovered half a month agoaccording to his calculations, had only appeared after another half a month. It turned out that the God had gone to contact the marine folks and the demons.","Although Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folk alliance had been besieged by the Federation, it didn’t mean that there were no hostile existences among the demons and marine folks.","In reality, there were still a large number of enemies of the Federation between the two races. They just lacked someone to unify them. Whether the God threatened or tempted them, he had succeeded in doing so.","“What a plan.”","The president understood the God’s thoughts. Although it was difficult for the Federation to do anything to the God, if he was alone, with the current level of defense in Kunlun City, even the God would not be able to do anything.","With all sorts of high-end weapons fired at the same time, the God would find it difficult to move even an inch unless he intended to test the ammunition reserves of the Federation.","But now, there were monsters and sea beasts everywhere, which could hold back most of Kunlun City’s defense system.","He looked over and saw a figure floating in the air above Kunlun City. The city reacted quickly and missiles with long tails of flames flew toward the figure.","However, this person’s figure was extremely fleeting. The missiles were blown up in mid-air and could not get close to him at all.","Small tactical nuclear bombs were launched one after another. Only nuclear bombs could seriously injure experts at the level of gods.","However, even though the nuclear bombs were launched quickly, it was nothing to the God.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","There were terrifying attacks everywhere. Every time the God made a move, a large area of the city’s defensive barrier would be destroyed. While he dodged the small nuclear bombs, he still had time to attack the city’s defense system.","Although the power of the nuclear explosions was extremely great, and the nearby aerial monsters were all wiped out, it still couldn’t do anything to the God.","One represented the highest achievement in technology, while the other represented the strongest existence in martial arts.","Within Special Ops, many people’s expressions became uglier and uglier. They could see the God dodging attacks while approaching Special Ops. It was clear that he had known about the existence of Special Ops for a long time.","And now, there were two important figures in Special Ops. One was the president of the Federation, and the other was Chu Yunfan, who was regarded as the future president.","If something happened to both of them, it would be equivalent to the complete annihilation of the Federation, both now and in the future.","Suddenly, a figure flew out from Special Ops and headed in the direction of the god.","Swish!","A shocking sword light swept out and slashed in the direction of the God.","Bam!","With a casual swing of the God’s hand, the sword light exploded in the mid-air. The sword light, which could destroy a mountain, was so weak in front of the God that it could not pose a threat to him in the slightest.","However, it had stopped the God’s progress, preventing him from moving forward.","At this time, everyone could see the appearance of the God clearly. It was an old man with white hair and a ruddy complexion. He wore a white priest robe and looked extremely majestic. He had a power that ordinary people could not imagine.","He existed between heaven and earth, but there was also a faint illusionary feeling that he was not here.","“It’s you?” The God looked at the person in front of him coldly. Who else could it be but Tang Siyu?","It was not that he did not know of Tang Siyu, but he had not expected her to have already entered the half-step to the Core Stage.","He was slightly taken aback, but that was all. He still did not take Tang Siyu seriously.","“I can’t believe that there’s someone like you in the Federation besides Chu Yunfan. If you’re given time, you might have a chance to enter the Core Stage, but I won’t give you that chance,” the God said indifferently.","“Today, if you want to approach, you’ll have to go over my dead body!” Tang Siyu said with determination even though the person in front of her was a Core.","She knew that she had no other choice. The president’s cultivation had been completely crippled. No one in the Kunlun Realm could stop the God except her.","“You are going to stop me?” The God sneered. With his supreme majesty, he instantly attacked."]},{"number":1142,"title":"Chapter 1142 Tang Siyu Is Seriously Injured, and Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","paragraphs":["1142 Tang Siyu Is Seriously Injured, and Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","The God’s body carried an unimaginable power, far beyond the martial arts masters of this era.","The martial arts masters who were fighting in various parts of Kunlun City were shocked when they saw this. The God’s divine power was as unfathomable as the sea.","Just by relying on his dense divine powers, he could kill all Divines!","Many people even wondered how the president had managed to injure such a powerful enemy and almost kill him.","However, some people knew that before the battle started, Chu Yunfan’s peerless arrow had severely injured the God before the president had the chance to almost kill him.","However, the God’s power was beyond their imagination.","Tang Siyu was very powerful—no weaker than the First Divine Servant, or even stronger. The First Divine Servant only had an ordinary physique. He could not be compared to Tang Siyu, who had the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique.","But in front of the God, it was still not enough.","Tang Siyu shouted. The sword in her hand was unsheathed, and a sword light tore the sky apart, turning the entire void into a kingdom of ice and snow. Compared to when she had fought the First Divine Servant, Tang Siyu was now even more powerful. They were not on the same level.","However, the God showed no fear. He allowed the sword light to land on his body, but they could not hurt him in slightest. Then, he tore with both hands, and the entire ice kingdom was torn into two halves, turning into snowflakes that scattered all over the sky.","Tang Siyu hastily retreated. Her pretty face was slightly red. She had clearly suffered the backlash of the attack.","The God sneered. “This is not enough. You’re just a half-step to the Core Stage. How dare you block my way. You’re looking for death!”","Then, the God attacked again. It did not seem to be any profound technique, but just a casual slap. The terrifying divine power turned into a mountain that came crashing down on Tang Siyu.","In an instant, Tang Siyu slashed out thousands of sword lights, which fell on the mountain. The sword lights and the mountain exploded, but she was still swept by the wind from the palm. She was forced to retreat as she coughed up a mouthful of blood.","A half-step to the Core Stage only had some techniques of the Core Stage. In essence, they were only in the Divine Abilities Stage. Tang Siyu’s strength far exceeded that of ordinary half-step to the Core Stage because of the power of her Arcane Sky Spirit Physique. If she were to enter the Core Stage, she would be far more powerful than the God.","However, she was only a half-step there at the moment and she could feel the God’s overbearing power.","Many people cried out in surprise when they saw this scene. Although they had expected it, many of them could not help but cry out in surprise when they saw Tang Siyu being beaten to the point of spitting blood.","“Fire!” the president shouted in a hurry, and all kinds of missiles were fired from the missile bases all over Kunlun City, blocking the God’s further attack on Tang Siyu.","He had bought time for Tang Siyu.","She quickly circulated her divine power, and in just a few breaths, her injuries had completely recovered. Although it could not be compared to the Imperial Physique, the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique was still a powerful physique cultivation.","By the time the God had dodged all the missiles, Tang Siyu had recovered. A murderous look flashed through his eyes. At this time, he was sure that Tang Siyu must have a special physique, and an extremely powerful one at that. Otherwise, she would not be so amazing.","Tang Siyu’s beautiful eyes fixed on the God and she shouted, “Again!”","“You’re looking for death!”","The God let out a roar, and his figure vanished. When he reappeared, he was right in front of Tang Siyu and he threw a punch at her.","This time, the attack was so fast that many people only saw a blur before their eyes and the God had already appeared in front of Tang Siyu.","The power of ice and snow suddenly burst out from Tang Siyu’s body. She was like the queen of ice and snow. The power of ice and snow spread out and covered the God’s fist.","Although it was only for a moment, she managed to shake off the God’s powerful divine power. However, it was only for a short time, and it gave Tang Siyu an opportunity to retreat a few hundred meters, avoiding the terrifying attack.","“You’ve got some tricks up your sleeve. Your special physique is not bad, but you’ve yet to enter the Core Stage, so you’re doomed to never make a comeback!”","The God sneered, and his white-haired, youthful face revealed an extremely dignified expression.","He shouted and slapped her. Tang Siyu wanted to retreat, but in an instant, she felt the air around her freeze. She had been locked in place by the God’s divine will. Even if she wanted to escape, it was impossible.","In a battle between experts, once one was locked on by the other party’s divine will, it would be difficult to escape and one could only fight head-on.","Tang Siyu was not flustered. A determined look appeared on her pretty face. With a","“whoosh” sound, her drew out a sword light. The sword light produced a thousand-meter ice and snow zone. Since there was no way to avoid it, there was only one choice—fight.","Boom!","The big hand and the sword light collided in mid-air. Countless sword lights turned into ice shards and scattered all over the place, turning into snowflakes that danced in the sky.","The crowd only felt a blur in front of their eyes before everything was over. Tang Siyu kept retreating, blood flowing from the corner of her mouth. She had suffered a great loss in the collision.","The president was just about to order the missiles to be launched to buy time for Tang Siyu again. But suddenly, he saw the God following Tang Siyu like a shadow. The God was almost on top of her. The distance between the two sides was less than a few meters. If the missiles were launched, they might not hurt the God, but Tang Siyu.","The crowd saw the God sneer and punch out. Tang Siyu, who had already suffered a great loss in the collision, was unable to fight back. She was hit head-on.","Boom!","In an instant, it was as if she had been hit by a missile. A small mushroom cloud rose, and Tang Siyu was instantly sent flying. One of the pieces of the treasured armor on her body instantly cracked, and she spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Die!”","The God didn’t even look at her. He slapped Tang Siyu, who was flying away. He was so fast that he instantly caught up with Tang Siyu. The president and the others couldn’t keep up with his speed even if they wanted to save her.","“Oh no!”","“No!” the president cried out in alarm. This attack might cause Tang Siyu to be severely injured.","Suddenly, at this critical moment, a sword light pierced through the sky and hit the big hand. The big hand was turned into a blast of air.","Then, a Qi-condensed hand appeared out of thin air and caught Tang Siyu in its palm."]},{"number":1143,"title":"Chapter 1143 A God? You’re Nothing!","paragraphs":["1143 A God? You’re Nothing!","Tang Siyu, who had been severely injured and sent flying, was caught by the big hand.","Then, a figure slowly walked out from the depths of Special Ops. He stepped on the air, and every step he took left behind a big footprint. It looked extremely strange. There was only air, but this figure made it look like a mud-like road.","“Mighty Chu! It’s Mighty Chu!”","Many people’s spirits soared. After the president’s martial arts were completely crippled, Chu Yunfan had become their only pillar of support. And at this critical moment, when even the powerful Tang Siyu was defeated, Chu Yunfan appeared.","Everyone felt a boost in morale.","However, the president kept frowning. “No, he hasn’t completely broken through!”","In his eyes, Chu Yunfan’s body had a divine power that was constantly surging. It was far beyond the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, and even beyond the half-step to Core Stage. In the eyes of ordinary people, this was the symbol of Chu Yunfan’s strength.","However, he noticed something different. Chu Yunfan had yet to completely break through to a new cultivation level, which was why he was unable to control the boiling divine power in his body.","This was a very dangerous omen. The God was already in the Core Stage and Chu Yunfan had not completed his breakthrough. This was undoubtedly very bad news for the current situation.","The president finally understood that this period was the critical moment for Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough. If he was given a few more days, or even a day, Chu Yunfan would be able to break through to a whole new level.","But it was clear that the God didn’t intend to give Chu Yunfan the time, and this was likely to be the key to victory.","When the God saw Chu Yunfan come out, he was shocked, but he soon realized that Chu Yunfan’s body was not in a good state. There was an aura on Chu Yunfan’s body that scared him.","However, Chu Yunfan’s qi was a little messy and disorderly. It was unbelievable for experts at their level, especially for Cores. Their control of their power had almost reached the point of perfection. Even if it was just a trace of power, as long as they were unwilling, it would not spread out.","In other words, Chu Yunfan should have been at the juncture of breaking through, and then the God interrupted him, which led to such a strange situation.","After understanding this, the God’s face showed a sinister and proud expression. “You have no choice but to come out in your current state. It seems that I came at just the right time!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the God coldly and didn’t say anything. Instead, he used all his strength to control the divine power that was spreading in his body. It was as the God had thought. Chu Yunfan had been interrupted at the critical moment.","“I heard that you’ve been looking for me all over the place. Now that I’m in front of you, what are you going to do?” The God’s face showed a cruel and proud smile.","He was like a real god that had descended from the heavens. He was dressed in a white priest’s robe, mysterious and full of oppression.","Many people saw the God’s face and could feel his power and coldness. Many weaker Innates felt cold all over, almost trembling under this pressure.","“I just have to cut you down.” Chu Yunfan’s voice was a little hoarse.","“Hahahaha, in your current state?” The God’s face revealed a somewhat arrogant smile, but there was still a hint of fear in his eyes.","Chu Yunfan had only cultivated for a few years and had reached this level. If he was allowed to grow, even if it was only for a few days, the God was afraid that Chu Yunfan would be able to be on the same level as him.","To him, who called himself a god, how ironic was this?","He stood there alone, and the entire Kunlun City fell silent. The various defensive barriers in Kunlun City could not stop him.","The God’s killing intent gradually boiled and became bone-piercingly cold. Many people in Kunlun City could feel the cold killing intent even through the enchantment. They quickly ran and hide. They couldn’t believe that they couldn’t resist the God’s killing intent even from so far away.","“Come and accept your death,” Chu Yunfan said in a low voice.","“Who do you think you are? You’re just a mere Divine! How dare you speak to me that way!”","The God didn’t move, but his expression became more and more sinister.","It was only at this moment that many people realized that Chu Yunfan, who looked extremely terrifying, had not yet entered the Core Stage. He was only in the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, many people were shocked by the God’s domineering aura. Chu Yunfan was famous in the Federation, but the God didn’t take him seriously.","That level self-confidence was indeed invincible.","However, while many Divines were shocked, they also understood that Chu Yunfan, who was only in the Divine Abilities Stage, could burst out with such combat power. In the future, his strength would increase to an unbelievable level.","And the more potential such a person had, the more the God would not let them go.","“If you break through, you might be able to fight me. But what are you now? I can suppress you with just one hand!”","His eyes seemed to shoot out two terrifying rays of light that could suppress people’s souls.","As soon as the God’s voice fell, he made his move. Facing Chu Yunfan, he didn’t hold back. A powerful aura poured over like a vast ocean—like an explosion—and instantly rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","The terrifying aura made everyone who noticed it feel as if their hair was standing on end.","The divine transformation turned into a terrifying attack that streaked across the sky, almost blowing up Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The terrifying light rushed toward Chu Yunfan’s body, and a terrifying explosion occurred.","The violent storm dissipated, and everyone finally saw that at that moment, the God’s punch had been directly thrown out, but when it hit Chu Yunfan, he had blocked it with a palm.","Everyone could see that the God’s entire body was emitting a kind of light, while Chu Yunfan’s entire body was emitting heat. His whole body was like a furnace that was on the verge of exploding.","“You’re nothing more than this!”","Chu Yunfan’s voice was hoarse, but his expression was extremely firm.","God’s eyes flashed with surprise, and he said coldly, “”Only this? Hahahaha!”","The God laughed out loud. His laughter was cold and wild as if he was the only one in the world who could do it. He had little regard for put Chu Yunfan.","“He caught it1 That’s great!” In the depths of Special Ops, Jeang Yuanbin couldn’t help but be overjoyed when he saw that Chu Yunfan had taken the attack of the God.","The president frowned and said, “It’s still too early to celebrate. For the God, this is normal, but Chu Yunfan has already used all his strength. The real battle is just about to begin.:","“That was just a warm-up. Let’s see how many moves you can take!”"]},{"number":1144,"title":"Chapter 1144 Both Sides Are Heavily Injured? An Arrow at the End of Its Flight!","paragraphs":["1144 Both Sides Are Heavily Injured? An Arrow at the End of Its Flight!","“That attack was just the God’s warmup?”","“How can we defeat such an existence?”","“How will Mighty Chu deal with him?”","Many experts ‘expressions changed. If it had been them, they would have been blown to pieces. However, for the God, this was just a warmup.","!!","“I’ll kill you!” the God bellowed.","His aura could swallow mountains and rivers. At this time, his strength was truly unleashed. The only person who had seen him unleash his full strength was the president. However, compared to a few months ago, the God who had been severely injured was clearly stronger than the last time. His control of the power of the Core Stage was also more amazing.","He looked like a comet about to crash into the earth and the whole air trembled.","This time, Chu Yunfan also moved. He let out a loud shout as if he was struggling to respond. His whole body emitted a golden light, which rose up like a dense immortal mist. He clenched his five fingers into a fist, and his asura fist blasted out.","Boom!","The two punches collided in mid-air. In everyone’s eyes, it was like a comet hitting a golden asura, and a terrible explosion occurred.","Everyone saw that a large area of the air had collapsed. The enchantment over Kunlun City was restored to resist the terrifying aftermath of the explosion.","They were all shocked and aghast at Chu Yunfan’s power, which was far beyond the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. But even so, he still couldn’t shake the God. They couldn’t imagine how powerful the God was.","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was bleeding, and the moment it flowed out, it turned into a cloud of blood mist. Chu Yunfan’s body was bleeding from all over from the collision.","He was clearly at a disadvantage in the battle, but his black hair was flying in the wind, and the killing intent in his eyes was even sharper. He wasn’t afraid. On the contrary, his fighting spirit was soaring.","“Is this all you’ve got? I’m so disappointed. It’s not much harder for me to kill you than to kill a chicken on the same level.” Chu Yunfan opened his mouth again, and blood was also coming out of it.","“Hahahaha, it’s already come to this, yet you’re still stubborn.” The God laughed arrogantly and didn’t care about the world’s heroes at all. However, a hint of fear flashed in the depths of his eyes.","He was indeed afraid. Chu Yunfan was not even in the Core Stage, but he could put up a fight. If he allowed Chu Yunfan to improve, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“Let’s see how long you can last!”","The God let out a loud roar and once again launched a terrifying attack. To ordinary people, it might seem like he had just thrown out a single punch, but in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, he had thrown out thousands of punches at once. If he couldn’t block even one of them, Chu Yunfan would be killed.","The scariness of the Core Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage were not on the same level. It could be said that they were two completely different things.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan closed his eyes. In his mind, the godhead was emitting a strong light. It was definitely not his plan to fight in such a situation. Whether he was the first to find the place where the God retreated to heal his wounds. It was better to wait a few more days after he fully breaks through.","He wouldn’t be so passive in a battle. On the contrary, he would steadily gain the upper hand.","But at this point, he had no room to retreat!","Chu Yunfan’s punch was a fusion of the asura fist and the garuda fist. In an instant, he had both speed and strength, and he threw out thousands of punches, clashing with the God.","Boom, boom, boom!","Heaven and earth were shaking. The God was using all his strength, and it was a terrifying attack that could easily explode the heaven and earth. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t show any weakness. Even if he had to use all his strength and mobilized all the qi and blood in his body, he still wanted to fight the God.","The two of them were emitting intense light from their bodies like two suns. Their killing intent soared to the sky and swept the world.","The Divines were all dumbfounded. They had never thought that an individual could have such strength. Even the most elite fleet of the Federation could be easily defeated at any time.","They were truly experts who had surpassed the limits of the current human Federation.","This was a level that human martial arts could reach, and it was not a delusion.","In an instant, both sides had already exchanged thousands of blows. It was so fast that no one could see clearly. In fact, everyone could only see that both sides had only exchanged blows once. The entire sky was about to collapse.","This was a battle at the peak.","Boom!","The two of them crossed each other, and the two figures each rushed to one side. In the sky, a blood flower burst out, turned into a blood mist, and scattered in all directions.","Everyone’s eyes widened. Whose blood was it?","Soon, the crowd discovered that it was Chu Yunfan’s blood. There was a large fist mark on his chest, and blood was spurting out from it.","“Mighty Chu is going to be defeated!” Many people gathered their divine power into their eyes and opened their heavenly eyes to watch the battle. At this time, they felt extremely terrified. In this kind of battle, Chu Yunfan had suffered a great loss.","Chu Yunfan turned around and faced the God. Without saying a word, he began to heal his injuries.","At his wound, a golden light was shining dazzlingly, healing his injuries.","However, what everyone found strange was that the God didn’t take advantage of this opportunity to attack. Then, they discovered that a huge wound had been torn open in the God’s waist and abdomen. It looked extremely terrifying.","“What? Even the God is injured?” It was only then that many people realized that the God was injured as well, but he looked much better than Chu Yunfan. After all, the injury on his waist and abdomen looked much better than the injury on Chu Yunfan’s chest.","It was also because of this that the God did not choose to pursue the victory, because he was uncertain if he would win.","The crowd was overjoyed. Chu Yunfan was able to win against a God, unlike Tang Siyu, who was completely suppressed. This meant that they still had a chance of winning. The Federation wasn’t completely powerless to retaliate.","“You’re pretty good to be able to hurt me. However, you’re already an arrow at the end of its flight!”","The killing intent in the God’s eyes became more and more intense. He could see that Chu Yunfan was about to lose control of the terrifying divine power that was about to burst out of his body.","Chu Yunfan’s divine power was surprisingly strong, but he still hadn’t crossed that realm. Chu Yunfan had already reached a critical point, and it was very difficult for him to even move.","Chu Yunfan simply grinned and said, “Come and try me. The way I am now, it’s enough to kill you !”","“Arrogant!”","The God shouted and once again flew toward Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1145,"title":"Chapter 1145 Breakthrough on the Battlefield, Tier Seven of the Divine Abilities Stage!","paragraphs":["1145 Breakthrough on the Battlefield, Tier Seven of the Divine Abilities Stage!","The God roared and pounced at Chu Yunfan again. The terrifying attack was like a mountain or an ocean, overturning Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly burst out with golden light. His Imperial Physique activated to its maximum. A mass of thunder energy surged out of his body and turned into thunder armor, making him look like a god of war.","Boom!","The two sides collided again, but it was different from what the God had expected. Although Chu Yunfan was already an arrow at the end of its flight, he didn’t collapse in a single blow. Chu Yunfan forcibly controlled his divine power and directed all the divine power that was about to explode onto the God’s body.","“You’re still able to hold on?” God’s face showed a hint of disbelief.","“I said, I’m enough to kill you,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He was gritting his teeth and spitting out blood as he spoke.","The two sides once again engaged in battle. It should be said that the God was attacking. Although Chu Yunfan was fighting back, he was at a disadvantage.","The battle between the two sides was like a raging fire. However, everyone could see that Chu Yunfan was forcefully holding back his anger, but the result of this kind of forceful lifting was that Chu Yunfan would collapse sooner or later.","After all, this state could not last long.","Everyone was looking at Chu Yunfan worriedly, but they couldn’t help. The two were fighting too fast, and they had no chance to intervene.","They couldn’t even see the situation when the two of them attacked. No one knew when Chu Yunfan had grown a pair of thunder wings on his back so that he could keep up with the God.","An existence at the Core Stage was indeed far beyond the Divine Abilities Stage, just like how the Divine Abilities Stage crushed the Innate Stage.","Boom!","It was another terrifying exchange of attacks. Both sides were bleeding. More and more cracks appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body, but the God’s body also had some injuries. This was simply unbelievable for the God who claimed to be invincible in the world.","The God could already tell that even if Chu Yunfan couldn’t hold on forever and would explode, it wouldn’t be now. However, he was getting a little impatient.","He looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and said, “I didn’t expect you to be able to hold on until now, but it’s useless. With your strength, you are no match for me. I originally wanted to use this against your bow, but seeing that you haven’t taken it out yet, I’m afraid that bow most have been destroyed.”","In just a few words, God had already analyzed that Chu Yunfan’s Sun Shooter could no longer be used after severely injuring him last time. Otherwise, with the power of the Sun Shooter, there was no reason for Chu Yunfan not to use it.","In fact, after suffering such a big loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands, he had always been on guard. Otherwise, if Chu Yunfan took out the Sun Shooter again, he would be caught off guard again. If he was injured by the bow a second time, that would be terrible.","The aura on his body was gradually growing and becoming more and more terrifying. It had even surpassed his previous peak state.","“He actually concealed his strength!”","When many people saw this scene, they were in despair. They understood that the God was guarding against Chu Yunfan’s previous attack with the Sun Shooter, so he had hidden a part of his strength. He was preparing to attack incase Chu Yunfan used the Sun Shooter.","However, at this point in the battle, how could he not see that Chu Yunfan’s Sun Shooter had been destroyed after that incident? Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would definitely use a magic weapon of that level.","After understanding this, the God no longer had any scruples. Compared to the nuclear bombs, he was more afraid of the Sun Shooter in Chu Yunfan’s hands.","It was hard for nuclear bombs to lock onto him. As long as he was not locked onto, the nuclear bombs would not be able to do anything to him. However, the Sun Shooter was different. This ancient spiritual artifact could lock onto people automatically. Once it locked onto someone, there was no way to escape it.","Last time, he had been severely injured by an arrow from the Sun Shooter. But now, since he had no scruples, he could attack with all his might.","“Chu Yunfan, I don’t care what other tricks you’re hiding. This time, you’ll definitely die. I’ll take your head!” the God roared.","His entire body exuded a blood qi as vast as the ocean. His divine power shook the sky. He was like a demonic god who had broken free from his shackles. He was extremely terrifying.","Boom!]","In an instant, the God moved and released all the divine power in his body, causing a terrible explosion. He circulated his cultivation technique, and a terrifying amount of qi and blood boiled between his fingers and palms. He suddenly threw a punch at Chu Yunfan.","This punch transformed into an incomparably huge star. It was as if the terrifying scene of a comet hitting the earth had been born.","All the experts in Kunlun City were completely stunned. They even felt that it was difficult for them to move. They felt as if someone was holding them in place with both hands, not allowing them to move.","They all understood that this was the pressure of martial Dao, but they didn’t expect the pressure of the God’s martial Dao to be to this extent. If the target of this punch was them, they wouldn’t even be able to move and would be beaten to death.","“He’s too strong! I can’t resist at all!”","Many people were trembling, unable to move.","Tang Siyu, who was recuperating, struggled to rush out. She slashed out a world of ice and snow with her sword and slashed it in the direction of the God.","However, the God did not even look at it. He easily shattered the world of ice and snow with a slap, and the sword light shattered inch by inch in the air, unable to deal any damage to him.","And the fist force of his punch instantly engulfed Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The sky was shaking, and it was as if the universe had been flipped over. The terrifying energy tide almost devoured the defensive barrier of Kunlun City.","However, the crowd soon discovered that the fist force did not land. A figure stood in front of them, blocking the fist with great strength.","Chu Yunfan had actually managed to block the attack that was enough to blow a big hole in Kunlun City’s defenses.","“How is this possible?!”","The God’s eyes widened in disbelief. He had used all his strength in this punch without holding back, but Chu Yunfan still managed to block it.","“I already said that you’re nothing and that killing you is no more difficult than killing a chicken,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","His entire body was emitting a faint blood aura, and the terrifying phenomenon of divine power spreading from before was gradually decreasing and disappearing.","The God’s pupils contracted slightly. This meant that Chu Yunfan had broken through on the battlefield.","Tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage!"]},{"number":1146,"title":"Chapter 1146 Face-Slapping on the Spot","paragraphs":["1146 Face-Slapping on the Spot","The God’s terrifying attack that almost pierced through Kunlun City’s defenses was blocked by Chu Yunfan. The terrifying scene of the earth cracking and the sky collapsing that everyone had expected did not happen.","The people in Special Ops felt as if they had just escaped death. If the attack had landed, they had no doubt that the entire Special Ops would have been destroyed and they would have been killed.","However, Chu Yunfan had actually blocked this terrifying attack.","At this time, they finally caught their breath and saw Chu Yunfan. Before this, his body was constantly wrapped in a huge and terrifying divine power.","People could feel his power from far away, but now, the divine power that was scattered around Chu Yunfan was being absorbed into his body bit by bit.","This Chu Yunfan didn’t make them feel weak. On the contrary, they were all cultivators, so they naturally understood what kind of progress it was to go from being unable to control his power to being able to completely control it.","This meant that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation and realm had made a breakthrough.","“He has finally broke through!”","Tang Siyu, who was about to rush out, saw this scene, and her pretty face relaxed as she sighed in relief. She could finally put down the worry in her heart.","“That’s great!”","Especially in the depths of Special Ops, Jeang Yuanbin could not help but feel relieved for his disciple. After the breakthrough, Chu Yunfan might not be able to defeat the God, but at least he would not be defeated.","“Old man, your good days are over!” the president muttered to himself.","Today, the grudges between them that had been entangled for countless years could possibly come to an end.","“You’re actually able to break through under such circumstances?!”","The God couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could actually break through to a whole new level. Although it was still in the Divine Abilities Stage, and even the bottomless divine power in Chu Yunfan’s body seemed to have been restrained a lot, he didn’t think that Chu Yunfan was any easier to deal with. On the contrary, he felt that Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying.","“If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have been able to break through so quickly.” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The God’s pupils contracted slightly, and he looked at Chu Yunfan. “You used me to break through!”","He suddenly understood why Chu Yunfan wanted to fight him even though he was clearly on the verge of collapsing. Although he had no other choice, he had his own plans.","Through the God’s power, Chu Yunfan successfully entered tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","At that time, Chu Yunfan already had one foot in tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage, but he had not completely stabilized it. It was like a piece of ordinary iron that had been tempered thousands of times to become steel, and he was the hammer.","Under his pressure, Chu Yunfan broke through at an extreme speed. To think that he thought Chu Yunfan was an arrow at the end of its flight and was obviously unable to hold on any longer.","Who would have thought that he would be used by Chu Yunfan.","“How dare you!” ther God said through gritted teeth.","Suddenly, at this time, when Chu Yunfan’s aura had been restrained to the extreme, it suddenly exploded, and a violent aura boiled. But this time, no one felt that Chu Yunfan would hold back anymore. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan had truly completed his breakthrough.","Behind Chu Yunfan, there was a faint shadow of an asura. It was majestic and huge, like a resurrected demonic god, and it opened its cold eyes.","In his body, he had finally absorbed a large portion of the Brahma Fruit’s energy which helped him to step into tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage.","It could be said that it was because of the God that he was able to break through to this level in such a short time.","“Weren’t you very arrogant earlier? Now let’s play a little more!”","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a somewhat playful smile, and said, “The game has only just begun!”","Suddenly, Kunlun City fell silent. Everyone was stunned by the frozen atmosphere on the battlefield, but their faces were filled with excitement.","What was a great reversal? This was a great reversal!","When everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was going to lose and die for sure and even they would not be able to escape death, Chu Yunfan performed a great reversal. When everyone thought that he was going to die, he made an extremely dangerous breakthrough on the battlefield.","After a brief moment of silence, everyone began to shout.","“The God must be exploding from anger. Mighty Chu actually used him to improve himself!”","“That’s right. Hahahaha, this is great. It’s a great counterattack!”","“Let’s see if this God still dares to be so arrogant!”","The God looked at Chu Yunfan with a calm expression, but his eyes were extremely cold, like an ice cave, which made people’s hearts palpitate.","He thought he had the upper hand, but he was used by Chu Yunfan. It was like he had been slapped in the face.","The God’s body released a terrifying divine power. There were even terrifying stars revolving around his body, forming a galaxy.","In an instant, the God appeared before Chu Yunfan. He threw a punch, and countless stars seemed to instantly explode.","The dazzling fist light tore the sky apart.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan also threw out a punch. The asura behind him rushed toward the falling stars at an astonishing speed.","Boom!","Countless stars were shattered by the asura’s punch. Chu Yunfan was not at a disadvantage in the face of a God’s full-power attack.","“How is this possible?!”","The God couldn’t believe that he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan at all. Chu Yunfan had just broken through, but he was already on equal footing with him.","“Again!” the God roared and pounced at Chu Yunfan again.","“As you wish!” Chu Yunfan shouted and also went head to head with the God, not giving in an inch.","The battle between the two sides cleared out a huge space in the sky.","No matter if it was the Federation’s mecha army or the aerial monster army, they didn’t dare to get close. If they were swept by the aftermath of the battle between these two people, they would die without a doubt.","The battle between the two sides became more and more intense. The barrir of Kunlun City was broken again and again. If it were not for the fact that there were many arrays and boundaries in Kunlun City, it would have affected the people below.","But even so, the barrier was on the verge of collapse.","Chu Yunfan suddenly broke away from the battle and flew directly into the sky.","“Don’t run!” the God shouted and chased after him.","...","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan threw out a scroll with one hand, and in an instant, the entire universe seemed to freeze over."]},{"number":1147,"title":"Chapter 1147 One Slap to Send the God Flying","paragraphs":["1147 One Slap to Send the God Flying","An azure dragon, a white tiger, a vermilion bird, and a black tortoise!","The four spirits of heaven and earth instantly appeared and wrapped around the God.","The moment Chu Yunfan threw out the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, the four spirits of heaven and earth appeared, and the God that had just caught up was suddenly frozen as if his entire person was trapped in a swamp.","“Sh*t!”","!!","The God suddenly realized that he had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s trap. This was clearly a trap set by Chu Yunfan.","It was to lure him in!","Boom!","All the divine power in the God’s body burst out, trying to open a way out of the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array. But things were not that easy. If the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array could be so easily broken, it would not be regarded as his trump card by Elder Sea.","The power that the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array displayed in Chu Yunfan’s hands far exceeded that in Elder Sea’s hands.","The God wanted to struggle free, but the eastern azure dragon suddenly shone brightly and turned into a giant dragon that pressed down on him.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had already pounced toward the God.","“Asura Punch!”","Chu Yunfan threw out a punch and hit the God’s body.","Bam!","The punch hit the God, and the God screamed. The God, who was locked by the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, couldn’t move. He couldn’t even make any defensive movements and was blown away.","Boom!","The God was sent flying all the way out of Kunlun City’s territory and crashed into a mountain outside of the city. It was unknown how many monsters were killed along the way. There was even a Divine monster who couldn’t dodge in time and was killed.","The monster was smashed into a cloud of blood mist in mid-air!","Everyone was stunned. Everything happened too quickly. The God looked invincible just a moment ago, but he was sent flying by Chu Yunfan’s punch in the blink of an eye.","Meanwhile, the experts in Kunlun City activated the satellite’s authorization one after another. Through the satellite’s lenses, they saw the God ruthlessly crash into a mountain, causing it to collapse. It was an earth-shattering scene.","“You actually dare to hurt me?!” the God roared like a wounded beast. All the mana in his body burned, and he was like a huge sun.","Chu Yunfan caught up to him. He looked down from above like a real demonic god.","“So what if I hurt you? Do you think you can run away today?” Chu Yunfan’s voice was incomparably cold. The series of things that happened in the Federation recently, even to the point of almost being destroyed, the mastermind behind it all was no other than the God.","If the God was killed here, it would undoubtedly be a great threat to the Federation’s future.","“You want to kill me? Do you think you can kill me?!” The God’s body burst out with a burst of intense light. His divine power was like rays of light, which turned into ribbons that danced in the sky.","He was going berserk. Even the monsters were dodging his power. Although their intelligence wasn’t high, they could sense what true danger was.","At this moment, the God was so dangerous that even ordinary monsters could feel it. This kind of power and domineering aura suppressed everyone.","Everyone realized that the God was truly angry.","Many people grew worried for Chu Yunfan. After all, the God had said that Chu Yunfan had not entered the Core Stage yet. He was only in the Divine Abilities Stage, so the gap between the two levels was real.","Chu Yunfan’s expression didn’t change. He said indifferently, “You’re really stubborn. Can’t you understand? The battle ended the moment I stepped into this new level.”","Behind him, on his left was a golden asura, and on his right was a golden roc. He was like an ancient sage, displaying all kinds of strange phenomena.","In ancient times, this was the Dharma form of Bodhisattva. The various phenomenons recorded in the mythological books and scriptures were nothing more than this.","It was a martial Dao phenomenon displayed by someone who had cultivated the martial Dao to an extremely profound level.","The God’s expression changed. No one had ever been able to force him to this extent—not even the president. The president had severely injured him, but even so, both sides had suffered.","He had never seen anyone as domineering as Chu Yunfan.","The phenomenon behind Chu Yunfan became more and more astonishing, and even a divine tree appeared behind him. It was the Brahma Tree, and it was the phenomenon manifested by the Brahma Fruit in his body. The spirit energy that had not been completely digested manifested.","As time passed, the more spirit energy Chu Yunfan absorbed from the Brahma Fruit, the more terrifying the phenomenon became.","The God could feel that Chu Yunfan’s every breath seemed to be longer than before, and each breath was stronger than before. Hisexpression changed. His white hair fluttered in the air, and his eyes exploded with a fierce light.","Boom!","The God made his move again. His injuries were almost healed, but Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of using this time to attack. Time was on Chu Yunfan’s side, and as time passed, he would only become stronger and stronger, while the God’s was constant.","The God’s punch turned into a river of stars, crossing the sky and instantly heading in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Under the sky, Chu Yunfan’s black hair fluttered in the wind and he was wearing a black robe. His eyes were deep and profound, like a demonic god. When the fist came, he barely glanced at it as he slapped it with a backhand.","In an instant, the sky trembled as the slap shattered the fist force of the God’s punch. Then, it slammed down in the God’s direction.","Bam!","The God was like a rubber ball. Just as he flew out of the mountain, he was ruthlessly slapped down by Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, the entire mountain peak was reduced to nothingness, and a monstrous wave of dust was set off on the ground. Sand and stones flew everywhere as if it was the end of the world.","The nearby monsters had no choice but to kneel down and shiver. They didn’t dare to move as if they were facing a real god.","Spurt!","The God spat out a mouthful of blood. One of his treasured armors had been completely shattered. He had suffered a great loss facing Chu Yunfan.","His originally fearless eyes finally revealed a hint of shock."]},{"number":1148,"title":"Chapter 1148 The God’s Fall","paragraphs":["1148 The God’s Fall","It was unprecedented for the God to be forced into such a situation. Even the president had never humiliated him like this before.","With a casual slap, Chu Yunfan sent the God flying, and his eyes flashed with horror and fear.","Meanwhile, in Kunlun City, the Divines who were watching the battle were all completely dumbfounded. The situation had changed too quickly.","Previously, the God ahd been all-powerful, but now, in just a short time, Chu Yunfan had reversed the situation. Even the people who had the most confidence in Chu Yunfan did not think that just breaking through to a new level could cause such a huge difference.","!!","Chu Yunfan was able to completely ignore the God’s level.","“Mighty Chu is so powerful... He’s invincible!” someone muttered.","For the experts of the Federation, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more beneficial it would be for them. As for the Divines from the Holy Land, they had a slightly complicated expression on their faces, but they soon accepted it. After all, they were now a part of the Federation. They would naturally benefit from Chu Yunfan’s strength.","At the very least, they could move out of the Holy Land that could be destroyed at any time. That would be the best.","“Invincible!”","“Invincible!”","“Invincible!”","Soon, all of the voices in Kunlun City had become one.","Chu Yunfan stood tall in the sky. He was just standing there alone, but he seemed to have a supreme power that could suppress the world.","Countless monsters were intimidated by his aura. They knelt obediently at the side, trembling and not daring to move.","“You want to kill me?!” the God shouted. “I’m invincible!”","As soon as the God’s voice fell, he shouted some kind of incantation. The divine power in his body burned and increased again.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about it. In his eyes, the God was like the sun at this moment, burning himself to the extreme in order to obtain supreme combat power. This method was naturally very useful at a critical moment, but the price was also very high.","He casually threw out the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array once again and locked down the God. The four spirits of heaven and earth instantly appeared. With the azure dragon as the leader, they locked down the four directions of heaven and earth.","But in an instant, Chu Yunfan discovered that the God had disappeared. The moment Chu Yunfan used the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array to lock him down, he had escaped.","The next moment, the God had already arrived behind Chu Yunfan. He threw a punch, and countless stars turned into a river of stars that fell toward Chu Yunfan.","This galaxy turned into an extremely dazzling bolt of light, tearing the world in half.","“Die!” the God roared. He had already staked everything on this one upgrade.","“Petty tricks,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, and then slapped down again. The galaxy was once again shattered by Chu Yunfan’s palm, and before it could even get close to Chu Yunfan, it had already turned into spirit energy and scattered in all directions.","The sky trembled. This palm was like the sky itself, pressing down and once again slapping the God’s body.","But this time, the God wasn’t casually slapped away by Chu Yunfan like before. Instead, he took Chu Yunfan’s slap head-on, and he felt like the world was about to explode.","“Chu Yunfan, it’s impossible for you to kill me now!” the God roared, and the mana in his body burned even more intensely. At this time, he was like a huge luminous body, fighting to the limit.","He didn’t know when it started, but the idea of killing Chu Yunfan had already been removed from his mind because it was simply impossible. Instead, it had become self-protection.","As long as he could protect himself, it would not be easy to defeat him.","Chu Yunfan was a little surprised that he couldn’t send the God flying with one strike, but he wasn’t worried. The God was just an arrow at the end of its flight. Just like Chu Yunfan earlier, he was just holding on to his last breath. But unlike him, Chu Yunfan was getting stronger all the time.","His strength had yet to reach its peak and touch the ceiling. In his eyes, the God’s explosion was like that of a trapped beast.","Once upon a time, the God had also looked at him in this way. But now, everything had changed.","“Kill you? I’ve said it before, killing you is like illing a chicken,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. He clenched his five fingers into a fist, withdrew it to his abdomen, and then punched out.","The fist force turned into fist shadows that filled the sky. Like a terrifying storm, they shot toward the God.","The God held his breath, not willing to show weakness, and began to attack Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The God’s attacks collided with Chu Yunfan’s. In the blink of an eye, the two sides had exchanged thousands of blows, and they were as brilliant as comets.","Many people were dazzled. Before they could figure out what was happening, the God suddenly let out a muffled groan and was sent flying like a kite with a broken string. He flew straight into a mountain.","Everyone realized that the God was already covered in blood. He had forcibly mobilized his internal energy to fight against Chu Yunfan, but he was just an arrow at the end of its flight. In fact, his body could no longer bear it. Blood was flowing all over his body, and he was in a worse state than Chu Yunfan.","On his chest, a clear fist mark appeared. It was this punch that had seriously injured the God.","The qi he had gathered also collapsed after being hit by this punch, and his secret technique had lost its effect.","“This is great! The God has been seriously injured. Take advantage of the situation and pursue victory!” an expert shouted in excitement.","In fact, he didn’t need not say anything. Chu Yunfan had already chased after the God.","“Chu Yunfan!” the shocked God shouted, “Don’t go too far in your bullying!”","“Bullying? You actually know this word? Today, you’ve come to kill me. Do you really expect me to surrender and let you kill me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted, “I’ll bully you as much as I want today. What are you going to do about it?!”","The God immediately understood that Chu Yunfan’s killing intent was stronger than anyone else’s. He immediately fled into the distance, leaving behind a blood-red shadow.","Suddenly, just as the God was about to escape, the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array appeared around him. It turned out that Chu Yunfan had already been on guard against his escape and had instantly fixed him in place.","Meanwhile, Chu Yunfan flew toward the God, and in an instant, thousands of fist shadows were blasted out, all of which landed on the God’s body.","The God seemed to have been hit by countless missiles and he exploded in mid-air.","“I’m not willing to accept this!” the God screamed and turned into a cloud of blood mist."]},{"number":1149,"title":"Chapter 1149 The Battle of Kunlun City Ends","paragraphs":["1149 The Battle of Kunlun City Ends","With the God’s scream, the battle that shook the Federation finally came to an end.","The terrifying existence that had once wreaked havoc on the Federation for many years was finally killed by Chu Yunfan in this battle.","In this battle, there were so many twists and turns that the Federation was in despair.","The timing was really unfortunate. Chu Yunfan was at the critical moment of his transformation, so he didn’t have the ability to resist the powerful God.","!!","Everyone thought that Chu Yunfan might even follow in the president’s footsteps.","What no one expected was that Chu Yunfan was able to reverse the situation under extremely unfavorable circumstances. He used the God’s power to complete his breakthrough and break through to a new level.","After that, he quickly defeated the God and killed him when he tried to escape.","This battle progressed too quickly, and the stalemate didn’t last for long. After Chu Yunfan used the God’s power to break through to a new level, he successfully killed the God.","In all parts of the Federation, many television stations were using satellite signals to do a live broadcast, and Chu Yunfan’s amazing performance had been broadcasted live throughout the Federation.","In the beginning, countless people were nervous and worried about Chu Yunfan. No one expected that the situation would turn around when everyone was not optimistic about it.","The Federation was in an uproar!","During the outbreak of the war, many people were also informed about the existence of this God. In the past, the Federation had kept his existence a secret for fear of causing panic. Such an expert was even more stressful for the Federation than the previous Monster Cult leader.","Therefore, all kinds of reports were either intentionally or unintentionally directed to Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks. After all, these two parties had participated in the attack on the Federation, so it was not considered unjust.","It was only now that most of them finally knew that such a terrifying existence was actually behind Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks’ attack on the Federation.","Even the president was injured along with the God, and his cultivation was completely crippled.","To the Federation, such an existence was undoubtedly a sharp sword hanging over their heads. If they could not kill him, then such an attack on the Federation could occur at any time.","Although Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folk alliance had been eliminated, the number of the demons and the marine folks was still endless, even more than that of the humans. Such a large-scale attack of hundreds of millions could be easily organized.","Compared to the three base cities from before, the Federation wouldn’t be able to lose that many base cities.","Now that the God had been killed, the Federation could finally breathe a sigh of relief. Many people thought that after the God had been killed, the great undertaking that the Federation had dreamed of for countless years to dominate the Kunlun Realm was finally possible.","With the removal of Infinite Demon Mountain and the collapse of the marine folk alliance, neither the demons nor the marine folks could pose a fatal threat to the Federation.","The outcome of the battle between the three parties was already foreseeable.","Furthermore, with the emergence of hundreds of Divines in the Federation, the Federation’s strength would also surge.","Even without Chu Yunfan, the experts of the Federation were still not something that the marine folks and the demons could resist.","The Federation was abuzz with discussion. However, compared to before, the tense atmosphere was no longer present. Only a relaxed atmosphere was left as they discussed the future of the Federation.","However, the battle in Kunlun City was still ongoing. It did not end just because of the God’s death.","The Divines of the demons and the marine folks who were mixed in the army of monsters saw their God killed by Chu Yunfan in a single strike, and their courage almost exploded.","Although they had been forced to come by the God’s might, it wasn’t all coercion. There were also many benefits involved. If the God could capture the leader and kill the president of the Federation, then the collapse of the Federation would be imminent.","After the collapse of the Federation, the demons and the marine folks would be able to dominate the Kunlun Realm and even fight their way back to the Federation’s nest—Earth.","They would be able to achieve a great counterattack!","Who would have thought that the God would be so weak? When he was threatening them, he was so high and mighty, but when facing Chu Yunfan, he was so vulnerable.","Because Chu Yunfan had killed the God so quickly, they didn’t even have time to react before everything was over.","At the same time, the Divines of the Federation began to enter the battlefield and to hunt down the Divines of the two races.","Previously, Infinite Demon Mountain still had the technology of nuclear bombs. Although it couldn’t be compared with the Federation, it could still pose a threat to Divines.","Now that Infinite Demon Mountain had been uprooted, all of their technological development had been destroyed, and the demons had completely fallen back into their primitive society. Therefore, the Divines of the Federation could attack at will without any worry.","Chu Yunfan’s promise regarding the Divinity Nourishment Pill was still there. In the eyes of the Federation experts, these Divines from the two races naturally became highly sought after. They represented Divinity Nourishment Pills that could help peak Innates to break through.","The demon and marine folk Divines wanted to escape, but they were quickly surrounded by the Federation’s Divines were several times more powerful than them.","Previously, the Federation’s Divines had been afraid of the God, so they had not dared to attack recklessly. But now, they had nothing to worry about.","Although these Divine monsters were generally very powerful, they could only barely hold on when they were surrounded by Divines who were several times more powerful than them. Soon, they were killed one by one.","And even if some managed to escape and kill their way out, they were targeted by Chu Yunfan.","In the middle of the battlefield, Chu Yunfan’s divine will was completely released, covering the entire battlefield.","He was like a super-large human radar. Any Divine monster that tried to escape could not escape his vision. He held a longbow formed by the power of thunder and shot one arrow at a time, not missing a single shot. He killed these monsters that tried to escape.","On the entire battlefield, the war was in full swing!","After the Divine monsters were killed one by one, the backup plan that the Federation had prepared finally began to be implemented. All kinds of missiles were launched crazily, and all kinds of tactical nuclear bombs were launched.","Even so, the battle lasted for a full day and night. The monster attack that affected the whole of Kunlun City finally came to an end."]},{"number":1150,"title":"Chapter 1150 A Year Later, I Want to Go to the Spirit Realm","paragraphs":["1150 A Year Later, I Want to Go to the Spirit Realm","The battle of Kunlun City finally came to an end after a day and a night, leaving only some clean up work.","However, to the Federation, the shock of this battle had just begun.","Such a big event of hundreds of millions of monsters attacking the city, if it was in the past, it might only happen once in decades, enough to be remembered by a generation. But now, it was nothing.","During this period, monsters of this level had attacked the human cities one after another, and Infinite Demon Mountain and the Federation had also suffered heavy casualties.","!!","Just the collapse of the three base cities of the Federation had resulted in the lost hundreds of millions of people.","The price paid by Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folks was even greater. Infinite Demon Mountain was uprooted, and the supreme court of the demons, which had been around for countless years, was completely destroyed overnight.","The upper echelons of the marine folk alliance were wiped out by Chu Yunfan in one night, and the Federation Army then killed the entire marine folk alliance.","It could be said that more things had happened in this period of time than in the past hundreds of years. The scale of the battle could be said to be unprecedented.","In this final battle, the Federation won the final victory. The future path of glory for the Federation could be predicted from this.","And this would benefit everyone. It was just a matter of how much.","Countless people wanted the Federation Army to take advantage of their victory and establish the position of the Federation as overlord of the Kunlun Realm, thus regaining the dominant position.","And after this battle, Chu Yunfan was sealed as a god in the Federation. Since ancient times, no one had ever had a status as high as Chu Yunfan.","Some people even made a survey in the Federation to see if there would be people supporting Chu Yunfan if he declared himself emperor.","In the Federation, which had been democratic for hundreds of years, as many as 80% of the people chose to support him, and 15% of the remaining 20% chose to remain neutral, while less than 5% of the people opposed him.","When the first emperor of the Federation, Gao Tenglong, claimed the title of Emperor, he was opposed by countless people in the Federation. He was beaten down from the altar by the continuous resistance. But now, if Chu Yunfan wanted to claim the title of emperor, he would receive almost unanimous support.","It was not hard to imagine how high Chu Yunfan’s status and prestige in the Federation had reached.","It made many people who supported democracy worried. Chu Yunfan’s strength was so strong that no one in the Federation could stop him. If he really decided to become the emperor, it might be a disaster for the Federation.","At this time, Chu Yunfan seemed to have disappeared. He didn’t appear in front of the public, and he didn’t intend to use such a high support rate to do anything. He didn’t even say much about the matter of countless people calling for him to take over as the next president.","For a whole year, Chu Yunfan did not appear in front of anyone again.","No one knew where he had gone.","In Capital City, in the presidential palace, Chu Yunfan, who had disappeared for a whole year, sat opposite the president. Chu Yunfan’s instructor, Jeang Yuanbin, and Tang Siyu were sitting next to him.","“You really don’t want to reconsider?” the president asked as he looked at Chu Yunfan. “With your current reputation, it’s easy for you to become the next president. As you know, I’ve already lost all my cultivation. The current Federation needs a powerful leader, and you’re more suitable than me.”","“I’ve already seriously considered it. Becoming the president of the Federation is not suitable for me. After seeing the scenery on the path of martial arts, I’m no longer interested in anything else,” Chu Yunfan said, shaking his head.","To many people, becoming the president of the Federation was undoubtedly a great achievement. Even a matter that would go down in history.","However, for Chu Yunfan, this was not the case. To him, the unparalleled scenery on the path of martial arts he had glimpsed was the only thing that possessed a supreme attraction.","The president nodded. He was also an extremely brilliant cultivator, so he could understand what Chu Yunfan was saying.","“What a pity. This is a great loss for the Federation,” the president said with a sigh. He loved the Federation deeply and treated it as his true home.","He sincerely hoped that Chu Yunfan could become the next president. With Chu Yunfan’s foundation and strength, the Federation would definitely flourish and dominate the Kunlun Realm under his leadership.","“It’s not really a loss. After all, I think it’s better for you to continue being the president than for me to take over,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“How can I continue to be when I’m like this? My cultivation is crippled. If it wasn’t for you, I’m afraid I would’ve died long ago.” The president laughed at himself mockingly. He wasn’t undervaluing himself, but he knew that he was in a terrible state.","“Don’t worry about that, sir. I’ve searched the entire Kunlun Realm over the past year and found the herbs. I’ve made this pill for you. It should be able to solve your current problem,” Chu Yunfan said.","Then, he took out a porcelain bottle from thin air. The bottle contained the pill.","A look of surprise flashed through the president’s eyes. He had sought out all the famous doctors in the Federation, all kinds of alchemy masters, and even the alchemy king. But the final conclusion was that there was no cure.","Even he himself was in despair. He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to give him such great news at this time.","The president was a man who had been through a lot. He calmed down almost immediately and took the bottle with a smile. He put it away and said, “I’ll accept it. Thank you.”","“Sir, you don’t have to thank me. You’ve done so much for the Federation. You deserve it,” Chu Yunfan said.","Although he could now speak to the president on equal footing, he had grown up listening to many legends about the president, so he respected the president.","The president had given everything for the Federation. He should not have such a miserable ending. This would be unfair.","“All right, there’s no need for such formalities between us. I won’t beat around the bush with you. You suddenly appearing should mean that you’re ready to go to the Spirit Realm, right?” the president asked.","“Yes!” Chu Yunfan nodded. “The Spirit Realm is the stage I’m looking forward to. This time, other than delivering the medicine to you, sir, I also want to understand the situation in the Spirit Realm.”"]},{"number":1151,"title":"Chapter 1151 Leaving","paragraphs":["1151 Leaving","The president thought for a moment and said, “In the Spirit Realm, I actually didn’t know much back then. I was only an Innate martial artist at that time. From what I knew back then, there were far more Divines in the Spirit Realm than in the Federation. In fact, there were far more.","“Cores were high and mighty in the Spirit Realm. They’re elusive existences. They’re a bit like the Divine of the Federation,” the president continued, “In the Spirit Realm, the situation is far more complicated than in the Kunlun Realm. In the Kunlun Realm, there are only three major forces—the Federation, Infinite Demon Mountain, and the marine folks. But in the Spirit Realm, there are far more forces.","“But you don’t have to worry. With your strength, you’re also one of the small group of people who are high and mighty in the Spirit Realm,” the president said after some thought, “As for the other things, I’ll organize some information for you to take with you. I don’t know much, but it’s better than letting you know nothing.”","“Thank you, sir,” Chu Yunfan said.","“So you’re saying that you’ve found the teleportation array left behind by the God?” the president said.","Chu Yunfan smiled and nodded, then said, “I’ve traveled all over the Kunlun Realm in the past year. Other than making pills for you, sir, I’ve also been looking for that teleportation array. And I’ve finally found it.”","“Alright, but are you guys planning to go together?” The president looked at Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu.","“Yes,” Chu Yunfan said.","He would be going to the spirit world with Tang Siyu. She had already entered the half-step to Core Stage, and with Chu Yunfan’s help in sorting out the many secrets and methods of cultivation in the Core Stage, it was only a matter of time before she entered the Core Stage.","The power of the Arcane Sky Spirit Physique was also one of the best in the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Its cultivation speed was no slower than Chu Yunfan’s.","In the Spirit Realm, she should be able to protect herself.","However, he was worried about was his family. For Tang Siyu, there was nothing to worry about. Her mother had passed away early, and she had no feelings for her father. The Tang family had also recently elected a new clan leader.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was worried about his parents, and although Chu Wencheng and Yang Yayun were reluctant to see him leave, they supported his search for a wider world.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan had left behind a lot of cultivation tips and secrets. In addition to the Dvinity Nourishment Pills, it was only a matter of time before they entered the Divine Abilities Stage. Chu Yunfan had also concocted a lot of Longevity Pills during this year. It was easy to imagine that his parents’ lifespans would become very long in the future.","His younger sister would also grow up. After making all these arrangements, Chu Yunfan decided to set off soon.","“Very well. You young people are so adventurous.” The president looked at the two of them with envy. “Don’t worry. As long as I’m here, I’ll take care of the Chus and Tangs. I won’t let anything happen to them.”","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu both nodded. This was one of the reasons why they came here, which was to entrust their families to the president.","Chu Yunfan had to prepare a few extra layers of insurance for his parents. After all, he didn’t know when he and Tang Siyu would be able to come back.","However, he wasn’t too worried. From the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, he knew that a true powerful being could travel between the two worlds as easily as eating and drinking, not to mention Chu Yunfan, who needed to use a teleportation array.","A year had passed, and the battle of Kunlun City had become an old story that people would only occasionally mention.","In the past year, the Federation had been conquering the North and the South. Without the threat of Infinite Demon Mountain and the marine folk alliance, the Federation had expanded at a rapid pace. In just one year, it had established its first base city on the sea in history.","Although there were some scattered sects and aristocratic families who had settled overseas, they were all closer to the Kunlun Realm. It was the first time they had built a base city in the deep sea.","During the construction process, the marine folks retaliated crazily. However, with the resources of the Federation, the marine folks was defeated. In the endless deep sea, the first sea base city of mankind was built. They didn’t even rely on the islands that originally existed in the Infinite Sea for construction. Instead, they built a city of steel out of thin air.","The huge consumption would have been unimaginable and a burden for the countries in the Common Era. Only by gathering the power of the Federation could they achieve such a feat.","The three base cities, including Binhai City, were also recovering in an orderly manner. Everything was on the right track, and there was new news every day. Good news.","The entire Federation was in full swing.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu got up early that morning. In the courtyard, Chu Yunfan’s family were already waiting for them.","Even Great Ancestor Chu and the current head of the Chu family, Chu Haoyue, came over after inquiring about it. The news of Chu Yunfan’s departure was not told to too many people, but the great ancestor and Chu Haoyue had a good relationship with Chu Yunfan, so they were informed of it.","In particular, his parents would be relying on them in the future, so these were naturally necessary.","Chu Wencheng and Yang Yayun both had a reluctant expression on their faces. This was different from before. After leaving this time, they didn’t know when they would be able to see each other again.","Yang Yayun’s eyes were red. She had cried the whole night and didn’t sleep at all.","Beside her, Chu Qingxuan was holding her arm. Her eyes were red. She had been crying too.","“Xuan Xuan, I’ll leave Mom and Dad in your care from now on,” Chu Yunfan said. “Also, take a look at the information I left behind. It’ll be good for your cultivation.”","Before he left, Chu Yunfan had compiled the many cultivation methods from the Physical Stage to the Core Stage into a book and distributed it to those who needed it. Of course, the ones in his parents ‘and sister’s hands were much more detailed than the others.","“Okay.” Chu Qingxuan nodded her little head, her tears almost flowing again.","“You can leave. Don’t worry, your mother and I are not that old yet,” Chu wencheng said.","“Great Ancestor, Brother Haoyue, if anything happens to our clan in the future, I’ll have to trouble you to take care of it.” Chu Yunfan looked at Great Ancestor Chu and Chu Haoyue.","“Don’t worry,” Chu Haoyue said.","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu looked at each other, then both of them rose from the ground and turned into a stream of light, flying toward the distant sky. Shortly, they had disappeared from everyone’s sight."]},{"number":1152,"title":"Chapter 1152 The Spirit Realm, a New Beginning","paragraphs":["1152 The Spirit Realm, a New Beginning","Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu were extremely fast. In less than half a day, they had already crossed the Kunlun Realm and arrived at an island in the deep sea.","This island wasn’t very big, only a few dozen kilometers in radius. This kind of small island could be said to be densely covered in the Infinite Sea. It could be destroyed by the raging marine monsters at any moment, or it could be born from the eruption of countless underwater volcanoes.","On this island, in the dense forest, there was a hill. At the base of the hill, there was a cave.","The two of them entered the cave. Soon, they could see that there was a huge ruin in the cave. It looked like the ruins of a sect. Although it was in shambles, it was clear that someone had cleaned up the place.","In the center of this ruin, the other ruins had been eroded by the long river of time, and there was only one huge array there.","All kinds of spirit stones were placed around the array. Some of them were placed by Chu Yunfan, while others had been placed there by the God. They were all placed to activate the array.","Chu Yunfan strode toward the array and poured his energy into it. In an instant, the array activated and lit up. He and Tang Siyu walked in one after another, and soon, the light of the array swallowed their figures.","Chu Yunfan felt the power of space wrap around the two of them, and the surrounding space was rapidly changing.","Just as he was feeling the smooth transfer, a figure suddenly appeared in front of him, causing his hair to stand on end. This person was none other than the God.","Chu Yunfan instinctively threw a punch at the God and the God was instantly shattered. It turned out that it was only his divine will.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan suddenly felt that something was wrong. When he checked the array, he hadn’t found any divine will in it at all. In other words, the God must have used a special method to hide it.","Chu Yunfan’s body was being repaired, and the first person to repair the teleportation array was no other than the God. And this divine will clone should have hidden inside before the God died, so it should also be a backup plan prepared by the God.","Almost immediately, Chu Yunfan understood the God’s plan. The God was also afraid that this array would be used by others, so he deliberately left a trace of divine will. If the person who came in was not the God himself, this divine will of the God would be immediately activated.","What a sinister method.","If it was outside, this trace of the God’s divine will would not pose any threat to him at all. Even if the God himself came back to life, Chu Yunfan would still be able to easily suppress im.","However, Chu Yunfan was helpless in this teleportation array.","At that moment, cracks began to appear in the space where the teleportation array was located. It was cracking inch by inch.","‘F*ck, even in death, he still wanted to trick me!’ Chu Yunfan cursed in his heart.","“Oh no!” Tang Siyu also immediately realized that something was wrong.","At this time, Chu Yunfan could sense that they were about to arrive at the destination of the teleportation, but the space where the teleportation array was located was also about to collapse. If this continued, the two of them would be trapped here and die in the spatial turbulence.","This was the scariest thing about teleportation arrays. If one was not careful, they could die in the space turbulence.","The power of space was a top-notch power of law that was on par with the power of time. It was not something that people of their level could come into contact with.","Chu Yunfan instantly made his decision. With a wave of his hand, the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array flew out and wrapped Tang Siyu within itself. Then, with a strong push, he pushed Tang Siyu toward the exit.","Then, he was instantly swallowed up by the spatial turbulence.","***","In the side courtyard of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence in Conglong City in the Great Wei Kingdom.","The autumn wind was bleak. A gust of wind blew, only blowing up the fallen leaves on the ground.","In this rustling autumn wind, a young man of about twenty years old was topless. Although the cold wind was blowing, he could not move his body. As he performed a set of simple fist techniques, his whole body emitted a faint heat. Soon, this heat turned into a storm, forming a protective energy shield that was visible to the naked eye around his body.","His skin was trembling at a speed invisible to the naked eye, and traces of spatial power were being expelled from the stellar energy.","“It’s been a whole year. I’ve finally managed to expel the space force that had invaded my body.”","This young man was none other than Chu Yunfan, who had met with a mishap in the teleportation array a year ago.","He had been recuperating for more than a year. At that time, he was on the verge of death. He had almost run out of breath. He had been recuperating since being rescued.","The damage caused by the space force was even more serious than the last time he had entered the Holy Land, but fortunately, his cultivation was no longer the same as before.","But even so, he spent a full year before he finally eliminated most of the space force.","In other words, the space force no longer caused continuous damage to his physical body. This was also because Chu Yunfan cultivated the Imperial Physique, which allowed him to persist until now. If it was an ordinary person, they would have long been torn apart by the space force. Even if they were lucky enough to survive, it would be impossible for them to recover.","Now, he had only recovered from the injuries of his physical body, but his Dharma power was completely shattered. His meridians were cut into countless pieces. This kind of injury was extremely difficult for him.","This situation caused him to be unable to use his divine power even though his physical injuries had recovered. It could be said that his strength had regressed greatly compared to before.","In the past, he was able to sweep away all the heroes and laugh proudly at the world because of his super strong physical cultivation and astonishingly thick divine power. Now, he could no longer use his divine power, which was basically equivalent to half of it being wasted.","However, even so, Chu Yunfan was confident that with his current combat power, he was comparable to a master at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. Ordinary Divines would not be able to withstand his full-force punch.","‘As expected, the body was the foundation of everything. Only with a strong body can there be a strong dharmakaya,’ Chu Yunfan thought. The body that cultivators talked about was the physical body that ordinary people talked about, while the dharmakaya was the concept of the so-called spirit, will, and even the soul.","The body was the foundation of everything. Only when the body was strong enough to stay in the world, would the dharmakaya have the opportunity to gradually become stronger. Buddha said that the physical body was just a stinky skinbag, but now Chu Yunfan really needed this stinky skinbag to help him get through the endless sea of suffering.","If it wasn’t for the fact that he had cultivated the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique, he would have died long ago.","Suddenly, a series of footsteps came from outside the courtyard."]},{"number":1153,"title":"Chapter 1153 Great Wei Kingdom, Marquis Zhongxin’s Residence","paragraphs":["1153 Great Wei Kingdom, Marquis Zhongxin’s Residence","After cultivating to this stage, Chu Yunfan was able to understand the importance of the Physical Stage.","That was the beginning of all cultivation and the most important stage of laying the foundation. In the later stages, many people actually didn’t pay much attention to the polishing of the physical body. This didn’t mean that they didn’t cultivate, but they would pay more attention to the accumulation of mana, the understanding of the divine arts, and so on.","However, after experiencing all this, he finally understood that the road of cultivation was like a boat going against the current. The body was the boat crossing the sea. If the dharmakaya wanted to cross the other side, the body must be strong enough.","Even if it was just a rotten skin, it was not something that could be thrown away now.","And now, Chu Yunfan’s physical body was almost fully recovered. He looked like he didn’t have any divine power, but if he really fought, his combat power would be close to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage.","After a whole year, he had gained some understanding. Although he had been plotted against by the God’s divine will, he had fortunately not fallen into the spacial turbulence at the last moment. In the end, he had fallen into the Spirit Realm.","However, he had completely lost contact with Tang Siyu. In the past year, he had been investigating both openly and secretly, but he had not heard any news about her.","Tang Siyu was not like Chu Yunfan, who had the protection of the Heavenly Guardians Sealing Array, so she should not have been injured. If she was nearby, with Tang Siyu’s cultivation, it would not be impossible for her to not have any news.","The only possibility was that Tang Siyu had fallen further away, so Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry, because there was no use in being anxious.","Tang Siyu’s cultivation was only one step away from the Core Stage, so she should be able to protect herself.","From what he had learned, this was undoubtedly the Spirit Realm. However, it was not the place the president had mentioned, but a place called the Great Wei Kingdom.","The Great Wei Kingdom was vast, and its scope was even more than twice the size of China in the Common Era. The population was also numbered in the billions.","Here, martial arts were highly prosperous. The development of martial arts was a level higher than that of the Federation. The spirit energy here was several times richer than that of the Kunlun Realm. Most people here had reached the peak of the Acquired Stage. With a little practice, it was not difficult to enter the Innate Stage.","The number of Innates in the Great Wei Kingdom was beyond the imagination of the Federation.","The Divines who had once been high and mighty in the Federation were not uncommon here. In the Great Wei Kingdom, the status of Divines was equivalent to the status of the Innates in the Federation. Although they were respected, there were also many of them.","All the outstanding figures were generally above the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, there were differences between each Divine Abilities Stage. Those below tier seven could only be considered ordinary, but once they reached tier seven, their status would fundamentally improve.","If they joined the army, they could immediately become a general. If they made a contribution to the Great Wei Kingdom, it was not impossible for them to be conferred the title of marquis or minister.","Experts above tier seven of the Divine Abilities Stage were the core of the entire country’s high-level. As for those at the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, they were extremely rare. As long as they were willing to serve the Great Wei, it was only a matter of time before they were conferred the title of marquis or minister.","The existence of such a person was a huge deterrent. It was enough to suppress a region and shock the world.","Above the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, there were also half-step Cores. Those experts could be conferred the title of duke if they made enough contributions in the court. They could also establish a sect and become the patriarchs of a region if they were not in the court.","The entire Great Wei Kingdom called this kind of person a martial arts grandmaster. This kind of person was rare within the Great Wei Kingdom. There weren’t many such existences in the entire kingdom.","Although there weren’t as many people as there were in Kunlun Realm, there were very few of them. Even the emperor had to treat these people with respect.","As for the Core Stage, which was above the half-step to the Core Stage, they were like immortals. Usually, they were mysterious and there were only some rumors about them circulating in the market. Few people had ever seen them with their own eyes.","These people were like gods on Earth in the Great Wei Kingdom. Their words and actions could even influence national policy. They truly had the power to overturn the rivers and seas.","It was in line with what the president had said. Although the Great Wei Kingdom wasn’t the president’s hometown, the general situation was similar. It could be seen that the Great Wei Kingdom wasn’t the only place in the Spirit Realm.","However, Chu Yunfan’s current situation was not enough to cross the Great Wei state and see the vast world outside.","However, in the past year or so, he had almost recovered from his injuries. As long as he could repair some of his meridians, it would not be a problem for him to recover his combat strength to the half-step to the Core Stage.","However, if he continued at this speed, he would probably need several years to recover to his peak. Only by making pills could he recover in the shortest time possible.","At that time, he would be able to go anywhere in the world.","The sound of footsteps disrupted Chu Yunfan’s thoughts, and the strange phenomenon around him instantly disappeared without a trace. A moment later, a young girl who looked like a maidservant walked in and saluted him.","“Young Master Fan, it’s almost time for the blind date that the grand madam has arranged for you to meet the eldest daughter of the Situ family. Before the grand madam went home to visit her family, she instructed us not to let you be late.”","As the maidservant spoke, she secretly glanced at Chu Yunfan. For more than a year, among the many young masters of the branch family, he was the most low-key one and almost never appeared in anyone’s sight.","However, everyone knew that the grand madam doted on him the most and he was a popular candidate to become the crown prince.","Although he didn’t show any enthusiasm, and even kept a low profile, everyone knew that Marquis Zhongxin had always listened to the grand madam. With the grand madam’s protection, this Young Master Fan, who rarely showed his face, had a high chance of becoming the prince of Marquis Zhongxin.","Hearing this, Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but smile, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. Speaking of which, this all started a year ago.","At that time, Chu Yunfan had just fallen into the Spirit Realm by accident. He didn’t expect to meet a young man who was killed by someone. That person actually looked 70% to 80% similar to him, and his name was also Chu Yunfan.","After that, he was mistaken for that young man and was rescued back to the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. Slowly, Chu Yunfan came to understand that it was because the Marquis Zhongxin’s original prince had been killed, and he had no other sons, so he had no choice but to choose a few people from the Chu clan’s branch families to be candidates for the new prince.","Chu Yunfan had used this identity to recuperate in the Zhongxin Marquis’s residence until today"]},{"number":1154,"title":"Chapter 1154 The Blind Date","paragraphs":["1154 The Blind Date","Yunfan’s original intention was just to use this identity to settle down in the Spirit Realm, but who knew that after meeting Marquis Zhongxin’s mother, the old lady would be unexpectedly good to him?","Later, Chu Yunfan found out that it might have something to do with his appearance. The old lady had a younger son who died many years ago while protecting her. She had always felt guilty, so after she saw him, she probably thought of him as the incarnation of her younger son.","Marquis Zhongxin’s household wanted to select a successor from the side. Many other candidates lived in the marquis’ residence, but they had not been decided yet.","And among these people, Chu Yunfan was the most special one. The others couldn’t wait to hang around in front of Marquis Zhongxin every day, but Chu Yunfan was different. Other than occasionally paying respects to the old lady, he only met Marquis Zhongxin during the new year with the others.","Although Chu Yunfan kept a low profile, he was quite famous in the marquis’ residence because of the old lady’s favoritism.","If it wasn’t for the fact that he really didn’t have the slightest intention of competing, he would probably be able to win over a group of people by his side, and he wouldn’t have to live in such a remote side courtyard.","However, the old lady had arranged a blind date for him when she returned to her hometown, which made him feel like how he had been forced by his mother to marry in the past.","No matter why the old lady was so nice to him, Chu Yunfan was someone of feelings so he was naturally touched. However, he didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","In the past year, due to his injuries, he had no choice but to lay low. Now, everything was different. Even if he was not at his peak, there were not many people in the world who could be his opponent.","“All right, I got it,” Chu Yunfan said.","He went to his room to change his clothes and left. Compared to the other candidates who had beautiful wives and concubines, Chu Yunfan was really low-key in many people’s eyes.","Seeing Chu Yunfan leave, the maidservant heaved a sigh of relief. She didn’t know why, but even though everyone in the manor knew that this Young Master Fan had no cultivation, she still couldn’t help but feel nervous when facing him. She was a maidservant of the grand madam and was not this nervous even when meeting Marquis Zhongxin.","As she heaved a sigh of relief, she did not notice that when Chu Yunfan left, his footsteps were so light that he did not make a single sound.","North of Conglong City, there was a huge mansion with red walls and green tiles. It was resplendent with gold and jade. The pavilions and terraces were comparable to each other.","On a pavilion, two women were sitting side by side. One of the women was wearing a fiery red short robe. She was neat and clean, had a pretty face and an outstanding figure. She looked valiant and heroic.","The other woman was dressed in a light yellow long dress. She had a slender figure and exquisite facial features. Her skin was as white as snow. At this moment, her embroidered brows were slightly furrowed, and her small mouth was slightly open as she said, “Xiuxiu, this is so annoying. My father wants me to go on a blind date with a good-for-nothing young master. It would be fine if he was the son of Marquis Zhongxin, but he’s just a branch family descendant. I heard that he doesn’t have any martial arts. He’s just a good-for-nothing young master.”","This was the young lady of the Situ family, Situ Miaoyi, who had a blind date with Chu Yunfan.","“We women are all grown up. Sooner or later, we will have such an experience,” the red-robed woman, An Xiuxiu, said directly, “Besides, he’s only asking you to go on a blind date, not to marry him. What’s the big deal? You can only blame your great reputation. Even the grand madam of Marquis Zhongxin’s household has heard of you. The old lady is the chaperone today. How many people in Conglong City can afford to offend her?”","“This is so annoying. Why can’t we women choose our own marriage? ” Situ Miaoyi mumbled in a depressed manner.","“I can!” An Xiuxiu pouted and said, “It’s because you’re too weak. If you were in the Divine Abilities Stage, your future would be limitless. No one could force you. In this world, the strong are respected. Innates are just ants. Only those in the Divine Abilities Stage can control a part of their own fate. If you want to truly transcend, you have to be in the Core Stage.”","“The Core Stage? I didn’t think that far. There are so many people in the Great Wei Kingdom, but how many of them can enter the Core Stage?” Situ Miaoyi pouted and said, “I know that you have good talent and have entered the Divine Abilities Stage at such a young age. There’s no need to keep showing off.”","“I’m still far from it. I’m now in the Divine Abilities Stage, but I only have the qualifications to enter the circle of a small group of people,” An Xiuxiu shook her head.","“Hey, don’t make it sound like you’re so much stronger than me. I’m at the peak of the Innate Stage!” Situ Miaoyi said with dissatisfaction. “I’m only one step away from Divine Abilities Stage!”","“It’s not the same. One step away is like the difference between cloud and mud. One step behind means you’ll fall behind step by step. I don’t doubt that you’ll be able to enter the Divine Abilities Stage, but at that time, you’ll be one of many,” An Xiuxiu said.","“Let’s not talk about this anymore. What if that guy pesters me?” Situ Miaoyi said. She had seen many people like that. Since she was young, her appearance had been outstanding, and she had many suitors. Among them, there were many who were pestering her.","“I don’t think it’s possible. I’ve investigated him. He’s really low-key, and not many people even know what he looks like. This kind of person is either really mediocre or has great perseverance. In any case, the probability of him pestering you is very low,” An Xiuxiu said bluntly. “But how about I go with you to check it out? If he dares to do anything, I’ll help you teach him a lesson.”","“I was just waiting for you to say that!” Situ Miaoyi’s smile was so sweet that it was as if the room was filled with flowers.","Pinyi Pavilion was one of the few teahouses in Conglong City. It was said that there was a powerful force behind it. All the rich people in Conglong City liked to drink tea here.","In a private room, Chu Yunfan was sitting on a chair, drinking tea from time to time. Although he had been waiting for an hour, he was not in a hurry.","The entire private room was in line with the way of Feng Shui. The furniture was also made of spirit wood and engraved with spirit-gathering arrays, constantly emitting faint spirit energy. If people lived in such an environment for a long time, it would be extremely beneficial to their cultivation.","The Federation also had similar places, but the Federation’s research on arrays was far less advanced, so the effects were naturally different.","The tea that Chu Yunfan was drinking contained extremely dense spirit energy. It was a high-quality tea. As he drank the tea, he used his cultivation to refine the spirit energy in it to heal his injuries.","To him, this was healing his injuries and a form of cultivation. Even though he had been stood up for an hour, he wasn’t in a hurry to leave."]},{"number":1155,"title":"Chapter 1155 Doctor Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1155 Doctor Chu Yunfan","Half an hour later, two beautiful figures appeared in the room.","Then, they sat down in front of Chu Yunfan.","“I’m sorry we’re late,” Situ Miaoyi said and then looked at Chu Yunfan.","What surprised her was that after standing him up for an hour, he didn’t even look angry. Of course, she was late on purpose. She wanted to anger Chu Yunfan so that they could have a big fight and then break up.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would not be moved in the slightest?","“It’s fine.” Chu Yunfan glanced at Situ Miaoyi and revealed a faint smile.","It was very easy for him to see through Situ Miaoyi’s thoughts. It was just the thoughts of a little girl. Although Chu Yunfan was only a few years older than her, the things that he had experienced were not something that Situ Miaoyi could imagine.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, her little tricks were nothing more than a child throwing a tantrum.","“This is my friend, An Xiuxiu!” Situ Miaoyi introduced An Xiuxiu who was beside her.","Chu Yunfan glanced at An Xiuxiu and was a little surprised. An Xiuxiu looked a few years younger than him, but she had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage.","Apart from special cases like him and Tang Siyu, it was an unimaginable miracle in the Federation to enter the Divine Abilities Stage at the age of twenty.","Before Chu Yunfan’s appearance, the Divines of the Federation were generally decades older, or even a hundred years older, before they entered the Divine Abilities Stage.","Needless to say, the potential of a Divine at the age of twenty and a Divine at the age of a hundred were worlds apart.","Such a person was rarely seen in the Federation for hundreds of years. However, he was actually meeting one here. The Spirit Realm’s martial Dao development was indeed at least one level stronger than the Federation’s.","An Xiuxiu glanced at Chu Yunfan and felt a little strange. He clearly gave her the feeling of a clear spring. She could see the bottom of the spring with a glance. He should not have any cultivation but there was a faint layer that she couldn’t see through.","This gave her a very special feeling, but she was sure of one thing—Chu Yunfan was definitely not as good-for-nothing as the rumors said. Although he didn’t have any cultivation, he was neither servile nor overbearing. He had a temperament that would not change his expression even if Mount Tai collapsed in front of him.","After being stood up for more than an hour, he still remained calm and composed. This was not something an ordinary person could do.","“Let’s get straight to the point. We were both forced to go on this blind date. From the looks of it, you don’t seem to be interested in me. In that case, it’s just right. Everyone is happy,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","“Good, you’re very straightforward.” Situ Miaoyi nodded but she felt a little strange in her heart. Although it was the best result that Chu Yunfan didn’t bother her, Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at her, which made her a little unconvinced.","If Chu Yunfan knew about this, he probably wouldn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","“Outsiders are spreading rumors that you’re a good-for-nothing, but now it seems that the rumors can’t be believed,” An Xiuxiu said. She had been staring at Chu Yunfan when he was talking, so she was sure that Chu Yunfan wasn’t playing hard to get or trying to save face.","“Your cultivation is also not bad. It’s very impressive!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“You can tell?” An Xiuxiu looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. In her opinion, Chu Yunfan shouldn’t have been able to see her condition.","“I can tell a little,” Chu Yunfan said as he sipped his tea. “You must have been guided by a famous master. You’re so young, but you’re already in the Divine Abilities Stage. Not just anyone can do this.”","An Xiuxiu’s face revealed a surprised expression. She didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be able to tell.","“But...” Chu Yunfan said.","“But what?” An Xiuxiu quickly asked. She had already sensed that Chu Yunfan was not as bad as the rumors made him out to be, but she still wanted to know what he would say.","“But do the mingmen and tianzong acupoints on your back start to hurt at midnight?” Chu Yunfan said.","“How did you know?” An Xiuxiu was shocked. She had never told anyone about this so how could Chu Yunfan know?","Situ Miaoyi, who was standing at the side, was also dumbfounded. She thought that Chu Yunfan was just trying to use this kind of tactic to attract An Xiuxiu’s attention.","She was extremely unhappy. Chu Yunfan did not care about her at all, but he seemed to be very interested in An Xiuxiu. This made her, who had always thought highly of herself, extremely unhappy.","But from what Chu Yunfan had said and An Xiuxiu’s reaction, it was obvious that she wasn’t just making things up. Could it be that this guy was right?","“You were born with a constitution of the fire attribute, so the person who guided you in martial arts should have chosen a fire attribute cultivation method for you. This is originally nothing. When your realm is low, it naturally doesn’t matter, and your cultivation will even progress rapidly. But after reaching the Divine Abilities Stage, there will be problems,” Chu Yunfan said, shaking his head. “Have you heard of the principle that neither solitary yin nor yang can not grow? It’s fine if you’re a man, but you’re a woman, and you’re cultivating such a fierce cultivation method. Sooner or later, you’ll encounter problems.”","An Xiuxiu was just listening for the time being and did not have much hope. After all, ever since she entered the Divine Abilities Stage, this problem had appeared. She had looked through many medical books, but none of them could solve the problem.","She had even consulted some doctors in private, but they couldn’t find the problem, while Chu Yunfan could see it at a glance.","This made her realize that Chu Yunfan might have a way to solve it.","What she didn’t know was that although Chu Yunfan wasn’t a doctor, he had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, and his knowledge reserve was so rich that it wasn’t something ordinary people could imagine.","A good doctor didn’t necessarily mean a good alchemist. An alchemist, a good alchemist, would also be a renowned doctor. This was because pills were meant to be consumed by people. If one didn’t understand the human body enough, the pills could kill people.","The Alchemy Emperor was one of the best among them. In his life, not only did he make pills, but he also cured strange diseases in countless experts.","Compared to those strange diseases, An Xiuxiu’s problem was a piece of cake.","An Xiuxiu was about to ask Chu Yunfan how he knew about it, but he suddenly asked, “Did you two offend someone?”","“No, I haven’t.” Situ Miaoyi shook her head, not understanding why Chu Yunfan would suddenly ask this question.","An Xiuxiu also shook her head.","“Since it’s not you two, that means he’s your elder,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently as he took a sip of tea.","“Friend, since you’re here, why don’t you show yourself? What can’t you say in person?”"]},{"number":1156,"title":"Chapter 1156 Assassination, the Calm and Composed Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1156 Assassination, the Calm and Composed Chu Yunfan","An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi were instantly confused by Chu Yunfan’s words.","An Xiuxiu seemed to have thought of something and instantly became alert. Situ Miaoyi, after covering herself up, also seemed to have thought of something.","“Hehe, I didn’t expect that I would be discovered.”","At this moment, on the originally empty wall, three men in green suddenly appeared. Of these three men, one was extremely fat, one had a medium build, and the last one was extremely thin. These three had completely different builds, but they looked somewhat similar.","!!","Among the three of them, the fat man in green was the leader. This man’s body was extremely bloated, and he looked no different from a ball.","However, his body carried an extremely terrifying aura, which enveloped the entire room.","The Divine Abilities Stage!","Chu Yunfan took a sip of tea. Although the three of them had special concealment techniques that ordinary Divine Abilities Stage cultivators couldn’t see through, it was a pity that they had met Chu Yunfan. Although he didn’t have any magic power, Chu Yunfan’s divine will came from his brain, so it was not affected.","Even without his divine will, with his current realm, even the slightest fluctuation could not escape his perception.","With Chu Yunfan’s experience, he could tell at a glance that the chubby green-robed man had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage, while the other two had also entered tier three of the Divine Abilities Stage.","In the past, such cultivation would have been equivalent to high and mighty figures like Great Ancestor Chu and Great Ancestor Jiang. They could make decisions with a single word. However, there were so many affairs within the Federation.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but sigh at the thought of it. The Federation’s foundation was too shallow!","“The Green Garbs!”","Compared to Chu Yunfan, who didn’t know anything about the situation, An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi, the two natives, were much clearer.","“That’s right. You two young ladies are knowledgeable.” The fat man laughed evilly.","The Green Garbs?","Chu Yunfan thought about it carefully and quickly recalled that he had heard about The Green Garbs in the past year. In the Great Wei Kingdom, The Green Garbs were a lawless assassination organization. It was extremely terrifying and had eyes and ears all over the Great Wei Kingdom. Even many high-ranking officials and nobles would be greatly threatened.","Although the Great Wei Kingdom was strong and powerful, its overall strength was far inferior to the Federation in terms of the number of experts. Moreover, it didn’t have a powerful central government. In the face of a terrifying assassin organization like The Green Garbs, although they had been encircling and annihilating it, the effect was very small. At most, they had only destroyed a few branches. They couldn’t find the location of The Green Garbs headquarters.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t expect that The Green Garbs would actually dare to kill someone in the middle of a busy city. If it was in the Federation, this would be a serious provocation to the dignity of the Federation. Basically, the Federation would hunt them down to the ends of the earth to exterminate them.","The Federation Government’s bottom line was to ensure that ordinary people could live and work in peace. Whoever stepped on it would die. On the other hand, they didn’t care much about the battles in the Outskirt Territories.","“The Snake Brothers!” An Xiuxiu immediately recalled who these three people were. Even in a huge organization like The Green Garbs, the Snake Brothers were very famous. Not only did they kill people, but they also often tortured their targets to death, causing great panic.","“Not bad!” The fat man, who was the eldest of the three brothers, sneered.","“The Green Garbs are lawless. Aren’t you afraid of being arrested by the Great Wei Kingdom? This is Conglong City, not a place where you can do as you please!” Situ Miaoyi shouted, which made Chu Yunfan look at her in a new light. Although Situ Miaoyi looked like a delicate young lady, she could still remain calm in the face of such a dangerous situation. It was indeed interesting.","“Hahaha, we’ll have to see if the Great Wei Kingdom can catch us.” the leader said, “Situ Miaoyi, this time, our target is you. I think you know the reason. Your father made someone lose tens of millions of lower spirit stones in one breath. Now, someone wants your head to let your father feel the heartache.”","“That’s right. We don’t have much time today, so we won’t do much. Tsk, tsk, what a pity. Two delicate little beauties!” the second brother laughed sinisterly as he said this. His eyes flashed with a hint of lust.","“You don’t have to shout. We’ve set up a barrier around the entire room. It’s useless even if you shout,” the third brother, the extremely thin young man, said.","Obviously, the three brothers felt that victory was already in their hands, and they did not care about Chu Yunfan, An Xiuxiu, and Situ Miaoyi.","The most powerful among them, An Xiuxiu, had only just entered the Divine Abilities Stage, Situ Miaoyi was only at the peak of the Innate Stage, and Chu Yunfan had no cultivation at all, so how could he be a threat?","At this time, Situ Miaoyi’s face flashed with a bit of regret. Although she didn’t know much, she knew that her father had recently provoked an incredible enemy, causing the other party to suffer heavy losses. She even came on this blind date with Chu Yunfan because the Situ family wanted to establish a relationship with Marquis Zhongxin’s household.","Although the Situ family was a wealthy merchant family and had a lot of power in the Great Wei Kingdom, it was still not enough to compare with the influential power of the Marquis Zhongxin’s household.","She knew all this, but she still didn’t care, because she thought that she was in Conglong City, the place where the great ancestor of the Great Wei Kingdom started his business. There were still many rich and powerful businessmen here. In terms of prosperity, it was one of the few places in the southern part of the Empire.","She had doubted that the Green Garbs would be so bold that she refused to bring the guards arranged by her father. Now, she had to pay the price for her willfulness.","“I’ll hold them back. You two leave quickly!” At that moment, An Xiuxiu stood in front of Situ Miaoyi.","“No, they’re coming for me. There’s a barrier outside, so I can’t run away, but you can,” Situ Miaoyi quickly said.","As the two of them argued, the leader laughed and said, “What nice sisterly love. Don’t worry, I’ll send you both on your way together.”","An Xiuxiu instantly launched an attack. Her entire body was covered in flames as she charged toward the leader.","“Petty trick. You little kids who grew up in a greenhouse dare to be impudent in front of me!”","The leader laughed hideously and threw a punch. It was only one punch, but it shattered the flames that were flying toward him. An Xiuxiu suffered the backlash of the punch and was forced to the corner.","The huge private room was only a small space in the battle between experts of this level.","As for the second and third brothers, they directly pounced on Situ Miaoyi. As for Chu Yunfan, he was completely ignored by the others. He was still quietly drinking tea as if he was not involved in any worldly affairs."]},{"number":1157,"title":"Chapter 1157 Do You Really Not Have Any Cultivation at All?","paragraphs":["1157 Do You Really Not Have Any Cultivation at All?","Although Situ Miaoyi tried her best to calm down, her peak Innate strength was too far away from Divine Abilities Stage tier three. Just the pressure released by the Snake Brothers made her unable to move.","The difference in strength between the two sides was too great. It was not something that could be made up for with willpower.","Suddenly, at this critical moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. With a slight movement of his hand, the tea in the teacup in his hand suddenly spilled out and turned into sharp arrows, shooting toward the Snake Brothers.","The brothers sensed the danger almost immediately, and they quickly took a step back.","The sharp arrows shot into the wall. The walls of the teahouse had been specially reinforced, not to mention the formation set up by the brothers. It could be said that they were as solid as a rock. Even if Divines fought in here, it would be difficult to break through them in a short time.","However, they saw that the entire wall had been blasted open by the sharp arrows, leaving behind a large hole.","The brothers’ hearts instantly trembled. If they had not reacted in time, the consequences would be unimaginable. They would most likely be shot through.","At this moment, they finally turned their eyes to the other person in the room—a person they had never paid the slightest attention to.","Suddenly, they felt their hair stand on end. This was because Chu Yunfan’s move showed that he was definitely not an ordinary person. Even in such a situation, he could still sit and drink tea as if these changes had nothing to do with him.","This in itself was already abnormal. What was even more abnormal was that there were so many abnormalities, but they turned a blind eye to him. This was the most abnormal part.","Being observant was a basic skill for assassins, and even though there were so many abnormalities, none of them noticed it as if someone had deliberately covered their eyes.","It was only now that they finally took a proper look at Chu Yunfan. Only then did they discover so many illogical and unscientific aspects. At this time, they suddenly felt like taking a deep breath.","“I’ll deal with this brat. Third Brother, quickly kill this b*tch!” the second brother said quickly. Even if they could delay, they could not delay for long. In fact, in Conglong City, where experts were as numerous as clouds, the danger increased with every minute they delayed.","He thought that victory was in his grasp, but he had not expected such an unforeseen event to happen.","“Okay!” The third brother responded and pounced on Situ Miaoyi as the second brother lunged at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was neither fast nor slow. He grabbed the teacup in his hand and threw it. In the blink of an eye, it was flying in the direction of the second brother.","The second brother was shocked. He condensed all his Dharma power and formed a thick protective energy shield around him. It was just an ordinary teacup, but it could penetrate his shield and hit his chest.","“Bam!”","With a muffled grunt, the second brother could not even unleash his dharmic power and was sent flying and crashing into the wall.","At this time, the third brother had already pounced toward Chu Yunfan. With a ferocious look on his face, his big hand grabbed at the void and pulled out a sharp sword. The sword light turned into an incomparably huge snake, which opened its bloody mouth and was about to swallow Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who had just thrown out a teacup, did not move too fast or too slowly. His palm moved like a hand knife and simply cut out.","When the huge snake with its mouth wide open came into contact with Chu Yunfan’s large hand, it was like butter coming into contact with a heated blade and was easily torn apart.","It turned into a sky full of spiritual light and disappeared.","Then, they saw Chu Yunfan’s palm touch the third brother’s sharp sword. That was a magic weapon that had been refined for many years and even had a faint poisonous light on it. But when it touched Chu Yunfan’s palm, it actually cracked inch by inch as if it was made of paper.","“Sh*! How is this happening?!”","The third brother knew that this was bad, but his eyes were still filled with disbelief. Chu Yunfan clearly did not have any divine power, and in fact, this attack had nothing to do with divine power.","However, this person, who had no divine power, was able to tear apart his attack with ease and break his magic weapon inch by inch.","However, it was too late for him to react. Chu Yunfan’s hand knife easily pierced through him as if he was a piece of paper. The terrifying force crushed his internal organs into pieces.","All of this happened too quickly. It took a long time to describe, but in reality, the third brother couldn’t even withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan.","At this time, the second brother had just barely managed to get up. He felt that the bones in his chest had been shattered by the teacup that Chu Yunfan had thrown out.","“Third Brother!”","Then, he saw his third brother being killed by Chu Yunfan’s hand blade. He was instantly furious. His vision blurred, and he saw Chu Yunfan’s figure rising like a dragon and falling like a phoenix.","Chu Yunfan pounced like a demonic ape, and he threw a punch from top to bottom.","“Bam!”","With a muffled groan, the second brother was gone. It turned out that Chu Yunfan’s fist had smashed into his chest, killing him instantly.","“Does he really not have any cultivation?” Situ Miaoyi was completely dumbfounded.","After Chu Yunfan finished off the second and third brothers, he headed in the direction of the first brother. At this time, An Xiuxiu was in a precarious situation under the first brother’s attacks. Although her cultivation was strong enough and had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage, she was not like Situ Miaoyi, who had almost no power to fight back.","However, the difference was limited. The first brother was too strong and forced her into a corner in just a few moves.","Just as the first brother was about to force An Xiuxiu to a dead end, he suddenly felt an evil wind coming from behind him. He turned around and saw a scene that almost scared him to death.","His two younger brothers had been killed by Chu Yunfan without him knowing, and they had died a miserable death.","Chu Yunfan, who he had never taken seriously before, actually flew over and grabbed the air with his big hand. The tea in the teapot seemed to feel some kind of attraction and shot out like a long arrow. All of it gathered in Chu Yunfan’s hand and turned into a long knife that was still emitting hot steam and the fragrance of tea.","Slash!","Blood spurted out.","The first brother did not have time to react.","The long saber slashed down, and the seemingly powerless saber cut off his arm."]},{"number":1158,"title":"Chapter 1158 Slaying the Leader of the Snake Brothers, This Expert Is a Bit Money-Hungry!","paragraphs":["1158 Slaying the Leader of the Snake Brothers, This Expert Is a Bit Money-Hungry!","Intense pain shot up to the first brother’s head, shocking him.","Congealing water into a knife was nothing more than a small trick for Divines like them. What was truly terrifying was that such a small trick could actually cut off his arm. There was nothing more exaggerated than this in the world.","Although the first brother looked like he was about to become a ball of fat, but the truth was that his fats had been specially refined, making his body as solid as a rock. He could casually crush gold and iron—not much more difficult than crushing tofu.","It was such a powerful body that had been cut open by a water blade, resulting in his arm being cut off.","‘This fellow is ruthless!’ His many years of experience in assassinations immediately made him realize that Chu Yunfan was really a ruthless person, and he was alarmed.","“You’re not dead yet. Interesting.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. He had aimed the knife at the first brother’s head, but the man had managed to dodge using his beast-like instinct.","“But it doesn’t matter. You’ll be dead very soon!”","After his first attack failed, Chu Yunfan’s expression didn’t change as he pounced forward again.","The first brother was about to dissolve into tears. He had never encountered such a situation. From what they had heard, this guy was just here for a blind date with Situ Miaoyi. Furthermore, the people had called him trash, and he believed it.","Not only the first brother, but An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi were also completely dumbfounded. What was going on?","Although she had changed her opinion of Chu Yunfan from his words before and felt that he was definitely not the good-for-nothing as the rumors said, in her heart, it was only in terms of knowledge that he wasn’t crippled. Even if Chu Yunfan couldn’t cultivate and didn’t have any divine power, this didn’t mean that he was a useless person. From the profound knowledge that he had displayed, he must have hidden it well.","However, Chu Yunfan’s ability to hide his strength was completely beyond her expectations. For her, the first brother could defeat or even kill her in ten moves at most, but he was so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","She even had the time to see the tragic state of the second and third brothers. They were killed in one move without any extra injuries.","If she hadn’t seen it with her own eyes, she wouldn’t have believed that someone could do this. Even among the small group of young talents in the Great Wei Kingdom, no one could do such a thing","If it wasn’t for today’s coincidence, she might never have learned how terrifying this ordinary-looking man who couldn’t cultivate was in her entire life.","Without any divine power, could he really be this strong just by cultivating his physical body?","That was simply inhuman. In her limited knowledge, there was no such thing.","Before her, Situ Miaoyi was already dumbfounded. She hadn’t recovered from the shock. A person who didn’t seem to have any martial arts could actually have such terrifying combat power.","On the other side, the battle between Chu Yunfan and the First Snake Brother had entered a critical stage. To put it simply, it was as if Chu Yunfan was toying with the first brother. He was walking leisurely and easily forced the first brother into a dead end with a few moves.","The first brother did not dare to take a single move head-on. His intuition told him that the result of that was death.","But at this time, he had already been forced into a corner by Chu Yunfan, and there was no way to retreat. Behind him was the wall of the private room. If it was any other time, he could burst through the wall and escape. But this time around, to avoid being noticed, he had strengthened the wall with a barrier.","The cage that was originally meant to trap Situ Miaoyi had now become a trap that cut off his last escape route.","“I’m going to kill you!”","Being forced into a desperate situation, the first brother’s viciousness erupted.","“Rrrrraaagh!”","The first brother seemed to have turned into an ancient snake, roaring and charging at Chu Yunfan, wanting to fight him to the death.","The primordial snake’s ferocity shook the entire private room, but Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry and simply slashed down with his blade.","Slice!","The ancient snake was directly cut in half by the water blade, and blood spurted out. After the martial arts concept dissipated, only the first brother’s fat body was left.","Chu Yunfan had chopped off his head.","Before he died, he still couldn’t believe that his desperate counterattack was so useless in front of Chu Yunfan. With just a casual slash, it had been completely destroyed.","After killing the first brother, the water blade in Chu Yunfan’s hand turned back into tea with a bang, spilling all over the ground.","After the battle ended, An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi finally came back to their senses. They looked at Chu Yunfan in a daze. After a long time, they finally felt like they had just survived a disaster.","It was simply unbelievable. They had thought that this was a dead end, but in the end, they survived.","“How...” Situ Miaoyi’s beautiful eyes looked at Chu Yunfan. For a moment, she didn’t know what to say.","“You’ve seen these three men from the Green Garbs. It seems that you’ll have to bring bodyguards with you in the future,” Chu Yunfan shrugged and said with a smile.","His calm and composed manner made it seem as if he was not the one who had just fought a great battle.","He had heard what the Snake Brothers’ leader said earlier and immediately understood the situation. It was likely that Situ Miaoyi’s father’s business opponent had hired someone to kill her. This kind of thing was inevitable even in the Federation, which had strict rules, let alone in the Great Wei Kingdom.","Tens of millions of lower spirit stones were enough to drive people crazy.","“No matter what, thank you!” An Xiuxiu was the first to react and thanked him.","“There’s no need to thank me. They wanted to kill me too. I was just protecting myself.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “If you really want to thank me, then help me with two things. First, it’s best if you don’t tell anyone about today’s incident. I’m afraid it’ll be troublesome. Second, since these three are famous assassins from the Green Garbs, they should bring in a lot of rewards. I’ll have to trouble you to send the rewards to me when the time comes. I’ll be very grateful.”","Chu Yunfan’s last words almost destroyed his image as an unfathomable master in the two woman’s hearts. Shouldn’t that kind of master be above the common populace and treat money like dirt?","Why did he look so money-hungry now?","“Also, today’s blind date will end here. There shouldn’t be a next time. You can rest assured. If there’s nothing else, I’ll take my leave first.”","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he turned around, opened the door, and left, leaving the two dumbfounded people in the private room."]},{"number":1159,"title":"Chapter 1159 Chu Yunfan? This Guy Is Not Simple!","paragraphs":["1159 Chu Yunfan? This Guy Is Not Simple!","The two of them looked at each other. In their hearts, the image of this master had almost collapsed.","But at the same time, they were also curious about Chu Yunfan. Not only was he not the trash that they had thought he was, but he also had unfathomable strength.","He was a terrifying assassin who could easily kill a tier-three or even a tier-four Divine.","“How terrifying! In just a few breaths, the Snake Brothers are all dead!” After a long time, Situ Miaoyi exclaimed.","!!","“He’s strong... Very strong!” An Xiuxiu said, “The strangest thing is that he didn’t use any Dharma power from the beginning to the end. He only relied on the strength of his physical body to achieve this. It’s simply incredible.”","“Don’t tell me he’s really a complete body cultivator!” said Situ Miaoyi after she had calmed down.","Although Chu Yunfan saw her as a pampered girl, she was not a flower in a greenhouse that had not experienced anything. It was because her father was a well-known wealthy businessman in the Great Wei Kingdom. He was once ranked among the top twenty richest in Great Wei. Although it was only on the surface, and he was not in the top few, he was already a peak figure in the business world of the entire kingdom.","The business world was like a battlefield, and competitors could do anything. She had been kidnapped and assassinated more than once since she was young.","She was indifferent to the bloody scene, but she was a little curious about Chu Yunfan.","What kind of person was he? Why did everyone say that he was a piece of trash? Since he had such powerful strength, why didn’t he show it?","Originally, she thought that Chu Yunfan was someone who could see through everything with one look, but now she realized that there was so much mystery surrounding him.","“Impossible. I’ve never heard of a body cultivator reaching this level. Besides, even body cultivators can’t not cultivate true energy and divine power. Body cultivators also need to use all kinds of energy to strengthen their bodies. Isn’t it a joke to not have any divine power?” An Xiuxiu immediately denied it.","Chu Yunfan’s situation was very strange. It was completely different from what she had learned. If someone had told her before that a person could kill three Divines without using divine power, she would have scoffed at it. It was impossible.","But Chu Yunfan did it, so he must have his own ways.","Thinking of this, An Xiuxiu couldn’t help but touch her back where Chu Yunfan said it would hurt at midnight. She had an idea.","“I didn’t think he was a good match for you. After all, he’s just the one that the old lady likes. I thought it was impossible for him to become the next marquis in the future. But now it seems that it’s not impossible,” An Xiuxiu praised, “Such a person is very thoughtful. He’s amazing when he does something.”","“Why are you saying all this? We’re not even in the right place yet,” Situ Miaoyi said as her pretty face blushed.","“But what do you think of him? Can he compare to your older brother?”","When she heard Situ Miaoyi mention her brother, An Xiuxiu’s brows furrowed slightly. She then said, “It’s hard to say. I’ve never seen my brother use his full strength. But even if he did, he would at most be similar to this. My brother’s cultivation level is too high. I can’t guess it.”","“Even you said so. It seems that this guy is really not simple.” Situ Miaoyi said.","“But he’s too money-hungry.”","An Xiuxiu thought about it and laughed. “He’s indeed quite unscrupulous, but that’s normal. The four main elements of cultivation are wealth, companionship, law, and land. Forget it, I’ll call someone in to deal with it. Hmph, they claim it’s absolutely safe here, but in the end, these fellows managed to get in. I’ll see how the boss explains it.”","At this time, Chu Yunfan, who was regarded as a profiteering master by the two, swaggered out of Pinyi Pavilion. Of course, he had to leave first, because he was completely penniless at the moment. In other words, he was the standard poor man.","Because he had lost his divine power, he couldn’t open the Mountain River Diagram. Otherwise, he wouldn’t covet the bounty of those wanted criminals.","After all, he was the richest man in the Federation. But now, he had to bow his head.","After all, in the end, cultivation was all about putting in the effort to cultivate. You’ll be paralyzed if you don’t have the money to cultivate.","If he wanted to speed up his recovery, he had to accumulate wealth and then make pills to recover from his injuries.","This was the first time he had fought with a master from the Spirit Realm in more than a year. He quickly noticed the difference. The rules of heaven and earth in the Spirit Realm were obviously stronger and more solid than those in the Kunlun Realm.","Therefore, the scale and momentum of the Divines were much smaller than in the Kunlun Realm. It was impossible for one Divine to turn the world upside down.","However, it was a good thing for him. He had lost all his divine power. Under such circumstances, the strength of his physical body could be greatly enhanced.","Walking on the streets of Conglong City, one could see a bustling crowd and skyscrapers everywhere. The degree of prosperity was not inferior to the cities of the Federation. However, the style of the entire city was very different from the cities of the Federation.","All kinds of tall buildings were arranged in rows, and all of them were antique. Because of the extremely developed martial arts, it was a place full of exotic customs for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s footsteps were extremely fast. He weaved through the crowd as if he was walking on flat ground. The pedestrians would unconsciously make way for him, allowing him to easily return to the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","As one of the most influential people in Conglong City, the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence occupied a vast area. It was splendid and magnificent. The two stone lions in front of the door were like gods guarding the house. They occupied the Feng Shui area, and all dark and evil creatures did not dare to approach.","Chu Yunfan had just entered when a voice suddenly came from behind him.","“Chu Yunfan!”","He turned around and saw a young man in his twenties. He was wearing a Chinese robe and was walking toward him.","When Chu Yunfan saw him, he frowned and said, “What’s the matter, Chu Yanghui?”","This young man was also one of the ten or so disciples of the Chu clan’s side branch.","“Have you thought about the matter I asked you to consider last time?” Chu Yang Hui asked.","“What is it?” Chu Yunfan said as he frowned.","“It’s about you joining Young Master Jie’s side,” Chu Yang Hui said.","Chu Yunfan suddenly remembered this matter. This matter was also related to Marquis Zhongxin choosing the future prince from the Chu clan’s side branches."]},{"number":1160,"title":"Chapter 1160 Face Smacking on the Spot, Crippled With One Kick","paragraphs":["1160 Face Smacking on the Spot, Crippled With One Kick","Because Marquis Zhongxin had no descendants, they had no choice but to choose a group of more than a dozen people from the Chu clan’s side branches as candidates for the crown prince. After more than a year, except for people like Chu Yunfan, who did not care at all and never participated in the selection, there was no one else.","In more than a year, more than a dozen people had been fighting openly and secretly. After all kinds of competitions, the advantages and disadvantages were quickly determined. Among them, two people stood out and became the best among the dozen. These two were the best among the Chu clan’s younger generation. They had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage and were stronger than the others.","One of them was the Chu Xiujie that Chu Yanghui had mentioned, and the other was Chu Haoyu.","After a year of open and secret fighting and various clashes, the supporters of the candidates for the position of crown prince slowly divided into two factions under the command of Chu Xiujie and Chu Haoyu.","Marquis Zhongxin seemed to have a positive attitude toward this. Just like raising venomous insects, he chose the most outstanding person among them. Only the most outstanding was qualified to become Marquis Zhongxin’s son, and in the future, that person would become the next Marquis Zhongxin.","And among the two, Chu Xiujie had the closest relation to Marquis Zhongxin. He was Marquis Zhongxin’s nephew, while Chu Haoyu’s relationship was much further. But in comparison, Chu Haoyu was more outstanding.","All in all, it was difficult to distinguish who was better. Each side had a large number of supporters. The two sides fought openly and secretly, becoming more and more heated every day. This was no longer a secret in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","And now, the only person who remained neutral was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Everyone in the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence knew that Chu Yunfan was very doted on because he looked like the grand madam’s youngest son. However, he didn’t have any cultivation, so no one would see him as a threat.","Although he was a popular candidate, everyone knew that as long as Marquis Zhongxin was not stupid, he would not choose someone who could not cultivate.","However, Chu Yunfan had a great influence on the old lady, so two factions wanted to rope him to their side, but he had always rejected them. Until now, the dozen people were all either one or the other, and there was no room for neutrality.","Although more than a dozen people could theoretically become Marquis Zhongxin’s son, each person’s talent was completely different. There was only one position, and in the end, only one person could be promoted.","Many people thought that it was impossible, so they instead chose to rely on those who had a chance. It was similar to a battle for a throne.","“I’ve said it before. I’m not interested in being the crown prince, so don’t come looking for me,” Chu Yunfan stated matter-of-factly. Before he had recovered his strength, he didn’t want to get involved in this kind of thing, let alone now. Although he had only recovered a part of his strength, he was still not someone these people could compare to.","Chu Yanghui’s face immediately fell. He knew that Chu Yunfan had no ambition. In fact, everyone in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence knew that Chu Yunfan didn’t even bother showing up in front of the marquis.","In many people’s eyes, this was a display of self-awareness. After all, a person who could not cultivate was a half-disabled person. Such a person could live as an ordinary person, but it was impossible for him to become the next marquis.","Those who became the marquis’ son would face great pressure, let alone someone from a branch family.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t want to get involved, his strong influence on the old lady was something that many people coveted.","“Chu Yunfan, you’d better think this through. After Young Master Jie becomes the crown prince, do you think you can do whatever you want just because of the Grand Madam’s favor?” Chu Yanghui threatened, “Young Master Jie is the one closest to Marquis Zhongxin. It’s only natural that he will become the crown prince.”","Naturally, Chu Yunfan could discern Chu Yanghui’s threat. He sneered and said, “Even if it’s natural for him to become the prince, what would that have to do with us?”","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately stunned Chu Yanghui. Chu Yunfan’s words had given him a different perspective on the matter. This relationship was the greatest support that Chu Xiujie’s faction had. But if this relationship was really so useful, why would there be candidates like them?","“I’ll warn you one more time. Don’t bother me. Otherwise, you won’t be able to bear the consequences,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, then headed for his side courtyard.","Chu Yanghui’s face burned with anger. More and more people gathered around to watch. He was also a young master of the residence, and his status was high and mighty. But now, Chu Yunfan slapped him in the face with his words. Many servants had seen this, and Chu Yunghui was immediately enraged.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re courting death!”","At the same time, Chu Yanghui took a step forward and threw out a punch. The air around him collapsed violently as his fist smashed toward Chu Yunfan’s back.","Chu Yanghui’s heart was filled with anger, and he was ready to kill.","“This isn’t going to turn out well!” The servants at the side suddenly exclaimed.","Compared to the arrogant and domineering Chu Yanghui, they liked Chu Yunfan more. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t often come out and walk around, and wasn’t as dazzling, he was kind to others. Even to servants like them, he wasn’t arrogant.","They could all tell that this was not an act. It was the truth. No matter what the reason was, they always had a good impression of him.","A few servants with cultivation immediately stepped forward, trying to stop Chu Yanghui. However, a scene that surprised them happened. Chu Yanghui’s punch hit Chu Yunfan’s body, but it didn’t hit him. Instead, it passed right through.","It was as if he had only hit an afterimage. Then, Chu Yunfan turned around at lightning speed, twisted his body, and swept out his long leg like a lightning bolt tearing through the night sky.","Bam!","As expected, Chu Yanghui let out a muffled groan and he was swept away.","At this time, everyone finally came back to their senses. The group of people hurriedly helped Chu Yanghui up from the ground. However, they discovered that his ribs were all broken. However, his internal organs were not injured. The destructive power was very calculated.","Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan had held back. While they were relieved that no one was killed, they were also in disbelief.","Young Master Fan held back?","Could it be that he wasn’t a good-for-nothing who can’t cultivate as the rumors say?","What kind of joke is this? If Young Master Fan was considered trash, then what about Young Master Hui","Young Master Hui’s cultivation was almost at the ninth Innate stage. Although he wasn’t outstanding among the candidates, he was still considered to be one of the top few. But now, Young Master Fan’s kick had seriously injured him.","It seemed that everyone had underestimated this Young Master Fan who had kept a low profile ever since he entered the residence.","At this time, when they looked at Chu Yunfan again. It was like looking at a ferocious beast hidden in the fog."]},{"number":1161,"title":"Chapter 1161 One Wave Has Not Yet Settled, but Another Wave Rises","paragraphs":["1161 One Wave Has Not Yet Settled, but Another Wave Rises","Chu Yunfan’s move immediately stunned the servants. Some of the more quick-witted ones immediately realized that Chu Yunfan had probably been hiding his strength over the past year. He was not as weak as many people thought he was.","He was also not a good-for-nothing. He was able to cripple Chu Yanghui with a single kick. No one would believe that this kind of strength was not at the peak of the Innate Stage.","He had such strength, but he had been lying dormant all this time. He was like a ferocious beast in the fog. Now, this ferocious beast was finally going to reveal its claws and fangs.","Chu Yunfan returned to his own side courtyard, and the news of him crippling Chu Yanghui with a single kick quickly spread throughout Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","However, since it involved two crown prince candidates, they couldn’t make their own decision. And now, the two people who could make the decision in the residence were not around. Marquis Zhongxin had accompanied the grand madam back to her hometown to visit relatives.","The impact of this matter continued to brew. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about these things. To him, recovering his strength was the most important thing. To him, those criticisms were just like clowns jumping around, and he didn’t care about them in the slightest.","In a remote side courtyard of the residence, Chu Yunfan was sitting cross-legged on a futon. His body was constantly emitting a faint white smoke, which slowly disappeared into the sky.","The meridians in his body were severely damaged, and it was difficult for him to mobilize even a little bit of divine power. However, through continuous efforts, he was finally able to mobilize a small amount.","Suddenly, the sound of footsteps could be heard. Immediately after, a seventeen or eighteen-year-old man appeared at the entrance of the courtyard. His face had a somewhat tender look.","“Brother Fan, are you there?”","Hearing this, Chu Yunfan smiled and said, “”Come in!”","The boy pushed the door open and walked in. When he saw Chu Yunfan, he said, “Brother Fan, you’ve finally made your move. You’ve ruthlessly taught that b*stard, Chu Yanghui, a lesson. I’ve heard that he actually dared to attack you. He really deserves to die!”","“It’s just a small punishment.” Chu Yunfan glanced at the young man and then said, “Hongcai, did you get into a fight?”","He saw that the young man’s clothes were all dirty, and his hair bun was loose. He looked very disheveled.","“It’s all because of that b*stard. Chu Xiujie and his gang were planning to teach you a lesson, Brother Fan. They wanted to deduct your monthly allowance. I got so angry that I argued with them!” the young man, Chu Hongcai, said angrily, “But I can’t stay with Chu Xiujie anymore. Brother Fan, since you’ve made an exception, why don’t I follow you instead? Chu Xiujie and Chu Haoyu are no match for you anyway.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry as he looked at Chu Hongcai. Of course, he could tell that Chu Hongcai was speaking the truth.","In fact, Chu Hongcai was also one of the dozen crown prince candidates. However, he was the youngest among them—only a teenager—so his strength was also the weakest. When he first entered the residence, he was bullied because of his young age, and after being secretly saved by Chu Yunfan once, he had since listened to Chu Yunfan’s orders.","However, Chu Yunfan himself had no intention of fighting for the title of Prince Zhongxin, so Chu Hongcai had no choice but to stand in Chu Xiujie’s camp.","And today, because of Chu Yanghui’s sneak attack on Chu Yunfan, he had completely fallen out with Chu Xiujie’s camp.","“You’re too impulsive,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile but he was touched. Chu Hongcai was a young man with a hot-blooded heart. He often did things according to his heart. Such a person was quite rare now.","“All right, I’ll stop talking now,” Chu Hongcai said, “I’ve challenged Chu Yongyan to a duel. I’m going to beat him to death. I always thought that he was just a pretty boy because of his fair and clean appearance. I didn’t expect him to be so sinister. He was the one who suggested that I deal with you, Brother Fan!","Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. A fair and clean face that made one look like a pretty boy would usually equate that one wasn’t a good person. What kind of logic was this?","With that, Chu Hongcai ran out in a hurry.","Chu Yunfan frowned and immediately stood up. He couldn’t ignore this matter.","Marquis Zhongxin’s heritage was passed down through martial arts. Within the residence, there was an arena area for the disciples of the Chu family to settle their grudges and spar.","At this moment, the entire arena was filled with people. Chu Yongyan and Chu Hongcai, two crown prince candidates, were about to battle each other in the arena.","This attracted many people in the residence to come and watch. After the incident of Chu Yunfan crippling Chu Yanghui with a single kick in the morning, there was now a battle between two candidates in the afternoon.","Recently, as the date of Marquis Zhongxin’s selection for the crown prince approached, this kind of open and secret struggle became more and more obvious.","But this time, the two of them were a bit strange. Originally, they were both from Chu Xiujie’s camp, but now they were fighting because of Chu Yunfan.","By the time Chu Yunfan arrived, it was already a hubbub of voices. Outside the ring, Chu Hongcai was facing off against a group of people with an angry expression.","He was surrounded by all kinds of people who had come to watch the show.","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a young man who looked to be around 25 or 26 years old. He was dressed in a magnificent robe, had fair skin, and a handsome face, but there was a hint of maliciousness between his brows.","It was the pretty boy Chu Hongcai had mentioned, Chu Yongyan.","Behind Chu Yongyan, a group of young men in similar Chinese robes were surrounding a young man who had an imposing appearance. The young man’s face had a calm expression that turned vicious after he spotted Chu Yunfan.","It was one of the two most popular candidates in the Chu family, Chu Xiujie.","Chu Yunfan’s arrival quickly attracted everyone’s attention. The aftermath of Chu Yunfan crippling Chu Yanghui with a single kick in the morning had yet to dissipate, and now Chu Yongyan and Chu Hongcai were going to fight because of him.","Chu Xiujie glanced at Chu Yunfan, his eyes flashing with a hint of ruthlessness. Today, he had lost a lot of face. Chu Yanghui was crippled by Chu Yunfan, which was already very embarrassing, and now his subordinate Chu Hongcai had switched sides because of Chu Yunfan.","He could already imagine how Chu Haoyu’s side would mock him for not being able to control his men.","And all of this was because of Chu Yunfan!","This was a person he had never once cared about!","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at Chu Xiujie. He merely glanced at Chu Yongyan, who was confronting Chu Hongcai, and immediately understood that Chu Hongcai had been tricked."]},{"number":1162,"title":"Chapter 1162 Teaching a Move Before the Battle, One Move to Defeat the Enemy","paragraphs":["1162 Teaching a Move Before the Battle, One Move to Defeat the Enemy","Chu Hongcai was only at the sixth Innate Stage. At his age, he was naturally considered outstanding, but among these candidates, he was at the bottom.","Chu Yongyan was slightly older than Chu Hongcai, but from the information received, he should be around the same strength level as Chu Yongyan.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, they were nothing, but in the outside world, they were considered outstanding figures. Although they were nothing compared to An Xiuxiu, they were pretty good.","In the Federation, they would be one of the top few people with a limitless future.","!!","But now, with a quick glance, Chu Yongyan discovered that Chu Yongyan’s strength wasn’t at the sixth Innate Stage as rumored. On the contrary, he had already stepped into the eighth Innate Stage. Although he had just stepped into the eighth stage, his strength was far above Chu Hongcai’s.","Chu Hongcai didn’t understand the situation and challenged Chu Yongyan, which meant that he had been tricked.","Chu Yongyan looked at Chu Hongcai with a hint of smugness in his sinister eyes.","Chu Yunfan’s arrival attracted everyone’s attention not long after.","“Brother Fan, why are you here?” Chu Hongcai was a little surprised that Chu Yunfan had followed them.","“If I didn’t come,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile, “You wouldn’t even know that you’ve been tricked.”","“I was tricked?” Chu Hongcai asked, confused.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re just in time!”","Chu Xiujie’s face was gloomy and he didn’t say anything, but Chu Yongyan stepped forward and said, “I heard that you’re very powerful now. You have no respect for us, huh? I’ll let you know the immensity of the heavens and earth!”","Chu Xiujie’s people glared at Chu Yunfan. Although the one who had been crippled by Chu Yanghui was not them, they were all on the same side. Chu Yunfan’s performance showed that he did not respect them.","“I don’t even need to personally deal with you. Hongcai is more than enough to deal with you,” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer.","“Very well. Just Chu Hongcai?” Chu Yongyan seemed to have been angered by Chu Yunfan’s words.","He knew very well that Chu Hongcai was only at the sixth Innate Stage. Although Chu Hongcai was not bad, he was definitely not his match.","Chu Yunfan claimed that Chu Hongcai was enough to deal with him. Chu Yunfan must have been affected by those rumors. How ridiculous. He was going to give Chu Yunfan a hard slap in the face later and let him know how wrong he was.","“So what if it’s just me? Isn’t it enough to deal with you?” Chu Hongcai said without any hesitation.","“Since you are so sure that you’ll win, you won’t mind me teaching Chu Hongcai a move before you two step into the ring, right?” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","“Hahahaha, who do you think you are?” Chu Yongyan laughed out loud.","He felt that Chu Yunfan was a laughable clown. Only he knew the difference in strength between him and Chu Hongcai. It was the biggest joke in the world that Chu Hongcai could defeat him.","“All right, I’ll let you teach him a trick first. Let’s see what you can do!” Chu Yongyan said, “It’s just one move. What was the use of teaching him one move?”","Chu Yongyan walked back to Chu Xiujie’s side, and Chu Xiujie only said one sentence, “Teach him a lesson and make him regret it!”","“Don’t worry, I’ll definitely give this kid a good stretch!” Chu Yongyan laughed hideously.","“Brother Fan, what are you going to teach me?” Chu Hongcai asked.","“You’re a spear user, right?” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Hongcai nodded. Behind him was a long spear that had been disassembled into several parts. This was a habit of a warrior. It was not convenient to carry such a long weapon on oneself. Usually, it would be disassembled into a few pieces. They could then carry it on their back like a sword.","“Give me the spear.” Chu Yunfan extended his hand, and Chu Hongcai quickly assembled the spear on his back and handed it to Chu Yunfan.","The others looked at Chu Yunfan with curiosity, not knowing how he was going to teach Chu Hongcai any moves at the last minute. In fact, their impression of Chu Yunfan had not completely changed. To be more precise, in their minds, Chu Yunfan was that useless person with no cultivation. No one knew how terrifying his strength was.","“Watch carefully. I’ll only teach you once,” Chu Yunfan said. In his mind, there was a set of spear techniques from the Mighty Emperor Battle Book that had been imprinted into his practice. This set of techniques was called the Heaven Splitter. When the entire set of spear techniques was used, its power was boundless, and it could even split the sky.","Of course, he wasn’t going to teach everything to Chu Hongcai. He was only teaching him one move at the last minute. Although it was only one move, its power was beyond imagination.","This set of spear techniques came from the Heaven-Splitting Spear Emperor during the era when the emperors stood side by side. With this set of spear techniques, the Heaven-Splitting Spear Emperor had swept through the heavens and countless experts had died by his spear.","Forget the entire set of spear techniques. Even if one only knew one move, it was enough for an ordinary person to practice for a lifetime.","Of course, Chu Yunfan knew about this spear technique. He even knew that the many profound meanings of this spear technique were all recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. However, he had never learned it before.","In other words, he was a half-baked instructor who he himself was learning on the spot. However, outsiders had no idea that Chu Yunfan was simply learning and applying what he had learned on the spot.","Chu Yunfan closed his eyes, and the profound meaning of the Heaven Splitter emerged in his mind. The words flew out rapidly, and the godhead in his mind began to emit dazzling light.","In an instant, it illuminated the space in his mind. The countless words transformed into a human figure. It was an unparalleled human figure with a long spear in his hand. Even the sky was about to be shattered by the spear.","After practicing the entire set of spear techniques, Chu Yunfan’s speed gradually increased from slow to fast. In just a few moments, Chu Yunfan had already completely mastered the Heaven Splitter with the help of the godhead.","Although the power of the technique might not be comparable to the Heaven-Splitting Spear Emperor, it was only because of the difference in cultivation.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan kept his eyes closed, many people began to make a fuss, especially Chu Xiujie and the others, who looked at Chu Yunfan as if they were watching a monkey show.","“Act. I’ll let you continue acting. How much longer can you keep it up?”","The only person present who believed in Chu Yunfan was Chu Hongcai because he had seen Chu Yunfan fight before. Although Chu Yunfan’s strength at that time was far from what it was now, it was still not something that ordinary Innates could compare to.","He really believed that Chu Yunfan was going to teach him a way to win.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes, and a sharp light flashed through his eyes. “Look closely, this move is called Cloud Split!”"]},{"number":1163,"title":"Chapter 1163 Great Enlightenment Method, One Spear Technique","paragraphs":["1163 Great Enlightenment Method, One Spear Technique","Chu Yunfan walked to an open space with the spear in hand. Everyone’s eyes were on him, waiting to see if he was going to teach them an exquisite move to use as a trump card.","Then, they saw the spear in Chu Yunfan’s hand suddenly thrust out. The momentum was not small, and the spear pierced through the air, making a “swoosh” sound.","However, just as everyone was waiting to see the next combo, they saw Chu Yunfan put away his spear.","“Just that one move?”","!!","“This must be a joke. It’s clearly just an ordinary stab. Even I could do it after learning it!”","“Hahahaha, Chu Hongcai is going to be tricked to death by Chu Yunfan!”","“Hahahaha, is this what Chu Yunfan meant by ‘let go?’ Are you kidding me?”","When Chu Xiujie and the others saw Chu Yunfan’s teaching, they started laughing at him. That spear seemed to be very powerful, but that was all. Even a novice who had only learned the spear for a month could probably stab with such power.","It did look good, but what was the use?","Could it be used to defeat the enemy in one move?","It was simply ridiculous. Spear techniques still required a series of moves. Unless there was a huge difference in strength, no one would be defeated by such a ridiculous spear technique.","This was simply a joke!","Chu Yongyan laughed so hard that he couldn’t even straighten his back. He even suspected that this was Chu Yunfan’s trump card—using jokes to make him laugh until he lost all his energy so that Chu Hongcai could win.","This sounded much more reliable than Chu Hongcai’s victory with that funny shot.","Opposite Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai’s eyes were a little dazed. After a while, his eyes became clear again. He had already understood the trick Chu Yunfan had taught him.","Although it looked like Chu Yunfan had simply thrust out the spear, the truth was, at that moment, Chu Yunfan had used his own powerful mental energy to instill the understanding of this move into Chu Hongcai’s mind using an Enlightenment Method.","This was a very impressive ability—a great method of empowerment.","Chu Hongcai was very excited. He was not a narrow-minded person. The method of enlightenment only existed in legends. A plot in popular fantasy novels.","In fact, Enlightenment Methods had extremely high requirements for the person who performed them. It could even be said that it was not something that ordinary people could do.","If anyone could do it, then everyone wouldn’t need to cultivate. They would just wait for the experts to enlighten them one by one.","Moreover, this kind of Enlightenment Method was also very harmful to the human body.","Even experts would rarely use this kind of Enlightenment Method, because it was very harmful to their bodies.","That move had completely exploded in Chu Yunfan’s mind. Chu Hongcai could, of course, understand that once this move was really cultivated, its power would be boundless.","Chu Hongcai was extremely touched. Not only had Brother Fan saved him last time, but he had also used a method that was extremely harmful to him now.","He clenched the spear that Chu Yunfan had handed over to him. He had to win, or he would be letting Chu Yunfan down.","However, he didn’t know that for Chu Yunfan, this kind of Enlightenment Method wouldn’t harm his body. For ordinary people, it would harm their bodies because there was no correct method.","However, Chu Yunfan discovered that there was more than one method of enlightenment in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. There were all kinds of methods from different sects and clans, and they were all different and exquisite.","It consumed a lot of his mental energy, but it was much easier to use it with the godhead. The technique could be instilled into Chu Hongcai’s mind in one go.","Chu Yunfan was also secretly amazed. If he was in his normal state, it wouldn’t be so easy to use this Enlightenment Method. But with the cooperation of the godhead, everything was much simpler.","In fact, it didn’t consume much of his energy.","“That’s enough. You can go ahead now.” Chu Yunfan said as he laughed, ignoring Chu Xiujie’s group’s ridicule.","“Okay!” Chu Hongcai nodded, then turned to Chu Yongyan and said, “Chu Yongyan, come on. I’ll help you loosen your muscles and bones!”","“You?” Chu Yongyan said as he straightened his back.","The two of them were as light as a swallow, they flew directly into the ring and faced each other from a distance. The qi from their bodies was released. Both of them were Innates, and their Qi was also very amazing.","In the Spirit Realm, although there were many Innate experts, not everyone was an Innate expert. Ordinary people were only at the Acquired Stage. Innates were outstanding even among ordinary people.","Not to mention such young Innates.","Many servants in Marquis Zhongxin’s household were watching the fight between the two young masters with excitement.","“Chu Yongyan!” Chu Hongcai’s spear shot out in an instant, rushing toward Chu Yongyan’s direction.","Chu Yongyan, on the other hand, laughed coldly and drew two sabers from his back. Then, he began to fight with Chu Hongcai.","Boom, boom, boom!","The two Innates exchanged blows. Each collision was like a missile exploding in the air. It was extremely terrifying.","However, it didn’t take long for everyone to realize that Chu Hongcai wasn’t Chu Yongyan’s match. The rumors outside said that Chu Hongcai and Chu Yongyan were on par with each other regarding strength. Chu Yongyan’s strength was clearly more than a level higher than Chu Hongcai’s.","Almost as soon as the battle began, Chu Hongcai was already at a disadvantage. His spear was completely suppressed, and Chu Yongyan’s dual saber dominated.","The spear was the main attack, but its moves were also bold and unrestrained. It was slightly weaker in terms of defense. Replacing defense with attack was the essence of spear techniques. After Chu Hongcai was suppressed, he could only use half of his moves before he was countered.","This was the most terrifying part. He felt completely aggrieved that his strength was inferior to Chu Yongyan’s.","Only now did Chu Hongcai realize that what Chu Yunfan had said before made sense. He thought that Brother Fan was just trying to help him. Now, he realized that Brother Fan must have discovered something.","“Go to hell!” Chu Yongyan laughed as he slashed down with both of his sabers. “What a bullsh*t move. It’s a joke. You’re still going to get beaten up by me!”","The more Chu Yongyan fought, the more carefree he became. He had planned to find trouble with Chu Yunfan after he defeated Chu Hongcai. He had to teach him the consequences of offending Young Master Jie.","At this moment, Chu Hongcai, who had been forced into a corner, suddenly shouted, his eyes filled with determination.","“Cloud Split!”"]},{"number":1164,"title":"Chapter 1164 Defeated in a Single Strike, the Might of the Cloud Split","paragraphs":["1164 Defeated in a Single Strike, the Might of the Cloud Split","Chu Hongcai, who had been forced into a corner, finally recalled the spear technique Chu Yunfan had taught him—the Cloud Split.","He had no other choice. In his original plan, this was just a trump card and he might not use it. However, he had no other choice now.","Following Chu Hongcai’s shout, the spear in his hand suddenly stabbed out. The attack was extremely terrifying, and the terrifying move that Chu Yunfan had imprinted in his mind immediately boiled, and the spear intent spread in all directions.","In that instant, everyone present seemed to see that after this move was launched, the entire sky became cloudless. It was only a spear attack, but it was actually able to disperse the clouds for miles around.","!!","Of course, this was just an illusion conjured by the spear intent and was not real. Even so, the power of this attack was shocking enough.","Almost in an instant, the spear intent had already crushed Chu Yongyan’s dual saber intent. It was only a single attack, but it was already heading straight for Chu Yongyan.","Bam!","The spear pierced Chu Yongyan’s chest. He groaned and was sent flying. His clothes were completely torn, revealing his inner armor. However, his inner armor had also been destroyed by the spear.","In an instant, the inner armor cracked open, and Chu Yongyan was sent flying out of the ring.","There was a deathly silence. Everyone looked at Chu Hongcai, who was panting heavily as if he had used all his strength. They were all completely dumbfounded.","‘How?!’","This word appeared in everyone’s mind. They were completely dumbfounded. If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they would never have believed such a ridiculous thing.","Some of the experts present could see that Chu Yongyan had already entered the eighth Innate Stage, while Chu Hongcai was at most at the sixth stage. The difference in strength between the two sides was clear.","As long as Chu Yongyan was careful, it was only a matter of time before he won.","Chu Yongyan didn’t let his guard down and forced Chu Hongcai into a corner.","However, the key was Chu Hongcai’s fatal spear attack. The terrifying power of the attack was clear for everyone to see. Just looking at Chu Yongyan’s inner armor that was directly blown apart, one could understand.","This kind of inner armor was extremely strong. Unless it was attacked by a Divine, it would be very difficult to break this kind of inner armor.","Since these people were not the true sons of Marquis Zhongxin, even if they were rich and powerful in the branch families, it was not easy to get such an inner armor.","However, the inner armor couldn’t even block a single spear strike from Chu Hongcai. Many people felt their scalps go numb. If it wasn’t for the inner armor blocking most of the power at the critical moment, Chu Yongyan would’ve been pierced through.","They finally understood why Chu Yunfan said he would teach Chu Hongcai one move before the battle. It was only one move, and Chu Yunfan was confident that Chu Hongcai would win against Chu Yongyan.","Just this move, except for Chu Xiujie, who dared to say that they could resist it? If the whole set was used, how powerful would it be?","However, with Chu Hongcai’s strength, he probably couldn’t display a complete set of spear techniques. That wasn’t realistic, but it was enough. With only one move, he was able to defeat an expert two levels higher than him. If this kind of martial art wasn’t a lost art, what kind was it?","But many people couldn’t understand how Chu Yunfan’s simple stab contained such terrifying power. They had this bit of insight. If a casual stab could have such power, they could all be hung. There must be some other profound mystery, but they could not see the profound mystery.","It was impossible for any spear technique to be just a simple spear technique. If one only knew spear techniques and did not know how to circulate one’s qi or the profoundness of spear intent, then it would all be useless.","But how did Chu Yunfan teach Chu Hongcai so quickly?","It was probably impossible to rely on that one moment alone.","They thought for a moment that it might be the Enlightenment Method, but it was immediately swept out of their minds. That method required the person to be a top master, at least a master in the Core Stage. In addition, it would also harm the body.","It was impossible for a Core to sacrifice himself using an Enlightenment just for a simple duel. The only reasonable explanation was that Chu Yunfan must have taught Chu Hongcai in advance so that he could learn it and have such great power.","Previously, they had laughed at Chu Yunfan’s spear attack as a joke, but now it seemed that it was just a feint. He must have taught Chu Hongcai the real technique before this.","Chu Xiujie’s face was even uglier. They had all thought that Chu Yongyan had schemed against Chu Hongcai. After all, Chu Yongyan’s strength was far superior to Chu Hongcai’s, but he didn’t say it out loud, waiting to trick Chu Hongcai.","Who would have thought that it was Chu Hongcai who had set Chu Yongyan up in the end?","Chu Hongcai had clearly been prepared, but he had acted as if he had no chance of winning and deceived all of them.","Thinking of this, Chu Xiujie felt a burning sensation on his face. It was the result of someone giving him a tight slap. He boasted that he had the pearl of wisdom in his hands, but in the end, he was fooled by Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai.","The anger in Chu Xiujie’s heart was constantly burning, but he couldn’t act out. In the morning, Chu Yunfan’s kick crippled Chu Yanghui because Chu Yanghui was the first to attack. Many of the Chu family’s servants saw it, so he couldn’t hide it, and he couldn’t act out.","He had not yet reached the point where he could cover the sky with one hand in Marquis Zhongxin’s household. He still had his biggest competitor, Chu Haoyu, who was eyeing his position covetously, so he could only swallow his anger.","He originally wanted to use this battle to ruthlessly teach Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai a lesson, but he had miscalculated.","Now, they were in the ring. According to the rules, victory and defeat were both self-inflicted. As long as they were in the ring, it was equivalent to signing a life-and-death contract.","He originally wanted to use this point to make Chu Hongcai loosen his bones, but now he was being used to loosen Chu Yongyan’s bones.","The feeling of being slapped in the face twice made him feel like a volcano that was about to erupt.","After imagining Chu Yunfan’s scheme, he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and said, “Well done, Chu Yunfan. You’re good. You’ll regret this one day.”","He looked at Chu Yunfan with a vicious expression. As long as he became the son of Marquis Zhongxin in the future, he would make Chu Yunfan suffer. He would make him beg for death."]},{"number":1165,"title":"Chapter 1165 If You Want to Act So Pretentiously, Why Don’t You Just Go to Heaven?","paragraphs":["1165 If You Want to Act So Pretentiously, Why Don’t You Just Go to Heaven?","After Chu Xiujie opened his mouth, everyone suddenly had a feeling of realization. Their minds were similar to Chu Xiujie’s, and this was the only possibility they could think of.","Chu Yunfan must have been prepared for this and had set up a trap with Chu Hongcai to lure Chu Xiujie’s group into it.","And Chu Xiujie’s group didn’t realize this and stupidly sent themselves to the door to be slapped in the face.","Many people thought of Chu Xiujie being slapped in the face twice in a row and suddenly felt the pain on his face.","“What a terrifying move! No wonder Chu Yunfan told Chu Hongcai to use it as a trump card.”","“The spear intent of this spear is truly vast and terrifying. A spear that can split the clouds, cloudless for miles, is truly terrifying!”","“That’s right. I’ve never seen such a terrifying spear technique before!”","“Young Master Cai aside, this Young Master Fan is also hiding his true strength.”","When the servants in Marquis Zhongxin’s household saw this scene, they began to discuss it among themselves. They were still reminiscing about that astonishing spear strike from earlier, which had helped Chu Hongcai defeat Chu Yongyan, who was much stronger than him.","They didn’t know where this secret technique came from, but it was really terrifying.","Now, when they looked at Chu Yunfan again, the look in their eyes suddenly changed. Chu Yunfan was no longer the useless young master who could not cultivate.","Although they still couldn’t see any traces of Chu Yunfan’s true cultivation. They had to admit that Young Master Fan was indeed a person with hidden abilities. He was definitely not an ordinary person.","In the past, Chu Yunfan kept a low profile because he knew his limits and didn’t dare to show himself. But now, it seemed that this wasn’t the case. He was probably just lying low.","He shocked the world with a single brilliant feat.","The two major events that happened today were both related to Chu Yunfan, which made him extremely mysterious in the eyes of the servants.","His body was also shrouded in a layer of fog, making people unable to see clearly at all.","“Brother Fan, that was amazing! That technique!”","Chu Hongcai directly jumped down from the ring and looked at Chu Yunfan with excitement. Just now, he almost thought that he had lost for sure. The difference in strength was hard to make up with one strike.","He had used that move at the critical moment and turned defeat into victory. This was completely unexpected. He finally understood Chu Yunfan’s painstaking efforts. Chu Yunfan must have seen something, but it was not convenient for him to intervene directly, so he taught him this move.","He had felt the power of this move. It was so great that he did not dare to imagine it. Even the terrifying spear intent contained in this move was something that he might not be able to fully explore even if he had to explore it for a lifetime.","Most people would have kept such a secret technique to themselves, but Chu Yunfan had taught him this technique openly and without any reservations. This showed that he regarded him as one of his own.","Chu Hongcai’s face turned red with excitement.","“Of course. Practice it well. When you’ve mastered this move, I’ll teach you the rest. You can go anywhere in the world then.” Chu Yunfan nodded with a calm expression on his face.","It was only natural for the invincible spear technique left behind by the Heaven-Splitting Spear Emperor to have such power. If it didn’t even have such power, then Chu Yunfan would be in disbelief.","When the others heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they felt that he was simply acting cool.","If you want to act so pretentiously, why don’t you just go to heaven?","They had all seen the power of the attack from earlier. That cloudless and terrifying spear momentum was an extremely brilliant spear technique even for Divines. It could even be said to be an extremely profound and mysterious spear technique.","And at that level, he actually hadn’t even reached a higher level and only knew a little?","Can you not brag so much? You’re about to break from it!","No one believed what Chu Yunfan said. Chu Hongcai had only mastered a little bit of it. After all, they had never heard of such a martial art before. They weren’t in a fantasy novel, so how could there be so many powerful martial arts?","To have such power just by grasping a little bit of it, then the power of this set of techniques could completely be comparable to the sky and the sun.","In their eyes, Chu Hongcai had to have cultivated to an extremely high level to be able to use this.","But even so, the power of this set of spear techniques was truly shocking. It surpassed any set of spear techniques that they knew of.","Chu Xiujie was even more shocked. That spear, if he had cultivated it well, could become a secret skill. However, it was clear that with his relationship with Chu Yunfan, he would not have the chance to learn it.","Only Chu Hongcai believed what Chu Yunfan said because he had indeed learned it today. To be more precise, he had just learned it. Chu Yunfan had instilled this move into his mind through the Enlightenment Method.","Compared to the terrifying power of the spear in his mind that could destroy the world, what he was using now could not even be considered superficial.","Not to mention entering the ultimate stage.","Not to mention the other moves Chu Yunfan mentioned, even if it was just this one move, if one could really master it, its power would be shocking. One strike might be able to kill a Divine.","Furthermore, this move was simply too profound. The more he comprehended, the more he felt that his comprehension of spear techniques rose. Even Chu Yunfan was willing to exchange blows with him with this kind of ultimate technique. This gave Chu Hongcai the feeling that he would die for his bosom friend.","Even if Chu Yunfan were to ask him to climb a mountain of swords or plunge into a sea of fire, he would not even frown.","In many people’s eyes, Chu Hongcai’s hot-bloodedness was disdainful and even childish, but Chu Yunfan felt that this was a good thing. To him, nothing was more precious than this pure heart.","What’s the use of those people’s talents? All of them schemed against each other.","“Well done, Chu Yunfan. You actually managed to plot against me!” Chu Xiujie gritted his teeth.","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and understood what Chu Xiujie was thinking, but he was too lazy to explain. There was no need to. Some things, to some people, were simply beyond imagination.","To Chu Yunfan, Chu Xiujie’s obsession with him was just like a frog at the bottom of a well.","“Do you dare to accept my challenge? Right here in this arena?” Chu Xiujie said.","“You?” Chu Yunfan said with a sneer. “I don’t have the time. How about one month from now? Chu Hongcai will take my place and fight you in a month’s time. Do you dare to accept the challenge?”","Chu Xiujie’s body trembled with anger. Chu Yunfan didn’t respect him at all, and even asked Chu Hongcai, who he didn’t even put in his eyes, to challenge him a month from now. Wasn’t this a slap to his face?","“All right, I’d like to see how you’re going to train Chu Hongcai to challenge me in a month from now. I’ll wait for that day,” Chu Xiujie said word for word through clenched teeth."]},{"number":1166,"title":"Chapter 1166 Are You Interested in Becoming Marquis Zhongxin’s Son?","paragraphs":["1166 Are You Interested in Becoming Marquis Zhongxin’s Son?","Chu Xiujie agreed to Chu Yunfan’s challenge word for word. He was already mad with anger, but he couldn’t act up. He had to maintain his image. Before he became the Marquis Zhongxin’s son, he had to maintain his image and couldn’t let it collapse.","But Chu Yunfan’s request for Chu Hongcai to challenge him deeply hurt Chu Xiujie’s self-esteem.","Chu Yunfan was delusional. Chu Hongcai was only at the sixth Innate Stage and could at the most break through to the seventh in a month.","Chu Xiujie had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage. Although he was only at tier one, it was enough. He was a powerful existence that had already surpassed the Innate Stage.","In a month’s time, Chu Yunfan said Chu Hongcai would be able to challenge him. If he could really do it, then Chu Xiujie might as well take a sword to his neck and commit suicide.","In order to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage, he had cultivated for so many years and spent countless resources. Only he knew how difficult it was. Now, Chu Hongcai wanted to catch up in a month. Wasn’t that wishful thinking?","A malicious glint flashed through his eyes like a venomous tongue, and his heart was filled with killing intent. One day, when he had power in his hands, he would definitely kill Chu Yunfan.","“Very well. We’ll see you in the arena in a month,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently and then left the arena with Chu Hongcai.","“What are you looking at? Hurry up and get back to work!” Chu Xiujie shouted and the servants of Marquis Zhongxin’s household who were watching the show quickly dispersed like monkeys scattering when a tree fell. In a moment, all of them had run away.","Only Chu Xiujie and the other candidates were left behind, as well as Chu Yongyan, who was constantly vomiting blood and recuperating.","Chu Xiujie originally didn’t mind these servants watching to establish his power—to let the whole mansion know what the consequences were for offending him. But in the end, he made such a big fool of himself.","Chu Xiujie coldly looked at Chu Yongyan and said, “Trash! All of you are trash. You can’t do anything right, but you’re good at ruining things!”","Hearing this, Chu Yongyan spurted out another mouthful of blood. A sinister look flashed in the depths of his eyes. He was also very aggrieved, but what could he do? This failure was also extremely humiliating to him.","But he didn’t have the guts to take revenge on Chu Xiujie, so he could only transfer all his hatred to Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai.","“Just wait. Next time, I’ll definitely teach you a lesson!” Chu Yongyan’s eyes flickered with a crazed look.","When Chu Xiujie and the others were about to vomit blood, Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai returned to Chu Yunfan’s side courtyard. This courtyard was located on the edge of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. Usually, very few people would come here, so it was very quiet. Most people were unwilling to come here because it meant that they were demoted but Chu Yunfan wanted such a quiet place to recuperate.","Along the way, Chu Hongcai was immersed in the excitement of defeating Chu Yongyan. To him, defeating Chu Yongyan was something he could brag about for the rest of his life.","“Hahahaha, Brother Fan, did you see that? Chu Xiujie’s face was as black as the bottom of a burnt pot. I’ve been unhappy with him for a long time. Just because he’s the nephew of the marquis, he doesn’t show us any respect. If it wasn’t for your unwillingness to participate in the fight for the title of Marquis Zhongxin’s son, I wouldn’t have joined him,” Chu Hongcai said excitedly.","After the two of them entered the side courtyard, Chu Yunfan sat in front of a stone table in the courtyard, while Chu Hongcai sat opposite him. The two of them sat opposite each other.","“Pfft, he can become the crown prince? Isn’t he just relying on the fact that he’s the marquis’ nephew? All the resources he has are a few times more than the others. Otherwise, just him alone? What right does he have to step into the Divine Abilities Stage?” Chu Hongcai said in disdain, “Also, so what if he becomes the crown prince? I’ll just hide in the countryside. He can’t cover the sky with one hand in the entire Great Wei Kingdom. I can still hide if he tries to come after me.”","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. Chu Hongcai was indeed young, hot-blooded, and impulsive, but he also had a drive, which was the rarest.","“But Brother Fan, you want me to challenge him in a month’s time. I know my own strength very well. If you want me to deal with Chu Yongyan, I can still deal with him with the Cloud Split. But if it’s Chu Xiujie, then isn’t that sending me to my death?” Chu Hongcai said with a cheeky smile.","He didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan would send him to his death, so he said this shamelessly. Anyway, he was only a teenager, much younger than Chu Yunfan, so he didn’t suffer any loss by acting cute in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Brother Fan, you must have a way, right? Tell me!”","Chu Yunfan laughed. “Since I asked you to challenge him in a month, I’m naturally confident about it. But these are just small matters.”","Chu Hongcai’s eyes widened as he looked at Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had asked him to challenge Chu Xiujie in a month’s time. In his heart, it was a huge pressure, but in the end, it was just a small matter for Chu Yunfan.","If he said it out, it would probably cause a huge uproar. Chu Xiujie would probably vomit blood again. He attached so much importance to this matter, but Chu Yunfan didn’t care at all and only treated it as a small matter.","“Brother Fan, if it’s you, then, of course, it’s a small matter, but I don’t have your cultivation. I haven’t even stepped into the seventh Innate Stage. Let alone a month, even if you give me a year, I still won’t be able to beat him. You don’t really want him to stretch his muscles and bones for me and be unable to get out of bed for a year and a half, right?” Chu Hongcai said gloomily.","“Since I’ve said this, I naturally have my reasons. I naturally have a way. Do you have to be so worried? It’s just Chu Xiujie. I’m not taking care of him because I’m leaving him to you as a whetstone. If I were to take care of him, he wouldn’t even be able to block one move from me,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","If his words were heard by others, they would definitely think that he was extremely arrogant. If word of this got out, it would definitely cause a huge uproar.","However, Chu Hongcai nodded his head fervently as if he was saying “You’re the boss. Everything you say is right.”","“Now, tell me. Are you interested in becoming the marquis’s son? ” Chu Yunfan asked as he looked at Chu Hongcai.","His expression was carefree as if he had just said something insignificant."]},{"number":1167,"title":"Chapter 1167 An Xiuxiu’s Visit","paragraphs":["1167 An Xiuxiu’s Visit","Chu Hongcai’s eyes widened. He hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to say this. Although he was hot-blooded and sometimes had a one-track mind, he wasn’t innocent. How could he not have any thoughts about becoming the marquis’ son?","In fact, among these people, except for Chu Yunfan, who wanted to find a place to heal, no one was chosen without any thought. If they didn’t have any thoughts, they wouldn’t have been selected as candidates.","But after more than a year of competition, Chu Xiujie and Chu Yongyan stood out from the crowd and both stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage, which isolated the thoughts of others.","No matter how much they wanted to become the crown prince, they knew that if they were all in the Innate Stage and the gap between them wasn’t big, then they could still fight for the position. It would just be a difference between a few small levels, which was nothing.","However, as the two of them reached the Divine Abilities Stage one after another, the outcome was already clear. It was not a matter of who reached the Divine Abilities Stage first. Some of them had even reached the peak of the Innate Stage, but it was useless.","It wasn’t something that they would be able to cross with time. Every step was like the difference between clouds and mud. If they couldn’t cross it, they couldn’t cross it. If they could cross it, they could. It was the difference between heaven and earth.","There was no possibility of them chasing each other.","In addition, the selection for the crown prince was about to end. From what Marquis Zhongxin had revealed, if he didn’t choose Chu Xiujie, then he would choose Chu Yongyan. It was unlikely that there were any other possibilities.","The difference between Chu Hongcai’s cultivation base and theirs was too great. Although it could be said that his luck was quite bad due to his young age, luck itself was also a part of strength. He couldn’t possibly make others stop and wait for him.","Therefore, he had long since given up on this idea. Everyone began to turn to a pragmatic approach, choosing one of the top candidates to assist them. As long as the person they assisted became the marquis’ son, even if they could not become the crown prince, they would still receive great benefits.","Because of this, Chu Hongcai chose to rely on Chu Xiujie, but because of his character, even if he relied on Chu Xiujie, he was out of place with Chu Xiujie’s lackeys, and there was no way to integrate with them.","In the end, because of Chu Yunfan, he completely fell out with Chu Xiujie and the others.","He wasn’t prepared at all, and Chu Yunfan had already said this.","But then, Chu Hongcai smiled bitterly and said, “Brother Fan, don’t make fun of me. Isn’t it obvious who will win? Brother Fan, if you take action, I believe you can still turn the situation around, but it’s impossible for me. How can I catch up with Chu Xiujie and Chu Yongyan in such a short time?”","“If I say yes, it means yes. If you want it, I can help you,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Chu Hongcai.","“Brother Fan, why do you think so highly of me? Don’t you want to be the son of Marquis Zhongxin?” Chu Hongcai asked.","He hadn’t thought about this problem before because he never thought that Chu Yunfan would stand out and assist him to become the crown prince.","But now, it was clear that Chu Yunfan had no intention of coming out at all. Instead, he wanted Chu Hongcai to become the marquis’ son. He couldn’t understand it.","“To me, Marquis Zhongxin’s residence is too small.” Chu Yunfan stood up with his hands behind his back and looked at the sky in the distance. Above the sky, an eagle-like monster flew past.","He was like an eagle in the sky. How could he stay in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and fight endlessly? What he pursued was supreme progress in martial arts. Otherwise, he could have just stayed in the Federation.","“To me, it doesn’t matter whether I’m loyal to the marquis or even the emperor. For people of my generation, the ultimate goal is to pursue the supreme martial Dao,” Chu Yunfan said.","His purpose of becoming stronger in the past was to stand out and make his family’s life better, and thus, that was what he did.","He had already passed that stage. Whatever he wanted to have—be it wealth, fame, or honor—he had already obtained it all in the Federation.","Therefore, he now had a new pursuit, which was to walk to the peak of martial arts, to see the most beautiful scenery, and to walk a path that no one had ever walked before.","Therefore, the glory and wealth that Marquis Zhongxin represented could not move him. Only after experiencing all that could he let go of it.","Chu Hongcai couldn’t quite understand. He was too young to understand Chu Yunfan’s ambition, but he was also influenced by Chu Yunfan.","“Hongcai, let me teach you another sentence. Strength is the foundation of everything. As long as you have enough strength, you can obtain everything in an open and aboveboard manner. Only the weak will think of schemes and intrigues all day long. So what if he’s loyal to the marquis? He’s a man. Even if he goes out, joins the army, and serves the country, he might get demoted,” Chu Yunfan said as he turned to Chu Hongcai.","Chu Hongcai immediately said excitedly, “Brother Fan, you’re right. I’m a real man with hands and feet. I can also get what I want through hard work.","“But Brother Fan, do you really want me to be the marquis’ son? Why?” Chu Hongcai asked, “Do you think that I’m so talented that I’ll have to take on the responsibility of saving the country and the world in the future?”","As soon as Chu Hongcai finished speaking, Chu Yunfan immediately gave him a knock on the head. Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry as he said, “You’re thinking too much. I’m only close to you. If I don’t help you, who else will I help?”","“Alright then!” Chu Hongcai immediately said with a smile.","Suddenly, another wave of footsteps came from the distance. Very quickly, a fiery red figure appeared outside the side courtyard.","“Chu Yunfan, you live here? It’s really hard to find.”","The fiery red figure was none other than An Xiuxiu.","“What are you doing here?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“You’re...An Xiuxiu!”","Chu Hongcai’s eyes widened as he looked at An Xiuxiu in shock. Unlike Chu Yunfan, who didn’t know much about An Xiuxiu’s background, Chu Hongcai was a native of the Great Wei Kingdom. He had grown up in Conglong City so he naturally knew her background very well.","An Xiuxiu was the only legitimate daughter of the Marquis Anguo. From a young age, she had been regarded as a pearl in the marquis’ palm. From a young age, she had been evaluated by a mysterious master as an outstanding talent and would become a great figure in the future.","Later on, the truth was as the mysterious expert had said. She quickly became the best among her peers. It was said that she had even entered the Divine Abilities Stage recently.","For An Xiuxiu, who was only in her twenties, this was an extremely amazing achievement."]},{"number":1168,"title":"Chapter 1168 Helping Chu Hongcai Break Through to Seventh Innate Stage Right Then and There","paragraphs":["1168 Helping Chu Hongcai Break Through to Seventh Innate Stage Right Then and There","With such talent and strength, An Xiuxiu’s name became a hot topic for some time.","In addition, she was born in the marquis’ residence and was the pearl in his palm. It could be said that she was the target of all the young talents in the city and even the entire Great Wei Kingdom.","In particular, the power and status of Marquis Anguo in the Great Wei Kingdom were higher than that of Marquis Zhongxin. Under such circumstances, it was impossible for Chu Hongcai to not know An Xiuxiu.","“That’s right, I’m An Xiuxiu.”","!!","An Xiuxiu saw Chu Hongcai’s shocked expression and nodded in satisfaction. ‘That’s more like it.’","As the precious daughter of Marquis Anguo and a famous genius, she was treated as a distinguished guest wherever she went. Only this Chu Yunfan showed no regard for her, which made her a little depressed.","“Is An Xiuxiu very famous?” Chu Yunfan asked Chu Hongcai.","“She’s not just famous, she’s very famous!” Chu Hongcai quickly explained An Xiuxiu’s situation, including the big things she had done in the past that had caused a sensation in Conglong City.","Chu Yunfan nodded and said, “Oh, I see. But you don’t have to act like you’re a retard.”","Although Chu Hongcai didn’t know what a retard was, he knew it wasn’t a good word. He couldn’t help but feel wronged and said, “Brother Fan, this is all common sense, okay? This is all common sense. You’re too much of a shut-in. You need to go out more!”","An Xiuxiu gritted her teeth when she saw Chu Yunfan’s indifferent expression. However, when she thought of how he had casually killed a few Divines in Pinyi Pavilion this morning, she was immediately discouraged and rendered speechless.","Chu Yunfan had the confidence to do so. Her pride was nothing in front of him. No matter how strong a Divine was, they would not be able to withstand his punches and kicks.","Chu Hongcai saw An Xiuxiu’s hesitant look—that she was hesitant to refute Chu Yunfan. He was instantly in disbelief. In Conglong City, who didn’t know An Xiuxiu’s fiery temper? Even young men of the same generation were hung up and beaten by her. They couldn’t do anything to her.","Not only did she have a noble status, but her strength was also first-class. Ordinary people couldn’t do anything to her, but she looked helpless in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Hongcai couldn’t help but secretly give Chu Yunfan a thumbs up. ‘Big brother, you’re really awesome. You can even take care of this kind of girl.’","Chu Yunfan saw Chu Hongcai secretly give him a thumbs up and didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. This kid must have thought of some incredulous things again.","However, he quickly turned to An Xiuxiu and said, “What are you doing here?”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s cold expression, An Xiuxiu pouted and opened her spatial ring. She took out a spatial bag and threw it before Chu Yunfan.","“Didn’t you say before you left earlier today that you wanted us to bring you the reward for the Snake Brothers? And here we are. One hundred thousand low-grade spirit stones,” An Xiuxiu said.","“Only one hundred thousand? How stingy!” Chu Yunfan complained for a moment, then quickly picked up the spatial bag. “But to be able to get this so quickly, it seems that you used a lot of strength.”","An Xiuxiu saw that Chu Yunfan thought it was too little and couldn’t help but sigh in experation. 100,000 low-grade spirit stones was not a small amount. It should be known that ordinary people used gold and silver to live, and only Innate and above experts used spirit stones to trade. 100,000 low-grade spirit stones was enough to make a Divine go bankrupt.","However, if she knew about Chu Yunfan’s previous assets, she would definitely not think this way. It was not that Chu Yunfan thought it was too little, but it was indeed not worth mentioning compared to his previous status.","Normally speaking, even if Chu Yunfan killed the Snake Brothers, he would have to report it to the higher-ups, and it would take a long time before he could get the gold reward.","It only took half a day for this reward to be given out. Of course, it was because of Marquis Anguo’s connections. Chu Yunfan did not want to be in the limelight, so the honor of killing the target fell on An Xiuxiu. After some processing, the reward was quickly dispensed.","Although An Xiuxiu had accepted the honor of killing the Snake Brothers, she was not so despicable as to take the reward. She immediately sent it to Chu Yunfan.","“No matter what, I still have to thank you,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","On the side, Chu Hongcai’s eyes were about to pop out. Although he had never seen the Snake Brothers, he had heard of the three brutal assassins of the Green Garbs. It could be said that many assassins with higher cultivation levels than the three brothers were not as famous as them.","The Snake Brothers were simply savage!","To the current Chu Hongcai, those people were legendary figures. But in the end, they were killed by Chu Yunfan.","And this morning, Chu Yunfan had gone out and done such a big thing, and the key thing was that no one knew about it. If it was Chu Xiujie or Chu Yongyan who did it, the whole house would know about it.","To be able to kill any one of the three Snake Brothers was an incredible feat, not to mention killing all three.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s nonchalant appearance, and even having the time to complain about the reward being too low, Chu Hongcai couldn’t help but admire him.","‘Brother Fan really is an expert. He’s completely different from ordinary people.’","“I’ve already benefited so much from you. This is just a small errand. It’s nothing,” An Xiuxiu said, “But I just heard that you plan to challenge Chu Xiujie in a month. What’s the point of that? I don’t think it’s something you should do.”","“Why is this news so out of place?”","Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. How did the news get out of hand when it reached An Xiuxiu’s ears? “I’m not the one challenging Chu Xiujie. I’m not that bored. Hongcai’s going to challenge him.”","Chu Yunfan pointed at Chu Hongcai as he said this.","An Xiuxiu looked at Chu Hongcai and said in disbelief, “How is that possible? Chu Yunfan, I admit that you have some means, but he’s only at the sixth Innate Stage. Although Chu Xiujie is more than thirty years old, he has already entered the Divine Abilities Stage. How can you let a level six Innate challenge a Divine in a month? Are you crazy, or is he crazy?”","Chu Hongcai nodded awkwardly. He also found it unbelievable, but he still believed in Chu Yunfan.","“You don’t believe me? How about we make a bet then? I’ll help Chu Hongcai break through to the seventh Innate Stage right here and now. If you lose, you’ll have to help me do one thing. How about it?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile."]},{"number":1169,"title":"Chapter 1169 Break Through on the Spot? It Really Happened!","paragraphs":["1169 Break Through on the Spot? It Really Happened!","“Immediately break through to the seventh Innate Stage? How is that possible?”","An Xiuxiu’s eyes widened in disbelief. She did not believe what Chu Yunfan had just said.","Chu Hongcai was only at the sixth Innate Stage. It was not easy for him to break through to the seventh stage.","The sixth Innate Stage was the middle stage, but once he broke through to the seventh stage, he would become a genuine upper Innate Stage master.","!!","An Xiuxiu knew how difficult it was to cross this step.","Chu Yunfan said that Chu Hongcai would break through immediately with his help, which was why she did not believe him.","“So, are you interested in making a bet?” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","“All right, I’d like to see how you’re going to help him break through. But I’m going to say this first. If it’s a very difficult request, then don’t blame me for rejecting you,” An Xiuxiu said straightforwardly. She seemed to have thought of something and blushed.","“Don’t worry, it won’t be a difficult task for you,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile.","“That’s good.” An Xiuxiu nodded. Although Chu Yunfan had already shown an unbelievable side in the morning, no matter how strong his cultivation was, it was impossible for him to help someone break through immediately.","She wanted to see what Chu Yunfan would do.","“Hahaha, then just wait and see!”","Chu Yunfan stood in front of Chu Hongcai and said, “”Relax and look into my eyes.”","Chu Hongcai looked into Chu Yunfan’s eyes which were as deep as the universe, his pupils as brilliant as the stars.","Suddenly, Chu Hongcai felt a figure drilling directly into his mind and then he felt all the internal energy in his body began to move involuntarily. They began to madly attack the barrier of the seventh Innate Stage.","This was an unprecedented circulation path that he had never cultivated before. However, he could feel that it was an extremely high-level cultivation technique. He couldn’t even guess the grade of this technique.","The true energy in his body instantly exploded and madly attacked the barrier.","The difference between a good technique and a bad technique was very obvious. The amount of true energy one could mobilize at any given time was a very obvious difference.","If Chu Hongcai’s technique could only mobilize 50% of the Innate true energy in his body, he could now feel that all of his Innate true energy had been mobilized. It was a completely unfamiliar circulation route, but its effects were far stronger than his previous techniques.","The barrier of the seventh stage, which was originally very strong for him, began to shake. He was surprised.","He quickly sat cross-legged and allowed the mental energy to mobilize the Innate true energy in his body and began to attack the barrier.","After a mere fifteen minutes, Chu Hongcai’s true energy began to burst out madly.","An Xiuxiu’s eyes were fixed on Chu Hongcai. Then, she saw that Chu Hongcai’s true energy seemed to have reached its limit and was pouring out like a mountain flood.","A storm of energy formed around Chu Hongcai, and in just a moment, it was boiling.","After a long time, Chu Hongcai’s true energy slowly receded. An Xiuxiu’s eyes widened in disbelief. How could she not understand that Chu Hongcai had successfully entered the seventh Innate Stage?","An Xiuxiu’s mouth was slightly agape. It was unbelievable. If she had not seen it with her own eyes from the beginning to the end, she would not have believed that such a thing could happen.","Chu Yunfan actually helped Chu Hongcai to break through to the seventh Innate Stage after just fifteen minutes.","She could roughly guess that Chu Yunfan made Chu Hongcai’s true energy circulate with his will so that Chu Hongcai’s true energy could be mobilized more efficiently than usual and break through the barrier.","However, just because she could guess it didn’t mean that she could do it. In fact, this kind of thing could not be done just by thinking about it. It was simply impossible.","A Divine’s mental power was very strong, but it depended on who they were compared to. Compared to an Innate, they did not have that much of an advantage.","However, Chu Yunfan actually did it. It was simply unbelievable. If he was not careful, he would suffer a spiritual backlash, and if that happened, he would be seriously injured.","Chu Yunfan withdrew his spirit. It was impossible for an ordinary Divine to do this. Not even a Core. However, he had the godhead, which greatly enhanced his spiritual power, allowing him to do this easily.","Of course, this was also because Chu Hongcai’s cultivation had already entered the peak of sixth Innate Stage. He was merely missing an opportunity, and Chu Yunfan was the one who provided him with it.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t a god who could raise a person’s cultivation level out of thin air.","Chu Hongcai was still immersed in his comprehension. Today’s surprises came one after another.","First, he had learned an extremely impressive spear technique from Brother Fan and defeated that annoying Chu Yongyan. After that, with the help of Brother Fan, he had actually broken through to the seventh Innate Stage. This was something that he had never even dreamt of.","He was still very excited as he looked at Chu Yunfan with a fanatical expression.","“It’ll be good for you to remember the circulation route from earlier,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Okay. Thank you, Brother Fan!”","Chu Hongcai was extremely excited. Now, Chu Yunfan could even ask him to climb a mountain of knives or plunge into a sea of fire and he would not find a problem with it.","At this time, he felt that Chu Yunfan’s previous words of guiding him to defeat Chu Xiujie in a month didn’t seem to be without hope.","“I didn’t expect you to be capable of doing this!” An Xiuxiu heaved a long sigh. It was as if she could witness some unbelievable miracle at any time while with Chu Yunfan.","It was just like how she had seen Chu Yunfan casually kill the Snake Brothers this morning.","“What do you want me to do?” An Xiuxiu looked at Chu Yunfan suspiciously as if she wanted to see if he would make any outrageous requests.","“It’s simple. You heard the rumors just now. Chu Hongcai will challenge Chu Xiujie in a month. I have other ways, but his combat experience is still too low, especially against a master like you. Over the next one month, I hope you will spend two hours each day teaching him moves. How about it?” Chu Yunfan said to An Xiuxiu with a faint smile. “As a reward, I can help you cure your midnight back pain. This is fair, right?”","“Okay,” An Xiuxiu agreed without hesitation. She wanted to see what kind of miracle Chu Yunfan could create."]},{"number":1170,"title":"Chapter 1170 An Xiuxiu’s Shock and the Birthday Invitation","paragraphs":["1170 An Xiuxiu’s Shock and the Birthday Invitation","Although Chu Hongcai had already stepped into the seventh Innate Stage and seemed to be a little better than before, in fact, there was still a huge difference between him and a Divine.","If it was said that ordinary people had a great dream to reach the peak of the Innate Stage, then stepping into the Divine Abilities Stage was an even greater dream.","Breaking through from the sixth stage to the seventh stage was no different from breaking through to the Divine Abilities Stage.","An Xiuxiu was also very interested in how Chu Yunfan was going to help Chu Hongcai achieve this almost impossible goal within a month. If someone else had said that, she would have spat in their face and said that it was impossible.","!!","However, Chu Yunfan’s words somehow made her want to believe them, even if they seemed absolutely ridiculous.","“That’s great!” Chu Yunfan nodded with a grin.","Chu Hongcai looked at Chu Yunfan gratefully. For his sake, Chu Yunfan had even asked a Divine to help him. This was treatment that he had never dreamt of before.","The heirs of each family were probably just like this.","“In that case, I won’t be stingy.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, he returned to his room in the side courtyard, took out a pen and paper, and started writing. “It’s a good thing your cultivation level isn’t that deep yet so it’s not too late to change it now.”","An Xiuxiu almost rolled her eyes when she heard this. She was in the Divine Abilities Stage, but Chu Yunfan actually said that her cultivation was not profound enough. She was almost crying her eyes out. However, when she thought of Chu Yunfan’s unfathomable and shocking cultivation, she could only swallow her anger.","“The main reason why you’re in this state is because of your cultivation method. The problem was caused by your cultivation method moving through these acupuncture points. The symptoms have only appeared now after accumulating for a long time,” Chu Yunfan said as he wrote. “That’s not a problem. I’ll help you modify your cultivation technique a little and there shouldn’t be any further problems.”","“Modify? How do you know what cultivation technique I’m cultivating? How do you know my circulation route?”","An Xiuxiu finally couldn’t hold it in anymore and asked in surprise. She remembered very clearly that she had never told Chu Yunfan about her internal energy cultivation method. In fact, although she wanted to cure her illness, she had a master who taught her internal energy. Unless her master agreed, she couldn’t just tell anyone about it.","But Chu Yunfan actually said that he knew An Xiuxiu’s circulation route, and was modifying her cultivation method?","This completely shocked An Xiuxiu. She could not believe that he could see through to her the circulation route with just a glance. Or even make changes immediately.","How could there be such an operation?","If you’re so awesome, why don’t you go to heaven?","She couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan was so powerful that he could see through her cultivation technique with a single glance.","Then, she took the paper from Chu Yunfan’s hand. Her whole body trembled because she was sure with just a glance that it was exactly the cultivation method she used. She couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan could deduce so many things just by looking at her moves.","She was also a Divine so she could tell at a glance that the modifications were extremely brilliant. The problem of her back hurting at midnight was solved from the root. After modifying the circulation route, she could feel that the effect of exerting force had increased by at least 20%.","Don’t look down on this 20%. The cultivation method she cultivated was passed down from generation to generation and had been modified by countless ancestors. It had basically reached a rather perfect level. Even if the younger generation wanted to modify it, they often had no way to do so unless their cultivation was far beyond the ancestors of the previous generations.","Not to mention increasing the power output by 20%, even increasing it by 1% was an extremely rare thing. Seeing that Chu Yunfan casually modified it and increased the power output by 20%, if he were to continue modifying it, wouldn’t it be possible for her to be reborn?","Now that the truth was right in front of her, she had to believe it even if she didn’t want to.","“What’s wrong? Did I make a mistake?” Chu Yunfan looked at An Xiuxiu with some doubt.","“No, but can you really tell all this just by watching me fight?” An Xiuxiu looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. Why did this sound so much like a myth? it did not seem like a normal situation.","“What’s the big deal about it?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","He could understand An Xiuxiu’s shock. For ordinary people, this was an impossible miracle, but for Chu Yunfan, it was too simple. His cultivation was much stronger than An Xiuxiu’s, and it was not something An Xiuxiu could imagine. In addition, he had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories so his vision was not something An Xiuxiu could compare to.","An Xiuxiu’s question was like asking a university student what one plus one was. With the help of the godhead, Chu Yunfan could easily figure it out.","The more Chu Yunfan thought that it was nothing, the more An Xiuxiu felt that it was unbelievable. If she wasn’t sure that her cultivation technique couldn’t be leaked out, she would have thought that Chu Yunfan had seen her cultivation technique.","Although it was still very magical to increase one’s strength by two levels with such a simple modification, it was still better than Chu Yunfan, who could see through to her cultivation technique with a casual glance and modify it.","Could it be that Chu Yunfan was not a young man at all, but an old monster in the skin of a young man?","An Xiuxiu felt as if she had been completely seen through.","“Since there’s no problem, then it’s decided. From today on, you just have to move your divine power according to the new circulation route. For the next one month, you just have to come in the morning to help teach Hongcai some moves,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile. “I’m not doing this for free, hahaha!”","“Of course not!” An Xiuxiu said quickly.","This time, she had gained a huge advantage. Not only did she get rid of the hidden danger in her body, but she also got a better cultivation technique.","“Oh, by the way, there’s another reason why I’m here today. It’s about Miaoyi. It’s her birthday in five days so she asked me to invite you to her birthday party,” An Xiuxiu suddenly remembered and quickly said.","“She wanted to come in person, but because of the assassination this morning, she was grounded by Uncle Situ. So, she asked me to invite you in her stead,” An Xiuxiu said."]},{"number":1171,"title":"Chapter 1171 Lack of Money, First Show of Talent!","paragraphs":["1171 Lack of Money, First Show of Talent!","An Xiuxiu looked at Chu Yunfan uneasily. It was a little rude to invite him to a birthday party at such a late time.","However, before this, the two of them didn’t know each other. Situ Miaoyi didn’t even know who Chu Yunfan was so even if she invited a wide range of people, it would be difficult to invite Chu Yunfan.","However, after today, Situ Miaoyi naturally understood that Chu Yunfan was definitely not as simple as the rumors said, and he was not some trash.","At this time, Situ Miaoyi naturally wanted to invite Chu Yunfan.","At first, An Xiuxiu didn’t think much of it, as she was just passing on a message. But after Chu Yunfan’s continuous incredible abilities, her impression of him had elated.","She still couldn’t figure out how Chu Yunfan was able to see through the cultivation technique she was using. This was the most amazing thing. Under such circumstances, she didn’t dare to be presumptuous in front of him.","“All right, no problem,: Chu Yunfan agreed after a brief pause.","“That’s great! I’ll go back and inform her. I’ll be here on time tomorrow morning!” An Xiuxiu quickly said.","“Alright.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","An Xiuxiu quickly left.","Chu Yunfan then turned to Chu Hongcai and said, “Hongcai, go back and train. Consolidate your cultivation. Over the next one month, I’ll give you special training. If you persist, you’ll be able to step into the Divine Abilities Stage without any problems.”","“Okay, Brother Fan. I’ll be heading back then.” Chu Hongcai nodded.","After sending the two off, Chu Yunfan stood in the side courtyard as the cold wind blew past him. A series of events had happened today, but the path ahead was very clear for him.","Now, he was basically a half-cripple. Although his physical body had been restored, his cultivation had yet to recover. The next period of time would be enough for him to recover a little more.","However, if he wanted to fully recover, or even go a step further, he had to rely on alchemy to recover. And this would require a lot of money.","Other than that, Chu Hongcai also wanted to break through to the Divine Abilities Stage. Of course, it was impossible for him to achieve it in a month’s time. This was something that even Chu Yunfan could not do so he naturally did not plan on letting Chu Hongcai do it.","He needed a lot of pills—in addition to the Divinity Nourishment Pills—to turn the situation around in a month and create a miracle.","Although it was a bit of a rush, with Chu Yunfan’s vision and means, he could naturally smooth out the aftereffects. Although he would have to break through in a month, it was far from the exaggerated kind of ascension.","It was even worse than Tang Siyu’s cultivation that had broken through all the way to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. As long as he was careful, it would not be a problem at all.","And just now, An Xiuxiu had delivered him an invitation to Situ Miaoyi’s birthday party. Since he was going to attend the party, he naturally would not miss out on a birthday gift. Chu Yunfan had already thought of what to give her.","He would also give her a Divinity Nourishment Pill.","Situ Miaoyi was already at the peak stage of the Innate Stage. What could be a better gift than this pill to help her break through to the Divine Abilities Stage?","Gifting a Divinity Nourishment Pill was basically gifting a future in the Divine Abilities Stage. It couldn’t be any more precious.","However, whether it was to make pills to heal his injuries or to make the two Divinity Nourishment Pills, he would need a huge amount of wealth to support it.","The 100,000 low-grade spirit stones that An Xiuxiu had given him were only a temporary solution. In fact, it was not enough to do anything.","This was especially true for pills of this grade. They were not the kind of common consumable pills that could be bought with low-grade stones.","Every single ingredient was expensive.","This meant that Chu Yunfan had to find a way to make money, and he had to make money in the shortest time possible.","The only way Chu Yunfan could think of was to make pills. He was an expert in this field so he was naturally very familiar with it.","However, if one wanted to rely on alchemy to earn money, if one wanted to have credibility, one had to pass the Alchemist Association’s assessment.","The Great Wei Kingdom also had an Alchemist Association just like the Federation. Basically, all the alchemy masters in the Great Wei Kingdom were members of the association.","If one wanted to rely on alchemy to make money, one must first get the approval of the Alchemist Association. As long as one passed the qualification assessment, then it was possible to get the certification and have credibility in the Great Wei Kingdom.","Whether Chu Yunfan wanted to open his own shop or help others make pills, he needed this kind of credibility guarantee.","After making his decision, Chu Yunfan did not waste any more time. He sat cross-legged in the small courtyard and used his will to forcibly mobilize his divine power to repair his meridians.","The waves caused by the two incidents in the morning and afternoon were still brewing. Through these two incidents, many people suddenly realized that the usually low-profile Young Master Fan was not as weak as others thought.","He had crippled Chu Yanghui with a single kick. This incident made many people realize that Chu Yunfan might possess a powerful combat strength. Although his combat strength couldn’t be said to have entered the Divine Abilities Stage, he was still an outstanding figure among the Innate Stage.","And this was already enough. After all, among so many candidates for the Crown Prince, only Chu Haoyu and Chu Xiujie had stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage.","In particular, Chu Yunfan’s declaration that he would let Chu Hongcai challenge Chu Xiujie in a month’s time quickly spread throughout the entire residence.","This was a new wave that had been set off in the gradually stabilizing situation of the fight for the position of crown prince.","Today’s two events had made Chu Xiujie lose face to Chu Yunfan, making Chu Yunfan’s name become more important for the first time.","Of course, this was only limited to the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. To outsiders, there wouldn’t even be a small ripple.","And Chu Yunfan’s strong move also made Chu Xiujie and Chu Haoyu’s two factions suddenly become vigilant.","In Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, in a luxurious mansion, Chu Xiujie and the others were all gathered together, the atmosphere was extremely depressing.","“Can we just let today’s matter go like this?”","Chu Yanghui was wrapped in a thick layer of gauze. When he spoke, he would pull on the broken ribs in his chest. He was in so much pain that he gritted his teeth.","“Of course, we can’t just let it go. We’ll have to settle this score with him sooner or later,” Chu Xiujie said with a dark look.","“Why don’t we take advantage of the fact that the marquis and the Grand Madam haven’t returned to have them killed without anyone knowing?”","At this moment, a person suggested in a sinister manner."]},{"number":1172,"title":"Chapter 1172 Casually Setting up an Formation, Is There Anything Chu Yunfan Doesn’t Know!","paragraphs":["1172 Casually Setting up an Formation, Is There Anything Chu Yunfan Doesn’t Know!","“That was a stupid suggestion. How am I going to do that?” Chu Xiujie rebuked. His eyes were flicked with a light but he soon figured that it was impossible.","Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai’s usual activity range was within Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. At most, they would only be active within Conglong City.","Even if he wanted to hire someone to kill the two of them, to make the other party attack Conglong City and Marquis Zhongxin’s residence under the tight security of experts, how many awesome experts would he have to hire? There was no need to even consider the Innate Stage. They would have to be at least above the Divine Abilities Stage.","Moreover, the price would probably be several times higher than usual. He felt his teeth ache when he thought of the possible price. Hiring Divine assassins to kill people in Conglong City would make him go bankrupt. He might not even be able to afford it so he might as well do it himself.","And he knew that was impossible.","“Let’s not talk about whether or not we can invite such an expert. Have you all forgotten how the previous princes died? Uncle and Grandma hate this kind of thing. Are you crazy?” Chu Xiujie immediately berated.","The others thought about it and agreed. The previous princes had all died at the hands of assassins. The entire Marquis Zhongxin household was too sensitive about this. If such a thing happened again, it didn’t matter how cleanly they did it. As long as they were suspected, they would be stripped of their qualifications to become the crown prince.","One could easily imagine how furious Marquis Zhongxin would be.","As for whether or not Chu Yunfan could escape from this kind of pursuit, they did not even think about it. Although Chu Yunfan’s kick that crippled Chu Yanghui was very brutal, it was also a fact that he did not have any true energy or divine power fluctuations. It was impossible for him to be in the Divine Abilities Stage. As long as he was not in the Divine Abilities Stage, it was impossible for him to escape.","“I can wait until he seeks his own death. Didn’t he say that he would let Chu Hongcai challenge me in a month? If anything happens in the arena, he can’t blame me,” Chu Xiujie said coldly.","“You are wise, Young Master Jie,” everyone said in unison.","The next morning, the Sun rose in the East and the Moon set in the West.","In the side courtyard, Chu Yunfan, who was sitting cross-legged and cultivating, was covered in morning dew. Suddenly, he moved slightly and his skin and flesh trembled at an amazing frequency. In an instant, all the morning dew was shaken off his body.","Chu Yunfan stood up. After a night’s cultivation, he had recovered some of his divine power. Although it was only a little bit—not enough to open the Mountain River Diagram—it was enough to open ordinary things like the spatial bag. Most importantly, with this foundation, his speed of recovery would not be constant but would get faster and faster.","After having a little breakfast, Chu Hongcai came to report. After a night of cultivation, he had stabilized his cultivation base, but his mood had not recovered.","“Brother Fan, I’ve consolidated my cultivation base,” Chu Hongcai said.","“Hmm, not bad, but it’s not enough. Come with me.” Chu Yunfan came to the surroundings of the courtyard, opened his spatial bag, and placed pieces of low-grade spirit stones around it, setting up a formation.","When the last formation eye was set up, the entire formation started to operate. Chu Hongcai instantly felt the spirit energy in the surroundings become dense.","The spirit energy in the Spirit Realm was very dense. Marquis Zhongxin’s residence was built in accordance with feng shui. The spirit energy here was ten times denser than outside.","However, after Chu Yunfan used several hundred low-grade spirit stones to set up the formation, the spirit energy in the area was several times denser than in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","It was almost comparable to a small sacred location.","However, other blessed and heavenly places were born with spirit veins, which could maintain a rich spirit energy for a long time. However, although the formation set up by Chu Yunfan had the effect of a small-scale blessed and heavenly place, it needed to consume spirit energy to maintain it.","“What a powerful formation!” Chu Hongcai looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. He felt that Brother Fan was even more mysterious than he had imagined. It was as if there was nothing he didn’t know.","“In the future, you will cultivate here. The speed of cultivation here will be faster than outside. Of course, this is just the foundation. To defeat Chu Xiujie in a month, this is far from enough,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan himself rarely set up formations like this, because he had a more brutal way of cultivation, which was to directly devour the spirit energy in the low-grade spirit stones. He did not need to use the formation to extract the spirit energy from the stones and release the spirit energy in a gentler way.","He usually just devoured the energy directly, which was much more efficient than converting it through an formation. However, this also had extremely high requirements for the cultivator. If Chu Hongcai followed Chu Yunfan’s method of devouring spirit energy, the only outcome for his entire body would be to explode and die.","“Remember where these spirit stones are placed. If I’m not around and the spirit energy in the spirit stones is used up, you can take one for yourself,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Understood.” Chu Hongcai nodded.","Not long after, An Xiuxiu, who was dressed in red, appeared outside the side courtyard. The moment she stepped into the side courtyard, she felt that the spirit energy in the entire place was so dense that it was almost impossible to disperse.","She even felt like he was immersed in Liquid Spirit Energy.","“What a powerful formation,” An Xiuxiu said in surprise.","Compared to Chu Hongcai, she was more aware of how amazing Chu Yunfan’s formation was.","Marquis Zhongxin’s residence itself was in a good feng shui spot, and in this spot, Chu Yunfan was able to find a clever way to break out of it and attract the spirit energy of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence over.","It must be known that the spirit energy in this formation was so dense not only because of the hundreds of low-grade spirit stones that Chu Yunfan had set up but also because it was a catalyst. Using these spirit stones to set up the formation, he guided the spirit energy in Marquis of Zhongxin’s residence to gather in this side courtyard.","An expert with a discerning eye would be able to see that this side courtyard was originally at the edge of the feng shui spot of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and was the place with the least spirit energy. Now, a large amount of spirit energy was pouring into this side courtyard under the guidance of the formation.","“Cultivating in such a place is simply half the effort and twice the result.”","An Xiuxiu naturally understood the importance of spirit energy to cultivators. She was a little curious as to how much more skills Chu Yunfan was hiding. How could such a person not give off any clues before?","It was not easy to set up a formation, especially to draw spirit energy from the feng shui of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. To borrow a chicken to lay eggs, one had to have extremely profound attainments in formations."]},{"number":1173,"title":"Chapter 1173 Chu Yunfan, the Expert of the Generation!","paragraphs":["1173 Chu Yunfan, the Expert of the Generation!","An Xiuxiu realized that the more she understood, the more she felt that she didn’t really understand Chu Yunfan. She might even have never really understood Chu Yunfan.","Not only did he hide his amazing cultivation, but he could even kill a Divine and also performed a miraculous scene in front of her, allowing Chu Hongcai to break through to the seventh Innate Stage.","The formation that Chu Yunfan had casually set up was at the level of a master. He had easily borrowed power from the feng shui of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","This in itself required an astonishing understanding of formations so that it would not destroy the overall situation of feng shui and the user would also not suffer the backlash of the formation itself.","It was as if there was such a formation in the first place. It was smooth and natural.","However, An Xiuxiu didn’t know that this was nothing to Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the memories of the Alchemy Emperor.","The Alchemy Emperor was good at alchemy, but he wasn’t good at formations. However, this was the conclusion that he reached after comparing himself with the Formation Emperor, who had become a Formation Emperor through formations.","The realm that the Alchemy Emperor was in himself made it so that no matter what he learned, it was all from a high point of view, and he could understand a hundred things. Even if his attainments in the field he wasn’t good at, they far exceeded the imagination of the citizens of this era.","According to their standards, Chu Yunfan was indeed a grandmaster.","For Chu Yunfan, this kind of borrowed chicken to lay eggs formation was as easy as lifting a finger. He could set it up with a little effort.","“Did your back hurt again last night?” Chu Yunfan asked casually.","“No, it didn’t,” An Xiuxiu quickly said after finally recovering from the shock of seeing the formation.","After she went back, she tried to cultivate according to Chu Yunfan’s modified cultivation method. At midnight, the faint pain disappeared.","This made An Xiuxiu heave a sigh of relief. She had been trying to find a way to solve this hidden problem in her body. And now, with Chu Yunfan’s help, it was finally solved.","“Well, your problem lies in your cultivation method. It’s not completely cured yet. You’ve been cultivating for a long time, and the damage to that part of your body has always been there. It’s just that your cultivation was not profound enough before so the backlash was not serious. Moreover, your physical cultivation is pretty good so you were able to withstand it. Now, the problem has just exploded,” Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll give you a prescription later. Get the medicine according to the prescription, and within seven days, it should be enough to solve the hidden danger in your body.”","“Thank you, Young Master Chu,” An Xiuxiu quickly said.","“It’s nothing. This is just a part of our deal, isn’t it? If you help me teach this kid, I’ll cure your illness,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","An Xiuxiu didn’t say anything but she knew the difference. They were not on the same level. Chu Yunfan had merely asked her to teach someone, but on the other hand, it seemed that no one except Chu Yunfan could cure her.","“All right, you two go ahead. I have things to do so I’ll be heading out first,” Chu Yunfan said.","“As long as you don’t kill him, I’m fine with anything.”","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately made Chu Hongcai’s face scrunch up. Wasn’t Chu Yunfan asking An Xiuxiu to beat him to death?","“No problem!” An Xiuxiu chuckled and looked at Chu Hongcai with an evil smile.","Chu Yunfan quickly left Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","The Alchemist Association was also a well-known society in the Great Wei Kingdom. Because of the special role of alchemists, many experts would more or less owe a lot of favors to alchemists. This also made the Alchemist Association one of the groups of people who couldn’t be provoked.","In particular, alchemists were often very rich, and with money and power, their cultivation wasn’t bad either. This made many people not dare to look down on alchemists.","When Chu Yunfan arrived at the Alchemist Association, the place was already filled with people. He followed the crowd and went straight in, finding the guide at the front desk.","The guide was a pretty girl in her twenties. Seeing Chu Yunfan walking over, she said, “How can I help you?”","“I want to take the alchemist assessment,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What rank of alchemist would you like to test for?” the girl continued to ask.","“I want to take the alchemy expert assessment,” Chu Yunfan said.","He had come to understand that the Great Wei Kingdom was similar to the Federation. It was also divided into alchemy apprentices, alchemy trainees, and alchemy experts. These few grades, like the Federation’s Alchemy King, were only nicknames and not considered an official division of social class.","To be more precise, the alchemy division of the Federation originated from the Ancient Zenith Civilization, and the Spirit Realm was the direct successor of the Ancient Zenith Civilization. Many of the systems of both sides were the same.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, the pretty girl immediately rolled her eyes and said, “Please stop playing around with me.”","Ye Qiaoxin looked at the young master in front of her, who was dressed in a black Chinese robe, and wondered what was wrong with these young masters. Did they have nothing else better to do?","Yet another person was using the reputation of taking the alchemy assessment to get close to her.","During this period of time, it had been a common occurrence since she started working as a receptionist.","Ye Qiaoxin knew that she was pretty and would naturally attract bees and butterflies. However, the way these young masters approached her was exactly the same—they were all here to take the alchemist test.","However, these young masters probably didn’t understand how difficult the alchemy expert assessment was. An ordinary alchemy apprentice was already very rare, but once one became an official alchemist, even the ordinary dignitaries would treat them as guests.","The number of alchemy experts in the entire Great Wei Kingdom could be counted on one’s palm. These people didn’t even need to bow to the Emperor. It could be said that they were high and mighty, and their status was almost the same as that of the Cores.","They had connections all over the world, and countless powerhouses owed these people favors. They were existences that could make many people tremble in fear with a stomp of their feet.","This young master actually didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth and wanted to take the alchemy expert assessment. She had seen ignorant and bold people, but Chu Yunfan was the most ignorant and also the most daring.","Ye Qiaoxin couldn’t help but roll her eyes.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what Ye Qqiaoxin was thinking. He only felt that after he said this, the girl’s attitude suddenly became cold. He did not know how he had offended her.","“I’m not playing around with you. I’m here to take the alchemy expert assessment,” Chu Yunfan said once again.","Seeing Chu Yunfan still pulling a long face, Ye Qiaoxin became even more unhappy and said, “In the entire Great Wei Kingdom, only The Alchemist Guild’s main branch in the Imperial Capital can perform the test to certify an alchemy expert. You’re taking a test here. If this isn’t to play around with me, then what is it?"]},{"number":1174,"title":"Chapter 1174 The Assessment That Shocked Everyone (Part 1)","paragraphs":["1174 The Assessment That Shocked Everyone (Part 1)","Chu Yunfan suddenly felt a little embarrassed. He didn’t know that the alchemy expert certification could only be done in the Imperial Capital. He wanted to complete all the certifications in one go. With the identity of an alchemy expert, he would naturally make a lot of money.","Now that he heard it, it was really a headache.","This was because the distance between Conglong City and the Imperial Capital was too great. If he still had his mana, it would be fine. But now that he was walking, the speed was far from what he could achieve.","Ye Qiaoxin glanced at Chu Yunfan and thought, ‘This good-for-nothing rich kid doesn’t even know the basic situation and actually tried to hit on me. He’s so stupid.’","She had seen too many of these stupid rich kids recently, and in her eyes, Chu Yunfan was no different.","“Fine,” Chu Yunfan said after some thought, “Then I’ll apply to take the alchemy apprentice assessments.”","When Ye Qiaoxin heard this, she thought that he was indeed a good-for-nothing rich man’s son. She said directly, “According to the rules here, if you want to take the senior alchemist test, you have to take the test online. May I know what level you are now?”","Hearing this, Chu Yunfan understood. He could only say, “I haven’t passed any exam yet.”","Ye Qiaoxin thought to herself, ‘He really is a good-for-nothing rich kid. A rich kid who knows nothing about alchemy dares to take the senior alchemist test. Other than the mysterious alchemy expert, becoming a senior alchemist is the limit that ordinary people can look up to.","Each of these people was a high and mighty figure in their respective regions, but this guy didn’t know anything at all.","Due to her misunderstanding of Chu Yunfan from the start, Ye Qiaoxin did not have a good impression of him. The more she thought about it, the more she felt that Chu Yunfan was just a young master who came to play around with her.","The more he acted this way, the more Ye Qiaoxin didn’t give Chu Yunfan a good look.","“In that case, there’s no way to do it,” Ye Qiaoxin said as she rolled her eyes.","“Since that’s the case, then I’ll start from the junior alchemy apprentice assessment all the way up to the senior alchemy apprentice assessment.”","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment. Things were more complicated than he had expected.","However, no one had ever been like Chu Yunfan, who wanted to become a senior alchemist from a nobody in one go.","Even the Alchemy King in Ye Qiaoxin’s memory had been tested step by step to reach the top. There was basically no one like Chu Yunfan, which was why Ye Qiaoxin thought that he was there to make fun of her.","After all, Chu Yunfan had previously said that he wanted to take the alchemy expert assessment, which was even more exaggerated.","“Then hand over ten thousand low-grade spirit stones,” Ye Qiaoxin said.","“That’s so expensive!” Chu Yunfan was stunned.","In the Spirit Realm, the price of low-grade spirit stones was not as expensive as in the Kunlun Realm, but ten thousand low-grade spirit stones were still outrageously expensive for the assessment.","“You’re not lying to me, are you?”","Seeing Chu Yunfan like this, Ye Qiaoxin was instantly furious, but her mood soon became better. ‘Who told you to act cool? You must be scared silly after hearing the fees.’","Even for an ordinary son of a rich and powerful family, ten thousand low-grade spirit stones might be his annual or even several years’ expenses. However, this wasn’t a place for ordinary people to pass time.","Ye Qiaoxin gritted her teeth and said, “You must be joking. We have a clear price list here. Take a look for yourself.”","As she spoke, Ye Qiaoxin took out a price list. From the basic apprentice to the senior alchemist assessment, it really did cost ten thousand low-grade spirit stones.","The most expensive one was the senior alchemist assessment, which cost five thousand low-grade spirit stones. The other assessments only cost five thousand low-grade spirit stones in total.","However, those who were able to take the senior alchemist test were generally very rich and did not lack money.","It was unfortunate that Chu Yunfan had encountered such a sudden change, otherwise, he wouldn’t be so embarrassed.","He thought about it for a moment. It was indeed not expensive, but if one took the assessment a few more times, the price would be quite considerable. The Alchemist Association’s money-making methods were indeed similar everywhere.","“All right, help me register,” Chu Yunfan said, “Where do I pay the fees?”","Ye Qiaoxin had originally wanted to see Chu Yunfan make a fool of himself and leave in embarrassment because he had no money. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would actually agree to it?","“You better think it through. If you don’t pass, these low-grade spirit stones will go to waste,” Ye Qiaoxin finally couldn’t help but say. Although this rich young man looked quite annoying, ten thousand low-grade spirit stones were a wealth that ordinary people couldn’t earn in their entire lives.","“I’ve thought it through. I’m saying this because I’m confident.”","Chu Yunfan had a whole new level of respect for her. He could tell that, although he did not know why Ye Qiaoxin had been hostile to her at the beginning, she had actually warned him in the end. This meant that this girl was not as bad as she looked.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s look of “don’t bother,” Ye Qiaoxin felt that her good intentions were being taken for granted.","‘Go ahead and do what you want. It’s ten thousand low-grade spirit stones anyway. Don’t cry when you go fail.","Let’s see how you’re going to clean up the mess!’","“Then please come with me,” Ye Qiaoxin said. Then, she turned around and left without even looking at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan followed behind Ye Qiaoxin. After paying the fees, he was brought to the assessment area.","There were a lot of people in the apprentice alchemist assessment area. From the beginning, there were youths who looked to be only twelve or thirteen years old, to middle-aged men who looked to be thirty or forty years old. There were all kinds of people.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder. Many people might have taken the test for apprentice alchemists since they were young, but they were still taking the test for apprentice alchemists when they were middle-aged.","Not everyone could stand out. Even if they worked as hard as others, or even harder than ordinary people, they would still not succeed.","“This is the apprentice alchemist assessment, and this is the test machine. After you wear this helmet, you’ll automatically be able to take the test. At that time, just follow the instructions and you will be fine,” Ye Qiaoxin said as she pointed at the test machine.","She looked at Chu Yunfan with some disdain in her heart. This rich playboy must have never seen a test machine before. He knew nothing about it, yet he still came to waste money.","The more she thought about it, the angrier she got. How many years would it take for her to earn ten thousand lower spirit stones? This guy used it without even blinking. He was simply too hateful.","However, to her surprise, Chu Yunfan was not unfamiliar with it. He only sighed slightly, then directly picked up the helmet next to the test machine, activated it, and put on the helmet. His movements were smooth, without a trace of unfamiliarity or sluggishness, as if he had used this test machine countless times."]},{"number":1175,"title":"Chapter 1175 The Assessment That Shocked Everyone (Part 2)","paragraphs":["1175 The Assessment That Shocked Everyone (Part 2)","Ye Qiaoxin was a little stunned. She originally wanted to see Chu Yunfan make a fool of himself and didn’t tell him what to do. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would turn on the switch with ease and put on the helmet?","Everything was so smooth and natural.","This made her a little confused. This good-for-nothing young master was not quite the same as the ones she had known before. Although his performance at the beginning was very poor, he didn’t fall flat on his face as she thought he would.","He gave away 10,000 low-grade spirit stones just like that and he also knew how to use the test machine. All of these naturally showed that Chu Yunfan was not a simple person.","Ye Qiaoxin only found out Chu Yunfan’s name when she was helping him register but she couldn’t think of any rich or powerful family’s son named Chu Yunfan. After all, Chu Yunfan’s reputation was only limited to Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. Outsiders did not know of his existence.","However, Ye Qiaoxin soon gave up the idea of continuing to investigate. Although Conglong City was not as powerful as Imperial Capital, there were countless dignitaries residing there. It was impossible for her to know everyone.","However, what she didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan was lamenting that after so many years, the test machine had not changed at all. In fact, the person who invented this test machine was no one else but the Alchemy Emperor himself.","With the Alchemy Emperor’s strong rise, after his many years of accumulation and sorting, he finally sorted out the entire alchemy Dao’s cultivation and alchemy into a system.","And this test machine was invented by the Alchemy Emperor to assess alchemy apprentices. Inside, a standardized assessment could be carried out, and a lot of time would be saved from terminating contracts.","The final assessment results would be judged by the test machine so there was no need to worry. It also put an end to some people who would randomly stretch out their hands to blackmail.","However, after so many years, the test machine had not improved at all. It was exactly the same as before, which made Chu Yunfan feel a little emotional.","After Chu Yunfan put on the helmet, the surrounding environment suddenly changed, and several lines of words appeared in his mind.","These words were none other than the questions of the assessment.","[Question 1: Please identify which one below is the Volcanic Dragon Tobacco Leaf.]","Immediately after, several pictures of medicinal herbs appeared below these words.","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. All of this was too easy for him, but he had to start from the junior alchemy apprentice assessment, the lowest level of the entire alchemist system. Of course, there was not much difficulty. He was only testing to be an apprentice so his basic skills needed to be assessed.","These were the rules set by the Alchemy Emperor, so how could Chu Yunfan not know about them?","He chose the correct answer to the Volcanic Dragon Tobacco Leaf with his mind. Sure enough, the next question quickly arrived. It was also a question about identifying medicinal herbs, which was a basic skill for an alchemist.","For Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, all of this was just a matter of convenience. As he quickly made his choices with his mind, he quickly passed the thousands of questions.","In the end, the speed at which the questions flashed by was so fast that it almost left afterimages. Ordinary junior alchemy apprentices simply couldn’t bear such a fast conversion speed, but Chu Yunfan’s own cultivation was deep. Even if it was just a flash, it was immediately captured by his eyes and completed in an instant.","All the questions were chosen within seconds, and he faced no difficulty.","Over a thousand questions. Chu Yunfan only spent a quarter of an hour completing all of them, and this was the whole junior alchemy apprentice assessment. The basic assessment was mainly about the mastery of basic knowledge, and this level of alchemist didn’t have the ability to make pills.","Ye Qiaoxin was bored to death as she waited at the side. She was very familiar with the junior alchemy apprentice assessment. Although there were only thousands of questions, there were tens of thousands of questions in the assessment library.","And this was only the basic assessment. The further the assessment went, the harder it would get. The assessment of the basic knowledge reserve would be increased by multiple times.","Those who were able to become alchemists, in the end, were basically those who were extremely knowledgeable. They were almost like a mobile alchemy knowledge bank.","It was because of this difficulty that the number of people who could take the assessment to become an alchemist was as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Many people started their journey to become junior alchemy apprentices in their teens, and by the time they were fifty or sixty years old, they still had not been able to take the assessment to become a senior alchemy apprentice, let alone a true alchemist.","They were basically destined to be apprentices for the rest of their lives.","This kind of assessment usually took a long time. With thousands of questions and thinking time, it was normal to take a few hours.","And she was Chu Yunfan’s server so she could only wait here. In the entire Alchemist Association, there were many servers like her. However, just as she was feeling bored, she saw Chu Yunfan suddenly take off his helmet.","Ye Qiaoxin was stunned. It had ended so quickly?","‘He must have backed out. No matter how rich he was, even if he had come into contact with the test machine, so what? He can pretend to be someone else, but he can’t pretend to be someone with knowledge. If he knows, he knows. If he doesn’t, he doesn’t.","‘Only now does he realize that he has to back off. Tens of thousands of low-grade spirit stones were gone just like that.’","Ye Qiaoxin’s heart twitched at the thought of the tens of thousands of low-grade spirit stones. They had been wasted by this rich young man. If they had been given to her, she would have retired immediately.","As Ye Qiaoxin thought about this, she immediately stepped forward and said, “You’re giving up? I hope you now understand how difficult alchemy is.”","Just as Ye Qiaoxin was about to criticize Chu Yunfan a little more, she suddenly saw a light screen appear above the test machine. On the light screen, some of Chu Yunfan’s assessment information was recorded.","Name: Chu Yunfan","[Assessment Level: intermediate alchemy apprentice]","[Assessment Result: full marks]","Ye Qiaoxin was completely dumbfounded when she saw the information on the screen. She couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan had gotten a full score.","According to the rules of the Alchemist Association, only ten out of a thousand questions were allowed to be wrong, but in fact, even if one memorized well, the average person would get a few questions wrong. There were very few people who got all of them right.","However, there were still people who got full scores. Since ancient times, there were many people who could get all ten correct. There were always some people who were geniuses with extraordinary memories.","But what really made her completely dumbfounded was that Chu Yunfan only used fifteen minutes to answer all the questions.","With a thousand questions, Chu Yunfan could answer them within seconds. He didn’t take any time to think and completed them by instinct. He also read the questions at a speed of ten lines at a glance.","In such a short time, most people wouldn’t even have finished reading one-tenth of the questions."]},{"number":1176,"title":"Chapter 1176 The Assessment That Shocked Everyone (Part 3)","paragraphs":["1176 The Assessment That Shocked Everyone (Part 3)","In just 15 minutes, Chu Yunfan had already completed all the questions. This was the most terrifying part.","Ye Qiaoxin immediately suspected that the machine was broken. It must be broken. Otherwise, how could Chu Yunfan finish all the questions in fifteen minutes?","One had to know that before this, the fastest person had taken an hour to finish the assessment. Even so, it had already caused a huge sensation. Although it was only an assessment of basic skills, these basic skills were the most important. Among all alchemists, the foundation was the foundation.","“All right, I passed,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes...” Ye Qiaoxin nodded in confusion. Although she was unwilling to admit it, she could only admit that Chu Yunfan had indeed completed the assessment for the junior alchemy apprentice.","However, looking at the smile on Chu Yunfan’s face, it was a little annoying. Didn’t he just pass the basic junior alchemy apprentice assessment?","A ten-year-old child had passed the exam. What was there to be surprised about?","However, she had to admit that she was starting to look at Chu Yunfan in a different light. This rich playboy did not seem as ignorant and stupid as she had thought.","Although some people passed the exam at a very young age, they received extremely strict training when they were young. The path they took was blocked, and it was difficult to come out and compare directly.","“I’d like to continue the assessment,” Chu Yunfan said.","“You really want to continue? The difficulty of the following questions is even greater. It’s still a thousand questions but the difficulty is at least several times greater!” Ye Qiaoxin couldn’t help but remind him.","“It’s nothing,” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","Seeing Chu Yunfan so insistent, Ye Qiaoxin could only roll her eyes. If a junior alchemy apprentice could pass by memorizing, then an intermediate alchemy apprentice could not pass.","The question bank behind it was at least a few times more difficult than the junior alchemy apprentice test. Most importantly, there was also a pill-making test.","Although it was only a simple test for a few types of medicinal pills, it made many people shrink back. It was very normal for some people to spend ten years completing this step from a junior to an intermediate alchemy apprentice.","However, it was obvious that she had underestimated Chu Yunfan. To Chu Yunfan, this kind of question was not difficult at all. It was a thousand questions. The real difficulty was that the scope of the questions was several times wider than that of the junior alchemy apprentice assessment. The difficulty here was multiplied.","However, it wasn’t difficult for Chu Yunfan. He still read and answered in seconds. In just 15 minutes, he had completed the test.","Unlike before, it didn’t end immediately. Chu Yunfan’s mind flickered and he appeared in an alchemy lab.","One had to follow the instructions and make a few basic medicinal pills such as the Qi Replenishing Pill. This test would be graded according to the examinee’s completion rate.","Another fifteen minutes passed. This time, Ye Qiaoxin was not as bored as before. In her heart, she hoped that Chu Yunfan would create a miracle.","Chu Yunfan didn’t disappoint her. When it was time, he took off his helmet. Ye Qiaoxin quickly walked over. This time, she didn’t say that Chu Yunfan must have failed the exam and ended early.","Chu Yunfan had just slapped her in the face with his score earlier, and she still felt a burning pain.","Sure enough, not long after Chu Yunfan took off his helmet, a screen appeared on the test machine.","[Name: Chu Yunfan]","[Assessment Level: intermediate alchemy apprentice]","[Assessment result: full marks]","Full marks! Full marks again!","Ye Qiaoxin’s eyes widened in disbelief. She could not believe that Chu Yunfan would get another full score.","It was an incredible miracle!","One had to know that in addition to the objective questionnaire, there was also a practical pill-making test.","It was already amazing enough that he could answer thousands of questions correctly. This was at least several times more difficult than the junior alchemy apprentice assessment, but Chu Yunfan did not make a single mistake.","The most ridiculous thing was that Chu Yunfan had not made a single mistake in his alchemy technique. His control of time had reached a perfect level so he could get full marks.","Because they were making pills in the virtual world, of course, they could not produce the results. There was no need to wait until the pills were out of the oven before they could be judged. Basically, they were judged through various techniques, control of the fire, and so on.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t make any mistakes. How was this possible?","Even if a real alchemist were to take the assessment, it would be very difficult not to make a single mistake, even if it was a very common pill.","Generally speaking, even if the method was the same, if one’s hand trembled, the effect of the pill produced would be different. This was also the way to distinguish the strength of different alchemists.","And Chu Yunfan was clearly at the peak of this aspect.","“Looks like there’s no problem. All right, I’ll continue with the assessment.” Chu Yunfan put the helmet on for the third time for the next round of assessment.","This time, Ye Qiaoxin had no intention of stopping Chu Yunfan. He had slapped her in the face twice in a row, making her realize how wrong her previous thoughts were. At least Chu Yunfan wasn’t the kind of playboy young master she thought he was that was just trying to hit on her because he had a lot of money.","Chu Yunfan did indeed have the right to take the assessment. Even if he was not young for the first assessment, his results were still very shocking.","‘Is he planning to pass all the apprentice alchemist assessments with full marks?!’ Ye Qiaoxin thought in shock.","Chu Yunfan passed the first two assessments with full marks. This proved that he was not an ordinary person. She didn’t know which shocking faction he was from.","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s expression, he must be quite confident. If he could really do it, he would probably create a record and cause a sensation.","One was the record of full marks, and the other was the record of the one who completed the assessments within the fastest time.","If he could really do all of them, it would be unprecedented. At the very least, she had never heard of anyone who could reach this level before, and the headquarters had never heard of it either.","Time flew by as she was lost in her thoughts. When she came back to her senses, she found that Chu Yunfan had already completed the assessment.","The screen above the test machine showed that he had got full marks score. Another perfect score!","Chu Yunfan actually did it. It was a grand slam!"]},{"number":1177,"title":"Chapter 1177 An Unprecedented Achievement","paragraphs":["1177 An Unprecedented Achievement","A true grand slam!","This was probably the first time anyone had passed the apprentice alchemist assessments with full marks!","Ye Qiaoxin didn’t know if there had been such a person before, but it was obvious that even if there was, it would not be as shocking as Chu Yunfan. Because even if there was a grand slam, not all three assessments would be completed in just a day.","Therefore, this record was very likely to be the true peak that others could not hope to reach.","At some point in time, many people who were taking the assessment or were in charge of guiding those receiving them had surrounded Chu Yunfan and Ye Qiaoxin.","Chu Yunfan might have become the grand slam that broke the record. At the beginning of the assessment, it did not attract much attention because everyone was busy with their own assessment. But soon, Chu Yunfan’s situation attracted the attention of many people.","Full marks!","Full marks again!","Three full marks!","Grand slam!","Those who were wearing apprentice alchemist robs all looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. How could anyone pass three assessments in a row? They were also examinees so they knew how difficult it was.","It was simply an impossible miracle!","Taking the assessments three times in a row was already an incredible thing, not to mention getting full marks every time.","They were very familiar with the test machine. It was not the first time for many of them to take the assessment. The number of questions was also very shocking. The assessment of the knowledge reserve of the potential apprentice was simply abnormal.","However, what was truly surprising was the pill-making part. If all the questions were answered correctly, it could be said that it was purely because of his good memory. However, there was actually no mistake in his operation. This was the most terrifying thing.","Even though there was a standard procedure for all the operations of an alchemist, humans were not machines. When to add herbs, what kind of heat was the most suitable, and so on, all of them had to be judged by experience.","And Chu Yunfan had no problem with it at all.","If they didn’t know that the test machine couldn’t be wrong, they would have thought that the machine must have made a mistake. Otherwise, how could there be such a ridiculous result?","Now, Chu Yunfan, who was dressed in a black robe, seemed to be shrouded in a layer of fog in their eyes.","“How can someone get full marks? Full marks!”","“It’s already not easy to get full marks once. How can he get full marks three times in a row?”","“Is he a monster? He didn’t make any mistakes.”","“What inheritance does he have? Why haven’t I heard of it before?”","Everyone started discussing. However, the news that Chu Yunfan had passed three rounds in a row and obtained full marks three times in a row, breaking the record of the shortest assessment time, quickly spread throughout this branch of the Alchemist Association.","Chu Yunfan was already used to being the center of attention so he didn’t care. He just said to Ye Qiaoxin indifferently, “Next, I want to take the official alchemist assessment. Bring me there.”","He knew that this test machine was only used to assess apprentice alchemists. There should be more advanced machines to assess true alchemists.","Chu Yunfan glanced around and didn’t see such a high-level test machine. He knew that the real assessment location wasn’t there.","“Oh, okay!”","Ye Qiaoxin finally came back to her senses. She was still immersed in the fact that Chu Yunfan had obtained three grand slam scores. It was still unbelievable.","She didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it but it was clear that her initial judgment must have been a huge mistake.","He was definitely not a good-for-nothing son who wasted money just to hit on her. He really wanted to take the alchemist assessment. His level was not something that she could judge.","However, it was clear that three perfect scores and a grand slam score were enough to explain everything.","Everyone knew that it was impossible to pass the senior alchemy apprentice assessment by luck. Behind it was hundreds of thousands of question banks, covering a wide range. It covered all the basic knowledge of alchemy. If one did not understand the limits, it was impossible to pass, let alone pass with full marks.","At this moment, Ye Qiaoxin thought of Chu Yunfan’s big talk when he first came. He wanted to take the alchemy expert assessment from the get-go. At that time, he looked arrogant and looked like he did not know the immensity of heaven and earth.","However, now that he had a grand slam record, Chu Yunfan’s words seemed to be more credible. At least no one would say that he didn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth.","Perhaps he really could become an alchemy expert?","Ye Qiaoxin thought of this, but she quickly shook her head and threw this thought out of her mind. How was this possible? That was an alchemy expert. An existence that was rare in the Great Wei Kingdom.","It could be said that they were rare figures who did not need to bow to the emperor. All the dignitaries had to treat them respectfully as distinguished guests. Which one of them was not in their seventies or eighties? Looking at Chu Yunfan’s age, it was impossible.","Thinking of this, Ye Qiaoxin felt much better. Otherwise, if an alchemy expert really appeared under her hospitality, she felt that her heart would explode.","“What? He plans on becoming an official alchemist!”","Seeing Chu Yunfan and Ye Qiaoxin leave, many people finally reacted. It was as if a pot had exploded, and they all exclaimed incredulously.","“No way. He has already passed the assessment of an apprentice alchemist in one go. This has never happened before, and in the next thousand years, no one will be able to break his record. Could it be that he is planning to create a record that is impossible to break?” someone exclaimed.","By now, Chu Yunfan’s assessment time was no longer a secret. While many people could not finish even one assessment in that timeframe, Chu Yunfan had already completed three. And now, he was going on to take the official alchemist assessment. If he passed the assessment, he might create a record that no one in the future could compete with.","This didn’t mean that they felt that there was no one in the world who could make pills better than Chu Yunfan, but could those alchemy experts turn back time and take the assessment again just to break Chu Yunfan’s record?","“Let’s go, let’s go. We have to watch it. If he’s sincere, it might be a new record!”","“I don’t believe that he can do it. If he underestimates the difficulty of the alchemist assessment, he’ll be badly injured!” someone suddenly thought of something and exclaimed.","“Have you forgotten? That so-called number one alchemy genius, Bai Shengzu, is also here. Isn’t he going to compete with our number one alchemy genius, Jiang Lan’er, of Conglong City? It seems that the time of the competition is today!”"]},{"number":1178,"title":"Chapter 1178 The Shock of the Alchemy Association President","paragraphs":["1178 The Shock of the Alchemy Association President","Only now did many people recall that this was indeed the case.","In recent years, two alchemy geniuses of similar age had appeared in the Great Wei Kingdom. One was Bai Shengzu from Imperial Capital, and the other was Jiang Lan’er from Conglong City. One was from the South, and the other was from the North. Recently, they had attracted a lot of attention.","There were even rumors that alchemy experts had said that these two people had the potential to become alchemy experts in the future, and it wouldn’t take much time.","For a time, these two people became famous. Because they were of similar age and were both outstanding in the same field, they were embroiled in competition with one another. One became a junior alchemy apprentice first and the other became an intermediate alchemy apprentice first after that.","!!","In the past few years, the two sides had competed in various fields more than once or twice.","When Jiang Lan’er announced that she wanted to take the official alchemist assessment, Bai Shengzu unexpectedly also said that he wanted to take the official alchemist assessment. He also issued a challenge to Jiang Lan’er, using the junior alchemist assessment as the content of the competition.","For a time, the battle between the two sides attracted the attention of many people. It caused a huge wave among the alchemists because the two represented the future. In the foreseeable future, the two of them were very likely to become alchemy experts. Their future was limitless.","In the office of the branch president of the Alchemist Association, a man in his sixties was sitting in front of a table and marking documents.","This person was none other than the Alchemist Association’s Conglong City branch president, Kong Buyi. As the president of the Conglong City branch, the things he had to deal with every day were much more complicated than many people imagined.","Even though it was his disciple, Jiang Lan’er, who was applying for the official alchemist assessment today, he did not go down to watch. In a place like Conglong City, he was the pinnacle figure of the alchemy world. If he hadn’t carefully nurtured Jiang Lan’er since she was young, it would have been impossible for her to have such achievements at such a young age.","He was proud to have such a disciple from the bottom of his heart. After all, the alchemy field in Conglong City was far less intense than in Imperial Capital. In the capital, there were alchemy experts holding down the fort. The gap between him and the alchemy experts could not be measured.","However, under such circumstances, he had nurtured a disciple who could compete with the geniuses of the capital. In the future, there was a very high chance that she would become an alchemy expert. This was also enough to make him feel satisfied for the rest of his life.","Although he had no hope of he himself becoming an alchemy expert in this lifetime, his disciple would become an alchemy expert.","Kong Buyi was very clear about Jiang Lan’er’s strengths. In fact, she already had the ability to pass the entrance assessment to become a junior alchemist a few years ago. However, he had held her back, constantly grinding away her edges and corners, constantly strengthening her foundation.","It wasn’t a problem for her to become an alchemist. The key was what kind of results she would get in. Even if her opponent was that genius from the capital, Bai Shengzu, Kong Buyi wasn’t worried.","However, he didn’t go down to cheer for her to not cause any pressure. After all, Bai Shengzu’s master wasn’t there personally. If he went and if Bai Shengzu lost, he would inevitably be accused of adding extra pressure.","He felt that this statement was simply bullsh*t. The problems that alchemists had to face and deal with in the process of making pills were too numerous to count. How far could a person who couldn’t even resolve this little pressure go in the future?","However, rumors were still terrifying.","Suddenly, hurried footsteps came from the corridor outside. Then, a tall middle-aged man pushed open the door and walked in.","“Elder Xu, what’s wrong?” Kong Buyi did not even raise his head, but he had already guessed the identity of the person who came. It was the elder of the Alchemist Association, Elder Xu.","“President, take a look at this!” Elder Xu hurriedly handed a document to Kong Buyi.","“What’s wrong? What document is so urgent?” Kong Buyi was a little puzzled. One had to know that Elder Xu was not a rash person.","“Sir, you’ll understand once you take a look! ” Elder Xu said excitedly.","Kong Buyi was curious when he saw Elder Xu’s excitement. He immediately looked at the document. However, his glassy eyes suddenly lit up.","Within a day, Chu Yunfan had consecutively passed the junior, intermediate, and senior alchemy apprentice assessments.","Kong Buyi did not find this part strange. To be honest, if he had not been suppressing Jiang Lan’er and allowed her to participate in the assessment, she could have completed all the assessments in one day.","This was nothing. He even felt that this kind of action was simply sensationalizing. He was probably crazy about breaking some record.","Since ancient times, how many of those so-called geniuses who had broken all kinds of records had made it to the end?","And those who made it to the end were mostly people who were down-to-earth and took one step at a time.","Kong Buyi looked like he was in his sixties or seventies, but in reality, he was already over a hundred years old. It was just that his Divine cultivation base had greatly extended his lifespan. A brilliant alchemist was also a powerful cultivator. This was an eternal law. He had seen too many geniuses in his life, and countless of them had fallen.","In this world, the strong were respected, not the geniuses. If a genius could not grow to the level of a strong person, he could die at any time. The trees in the forest would be destroyed by the wind. This principle had existed since ancient times.","Therefore, in his opinion, Chu Yunfan’s behavior was simply sensationalizing. Of course, this should not be Chu Yunfan’s own action, but the arrangement of the master behind him.","Kong Buyi knew that some people from alchemy sects liked to play this kind of trick. No matter how Chu Yunfan did it, he must have had the support of a powerful sect to take three assessments in one day. He knew all too well that the rise of any genius represented the support of a force or even a huge power. Wild geniuses simply did not exist.","However, when he continued to read the report, his breathing suddenly became rapid. This Chu Yunfan not only took three assessments in a row, but he also scored full marks in all three.","Full marks for all of them.","This made Kong Buyi somewhat stunned. Even his favorite disciple, Jiang Lan’er, had not achieved this. She only got full marks for the first round. There would always be some flaws in the second and third rounds.","Those small flaws were not a big problem in reality so he never cared about such problems. He would slowly improve them in the future. However, even if he were to personally take the test, it would be difficult to say that he would be able to achieve a perfect score for three rounds.","And when Kong Buyi saw the time Chu Yunfan took, he immediately understood that he could not do what Chu Yunfan had done.","What kind of joke was this? Three tests only took an hour. That was simply impossible.","If it was him, using one hour for one round was already very fast. One hour for three rounds was simply a joke.","The test machine was broken. It must be."]},{"number":1179,"title":"Chapter 1179 Granstanding? This Visitor Is up to No Good!","paragraphs":["1179 Granstanding? This Visitor Is up to No Good!","Kong Buyi’s first reaction was that the test machine must be broken. Otherwise, how could such ridiculous statistics appear?","If one wanted to complete all the tests in an hour, what kind of situation would one need to be in? They probably did not think about it and completed all the steps at an extremely fast speed.","But this had to be done without thinking. Only then could one achieve such a result.","However, this was in conflict with his previous full marks. One could not complete all the questions without thinking, let alone making pills. Every step required extremely strong control—accurate to the second. This kind of control could not be completed without thinking.","If they had made it countless times before, they would be able to form this kind of instinct, or their cultivation level far exceeded that of an alchemy expert. Only then would it be possible to do this.","These things didn’t make sense no matter how one looked at it, especially when all these illogical things were stacked together.","“Have you double-checked it? There’s no problem with the test machine? Did something go wrong?” Kong Buyi asked as he frowned.","Elder Xu revealed a bitter smile. He thought that he knew what President Kong was suspecting. When he received the report, his first reaction was also complete disbelief.","What a joke. It was simply a joke.","No matter how one looked at it, these things were unbelievable.","Therefore, the first thing he did was verify the matter. In the end, he realized that there was actually such a thing. Moreover, the test machine was not broken.","This was the most embarrassing part. He thought that no one could do it and even point out a few unreasonable parts. In the end, who knew that the other party actually did it?","This meant that what he had thought before was wrong.","Elder Xu smiled bitterly and said, “I checked the test machine. There’s no problem at all. Moreover, the machine has been used for so many years, and I haven’t heard of any problems. I’m afraid we’ve really encountered an extraordinary genius!","“Moreover, from the image recorded by the projection stone, it isn’t his first time coming into contact with the machine. I’m guessing that he might be the successor of some great alchemy sect. He probably stepped forward now to amaze everyone with a single feat!” Elder Xu speculated.","Kong Buyi nodded. This statement was reasonable. In fact, this kind of thing was not the first or second time. If an alchemy sect wanted to cultivate, they could not do without wealth, magic, and land. They also had to obtain the support of secular nobles in order to smoothly develop and grow.","As a result, many alchemy sects would choose to let their disciples become famous through this method. This was also the most common method. What could be more eye-catching than a genius?","“That must be it.” Kong Buyi frowned, but he did not like this method. It was too unconventional.","“And I heard that after he finished the senior alchemy apprentice assessment, he went on to take the official junior alchemist assessment. Now that Bai Shengzu and Lan’er are preparing to compete, could he be here for today’s competition?” President Xu voiced his guess.","Kong Buyi’s expression was also a little ugly. This was not impossible. Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er were alchemy geniuses who had risen to fame in the Great Wei Country in recent years. If Chu Yunfan could successfully defeat these two in today’s battle, it was completely imaginable that his reputation would immediately rise.","As long as he was willing, he could quickly become the most dazzling alchemy star.","Although it was another matter of whether he could do it or not, with his strength from today’s three consecutive assessments, it was not impossible. If he did not have a diamond in the rough, he would not take on this porcelain job.","The more he thought about it, the more Kong Buyi felt that Chu Yunfan must have come prepared.","Chu Yunfan’s goal was clearly to step on the shoulders of the two geniuses of the Great Wei Kingdom.","“Hmph, let’s go and take a look. I want to see who this person is.” Kong Buyi coldly snorted.","At this moment, many people had already gathered in the official alchemist assessment venue. The vast majority of them were alchemists. These people were all wearing long robes with the Alchemist Association’s logo. They all looked at the two people on the stage.","A man who looked to be in his twenties was dressed in a long, embroidered robe. He had an outstanding aura and just by standing there, he was extremely confident, attracting the attention of countless people.","On the other side, there was a woman who looked about twenty years old. She was wearing a long blue dress that outlined her curvaceous figure.","The two of them faced each other in the arena. In this official alchemist assessment venue that could originally accommodate ten people at the same time, only these two people were standing in there.","The other senior alchemy apprentices who wanted to take the official alchemist assessment had all changed the date of their application to avoid the limelight of these two.","Everyone knew that these two people had been famous for many years and were also famous young geniuses.","Many people said that they already had the strength of an official alchemist, but they were not willing to try it easily. Instead, they wanted to become an official alchemist with the best results. This was also one of the contents of the competition between the two.","Today was the day of the decisive battle between the two. If anyone else appeared at this time, they would only become cannon fodder for the two.","After all, most people only pursued passing grades. As long as they passed, they could become an official alchemist. Once they successfully obtained the certification, their entire life would undergo a huge change.","Alchemy apprentices were only a step away from becoming alchemists, but the gap between them was like the difference between heaven and earth. Alchemy apprentices, even high-leveled ones, were common in Conglong City, but official alchemists were less than one-tenth of this number. Every official alchemist was a distinguished guest of various forces.","From the moment one broke through, one would successfully become a member of the upper class of Conglong City. Even if they only passed with a passing grade, it would be worth celebrating for the rest of their lives.","However, these two people were clearly different. Both of them came for the sake of improving their results. Their goal was to be number one.","Taking the assessment with these two people would probably only be a blow to their bodies, so everyone temporarily avoided the edge.","At this moment, there were only these two people who were the main characters in the scene. However, soon, the crowd, whose eyes were originally only on the two of them, suddenly began to stir.","Many people began to communicate in low voices.","“What? Someone scored full marks for three consecutive assessments? A grand slam?”","“How is that possible? How can someone have a grand slam?!”","“Are you kidding me? The time taken added together didn’t even exceed an hour? You must be joking.”","The crowd gradually became restless, and the range of this commotion became larger and larger."]},{"number":1180,"title":"Chapter 1180 Everyone Was Dumbfounded","paragraphs":["1180 Everyone Was Dumbfounded","As the news of the situation in the other assessment hall spread, the commotion in the crowd became more and more intense. It was so intense that even the two people who were confronting each other on the stage sensed that something was wrong.","Soon, they knew what the problem was. They saw a young man in black walking in. Beside him was a young and beautiful woman. Not far from him, a group of people followed him in.","Everyone’s gaze fell on these people, but they quickly understood that the young man in black who was leading them should be the person who had just got the grand slam.","“It’s him? He looks very young too.”","“He is indeed very young. He looks to be at most twenty years old.”","“Another young genius?”","“Young people nowadays are really more powerful than the last!”","Chu Yunfan walked into the hall and found that it was already crowded with people. It seemed that only two people had applied for the assessment.","“Ah!” Ye Qiaoxin exclaimed. She suddenly remembered that Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er were going to fight here today.","Or rather, she was completely shocked by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing performance and had only just recalled the battle between Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er.","“Do you want us to change it to another day?” Ye Qiaoxin asked then told Chu Yunfan about the fight between the two of them.","Now that everyone had changed the time of the application for the assessment, it was natural to give way to the two of them. Many people also wanted to know who was more powerful between the two.","Only then did Chu Yunfan know that such a thing actually happened. However, he immediately said, “No, today is fine. I don’t have that much time.”","Chu Yunfan’s time was very tight. He had to plan his every day so he didn’t have that much time to waste here.","Besides, what did their plan have to do with him?","Chu Yunfan’s words, in Ye Qiaoxin’s ears, must have raised the idea of comparison. Although Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er were very famous, from today’s situation, Chu Yunfan’s achievements in alchemy would not be worse than these two.","It was even very likely that Chu Yunfan had chosen to come today because of these two.","If Chu Yunfan knew what Ye Qiaoxin was thinking, he would not know whether to laugh or cry. He had not chosen the time at all. Even if he had come by coincidence, he would not have known who Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er were.","Besides, even if he knew, he didn’t care, nor did he want to compete with the two of them. In the eyes of others, perhaps Chu Yunfan was enough to compete with the two geniuses, but in his eyes, these two people were not enough to compete with him, and he had no intention of competing.","Chu Yunfan strode in. Bai Shengzu stepped forward and said, “Who are you? Don’t you know that we’ve booked this place today?”","“Oh? I didn’t know that the Alchemist Association had turned into a restaurant and could actually be booked.” Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him and went straight to an advanced test machine.","“Why you...” Bai Shengzu was at a loss for words. The reason why this situation occurred was that everyone had deliberately avoided and retreated, but that didn’t mean that others couldn’t take the assessment in the same round.","At this time, the two people from behind the stage ran out from the side and told them about Chu Yunfan.","The two of them looked at Chu Yunfan in shock. A grand slam. This was a result they didn’t have. Of course, they didn’t think that Chu Yunfan was very good. If they were to take the assessment now, they would also have a high chance of getting a grand slam.","Chu Yunfan had only delayed applying for the assessment and only wanted to show up today to amaze everyone.","“So you also have some backing.” Bai Shengzu, who now knew the whole story, stepped forward and glanced at Chu Yunfan.","“But don’t think that a grand slam is so great. We can do it too. We just don’t want to cause a scene.”","On the other side, Jiang Lan’er also looked at Chu Yunfan with an unfriendly expression. She also thought that he had chosen to come at this time to provoke them.","Even if Chu Yunfan was covered in mouths, he couldn’t explain it clearly. Moreover, he didn’t intend to explain himself.","Chu Yunfan’s mouth twitched slightly, but he couldn’t be bothered.","Suddenly, the crowd became restless again. The branch president of the Alchemist Association from Conglong City, Kong Buyi, strode in.","“Why is the president here?”","“The president has also been alerted!”","“Looks like this battle is not simple!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, and Jiang Lan’er was similarly dumbstruck. She had clearly heard her master say before that he would not appear because he did not want to give some people in the capital any leverage.","But now, he had unexpectedly appeared. And it was clearly not because of her. It could only be because of this guy who had suddenly appeared.","“Can we start now? If you don’t start, I’ll go first,” Chu Yunfan said directly. He was too lazy to wait for them, and he had no intention of competing. That was just a boring guess by others.","Kong Buyi didn’t like Chu Yunfan’s words, but he didn’t say anything. Instead, he said directly, “I’m just here to observe. Don’t be nervous, everyone. Go ahead and start.”","Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er quickly took their places in front of the advanced test machines.","The three of them entered the assessment state almost at the same time. No one said anything more.","When he entered the assessment space, Chu Yunfan realized that the questions had been reduced to five hundred, but the difficulty had increased a lot. This was because the content of these assessments had changed from basic content such as seeing pictures and identifying herbs to writing down the specific effects of these herbs, how many kinds of pills could be used, and so on. The difficulty was completely different from that of an advanced alchemy apprentice.","It was completely different.","Therefore, many alchemy apprentices would never be able to pass the senior alchemist level in their entire lives. The difficulty of the assessment increased exponentially.","Of course, this might be a problem for others, but for Chu Yunfan, it was not difficult at all. In fact, the answers he could answer far exceeded the scope of the question bank of the test machine.","After answering the questions, it was soon time for the pill-making segment. Compared to a senior alchemy apprentice, the difficulty of making pills for a junior alchemist was several times higher, and the number of pills had increased to dozens.","If all of this were done in the real world, who knew how long it would take to complete? However, in the advanced test machine, it could be completed quickly.","This was also the fundamental purpose of the Alchemy Emperor creating the test machine back then.","As time passed, two hours passed under everyone’s watchful eyes. When many people began to feel bored, Chu Yunfan suddenly took off his helmet.","Everyone’s eyes widened. He had finished the assessment?"]},{"number":1181,"title":"Chapter 1181 Another Full Score, the Challenge of a Genius!","paragraphs":["1181 Another Full Score, the Challenge of a Genius!","Even Kong Buyi, who was waiting for the results, turned his gaze over. It had only been two hours, and Chu Yunfan had already finished the whole assessment?","Just like how he completed the alchemy apprentice assessments with such astonishing speed?","Sure enough, not long after, a screen appeared on the advanced test machine and displayed Chu Yunfan’s results.","Full marks! It was another full marks!","Instantly, the entire place was in an uproar.","Full marks! Full marks again!","Even those who followed Chu Yunfan here had not expected him to complete the junior alchemist assessment at such an astonishing speed. Moreover, he scored full marks again.","“Did he really not make any mistakes?”","“Is thay advanced test machine broken?”","“Among the three of them, this person actually finished the assessment first!”","Everyone was in an uproar. Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er, whom they had thought highly of, were actually no match for Chu Yunfan. They had been completely defeated.","The winner had already been decided. Even if the two of them also got full marks, so what? In terms of speed alone, they were already more than a level lower than Chu Yunfan.","This had happened in front of everyone, so there was no possibility of cheating.","This time, even Kong Buyi and Elder Xu were somewhat stunned. The two of them looked at each other. Chu Yunfan had managed to get full marks again.","Their previous predictions were completely wrong. Chu Yunfan’s strength was far stronger than they had imagined, and it was not just a little bit stronger.","From Kong Buyi’s understanding of his own disciple, it was definitely impossible for her to complete the assessment so quickly. This victory was not just by a small margin.","If it was before, Kong Buyi would have suspected that the advanced test machine was broken. But now, he no longer suspected it. What a joke. If this advanced test machine was broken, could it be that the previous one was also broken?","The only possibility was that Chu Yunfan really had such strength.","“Find out who this Chu Yunfan is. Now!” Kong Buyi had a feeling that Chu Yunfan’s strength was definitely not limited to this. In addition to the news he had received earlier, Chu Yunfan had actually applied to become a senior alchemist today. Now, it seemed that this was not impossible.","If Chu Yunfan really made it, wouldn’t he be on equal footing with him?","Thinking of this, Kong Buyi was eager to know who Chu Yunfan and the force behind him were.","“Yes, President.” Elder Xu quickly accepted the order.","Chu Yunfan looked at the results displayed on the screen and nodded in satisfaction. No one knew the advanced test machine better than him so it was only natural.","Immediately, he stretched out his hand and said, “Now that I’m done with the assessment, can I apply for the intermediate alchemist assessment?”","Everyone was in an uproar again. Was Chu Yunfan planning on getting into the senior alchemist class? Within a day, he had taken all the alchemy apprentice assessments and was now going to take the intermediate alchemist assessment.","However, no one dared to say with certainty that Chu Yunfan did not have such strength. Many people were even a little excited!","“All the previous assessments could be completed in the test machine, but an intermediate alchemist actually has to make pills. At that time, we can see how he makes the pills and how he completes the process so quickly!”","“That’s right. We’ll be able to see his true colors then.”","“Perhaps we’ll witness a miracle.”","Faced with Chu Yunfan’s request, Kong Buyi said, “Don’t be anxious. The intermediate alchemist assessment requires one to make pills in the real world. I’ll get someone to prepare the venue as well as the medicinal herbs needed for the assessment. It will take some time.”","“All right.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Kong Buyi took a step forward and said, “The intermediate alchemist assessment is not a written test, but an assessment of one’s ability to make pills. After the first few rounds of the test, these basic questions are no longer meaningful. The real test is your ability to make pills. When the time comes, you’ll have to draw from a batch of pre-prepared pill recipes and make a pill according to what’s written on it. If you pass, you’ll become an intermediate alchemist.”","“I understand.” Chu Yunfan nodded. This assessment tested the alchemist’s ability to adapt on the spot. No one person had ever seen every type of pill before, and neither have they made every type. This assessment was about basic skills.","“Please forgive me for being presumptuous. May I know where you come from, my friend? I, Kong Buyi, have a wide network of friends. I might even know your master!” Kong Buyi asked directly.","He wanted to know where Chu Yunfan came from. However, judging from Chu Yunfan’s performance, even if he could compare to Chu Yunfan now, Chu Yunfan would surely shoulder to shoulder with him in the future, or even surpass him.","Therefore, he did not dare to treat Chu Yunfan as a junior.","“I don’t belong to any sect. I rely on self-study,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Kong Buyi was about to curse. No sect? Self-taught talent? Who are you trying to fool?","Alchemists were more reliant on wealth than ordinary martial artists. To be able to have such achievements at this age, he surely was lying.","But seeing that Chu Yunfan was unwilling to divulge any information, Kong Buyi could only drop the matter. However, he was now even more certain that he had to find out about Chu Yunfan’s background.","After another hour, Jiang Lan’er had completed all the tests. At almost the same time, Bai Shengzu also finished. The two of them took off their helmets at the same time. However, when they saw Chu Yunfan, who had already completed the test, their expressions changed.","In the end, they had lost in terms of speed.","When they saw their own results, they saw that they had both got scoring of excellent. Their faces revealed a satisfied smile. This level was already much more powerful than many old alchemists, and it also represented their highest level.","But then they saw Chu Yunfan’s results, they realized that he had scored full marks.","“How can it be full marks? That’s impossible!”","Bai Shengzu was the first to express disbelief. Even if his work was considered excellent, Chu Yunfan had gotten full marks. He knew how difficult it was after experiencing the same test. It was precisely because of this that he did not believe that anyone could get full marks. It was simply a joke.","“The test machine must be broken!” Bai Shengzu couldn’t believe that he had lost. Even Jiang Lan’er couldn’t defeat him.","At this moment, everyone looked at Bai Shengzu, who had lost his composure, and revealed ugly expressions. Since many of them were from the Alchemist Association, their expressions were even more unfriendly at this moment.","Jiang Lan’er’s face was also filled with disbelief. Then, she heard that Chu Yunfan wanted to take the intermediate alchemist assessment. She immediately made a decision.","“I too want to apply for the intermediate alchemist assessment.”","“That’s right, I also want to apply for the intermediate alchemist assessment. Chu Yunfan, do you dare to accept the challenge?”"]},{"number":1182,"title":"Chapter 1182 Stupid, That Isn’t the Way to Make Pills!","paragraphs":["1182 Stupid, That Isn’t the Way to Make Pills!","The two great geniuses actually applied for the intermediate alchemist assessment one after another, instantly causing an uproar.","They had clearly been provoked by Chu Yunfan’s results. They were defeated by him this time, but they were unwilling to accept it. They wanted to fight Chu Yunfan again.","Everyone was in an uproar.","“Do they already have the strength to become intermediate alchemists?”","“Isn’t this too forced?”","“That’s great! Another confrontation between the three geniuses!”","“Today will go down in the history books. It’s a scene that will be difficult to reproduce!”","On top of Chu Yunfan’s continuous skipping of grades in a day, there was also the gimmick of two geniuses challenging each other. Many people felt that they had not come in vain today. It was a good thing they had come. Otherwise, it would have been a pity.","“Nonsense!” Kong Buyi’s first reaction was that they were messing around. If this wasn’t anger, then what was? However, seeing Jiang Lan’er’s determined expression and Bai Shengzu’s similarly unwavering look, he knew that if the three of them didn’t have another match, the two of them would probably be unwilling.","In the end, Kong Buyi could only acquiesce.","Facing Bai Shengzu’s interrogation, Chu Yunfan smiled faintly and said, “Whatever.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t care. He did not think anything of Bai Shengzu.","This made Bai Shengzu furious. This was blatant contempt.","Soon, the venue for the intermediate alchemist assessment was ready. Everyone quickly moved to the huge alchemy lab.","In the alchemy lab, there were five huge alchemical furnaces scattered around. Usually, this place was used as an ordinary alchemy lab because only a very small portion of people could pass the junior alchemist assessment. Those who went to take the intermediate assessment were even rarer.","Therefore, it was more than enough to have five furnaces here. There were all kinds of medicinal herbs in a room located at the side of the lab. The medicinal herbs that might be needed for alchemy could be found here. This highlighted the huge financial resources Conglong City’s Alchemist Association possessed.","Nobody knew how much time would be needed to gather all these medicinal herbs.","Soon, Kong Buyi came up with a tray. On it were many scrolls tied with ropes. Inside the scrolls were the pill recipes used for the assessment. The three of them were going to choose one of these recipes.","Among the youths, Bai Shengzu quickly picked one. He unfurled the scroll and found the words “Fire Energy Replenishing Pill” written on it.","He frowned. From ther recipe, it was clear that this pill was mainly used to help martial artists who cultivated fire attribute cultivation techniques to recover their true energy faster.","This kind of medicinal pill that targeted a single attribute was rare. Compared to ordinary Qi Replenishing Pills, the effect was at least several times better. Of course, this applied to martial artists who cultivated fire-type cultivation methods.","Next, Jiang Lan’er drew a scroll. Everyone saw that it was an Elementary Divine Power Pill. After swallowing it, one’s strength would double within an hour. However, within six hours after the effects passed, one would enter a weakened state. Although there were some side effects, the payoff was acceptable.","These pill recipes were the results of the Alchemist Association’s many years of research and development. They were not something that outsiders could read.","In the end, it was Chu Yunfan’s turn to draw a random scroll. On it was written Elementary Divine Wind Pill. This pill could double one’s speed for an hour, but there would be a certain degree of side effects. However, if the two sides were in a fight to the death, at a critical moment, this pill could save their lives.","The pill recipes in their hands were not common pill recipes. Chu Yunfan found that although the pill recipe listed the required ingredients and the general steps, there were no other detailed contents.","The assessment clearly depended on the individual’s comprehension level because alchemy was nothing more than the control of fire and time, and the correct time was often found after thousands of experiments.","This was the essence of pill recipes. If there was no edge of challenge, this assessment would be the most basic exam to test the ability of the alchemist and their grasp of alchemy.","“All right, you’ve all picked a recipe. Let’s begin!” Kong Buyi said.","Bai Shengzu’s expression was a little ugly. This test was undoubtedly an assessment of his basic skills. He felt that he had been a little impulsive, but when he saw Chu Yunfan’s indifferent expression, he immediately burned with anger.","After Chu Yunfan picked a recipe, he glanced through it and immediately understood it. He immediately put the recipe away and began to take ingredients from the room next to the lab.","‘He made a decision so quickly?’ Kong Buyi couldn’t help but feel a little stunned. At this moment, Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er were still looking at their recipes and thinking about the specific steps to complete them.","After all, if one made a mistake, the process would fail completely. This was the most difficult part of the entire intermediate alchemist assessment.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s confident and calm appearance, it was as if nothing could stop him. After gathering the ingredients, he began to light the furnace and start making his pill.","At this moment, everyone felt like they had been enlightened. Chu Yunfan’s movements were simple but smooth. His simple movements actually had a sense of beauty.","“This Chu Yunfan is definitely not ordinary!”","Kong Buyi immediately realized that Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person. His actions were clean and without any unnecessary movements. For alchemists of this level, it was simply unbelievable.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had already started his work, Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er didn’t want to fall behind too much and quickly started. However, compared to Chu Yunfan’s smooth and natural movements, the two of them were much more careful. They had to think twice before they did anything.","Seconds and minutes passed. Suddenly, a huge explosion rang out. Immediately after, everyone saw Bai Shengzu’s alchemical furnace explode, and the furnace was shaking violently.","Bai Shengzu had a look of disbelief on his face.","“I failed?! How could I have failed?!” Bai Shengzu was furious. “You must have tampered with the test somehow. Otherwise, how could I have failed?”","Bai Shengzu couldn’t accept his defeat and scolded angrily.","His words made the people present glare at him angrily. Saying that they had tampered with the test, wasn’t this slapping their faces?","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan said, “Stupid, that isn’t the way to make pills!”"]},{"number":1183,"title":"Chapter 1183 The Final Results Are Out, Perfect!","paragraphs":["1183 The Final Results Are Out, Perfect!","“What did you say?” Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Bai Shengzu immediately glared at him. He still couldn’t accept that he had actually failed.","“I called you stupid.” Chu Yunfan repeated as he stood up.","“Impossible. I’ve been refining pills for so many years. There’s no way I’d make a mistake. You must have done something to it! ” Bai Shengzu refused to believe it.","Jiang Lan’er saw this and shook her head. She had fought with Bai Shengzu more than once, but this was the first time she had seen him lose his composure like this. However, it made sense. A genius like Bai Shengzu had probably never encountered such a miserable situation. She was curious about what Chu Yunfan would say.","“It’s simple. You added the Fire Spirit Grass to the Fire Energy Replenishing Pill too late. The temperature inside was too high. The Fire Spirit Grass already contains very strong fire attribute energy. That’s why it exploded,” Chu Yunfan explained.","Bai Shengzu’s face turned pale because he suddenly remembered after hearing what Chu Yunfan said. When he added the Fire Spirit Grass, he hesitated for a long time before deciding on the time to add it. In the end, it didn’t take long before it exploded.","However, he still could not accept that he had actually lost.","Chu Yunfan sneered. A genius like Bai Shengzu might seem powerful, and some of his pills were even better than those of ordinary old alchemists, but that was all done according to the existing rules and procedures.","It could only be said that they were talented and intelligent, and their comprehension ability far exceeded that of ordinary people. However, theintermediate alchemist assessment only listed the recipe and brief steps. There were no specific instructions or things to take note of. What was tested at this time was actually the experience of the alchemist.","Experience couldn’t be made up for with talent.","Experienced alchemists could roughly deduce the specific steps with a glance at the recipe, but for young alchemists, they were somewhat at a loss.","For an old timer like Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, he could deduce the process, the materials used, and so on by just glancing at the pill. He didn’t even need the recipe.","Bai Shengzu couldn’t believe it. He had always thought that with his strength, it would be easy for him to become an intermediate alchemist. In fact, even the pills refined by some intermediate alchemists were far inferior to his level.","At this moment, Kong Buyi couldn’t help but shake his head. Bai Shengzu still didn’t understand that the difference between between a junior alchemist and an intermediate alchemist wasn’t about talent.","Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er were heaven-sent geniuses with outstanding talent. In terms of standards, they were not inferior to some intermediate alchemists, or even stronger. The only difference was experience.","Experience wasn’t something that talent could make up for. The only way was to accumulate experience over time.","However, Kong Buyi was even more shocked by Chu Yunfan. He had been looking at Chu Yunfan the whole time and was sure that Chu Yunfan hadn’t even looked at Bai Shengzu and Jiang Lan’er. Chu Yunfan couldn’t have seen when Bai Shengzu add the Fire Spirit Grass.","In other words, Chu Yunfan knew where the problem was based on his experience.","This level of knowing where the problem was without even looking, nobody except the legendary alchemy experts could do it. However, he immediately shook his head. Chu Yunfan was only a few years old. How could he rely on his rich experience? The only explanation was that Chu Yunfan had refined the Fire Energy Replenishing Pill before.","Although this medicinal pill was not common, it was not completely impossible for many people to see it. Thinking about it this way, Long Buyi felt that it was reasonable.","When the others heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they suddenly realized that none of the people gathered here today were ordinary people. They were either alchemists or engaged in alchemy related industries. They had an extraordinary understanding of alchemy.","“Amazing. He didn’t even look at it and managed to guess the problem.”","“It’s more than just guessing. Look at how sure he is. He clearly knows what the problem is.”","“He’s amazing!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Bai Shengzu’s face was pale and he was in a daze. However, he did not give up. Even though he had failed, it did not mean that Chu Yunfan and Jiang Lan’er would succeed. It was just a matter of whether it was sooner or later.","‘That’s right. If I can’t succeed, they can’t succeed either!’ Bai Shengzu gritted his teeth.","At this moment, the further she went, the more careful Jiang Lan’er’s movements became. She had to carefully consider every step.","On the contrary, Chu Yunfan did everything without even thinking.","Jiang Lan’er felt a little regretful at this moment. Now that she had forced herself to attack, she realized that things were far more complicated than she had imagined. The result would be a direct reflection of her comprehensive strength.","Compared to her, Chu Yunfan’s movements were much more relaxed. If she was forced to do it, then Chu Yunfan was obviously at ease. The four grand slams before were not the limit of his strength.","And the truth didn’t go in the direction Bai Shengzu had hoped for. Jiang Lan’er didn’t fail and cause an explosion, and Chu Yunfan didn’t look like he was going to fail at all.","All of his movements seemed to be firm and smooth, brimming with confidence.","This time, Bai Shengzu was watching from the perspective of a bystander. The more he watched, the more shocked he became. At first, he was sure that Chu Yunfan was putting on an act and that it was impossible, but later, he had nothing to say.","Chu Yunfan and Jiang Lan’er’s pills were completed at the same time. The entire lab was filled with the fragrance of medicine.","Soon, the pills came out of the furnace.","Everyone saw that the two of them were in completely different states. Chu Yunfan was quietly waiting for the final product. Everything was under control and he had a plan in mind.","Jiang Lan’er, on the other hand, was covered in sweat. She was even a little exhausted as if she had just fought a great battle.","However, all the alchemists present knew how difficult this assessment was. No one laughed at Jiang Lan’er. They only looked at Chu Yunfan in horror.","As for Bai Shengzu, he had already been forgotten in a corner.","Kong Buyi took the pills to the machine at the side for testing. This machine was similar to the machine used in the Federation to assess pills.","Soon, the results were out and displayed on the screen.","The first thing that came out was Jiang Lan’er’s assessment results. She passed.","Seeing this result, Jiang Lan’er heaved a huge sigh of relief. She had already done her best. No matter what, she didn’t fail like Bai Shengzu.","However, when Chu Yunfan’s results came out, she couldn’t help but feel her jaw drop.","Chu Yunfan’s assessment results came out. It was perfect.","Everyone was in an uproar. Although they had already guessed it, when they saw that Chu Yunfan’s results were perfect, they still exploded."]},{"number":1184,"title":"Chapter 1184 The Extremely Difficult Expert Alchemist Assessment","paragraphs":["1184 The Extremely Difficult Expert Alchemist Assessment","“He actually passed the intermediate alchemist assessment”","“They’re really not on the same level. Whether it’s Bai Shengzu, Jiang Lan’er, or Chu Yunfan, they’re not on the same level.”","“Where did such a terrifying guy come from?”","Many people were in an uproar. Bai Shengzu, who was watching from the side, was sweating profusely. At this moment, even the most arrogant person could see the difference between him and Chu Yunfan. It was like the difference between clouds and mud.","He was confident that he could catch up with Jiang Lan’er, but he had already given up on Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had easily passed the intermediate alchemist examination, which meant that his strength far surpassed this.","However, he immediately thought of the possibility that Chu Yunfan might have known about this pill recipe beforehand. This was not impossible. Sometimes, the intermediate alchemist assessment really tested one’s luck.","“He must have been lucky to have refined this pill before!” Bai Shengzu shouted, trying to turn the situation around.","Beside him, Kong Buyi could not help but shake his head in disappointment. Even now, Bai Shengzu was still trying to spread rumors and smear others’ reputations. Moreover, even if Chu Yunfan had refined it before, it was his luck.","Luck was clearly a part of strength.","“Men, take him outside and let him wake up!” Kong Buyi said without any politeness. How bad would it be if Bai Shengzu continued to deny the results? Outsiders might think that this was some kind of filthy place.","Elder Xu quickly dragged Bai Shengzu out.","Many people felt extremely relieved. After Bai Shengzu had been here for a few days, he shouldn’t be too arrogant. That kind of high and mighty attitude was extremely annoying. And now, after losing, he was still so unyielding.","“I heard that you’re planning to take the senior alchemist assessment,” Kong Buyi suddenly said while everyone was still in shock.","“What? Senior alchemist?”","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan in shock and were in an uproar. Although senior alchemists were not as rare as alchemy experts, they were also high and mighty existences. One had to know that in a big city like Conglong City, the president of the Alchemist Association was only a senior alchemist.","Kong Buyi was already over a hundred years old, but how old was Chu Yunfan?","“Yes, can we proceed with the test now?” Chu Yunfan asked.","The crowd’s discussion became even louder.","“He actually wants to take the senior alchemist assessment?!”","“No wonder he was fearless. It turns out that he has such confidence!”","“If he has such strength, then it can explain why the previous tests were so easy for him.”","Jiang Lan’er had finally recovered some of her strength. She looked at Chu Yunfan with her mouth agape. She had already done her best just to get into the intermediate alchemist’s class.","She was very clear about her own strength. She had finally passed the intermediate alchemist assessment due to luck. If she had picked another pill, she might not have succeeded.","As for becoming a senior alchemist, she didn’t even dare to think about it. In the words of her master, Kong Buyi, she shouldn’t even think about it for the next ten years.","But now, Chu Yunfan actually wanted to challenge the senior alchemist assessment. He was an existence that was completely on a different level from her.","She couldn’t help but wonder where this monster came from.","Among these people, only Ye Qiaoxin was very calm. Looking at the others who were in shock, she couldn’t help but feel a sense of superiority. ‘You guys are ignorant. Chu Yunfan actually wanted to take the alchemy expert assessment!’","If it wasn’t for the fact that alchemy experts couldn’t be tested here, he might even be certified as an alchemy expert in one go.","She had completely forgotten how frightened she was by Chu Yunfan’s application.","“All right, since you want to take the senior alchemist assessment, we’ll personally conduct the test,” Kong Buyi said in a serious tone.","He still didn’t know where Chu Yunfan came from, but he had already recognized Chu Yunfan’s strength. Chu Yunfan couldn’t be underestimated, and he was even on the same level as him.","A few elders of the Alchemist Association had already gathered beside Kong Buyi. Such a huge incident shocked almost all the elders who were in the association.","“The rules of the assessment are as follows. A few of us will each take out a pill. You can taste it, smell it, and look at it. You can use any and all means to determine the ingredients used, the approximate refining method and steps, the effects of the pill and whether there are any drawbacks, and so on,” Kong Buyi explained.","When the crowd heard this, they all looked at each other. There were too few senior alchemist masters. Most people didn’t know that this was how a senior alchemist was actually tested. It was simply abnormal.","There was no hint at all about the medicinal pill, but the examinee had to reverse deduce all the information. How familiar did one have to be with medicinal pills to be able to do this? No wonder for so many years, in the Alchemist Association of Conglong City, only Kong Buyi had reached this level.","“No problem,” Chu Yunfan said without thinking.","“However, for the sake of fairness, you only need to answer correctly for three of the medicinal pills that the five of us take out,” Kong Buyi said.","However, for an ordinary person, even if they only needed to answer three out of five correctly, the difficulty would still be extremely difficult.","“All right, let’s begin,” Chu Yunfan said.","Kong Buyi and another four elders immediately turned around to prepare. Soon, the five of them each took out a pill and approached Chu Yunfan.","“I’m sure that these medicinal pills are not any of the medicinal pills that I know of. They must have been improved on.”","“That’s right. This is too difficult. These medicinal pills don’t seem to be regular medicinal pills. They’re all medicinal pills that these elders have privately improved. Even if they want to be blind, it’s impossible.”","“That’s right. It looks like Chu Yunfan won’t be able to pass.”","While everyone was discussing, Kong Buyi said, “You can choose a starting point. If you get three correct answers, you’ll pass the assessment.”","“All right, then I’ll start with you.” Chu Yunfan looked directly at a short and fat middle-aged elder.","He looked at the pill a few times, took a deep whiff of the pill’s medicinal fragrance, and looked at the badge hanging on the man’s chest. “Elder Wang, right? This should be an improved variant of the Elementary Divine Power Pill.”","“Not bad, you have good eyesight.” Elder Wang nodded.","“However, just this alone is not enough. You’ve made a lot of improvements to it. If I used the regular recipe for the Divine Power Pill to reverse deduce, it will definitely be wrong.”"]},{"number":1185,"title":"Chapter 1185 Promotion, the Second Expert Alchemist of Conglong City!","paragraphs":["1185 Promotion, the Second Expert Alchemist of Conglong City!","Elder Wang was very confident in the improvements of his Divine Power Pill. He did not think that Chu Yunfan would be able to tell from just a glance.","In fact, many alchemists were carrying out such improvements. The standardized Divine Power Pill was determined by the balance between its medicinal effect and its cost. It did not mean that other attempts were not feasible.","Some people didn’t lack money and were rich. These people just wanted an increase in the pills’ medicinal effects. The cost was completely irrelevant to them. After all, when most people used the Divine Power Pill, many of them were at a critical moment of life and death.","“If I’m not wrong, it should be the blood of the Mammoth Beast!” Chu Yunfan said, “Adding the blood of this beast can double the effect of the Divine Power Pill.”","Mammoth Beasts were a very famous type of monster with innate divine strength. Most of them were in the Acquired Stage or above, and there was no lack of them in the Divine Abilities Stage. They were considered an extremely powerful species.","Elder Wang’s eyes widened. Chu Yunfan had only taken a glance and hadn’t even tasted the pill, yet he could tell from the smell of the medicine alone.","However, he quickly calmed down and said, “But that isn’t enough.”","“Of course, it isn’t,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“However, if I’m not wrong, when you added the Mammoth Beast blood, you added it about thirty breaths too early. Therefore, the blood you used went to waste.”","Chu Yunfan spoke with confidence, while the others looked at Elder Wang, not knowing if Chu Yunfan was right or wrong.","“That’s right, you passed.”","In the end, Elder Wang could only admit it. He didn’t want to admit it at first, but Chu Yunfan could even deduce that he had added the blood thirty breaths too early. What else did he need to say?","If he continued to ask, he would only make himself more embarrassed.","He originally thought that Chu Yunfan would not be able to tell. After all, although it was said to be a waste, in fact, the effect of the pill was still better than that of ordinary Divine Power Pills.","“Come and see mine too.” Elder Xu took out a green pill and gave it to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath. The names of many medicinal herbs flashed through his mind. Chu Yunfan then said, “This should be the Green Wood Pill. It’s used to promote the cultivation of martial artists who cultivate wood-type cultivation techniques. It’s probably made of Lithe Grass, Dragon Spittle Grass... ”","Chu Yunfan listed dozens of ingredients in one breath. Elder Xu’s face revealed an extremely shocked expression. Chu Yunfan had only taken a whiff of the medicinal fragrance, but he could list all of the ingredients, not just one of them.","He also noticed that the order that Chu Yunfan read out was actually the order in which he added the medicinal ingredients. In other words, Chu Yunfan had already mentioned the order in which he added the medicinal ingredients when he was making the pill. And there were no mistakes. It was as if Chu Yunfan was beside him when he was making the pill and watching him.","Elder Xu had modified this Green Wood Pill, and it was different from the recipe of the Green Wood Pills that were circulating outside. However, Chu Yunfan listed the ingredients without any difficulty. It could be seen that all of this was not difficult for him.","Thinking of all this, Elder Xu felt a chill down his spine.","“This is a very meaningful attempt.” Chu Yunfan smiled. “How did I do? Do you want me to continue?”","“No need. I admit that you passed,” Elder Xu said with a bitter smile.","Of course, Chu Yunfan could continue to tell him the specific steps of how he made the pill, but Chu Yunfan didn’t say it, which meant that he kept it a secret.","After all, Elder Xu had spent a long time developing this improved version of the Green Wood Pill. He had never thought that he would casually make it public here.","He even looked at Chu Yunfan gratefully. These pill recipes were the foundation of alchemists.","Many people who had ulterior motives and wanted to know the exact method of refining the Green Wood Pill couldn’t help but feel disappointed. Just knowing which herbs were used was useless.","However, many people’s breathing suddenly became hurried. According to the rules of the Alchemist Association, Chu Yunfan only needed to get three correct answers to become an alchemy expert. Now that he had two correct answers, he only needed to get one more correct answer to successfully become an alchemy expert.","Many people held their breaths and looked at Chu Yunfan, not knowing who he would choose.","However, to everyone’s surprise, Chu Yunfan actually chose the Alchemist Association’s president, Kong Buyi.","Chu Yunfan walked up to Kong Buyi. Kong Buyi looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. Among the five of them, his level was the highest. Of course, the difficulty of his question was also the highest. However, Chu Yunfan chose to challenge him.","“Since you’ve chosen me, then come and see what this medicinal pill of mine is used for.”","On Kong Buyi’s palm, there was a pitch-black pill that emitted a faint medicinal fragrance.","“If I’m not wrong, this should be an antidote pill, ” Chu Yunfan said without any hesitation after taking a whiff.","“That’s right. This is an antidote pill. But what kind of poison is it used for?” Kong Buyi looked at Chu Yunfan and said with a faint smile.","In this world, there were all kinds of poisons, whether man-made or natural. It could be said that there were many types, and thus all kinds of antidote pills were born.","Some antidote pills could cure most poisons, while others were specifically for one type of poison.","“If I’m not wrong, this should be the antidote to the poison of the Poisonous Winged Frog,” Chu Yunfan said after some thought.","“Oh?” Kong Buyi’s expression suddenly changed. This time, he was really shocked. Most of the antidotes looked similar, but Chu Yunfan could tell just by smelling them.","“Why do you think it’s the poison of the Poisonous Winged Frog?”","Chu Yunfan paused and said, “This isn’t hard to guess. Poisonous Winged Frogs are famous venomous creatures, and they appear in groups in places filled with miasma. Once they’re infected, the final result is basically death. Even Divines will be affected if they’re not careful. Am I right?”","“That’s right, but this shouldn’t be a reason for your answer,” Kong Buyi said.","“I know that there’s only one way to cure the poison of the Poisonous Winged Frog, and that is its own poison. I smelled the scent of the Poisonous Winged Frog inside so it’s not hard to guess the result,” Chu Yunfan said confidently.","“Not bad, you don’t have to continue, you’ve passed, I admit that you do have the strength of an expert alchemist,” Kong Buyi announced."]},{"number":1186,"title":"Chapter 1186 The Youngest Senior Alchemist in History","paragraphs":["1186 The Youngest Senior Alchemist in History","Chu Yunfan looked at Kong Buyi with a faint smile. Obviously, Kong Buyi didn’t want him to continue talking. After all, this antidote pill was developed with great difficulty. If Chu Yunfan continued to talk and made everything public, it would be terrible.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t have such strength, Kong Buyi thought that he did.","Because of this, he didn’t let Chu Yunfan continue. Since Chu Yunfan already had such strength, there was no point in continuing to make things difficult for him.","However, he also wanted to know who exactly Chu Yunfan was. One had to know that when he took the senior alchemist assessment, he was trembling with fear. In the end, he passed the examination with great difficulty.","Back then, he had more or less relied on luck. He had not been present with medicinal pills that were particularly difficult to identify. Otherwise, he might not have passed.","He couldn’t be like Chu Yunfan, who could easily complete all the tests.","The remaining two elders didn’t need to continue the test. Chu Yunfan had already answered three questions correctly, so he naturally didn’t need to continue.","The crowd was instantly in an uproar. They seemed to have seen a miracle happen in front of them.","“Senior alchemist! He actually passed the senior alchemist assessment. What should we call him now? Master Chu?”","“He has overcome all the obstacles along his way. Since when did such a genius appear in the Great Wei Kingdom?”","“At this rate, how long will it take for him to become an alchemy expert? I’m afraid it won’t take long.”","Everyone was in an uproar.","Ye Qiaoxin, who was in the crowd, was also completely dumbfounded. Although she had some premonition before, when Chu Yunfan really became a senior alchemist, she still felt that it was unreal. He was probably the youngest senior alchemist she knew.","There had never been a young senior alchemist before, let alone one who was so outstanding.","Amidst the commotion, Chu Yunfan left with Kong Buyi to collect his senior alchemist certificate. Chu Yunfan also had to complete the registration. At that time, Kong Buyi would be able to find out Chu Yunfan’s identity.","Of course, these were all handled by others. Chu Yunfan just had to wait patiently.","“My friend, you truly are young and promising. To be honest, I’ve never seen a genius like you!” Kong Buyi, who was waiting in the guest room, said directly.","Chu Yunfan smiled slightly. In this world, the strong were respected. Obviously, Kong Buyi did not dare to underestimate his strength. However, in fact, Kong Buyi had underestimated Chu Yunfan. What he thought was the limit of Chu Yunfan’s strength was far from what he saw on the surface.","“President Kong, you flatter me,” Chu Yunfan said.","Kong Buyi really did not dare to underestimate Chu Yunfan. In the Alchemist Association of the Great Wei Kingdom, a senior alchemist could become a local branch president. If he was in the headquarters, he could also be an elder with high authority. Moreover, Chu Yunfan was still so young. He might be able to become an alchemy expert in less than two years. At that time, his authority would be above Kong Buyi’s.","“I haven’t asked. Are you from Conglong City, my friend?” Kong Buyi asked.","“Oh, actually, I’m a member of the loyal and trustworthy Chu clan,” Chu Yunfan said vaguely.","This was not a secret and it would be exposed sooner or later so Chu Yunfan did not hide it.","“So you’re the descendant of a noble!” Kong Buyi said as he came to a sudden realization. In the system of the Great Wei Kingdom, the nobility possessed an extremely high status. At the same time, they also possessed powerful financial resources that many people did not dare to imagine.","“I can’t be considered a direct descendant of the Chu clan. I’m just a branch member,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly. The Chu Yunfan that he was replacing was only distantly related to Marquis Zhongxin, let alone him.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was not willing to be proud of the Chu Clan, Kong Buyi felt that it was normal. With Chu Yunfan’s current achievements in alchemy, he could even be on equal footing with the Marquis Zhongxin.","A mere family member of Marquis Zhongxin might be an honor for others, but for Chu Yunfan, it was nothing. If Chu Yunfan could become an alchemy expert in the future, his status would be above the marquis, and he would be on equal footing with those famous princes.","This was the pride that everyone on the path of alchemy should have.","“Oh right, do you have a comms talisman that can imprint my primordial spirit? If anything comes up, I can contact you immediately,” Kong Buyi said.","In the Spirit Realm, there were no personal communication devices like in the Federation. However, there was another system that was developed based on martial arts. There was a communication talisman that was passed down among experts. Experts above the Innate Stage could add a wisp of primordial spirit mark into it and transmit messages from thousands of miles away.","It was the same as calling through in the Federation.","“In fact, I do,” Chu Yunfan said.","He took out his comms talisman. In a whole year, he had only added Chu Hongcai, and Kong Buyi was the second person.","Soon, not long after adding Kong Buyi, Elder Xu came in with an identification card. It was a card made of special metal with the words “Chu Yunfan — Senior Alchemist.”","This was the Alchemist Association’s specially made identity card, refined by the Alchemist Association’s special method. No one could impersonate it, and no one dared would dare to either. Otherwise, they would be hunted down by the entire Alchemist Association.","After Chu Yunfan put away the identity card, Kong Buyi wanted to invite Chu Yunfan to have a meal with him. He wanted to rope in this young genius with a limitless future, but Chu Yunfan was not interested in these things and directly refused.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left, Kong Buyi said to Elder Xu, “Investigate everything about Chu Yunfan, especially the sect behind him!”","Just now, Chu Yunfan had only said that he was from Marquis Zhongxin’s household. However, Marquis Zhongxin’s household was so big, and Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary clansman. Most importantly, as far as he knew, Marquis Zhongxin’s household had nothing to do with the alchemy line. It was impossible for them to cultivate a genius like Chu Yunfan.","There was only one possibility, and that was that there must be an expert behind Chu Yunfan. It was even very likely that this expert was an alchemy expert!","Kong Buyi couldn’t sleep or eat at ease if he didn’t figure it out.","Chu Yunfan left the Alchemist Association but did not return to the Marquis Zhongxin’s household. Instead, he went straight to the city’s pill street. On this street, there were all kinds of shops selling pills. Chu Yunfan looked around as he walked and soon arrived at the real estate agency at the corner of the street.","This would be a brand new beginning for him."]},{"number":1187,"title":"Chapter 1187 The Shop With a Problem","paragraphs":["1187 The Shop With a Problem","This was a huge real estate agency. People came and went, and it was quite lively. Many people were asking questions. Soon, a middle-aged man quickly came forward and said attentively, “Young Master, are you looking to buy or rent?”","“I’m planning to rent,” Chu Yunfan said. He didn’t know how long he would be staying in Conglong City so it wouldn’t be appropriate to buy one.","“Since it’s a rental lot, can I take the liberty to ask what it will be used for? Self-housing or a commercial building?” The middle-aged man led Chu Yunfan to the side and hurriedly poured some water for him.","“I want to rent a shop lot. I plan on selling medicinal pills,” Chu Yunfan said, “It’s best if the shop comes with its own alchemy room.”","“What a coincidence!” The middle-aged man hurriedly squeezed out a smile and said, “Just a while ago, someone came to rent out his place. He’s also a down-and-out alchemist. It was originally a business passed down from his ancestors, but when it came to his generation, he didn’t have much ability and declined. Now that the place is to be rented out. If you want, I can bring you to take a look.”","“All right, let’s go take a look,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Please follow me. May I know your name, Young Master?” The middle-aged man carefully glanced at Chu Yunfan. His profession made him very observant. Although Chu Yunfan’s clothes were only slightly better than the average person’s and were not very luxurious, his every word and action had a sense of nobility. Such people were all high and mighty figures. After making decisions for a long time, they would naturally have a kind of imposing aura mixed in.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s age, he naturally thought that Chu Yunfan must be a descendant of a big force or a big figure and thus restrained some of his thoughts. He was a property agent so he naturally knew who would scam him and who wouldn’t.","Chu Yunfan, who didn’t show any signs of anger, was the kind of big shot that couldn’t be provoked.","“My surname is Chu,” Chu Yunfan said.","“So, it’s Young Master Chu. You can just call me Old Jin!” the middle-aged man said.","As he spoke, he led Chu Yunfan to the pill street. All kinds of medicinal pill shops were opened on this street. It was bustling with activity. One by one, they looked like people who were not to be trifled with. Fiendish people shuttled among them.","Each of them carried an extremely strong martial aura, making it easy to distinguish at a glance. These were all martial artists and not ordinary martial artists. Each and every one of them was a figure who lived by the knife.","Each of these people had rolled over from a mountain of blades and a sea of flames. They all carried a very strong smell of blood. Ordinary people couldn’t see it with their naked eyes but they could instinctively sense these people.","“Looks like the business on this street is pretty good.” Chu Yunfan said.","“It is. Young Master Chu, look. This street sells all kinds of pills. Mercenaries and monster hunters like to come here,” Old Jin explained.","Chu Yunfan nodded. These two types of people needed pills the most. In the wild where monsters were born, pills were often another life. Unless that person was like Chu Yunfan and had absolute strength, they would have to rely on pills to save their lives.","Soon, Chu Yunfan followed Old Jin to a shop at the corner of the street. Compared to the other lively shops around, this shop was located in the middle of the street. The location was excellent, but strangely, there were not many people. It gave off a neglected feeling, and even the door was crooked as if it could fall down at any time.","Chu Yunfan felt that it was a little strange. According to the geographical location of this place, business shouldn’t be so bad.","” Wang Zhao!” Old Jin knocked on the door and shouted. “Open up. Someone’s here to rent the place.”","After a while, a figure opened the door. Chu Yunfan saw that it was a middle-aged man in his thirties but he looked rather down and out. His clothes had not been washed for a long time and his beard was unshaven. He looked extremely dispirited.","“It’s you, Old Jin,” the middle-aged man said in surprise, “What did you just say? Someone’s here to rent?”","“Yup, you’re in luck today. Someone is willing to rent your place.” Old Jin quickly winked at Wang Zhao.","“What did you say? Everyone nearby knows that I’m unlucky. There’s someone who actually wants to rent my place?” Wang Zhao immediately said.","Hearing Wang Zhao’s words, Old Jin couldn’t help but feel embarrassed. Beside him, Chu Yunfan watched their exchange with a faint smile. Obviously, this shop’s location was very good, but at the same time, there must be a big problem.","However, this Old Jin had concealed all of this before. Who knew that this Wang Zhao would be a big mouth and say it out loud?","Old Jin saw Chu Yunfan’s half-smile and naturally understood that he had been seen through. He could only say, “Young Master Chu, it’s not that I want to hide it from you, but you’ve seen the location of this shop. It’s indeed first-class. Moreover, Wang Zhao is an alchemist himself. There’s an alchemy room in the backyard. It’s the most suitable place according to your request.”","“But you didn’t tell me that there’s another reason why such a good place is being rented out, right?” Chu Yunfan immediately said, “Although I don’t mind some trouble, you dare to play tricks in front of me. Do you not fear death?”","Chu Yunfan’s expression turned cold. Old Jin suddenly felt a terrifying pressure pressing down on him like Mount Tai. He was so scared that he almost peed his pants. In this line of work, he had met some big shots, but none of them had such terrifying pressure.","Just one glance made him feel like he had fallen into an ice cave.","“Young Master Chu, please calm down. I was wrong. I don’t want a single cent from the intermediary fee but this house really is top-notch. There’s nothing better than this.” Old Jin gritted his teeth.","“Young Master Chu, don’t make things difficult for Old Jin. He only did this because he wanted to help me. If you want to blame someone, blame me,” Wang Zhao said, looking as if he wanted to kill or torture as he pleased.","“I didn’t expect that with your slippery personality, you’d actually be willing to put in your best effort for your friend.” Chu Yunfan glanced at Old Jin and restrained his aura. He thought of Gao Hongzhi. If it were him, he would probably risk his life for Old Gao too.","“Tell me, what’s wrong with this place?”"]},{"number":1188,"title":"Chapter 1188 Trouble Arrives","paragraphs":["1188 Trouble Arrives","“Since you really want to rent, come in with me, Young Master Chu.” Wang Zhao glanced at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan followed Wang Zhao into the place. Jin followed behind them but he was scared by Chu Yunfan and didn’t dare to say anything.","When Chu Yunfan entered the shop, he saw that it was extremely messy. All kinds of shelves and cabinets had been toppled over. It was as if a series of fights had just taken place here.","Wang Zhao reluctantly found a clean chair for Chu Yunfan. After he sat down, he said, “Young Master Chu, as you can see, the shop is in a state of disrepair right now.”","!!","“Logically speaking, this shouldn’t be the case. The location is very good. Could it be that the pills you sell were of poor quality and they came to smash up the place?”","Chu Yunfan voiced his speculation. This was not impossible. After all, those mercenaries and monster hunters were all people who licked the blood off their blades. These people had bad tempers and could draw their swords at any time.","Chu Yunfan had seen this kind of scene many times so he wasn’t surprised.","“Of course not,” Wang Zhao said haughtily.","Suddenly, Old Jin interrupted, “Actually, Wang Zhao’s parents were pretty good alchemists in their generation. Later on, they opened this shop. Their business was booming and they made a lot of money. Wang Zhao’s parents even did me a favor in the past so I wanted to help him. I didn’t mean to deceive you, Young Master.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at him and said, “I don’t think you have the guts. Seeing that you’re standing up for your friend, I will let you off this time.”","“Thank you, Young Master Chu! Thank you, Young Master Chu!","“But after this shop passed to Wang Zhao, it changed. It was nothing much at first, but a man named Liu Feng came to this pill street and opened another pill shop. Because this shop is in a very good location, he wanted to buy it. Who knew that Wang Zhao would be stubborn and refuse to sell. As a result, the two sides became enemies. Every three or five days, there would be ruffians coming to find trouble. As time passed, the shop declined.”","Old Jin said with a bitter smile, “Actually, there were people who wanted to rent or buy this place before, but those who came to ask for the price were all chased away. Some of them were even injured. Liu Feng and his men announced to the public that anyone who wanted to buy this place would be going against him.","“Ordinary people can’t afford to offend Liu Feng. He is said to be closely related to the Alchemist Association. But I think you aren’t an ordinary person, Young Master Chu. I’m sure you aren’t afraid!”","Old Jin glanced at Chu Yunfan as he spoke. He was afraid that Chu Yunfan would immediately get angry and turn hostile. That would be terrible. In the end, although he felt that Chu Yunfan couldn’t be tricked, he still tried to trick Chu Yunfan and brought him to this problematic shop.","If it wasn’t for Wang Zhao’s parents’ kindness in his early years, he wouldn’t have taken such a huge risk.","“You sure have good eyesight.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He finally understood why the shop’s business was terrible despite being in such a good location. It turned out that there was a human factor. If he bought this shop, there was no doubt that he would have to go against Liu Feng.","An ordinary person might not be able to afford to offend Liu Feng, but Chu Yunfan was not afraid of him.","If Liu Feng didn’t come out, then so be it. If he dared to come out, then Chu Yunfan would be sure to teach him a good lesson. However, Old Jin was wrong. Chu Yunfan was confident not because he was the descendant of a big force but purely because he had such strength.","This shop was related to Chu Yunfan’s recovery, and it was also related to the battle between Chu Hongcai and Chu Xiujie a month later. Not to mention, there was also Situ Miaoyi’s birthday present.","It could be said that this matter was of great importance. Whoever dared to disturb him at this time would be courting death.","“Young Master Chu, I’m not trying to trick you. Liu Feng is not easy to deal with. He has a lot of thugs under him. As far as I know, he seems to be in contact with Divines. Even ordinary bigwigs can’t afford to provoke him,” Wang Zhao hesitated for a moment before saying.","Old Jin saw this and was anxious to death. In his eyes, Wang Zhao was too stubborn. Seeing that Chu Yunfan was about to rent the place, Wang Zhao still had to go and say this.","“All right, I’ll follow your recommendation. I’ll take this shop. As for Liu Feng and his men, if they don’t show up, then forget it. If they do, I’ll let them know why blood is red,” Chu Yunfan said as he stood up.","“How much is the monthly rental of this place?”","Wang Zhao nodded and said, “The location of this shop is very good. Although I’m about to close down, that’s my personal problem. It had nothing to do with the shop. If you want to rent it, it’ll be 1,000 low-grade spirit stones a month, Young Master Chu.”","“All right, I’ll rent it for a year first,” Chu Yunfan said. This was a good price.","Although Wang Zhao was stubborn, Chu Yunfan liked to deal with people like him because he wouldn’t play tricks. If it was Old Jin, Chu Yunfan would have to think twice.","“That’s great!” Old Jin said excitedly. He was even happier than if he had rented out his own place.","“All right, I’ll come back tomorrow to do the handover, but you have to clean up properly.” Chu Yunfan gave Wang Zhao twelve thousand low-grade spirit stones for the year.","However, as a precaution, Chu Yunfan left a trace of his primordial spirit on Wang Zhao’s body. If Wang Zhao wanted to run, it would be useless even if he ran to the ends of the earth.","“No problem!” After counting, Wang Zhao felt much more energetic.","“By the way, you don’t have a job now, right?” Chu Yunfan said.","“No, I don’t,” Wang Zhao said, “Previously, I was in charge of the alchemy in the shop. Now that the shop has become like this, I don’t have a job.”","“How about I hire you? I’ll pay you 1,000 low-grade spirit stones a month to be my assistant,” Chu Yunfan proposed. “Are you willing?”","Wang Zhao’s eyes widened. It wasn’t because this treatment was too bad. On the contrary, this treatment was too good. 1,000 low-grade spirit stones were equivalent to the monthly net profit of his shop.","“Of course, I’m willing!” Wang Zhao hurriedly said, his face filled with joy. It seemed that he had really met a benefactor this time.","“All right, I’ll come by tomorrow. Take the day to clean up,” Chu Yunfan said.","Just as he was about to walk out, he saw a tall figure striding in.","“Oh my, there’s actually someone who wants to rent Wang Zhao’s shop. Kid, why don’t you ask around? Nobody dares to rent it unless Master Liu says otherwise.”"]},{"number":1189,"title":"Chapter 1189 A Lesson","paragraphs":["1189 A Lesson","“I’ve barely taken over the place and trouble is already knocking on my door.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Although he had expected trouble to come, he didn’t expect it to come so soon. It was obvious that Liu Feng was watching the place closely.","However, Wang Zhao’s bones were tough enough. He didn’t lower his head. Otherwise, he probably wouldn’t have been able to hold out till Chu Yunfan came.","Chu Yunfan didn’t want to meddle in other people’s business, but now, it seemed that he had to. Even if he didn’t want to interfere, the trouble was already here.","He turned his head and saw a middle-aged man with a ferocious face. He was extremely tall and looked like a bear.","“You want to rent this place? Don’t blame me for not warning you. If anything happens, don’t blame us!” the middle-aged man threatened Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan glanced at him. “Get lost now. I can’t be bothered with you. Otherwise, you’ll have to bear the consequences.”","“Oh, this is the first time I’ve seen someone more arrogant than me!” The man suddenly laughed loudly. In an instant, a fierce look flashed through his eyes. Then, his big hand, which was like a futon, smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","The big hand slapped Chu Yunfan’s body fiercely and the sound of metal clashing erupted. The burly man seemed to have slapped a piece of metal.","Chu Yunfan, who was attacked, did not move an inch, but the burly man screamed and retreated. His entire arm was covered in blood and hung limply by his side.","The burly man looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. Only he knew how much strength he had exerted just now. Although he had not held back, the rebound force could not be so strong that it crippled his entire arm.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan grabbed the teacup on the table and flung it.","Bam!","The burly man did not have time to react. With a muffled groan, he felt a huge force ruthlessly fall on his body, and he instantly flew out of the shop.","“Get lost!” Chu Yunfan shouted as the burly man smashed into the door and landed on the ground, screaming.","The man clutched his chest and curled up into a ball. All of this happened in an instant.","Wang Zhao and Old Jin hadn’t reacted yet. Wang Zhao finally reacted after a long time. He looked at the burly man and was extremely excited, although he didn’t do it himself.","However, seeing these people being taught a lesson made him feel extremely happy. It had been a few years, and his originally good shop had become like this. It was impossible for him not to hate them.","However, most of the time, he did not have the ability to fight back. He could only hang on with one breath. Even at this point, he was unwilling to give in. But now, Chu Yunfan had taught Liu Feng’s man a lesson, allowing him to vent his anger.","Compared to Wang Zhao’s delight, Old Jin was just extremely shocked. He knew a little about the burly man. He was a powerful fighter under Liu Feng. His cultivation level was very high, at least at the upper stage of the Innate Stage.","This man had been keeping an eye on this place all year round. However, such an expert was seriously injured by Chu Yunfan’s teacup. It was simply shocking.","However, he immediately understood. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was the descendant of an unknown noble family. Which of these people did not have excellent resources? It was normal for their cultivation to be higher.","Furthermore, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem like a person who was afraid of trouble. Since Wang Zhao was able to follow such a big shot, he naturally didn’t need to worry about his future prospects.","Chu Yunfan glanced at the broken door and said, “Since the door is broken, let’s just replace it with a new one.”","Then, he said to the burly man who had curled into a ball, “Go back and tell your master that I’ve booked the place. If he’s not happy, I can bring someone over tomorrow. However, at that time, things won’t be so easy.”","Then, Chu Yunfan said to Wang Zhao, “Clean up the place and change the door. We’ll reopen tomorrow.”","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he disappeared down the end of the street.","All of this happened too quickly. Wang Zhao felt like he was in a dream. In front of him, the fiendish man who suffocated his place seemed to be nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Brother, from now on, you’re rich. Don’t forget me in the future!” Old Jin patted Wang Zhao’s shoulder.","Wang Zhao glanced at Old Jin. He didn’t like Old Jin’s tactfulness in the past, but no matter what, Old Jin had indeed brought him hope for rebirth. He had given him a big present.","Old Jin understood what Wang Zhao meant and didn’t want him to change his attitude. He just smiled and left.","When Chu Yunfan returned to the side courtyard of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, it was already late in the morning. He didn’t expect An Xiuxiu to still be there.","When Chu Hongcai saw Chu Yunfan, it was as if he saw a light of hope. He ran over with tears in his eyes, looking in a very sorry state. His clothes were ragged and his face was covered in bruises.","“Brother Fan, you’re finally back! If you came back any later, I would lose my life!” Chu Hongcai was on the verge of tears.","“What are you crying for?” An Xiuxiu glanced at Chu Hongcai unhappily. “Can’t you even take this little bit of hardship? How are you going to reach the Divine Abilities Stage, let alone win within a month?”","“Is the process really so bitter? You’re just beating me to death!” Chu Hongcai was about to explode. He had been tortured by this female devil for most of the day.","He wanted to resist and rebel, but his cultivation was far inferior to An Xiuxiu’s. Every time he wanted to resist, he would be easily suppressed.","Chu Hongcai’s joy of just reaching the seventh level of the Innate Stage disappeared without a trace. The difference between the Innate Stage and the Divine Abilities Stage was too great. From the beginning to the end, he was completely suppressed.","Now that Chu Yunfan had finally returned, it was as if he had seen his family.","Chu Yunfan looked at him and couldn’t help but laugh. With his eyesight, he could naturally see that Chu Hongcai only had superficial wounds. For a martial arts master in the Innate Stage, this kind of superficial wound could be healed with a nap. It was nothing.","“Now, now. If you want to gain some experience, you have to suffer a little,” Chu Yunfan said, “Oh right, my pill shop will be opening tomorrow. If the two of you are free, you can come and support me.”"]},{"number":1190,"title":"Chapter 1190 Opening of a New Shop","paragraphs":["1190 Opening of a New Shop","“No problem!” Chu Hongcai patted his chest, but his face immediately scrunched up. His chest was badly bruised.","Although An Xiuxiu hadn’t killed him, when it was time to teach him a lesson, she didn’t hold back and beat him up until he was covered in bruises.","However, Chu Hongcai knew that he had gained a lot today. Although An Xiuxiu had shown mercy, she was still an existence that he looked up to like a tall mountain, especially since she had implemented many Divine Abilities Stage battle strategies.","These were all experience points that could not be bought with money.","“All right, I’ll be there too,” An Xiuxiu said after a moment of thought.","“But Brother Fan, when did you open a pill shop?” Chu Hongcai asked.","“I just rented a shop. You two should come early tomorrow. I think there will be a lot of fun to watch,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile. He was not the least bit moved by the possibility that Liu Feng would come looking for trouble tomorrow.","Then, Chu Yunfan told them the address.","“Haha, I love watching a show!” Chu Hongcai looked at An Xiuxiu and said, “I’m going to head back now. I have to go back and recuperate.”","He was a little afraid of An Xiuxiu.","After Chu Hongcai left, Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but smile and say, “Looks like he’s afraid of you.”","“I was already going easy on him. If we really fought, I can kill him with one finger!” An Xiuxiu pouted. “Why don’t you teach him yourself? You should be able to teach him better than me.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at An Xiuxiu and said something that almost made her jump.","“I don’t have the time.”","An Xiuxiu almost choked on her saliva. Although it might be the truth, it was too arrogant. Moreover, he was not the only busy person. She was also very busy.","However, she pursed her lips and did not say anything. She had lost a bet to Chu Yunfan and had to work for him for a month. However, upon further reflection, it felt quite good. It was as if she had found a free sandbag that she could beat up as she pleased.","Soon, An Xiuxiu also bid farewell and left. Chu Yunfan began his secluded cultivation again. Today, he had just passed the senior alchemist assessment, which caused a wave of commotion.","However, he clearly did not have this self-awareness. To him, nothing was more important than recovering his strength.","As his strength continued to recover, this process was rapidly accelerating.","While he was recuperating in seclusion, news about him began to spread among the upper class of Conglong City. For the first time in history, Conglong City had a second senior alchemist.","Although senior alchemists’ statuses weren’t as high as alchemy experts’, they were undoubtedly considered top figures in the alchemy field. They were often only a fine line away from becoming an alchemy expert.","There was usually only one such person in a city. Now, there was actually a second.","This was a huge shock to the upper class of Conglong City, especially to many people who needed someone to make them pills. It was undoubtedly an additional choice. After all, there weren’t many times when one needed to hire a senior alchemist. However, once there was such a need, it was often a very important matter.","Although there was such a person by word of mouth, because Chu Yunfan had asked Kong Buyi to keep it a secret, not many people had actually seen Chu Yunfan. Only those who were present at the time had seen him.","Most people could only say that they knew about the existence of such a person, and they were not clear about anything else. The person who had passed the senior alchemist assessment at such a young age was still a mystery to them.","The sun rose and the moon set. A new day arrived with the first ray of sunlight piercing through the darkness.","Chu Yunfan’s spirit was roused. The broken meridians in his body had recovered a little and he was now one step closer to recovering his strength.","Early in the morning, Chu Yunfan arrived at pill street. Although it was still early, it was already crowded with people. Many of the pill shops had just opened their doors when many mercenaries and monster hunters who had been waiting for a long time came to buy supplies.","After a night of cleaning, the interior had been completely renewed, and the broken door had been replaced with a new one. Wang Zhao had been cleaning alone for the entire night, but he was still in high spirits. He was rather excited and did not look tired at all.","“Young Master, you’re here!”","Wang Zhao had completely changed the way he addressed Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan nodded. “Well done. I’ll leave the shop to you in the future. You can also make your own pills to sell.”","“Understood!” Wang Zhao said.","“Oh, you’ve had experience managing a pill shop so you should have your own supply channels for medicinal herbs, right?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Yes, of course.” Wang Zhao nodded.","“I’ll give you a list of medicinal ingredients later. Help me gather them as soon as possible,” Chu Yunfan said.","At this time, he already felt the inconvenience. If it was in the Federation, as long as he put up a list on the Internet, someone would quickly send the herbs he needed. In the Spirit Realm, this process was clearly much more troublesome.","“Understood. I’ll get it done immediately,” Wang Zhao said. “But Young Master, you hit Liu Feng’s subordinate yesterday. With Liu Feng’s personality, he definitely won’t let it go. He’ll come looking for trouble. You have to be careful.”","Chu Yunfan just smiled and said, “I was afraid that he wouldn’t show. It’s good if he comes. We can solve all these problems at once. We don’t have to keep waiting for trouble to come.”","“Young Master, Liu Feng has a lot of connections. I’m afraid he won’t be easy to deal with,” Wang Zhao gently advised Chu Yunfan.","“It’s okay. Follow me. You don’t have to worry too much about these miscellaneous matters. I’ll settle them.” Chu Yunfan waved his hand.","Wang Zhao didn’t know if Chu Yunfan was really confident or ignorant to the point of fearlessness, but when he thought about how Chu Yunfan had severely injured that Innate with a teacup yesterday, he was confident again.","“Oh, Young Master, I also make some pills before this. But because of Liu Feng, the shop couldn’t be opened anymore. Now, I can take them out to make up for it. What do you think?” Wang Zhao suddenly suggested after thinking of something.","“Sure.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Soon, Wang Zhao started preparing the pills for sale. Not long after, Chu Hongcai was the first to arrive.","“Brother Fan, this is your shop? The location is pretty good!” Chu Hongcai said after he walked in and looked around.","Some people were already poking their heads in, but seeing that the shop was still empty, they didn’t enter.","“Yes, I’ll be staying here in the future. You’ll have to come here for training too. There’s a huge backyard behind this shop. It’s enough for you to train,” Chu Yunfan said.","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, a fiery red figure rushed in. Who else could it be but An Xiuxiu?"]},{"number":1191,"title":"Chapter 1191 Looking For Trouble? Crippled in One Kick!","paragraphs":["1191 Looking For Trouble? Crippled in One Kick!","“Is this the location of your shop?” An Xiuxiu took a look around. “The business on this street is very good. I didn’t expect you to be able to get such a location.”","An Xiuxiu clicked her tongue in wonder. Having grown up in Conglong City, she understood the value of this lot on this street.","Under normal circumstances, it would not be sold or rented out. Here, as long as a slightly more reliable alchemist was hired, there was no need to worry about business.","“Of course, there’s no free lunch in this world. There’s a problem that needs to be solved!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","An Xiuxiu’s beautiful eyes went wide and she immediately thought of something. She said, “This is that big show you were talking about, right?”","“Not bad. You wised up pretty quickly,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Oh, I’m wise all right.” An Xiuxiu chuckled. “I just don’t know who will fall into your hands. It’s really bad luck for eight lifetimes!”","The others didn’t know Chu Yunfan’s background. Even Chu Hongcai didn’t know about Chu Yunfan’s background. Although Chu Hongcai knew that Chu Yunfan was very strong and might even be a Divine, he didn’t know exactly how strong Chu Yunfan was.","He just instinctively felt that Chu Yunfan should be stronger than Chu Haoyu and Chu Xiujie, but it was only a concept of being stronger than the two of them. Only An Xiuxiu had witnessed how Chu Yunfan had easily killed the Snake Brothers.","At that time, when she brought the corpses of the Snake Brothers to collect the reward, it caused a commotion. These three ferocious fellows had long been on the Great Wei Kingdom’s wanted list, but no one had been able to do anything to them.","But this time, Chu Yunfan had killed them all. It was terrifying!","In her eyes, Chu Yunfan was simply unfathomable. He might even be stronger than her brother. Anyone who provoked him would be courting death.","Chu Yunfan smiled and told them about Liu Feng.","“I beat up his underling yesterday. He definitely won’t let it go. There should be a big show to watch then.” Chu Yunfan smiled.","“I see. This Liu Feng fellow is too overbearing!” Chu Hongcai said indignantly. He still had the temperament of a young man and was hot-blooded.","“But this time, I’m afraid that Liu Feng is going to kick a hornet’s nest. Why doesn’t he look into who you are?” At this moment, An Xiuxiu felt sorry for Liu Feng, who had yet to appear. Clearly, he was going to kick a diamond-level hornet’s nest this time.","Without waiting for the three of them to continue speaking, the crowd on the street outside suddenly began to stir. Immediately after, they heard a series of hurried footsteps. Soon, a group of fiendish burly men appeared at the entrance of the shop.","The trio looked at each other and knew that the real excitement was coming.","At this moment, a figure slowly walked in. It was a middle-aged man in his thirties. He had a slender figure and narrow eyes, carrying with him an icy aura.","“I want to see the person who’s so arrogant!” The middle-aged man saw Chu Yunfan and the other two, and then his gaze quickly locked onto Chu Yunfan. “It’s you, right? You’re very bold. What methods do you have? Tell me!”","Chu Yunfan was a little surprised. Even at this point, the other party still did not make a move. Clearly, he was cautious enough.","Chu Yunfan knew about Liu Feng and still dared to interfere in this matter so arrogantly. Either Chu Yunfan was ignorant to the point of fearlessness or he had something to rely on.","If it was the former, then it would be easy to deal with. Liu Feng would just kill and bury him. If it was the latter, he had to be more serious.","There were too many important figures in Conglong City. If he was not careful, he would have died long ago.","“I don’t care. It’s good that you’ve come. I can now tell you that I’ve bought this shop. From now on, you should get as far away as you can. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude,” Chu Yunfan warned.","“You’re really arrogant. You’re even more arrogant than me!” Liu Feng gritted his teeth.","He recalled the influential figures in the city that he could not afford to provoke and confirmed that there Chu Yunfan was no such person. He had already confirmed that Chu Yunfan was an outsider who relied on his strength but did not know the immensity of heaven and earth. Otherwise, with his vast network of friends, it was impossible for no one to know who Chu Yunfan was.","“Smash everything. Today, I’m going to give you a good trashing and let you know that not everything in this world can be meddled in.” Liu Feng snorted coldly.","His eyes flashed with terrifying killing intent. His heart was filled with killing intent toward Chu Yunfan. Today, he planned to kill Chu Yunfan to prevent any more twists and turns in this shop.","Those burly men immediately rushed in and were about to start smashing the shop. They were all Innates and their cultivation was not simple.","“Hongcai, it’s your turn. Break all their limbs and throw them out,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Hongcai was already eager to give it a try and instantly rushed out. Although those burly men were all Innates, they were at most at the first or second stage. How could they resist Chu Hongcai, a seventh Innate?","For a moment, Chu Hongcai was like a fierce tiger that had descended from the mountain. He rushed in and defeated these burly men with his strength.","“My boy, you actually brought helpers!” Liu Feng flew into a rage and instantly pounced toward Chu Yunfan.","He completely unleashed his aura. He was actually a Divine. He had been hiding it very well all these years and had not fought anyone. No one actually knew that he was a Divine.","An Xiuxiu, who was beside Chu Yunfan, was eager to make a move, but Chu Yunfan did not say anything.","Liu Feng’s hands turned into claws, and his divine power attached to them. It was as if he had turned into a pair of eagle claws, and he slashed at Chu Yunfan’s vital points. It could be said that every move was fatal, and it did not leave Chu Yunfan’s vital points.","Chu Yunfan’s body only swayed slightly and all of Liu Feng’s attacks missed. No matter how big his attack range was, it seemed that he could not catch Chu Yunfan.","Liu Feng immediately realized that he seemed to have encountered an expert. He immediately shouted, “This is a tricky move. Hall Master Liu, please make your move!”","As soon as he finished speaking, an even more terrifying aura enveloped the shop.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. He just followed his own rhythm, glanced at Liu Feng, and then suddenly kicked out like lightning.","Bam!","“Aaagh!” Liu Feng screamed as he was sent flying. He spat out a mouthful of blood, which turned into a rain of blood.","Everyone was dumbfounded. Everything had happened too quickly. Liu Feng, who had been attacking fiercely just now, had been crippled by Chu Yunfan’s kick."]},{"number":1192,"title":"Chapter 1192 Why Do I Need to Explain Anything to You?","paragraphs":["1192 Why Do I Need to Explain Anything to You?","Chu Yunfan’s attack was too fast, and he didn’t give the others any time to react. Liu Feng hadn’t expected that he would be kicked to the ground by Chu Yunfan just as he was about to call for help.","He couldn’t even touch the corner of Chu Yunfan’s clothes, but Chu Yunfan only needed one kick to defeat him.","There was no doubting the gap between the two sides.","The others were also shocked by the fact that the battle had ended so quickly. Only An Xiuxiu was used to it. In terms of strength, Liu Feng was far inferior to the Snake Brothers.","Even the three brothers had been easily killed, let alone Liu Feng.","At this moment, another figure appeared outside the door. A tall middle-aged man strode in. At this moment, his face was filled with embarrassment and anger. He was just about to attack, but Chu Yunfan crippled the main character with a single kick.","This was what happened when he wanted to act tough.","At this moment, the battle had attracted many mercenaries and monster hunters on the street. These people all licked blood from their blades. Even if the battle here was intense, they would not retreat. At most, they would watch from a distance.","Chu Yunfan’s clean kick also made many people’s expressions turn cold. Just this kick was enough to make them put the owner of this shop on the list of people who must not be provoked.","After all, most of them were only at the Innate Stage, and those in the Divine Abilities Stage were rare. However, now that a Divine had been crippled by Chu Yunfan’s kick, how could they dare to be impudent?","“Who is that shop owner? How is he so scary?”","Many people had such thoughts. Although a powerful alchemist was also a powerful martial artist, not every alchemist could step into the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, when they saw the towering Hall Master Liu, they could not help but exclaim in surprise.","“Isn’t that Hall Master Liu of the Battle Wolf Gang?” Someone recognized him.","Instantly, everyone held their breaths. Even existences like them who licked blood from their blades would still retreat when facing the Battle Wolf Gang.","The reason was simple. The Battle Wolf Gang was the largest gang in Conglong City. Their leader was one of the few experts in the city. Ever since the Battle Wolf Gang was founded, they had fought all over the city and subdued all the other gangs. That was why the Battle Wolf Gang was so famous today.","The Battle Wolf Gang was filled with experts, and Hall Master Liu was one of them. His cultivation had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage.","Even in Conglong City where elites gathered, Divines were still existences that could not be provoked.","“Looks like there’s going to be a show today!”","Many people revealed playful smiles on their faces.","The Battle Wolf Gang was indeed not to be trifled with, but it was clear that this shop owner was not someone to be trifled with either. The owner had crippled a Divine with a single kick. How could he be an ordinary person?","It was obvious that he was not a simple person. When the two sides met, it became a good show in the hearts of countless people!","“My friend, aren’t you going a little too far by doing this?” Hall Master Liu said fiercely as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“Too far?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Do I need to explain anything to you? If you want to fight, come. If you don’t, get lost.”","“You’re very arrogant. It seems like you’re looking down on the Battle Wolf Gang!”","Leader Liu looked at Chu Yunfan and naturally put him on the opposite side of the Battle Wolf Gang. Even if this matter had nothing to do with the Battle Wolf Gang, it had to be said that this tiger’s skin was very useful.","“So what if I look down on them? So what if you don’t take them seriously?” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Beside him, An Xiuxiu suddenly snorted. In her opinion, Chu Yunfan was simply teasing Hall Master Liu. With Chu Yunfan’s ability to easily kill the Snake Brothers, the Battle Wolf Gang would not scare him.","She was born and raised in Conglong City so she naturally knew some things about the Battle Wolf Gang. She also knew that the hall masters of the Battle Wolf Gang were indeed very impressive. Even people like them, who were born to noble families, could not completely ignore the existence of the Battle Wolf Gang.","In this world, the strong were respected. Not only were those dignitaries strong, but they were also existences with great influence in the Great Wei Kingdom.","However, Chu Yunfan was clearly unafraid. An Xiuxiu was a little curious. Based on Chu Yunfan’s background in Marquis Zhongxin’s household, as long as he pulled out the banner of the marquis, even the Battle Wolf Gang would have to retreat.","The Battle Wolf Gang was powerful, but it was unrealistic to go against a noble like Marquis Zhongxin for such a small matter, let alone a mere hall master.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t reveal his identity. Perhaps he really had absolute confidence in himself.","“Liu Feng is under the protection of the Battle Wolf Gang. Today, if you give up this shop and pay me a million low-grade spirit stones, this matter will be over. How about it?” Hall Master Liu glanced at Chu Yunfan and demanded an exorbitant price.","“I think you’re crazy about money. Get lost!” Chu Yunfan said with a cold expression.","“Looks like you’re going to refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit. Then don’t blame me for being impolite!”","Hall Master Liu sneered and released his aura, which instantly stunned everyone in the area. The terrifying aura was released like Mount Tai. Although it was mainly aimed at Chu Yunfan, the surrounding people could also feel the terrifying pressure.","Apart from An Xiuxiu, who was also a Divine and was not affected, the other mercenaries and monster hunters who had come out of the mountains of corpses and seas of blood were completely suppressed.","The Divine Abilities Stage and the Innate Stage were simply two different levels of life!","Moreover, Hall Master Liu was even stronger than Liu Feng. He had already reached the fourth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, and his strength far surpassed ordinary Divines.","“Is this the strength of a Divine?” Chu Hongcai suddenly felt as if his entire body was being pressed by a thick layer of pressure. If the pressure of an Innate was only a spiritual pressure, a Divine could already half-materialize this pressure. It was definitely not just a spiritual pressure.","Chu Hongcai mobilized all the Innate true energy in his body and shouted with all his might. His arm thrust out like a long spear. It was the spear that Chu Yunfan had taught him before.","The spear pressed forward and pierced through everything. Only then did it finally break through the pressure. However, after stabbing out with the spear, his entire body seemed to collapse. He completely collapsed on the ground. He could not even get up to face such an expert. This was all he could do."]},{"number":1193,"title":"Chapter 1193 Fainting After Just One Slap","paragraphs":["1193 Fainting After Just One Slap","Although Chu Hongcai looked extremely miserable at this moment, in the eyes of thethugs, it was shocking. Although he looked like he was struggling, they couldn’t do what he did. They were completely crushed.","It was like a little rabbit facing a tiger. If Hall Master Liu wanted to kill them, they couldn’t even resist and could only be killed obediently.","The difference in strength between the two sides had already reached such a level that there was no way to resist.","That was why they looked at Chu Hongcai with envy. He dared to fight against a Divine. This was the heart of a strong person. The heart of a strong person was not ruthless, but the spirit of never compromising.","This was something they couldn’t do. Although they were vicious and merciless, they didn’t have the courage to fight against an expert like Hall Master Liu. They could only submit obediently. Such people would never get far.","Chu Yunfan also looked at Chu Hongcai in surprise. He had not expected Chu Hongcai to be able to break through Hall Master Liu’s suppression.","This was the heart of the strong. Chu Yunfan nodded slightly, very satisfied with Chu Hongcai’s performance. What was a strong person? If one didn’t have the courage to punch, one wouldn’t be able to become a strong person in life.","However, he didn’t think much of those people’s surprise. It was just that breaking through the pressure was nothing.","One had to know that when Chu Yunfan was only at this cultivation level, he had slaughtered Divines. That was truly an action that shocked the world.","He had never backed down even when facing a Divine.","When he was in the Divine Abilities Stage, he had killed a Core Stage expert.","To go against the flow, not only did one need strength but also courage!","An Xiuxiu was also very surprised. She finally understood why Chu Yunfan valued Chu Hongcai so much. Perhaps it was not just what she thought.","Chu Hongcai had broken through Hall Master Liu’s suppression. To Hall Master Liu, it was a small matter that was not worth mentioning. His gaze was all on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s body did not have any fluctuation of divine power. He looked like an ordinary person with flaws all over his body. However, this ordinary person who looked like he had no divine power at all had crippled Liu Feng, who was in the Divine Abilities Stage, with a single kick.","After witnessing all of this, of course, he would not think that Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary person. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was a person who pretended to be a pig to eat a tiger.","He knew his own strength, but he would not underestimate Chu Yunfan.","Suddenly, Hall Master Liu made his move. He decided to ignore Chu Yunfan’s tricks and beat him into submission first. With the Battle Wolves as his backing, there were not many people in Conglong City that could make them afraid.","Boom!","The terrifying aura did not spread out like before. Instead, it all rushed toward Chu Yunfan. This was the prelude to the attack, but Chu Yunfan did not move as if he was being restrained by the aura.","Hall Master Liu drew a saber from his back and slashed out. In an instant, the entire room was about to be torn into two by this sharp saber.","“He’s crazy!”","Many people cried out in surprise. In a place like Pill Street, the destructive power that a Divine could cause with their full strength could be imagined. However, it was also imaginable how many people would pay attention to him because of this.","Hall Master Liu simply ignored the rules!","There was a barrier in this shop. In the early years, Wang Zhao had continuously set up barriers but they could not withstand this saber and were all shattered.","Fortunately, the saber light was not aimed at these barriers. It only flashed past and then slashed fiercely at Chu Yunfan.","Hall Master Liu didn’t know why he suddenly used his full strength, but he had a feeling that if he didn’t, he might not have a chance.","Clang!","A crisp sound was heard. Chu Yunfan was not cut in half like what ordinary people thought and instead caught the terrifying saber light with two fingers.","Chu Yunfan was like catching a fly—he didn’t use much strength at all.","“Impossible!” Hall Master Liu was shocked, and his entire body was covered in cold sweat. He had thought of countless possibilities, but none of them included the strange scene in front of him.","“Weak.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. It seemed that due to the restrictions of the Spirit Realm’s laws, the power of Divines was limited. If it was in the Federation, this slash would be enough to split the entire street in half.","In the Spirit Realm, only existences above the Core Stage could do this.","Chu Yunfan moved slightly, but the long saber in front of him shattered inch by inch. Although he couldn’t use his divine power, his physical strength alone was already an absolute expert that ordinary people couldn’t imagine.","“Sh*t!”","Hall Master Liu instinctively wanted to retreat, but Chu Yunfan had already appeared in front of him and slapped him.","Bam!","Hall Master Liu felt a slap coming at him, and he couldn’t dodge it. He was sent flying by the slap, and his teeth were shattered. He spat out a mouthful of blood.","He was like a spinning top as he flew out and crashed into the ground.","At this moment, there was pin-drop silence. Only Liu Feng’s screams could be heard. As for Hall Master Liu, there was no scream at all because he had already fainted from Chu Yunfan’s slap.","Everyone’s eyes widened. It was even more shocking than when Chu Yunfan crippled Liu Feng with a single kick. It was as if they had seen a monster.","If they hadn’t seen it with their own eyes, they would never have believed such a ridiculous thing.","That was a fourth tier Divine, and he wasn’t an ordinary person among Divines. In the end, he was almost killed by a single slap and had fainted.","Who was this young man who did not seem to have any divine power fluctuations at all? What level had his strength reached?","After experiencing a deathly silence, everyone exploded.","“Is he a monster?”","“We absolutely can’t provoke him. The owner of this shop is too terrifying!”","“What kind of expert is Hall Master Liu? In the end, he was slapped unconscious!”","Only An Xiuxiu was still calm. She had seen Chu Yunfan easily kill the Snake Brothers. It was much more exciting than this, but Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to be so strong at that time."]},{"number":1194,"title":"Chapter 1194 If There Is to Be Revenge, Come at Me! I’ll Take It!","paragraphs":["1194 If There Is to Be Revenge, Come at Me! I’ll Take It!","An Xiuxiu’s intuition was indeed right. In fact, Chu Yunfan was recovering every moment. Now that his physical body had healed, he turned to the recovery of his meridians. It could be said that he was getting stronger every moment. To be precise, he was recovering.","If it was an ordinary person, he would not feel much if they recovered a little every day. However, Chu Yunfan’s strength was too strong. Even if he only became a little stronger on this foundation, in the perception of ordinary people, he was much stronger.","Just like how 1% of a pool of water might not be a lot, but if it was 1% of an ocean, it would be completely shocking.","The one who was truly shocked was Chu Hongcai. This time, he truly felt Chu Yunfan’s strength. The time Chu Yunfan had saved him was just the tip of the iceberg. This was Brother Fan’s true strength.","!!","The terrifying existence that had exuded a pressure he had to use all his strength to break through was actually knocked out by Brother Fan’s slap.","The difference in strength was so great that it could be seen that it was ordinary.","It was an existence that was simply not on the same plane.","At this moment, Chu Hongcai understood why so many people wanted to fight for the position of the loyal and trustworthy heir, but Brother Fan didn’t care. With his strength and age, if he was willing to join the Empire, it was only a matter of time before he obtained another noble title.","If he could obtain it himself, why did he need others to give it to him?","What was given by others was never more justified than what he had obtained.","Everyone was in an uproar.","When the burly men who had followed Liu Feng here saw this scene, they were shocked. In fact, they did not even dare to move. It was as if they were being stared at by a terrifying beast, unable to move at all.","“Take them away and tell the Battle Wolves that if they want to cause trouble, they can come to me. I’ll wait for you here,” Chu Yunfan said.","These burly men immediately felt as if they had been pardoned. They hurriedly carried their fallen companions, Liu Feng, and Hall Master Liu away.","Chu Yunfan had not give off such an aggressive feeling they had first arrived. They thought they could beat him.","They were shocked!","“This shop owner is so scary. He’s so powerful at such a young age!”","“Liu Feng is also a powerful character. He was able to conceal his strength breakthrough for so long.”","“That’s right. If he hadn’t used his full strength today, who would’ve known that he had already stepped into the Divine Abilities Stage. ”","“But what’s the use? He was still beaten down by this shop owner!”","Many people remembered this shop and listed it as an establishment that they could not provoke.","After the crowd dispersed, Wang Zhao, who was tidying up his things, came out. He then found out what had happened and was instantly extremely excited.","For the past few years, Liu Feng had been like a huge mountain pressing down on his head, making it difficult for him to even breathe. But now, Chu Yunfan had easily beaten up Liu Feng. It was so satisfying, so satisfying!","“But Young Master, the Battle Wolves Gang is not to be trifled with. Is it appropriate for us to do this?” After feeling happy, Wang Zhao started to worry.","Just Liu Feng alone was enough to give him a headache. If the Battle Wolves got involved, it would probably be a disaster.","“What’s there to be afraid of? So what if he’s from the Battle Wolves? Didn’t Brother Fan tell you? We’re part of Marquis Zhongxin’s household,” Chu Hongcai said bluntly.","Although the Battle Wolves was stronger than the marquis, the marquis had the backing of the Great Wei Kingdom. He could borrow the power of the entire country. If he really wanted to kill the Battle Wolves, there were ways to do so.","That was why Chu Hongcai, the son of a noble, didn’t put the Battle Wolves in his eyes at all.","“Marquis Zhongxin?” Wang Zhao looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise.","Chu Yunfan hadn’t told him anything before so he was worried. But now that he knew Chu Yunfan was from the marquis’ household, there was nothing to be afraid of.","The Battle Wolves was terrifying mainly to ordinary people like them, but to a behemoth like the marquis, the Battle Wolves was not that terrifying. At the very least, the Battle Wolves would not completely fall out with the marquis because of this shop.","“It’s nothing. There’s no need for the marquis to make a move. I alone am enough,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Wang Zhao quickly nodded. He had finally witnessed Chu Yunfan’s strength. Chu Yunfan could easily deal with Divines.","“I’ve seen a lot of good shows today!” An Xiuxiu said, “Speaking of which, it feels like a lot of things are always happening on your side.”","“All right, today’s training can begin.” Chu Yunfan glanced at Chu Hongcai.","Chu Hongcai suddenly thought of what An Xiuxiu had done to him yesterday and let out a scream.","Soon, they arrived at the backyard. An Xiuxiu called Chu Hongcai to the side to teach him.","Chu Yunfan said to Wang Zhao, “I’ll leave the matters of the shop to you. You can also arrange for a few more assistants. You should gather the medicinal herbs I want as soon as possible.”","“Okay.”","Wang Zhao no longer had that dispirited feeling from before. It was simply swept away. Chu Yunfan had given him a new way out, completely different from before.","The flowers bloomed at both ends, each showing a branch.","At this moment, in the Alchemist Association, a middle-aged man was pacing back and forth in an office, looking extremely anxious.","Suddenly, the office door was pushed open. Elder Xu pushed the door open and entered. When he saw the middle-aged man, he could not help but say, “Deputy Liao. What a rare sight, seeing you here.”","Elder Xu was a little surprised. This middle-aged man, who looked like he was untamed, was actually the deputy leader of the Battle Wolves, Liao Deyi.","“Elder Xu, I won’t be so polite with you. Let me get straight to the point. Do you still remember the matter of the Everlasting Pill that I asked you about last time?” Liao Deyi said as he stared at Elder Xu.","“I do. It’s a sacred healing pill,” Elder Xu said, “Do yyou have a lead?”","He still remembered that he had indeed given Liao Deyi a list of medicinal herbs for the Everlasting Pill, but many of the medicinal herbs were very difficult to find. He had not expected that in just over a month, Liao Deyi had actually found all of them.","“That’s right. I’ve already collected all the herbs for the Everlasting Pill. Today, I’m here to ask you to come out of the woodworks and help me make it,” Liao Deyi quickly said.","“May I ask, who exactly is this pill for? If I don’t get a clear answer, I won’t make a move,” Elder Xu said.","“It’s for our gang leader!” Liao Deyi said anxiously."]},{"number":1195,"title":"Chapter 1195 I’m Not Free. Let Him Wait","paragraphs":["1195 I’m Not Free. Let Him Wait","“Your gang leader?” Elder Xu’s eyes immediately widened. He knew the powerful effects of the Endless Pill. As long as it was not a dead person, even if it was only a breath away, it could be pulled back.","It could be said to be a peerless healing pill, but it was also because of this that he could deduce the extent of the War Wolf Gang leader’s injuries. It was actually impossible to treat it without the Endless Life Pill.","Thinking of this was the most terrifying news!","That was because he had not received any news at all. However, judging from the fact that the Battle Wolf Gang’s leader needed the Endless Life Pill, he must have been severely injured. At the very least, even with his divine-tier cultivation base, he could not heal himself.","Once this news was spread, one could imagine how big a commotion it would cause!","The Battle Wolf Gang was able to become the largest gang in Dragon City largely because of the Battle Wolf Gang Leader’s powerful strength. If he was seriously injured and the news of his death spread, the consequences would be unimaginable.","He could guess that the Battle Wolf Gang must have completely sealed off the news from the beginning. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been unable to get any information.","After all, the Alchemist Society was still very well-informed. There were not many things big and small in Dragon City that could be hidden from them.","“That’s right. I’m sure you can guess that our sect master is seriously injured. Without the Endless Life Pill, there’s no way to treat him!” Liao Deyi gritted his teeth and said. Although this news was temporarily hidden, it was definitely impossible to continue hiding it. It was only a matter of time before it was exposed.","“Then I can’t do anything!” Elder Xu shook his head.","“Why?” Liao Deyi shouted.","“Because of the Endless Life Pill. With my strength, the success rate is less than 50%. If you want me to refine it just to be prepared, I can help you. But if you want to save someone, I have a 95% chance of failure. I will definitely fail. If you want me to refine it, I will definitely not agree!”","Elder Xu said. Although he was also very tempted, he knew the risks involved. If the refinement failed, the entire Battle Wolf Gang might tear him apart.","These people licked blood from their blades. If it really reached that point, they would not care about your identity.","“What about your guild leader?” Liao Deyi seemed to have thought of something.","” If our Guild Master takes action, there’s a 30% chance of success. If you can find an Alchemy Grandmaster, then you’ll probably have a 70% chance! ” Elder Xu said.","“Where can I find an Alchemy Grandmaster now? How about this? Take me to your president!” At this moment, Liao Deyi quickly said. Although the probability of 30% was not high, it was better than waiting for death.","“Unfortunately, our president has just returned to the capital overnight. If you want to find him to refine pills, I’m afraid you won’t be able to do it in less than ten days!” Elder Xu shook his head.","” I can wait, but how can our guild leader wait? Why is your guild leader back in Hillford at this time? ” Liao Deyi immediately became anxious. He knew that Elder Xu would not lie to him. In other words, the person who had the highest possibility of succeeding was the Alchemist Association’s President, Kong Buyi. However, Kong Buyi had left. What should he do?","” Actually, there’s someone else who should have a way to refine the Endless Life Pill. He might even be stronger than our president! ” Elder Xu thought for a moment and said.","“Who is it?” Liao Deyi’s eyes lit up as he quickly said.","“His name is Chu Yunfan!”","Elder Xu said a name.","A figure appeared on a bustling medicinal street. Just as many people were wondering who was so arrogant...","They saw who it was. It was the deputy leader of the Battle Wolf Gang, Liao Deyi.","“The Battle Wolf Gang reacted so quickly? He’s really fast!”","” I didn’t expect that Liao Deyi would come personally. Looks like there’s going to be another fierce battle! ”","“Looks like the Battle Wolves Gang is going to cause a ruckus!”","Soon, a group of people surrounded them.","In the elixir store, Wang Zhao, who was constantly putting out all kinds of elixirs, saw a robust middle-aged man striding over. He frowned slightly and said,”Are you here to buy medicinal pills?”","“Excuse me, is Master Chu here?” Liao Deyi looked at Wang Zhao and said.","“Master Chu? Oh, you mean Young Master!” Wang Zhao immediately reacted. However, he also heard the discussions of the others. He said,”You are the deputy leader of the Battle Wolf Gang!”","“Yes, that’s right!” Liao Deyi nodded.","” You’re here! ” Wang Zhao immediately looked as if he was facing a great enemy. ” I didn’t expect you to come so quickly. You’re really vengeful! ”","Liao Deyi didn’t know why Wang Zhao’s expression had changed so suddenly, but he knew that there was definitely a problem!","“I was wondering if there was an accident. I’m here to see Master Chu!” Liao Deyi quickly said.","“You’re not here to find trouble?” Wang Zhao frowned as he looked at Liao Deyi. He thought that Liao Deyi was here to stand up for Hall Master Liu. After all, no matter how he thought about it, this possibility should be the highest.","“That’s right. How could I be here to find trouble? I’m really here to look for Master Chu. Can I trouble you to inform him?” Liao Deyi didn’t know whether to laugh or cry.","“Since that’s the case, I’ll report it!” Wang Zhao couldn’t figure out what this vice sect leader was here for since he wasn’t here to pick a fight.","Wang Zhao quickly returned to the backyard, where Chu Hongcai was still fighting with An Xiuxiu. To be more precise, Chu Hongcai was taking a beating.","The speed at which the two of them fought was extremely fast, and it was dazzling to watch. Both of them were suppressing their magic power and true qi. From time to time, only the sound of ‘bang’,’ bang’, ‘bang’ could be heard, accompanied by Chu Hongcai’s miserable screams.","In a corner of the backyard, Chu Yunfan sat on a stone bench and watched Chu Hongcai being taught a lesson with interest. He would then give a few pointers from time to time.","“Young Master!” Wang Zhao quickly walked to Chu Yunfan’s side and said.","“What is it?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“There’s a deputy leader of the Battle Wolf Gang outside who wants to see you?” Wang Zhao said.","“You want to see me? Are you sure you’re not going to fight your way in?” Chu Yunfan was also a little puzzled.","“That’s right, he wants to see you!” Wang Zhao hurriedly said. “He doesn’t look like he’s here to cause trouble!”","“I’m not free. Let him wait!” Chu Yunfan said bluntly.","Wang Zhao almost choked on his saliva. That was the deputy leader of the Battle Wolf Gang. He was also a big shot in Dragon City. Now, his young master actually asked him to wait there.","This was even more miraculous than when Chu Yunfan had dealt with Liu Feng and Hall Master Liu."]},{"number":1196,"title":"Chapter 1196 You Want to Kill Me? Interesting!","paragraphs":["1196 You Want to Kill Me? Interesting!","Wang Zhao replied to Liao Deyi.","Liao Deyi was anxious. “I really have something urgent that needs attention. Can he make an exception?”","“What’s the use of being anxious? The young master said to wait. We’ll talk about it when he’s free,” Wang Zhao said as he glanced at Liao Deyi.","If it was in the past, such a big shot wouldn’t even look at him. But now, this big shot was begging him. This feeling was unprecedented.","!!","“Just wait here.”","Liao Deyi was so anxious that he almost wanted to make a move. However, he knew that it was absolutely impossible. Putting aside the fact that a person who could become a senior alchemist was surely powerful, they often had a wide network. Who knew how many people owed them favors?","If they dared to kidnap him, they would probably immediately stir up a hornet’s nest. Even the Alchemist Association would completely jump up.","Liao Deyi didn’t dare. What kind of person was a senior alchemist? He simply could not afford to offend them.","At this moment, more and more people surrounded him, and Liao Deyi became more and more anxious.","Chu Yunfan had just dealt with Hall Master Liu of the Battle Wolves. In many people’s eyes, Liao Deyi was clearly here to cause trouble, but he stood there obediently. There was no fight as many people had expected.","Two hours passed quickly, and the sun was getting hotter. Chu Yunfan had no intention of coming out, while Liao Deyi stood there without moving, allowing countless people around him to point at him.","“The owner of this shop is so arrogant. He even dares to ignore the deputy leader of the Battle Wolves.”","“Looks like he’s really a big shot with a strong background.”","“The owner of this shop must not be provoked.”","However, just as everyone was discussing, Liao Deyi unexpectedly shouted, “I am Liao Deyi, the deputy leader of the Battle Wolves. I wish to meet with Master Chu. I hope that can spare some time to meet me, Master Chu!”","Then, Liao Deyi gritted his teeth and knelt down in front of the shop. Instantly, the people who were originally discussing in low voices were in an uproar.","“Liao Deyi knelt down! How could this be?!”","“Who’s the owner of this shop? He called the owner ‘master’ too. Could he be a really powerful alchemist?”","Many people could guess that Liao Deyi must have something to ask the owner of this shop, Master Chu, but they didn’t expect Liao Deyi to kneel down in front of everyone.","While many people were discussing, suddenly, a series of footsteps came from afar. A group of people wearing the Battle Wolf logo—more than a hundred of them—quickly parted the crowd and rushed to the front of the shop.","“The Battle Wolves are here!” someone shouted, and everyone immediately stepped aside, afraid that they would be intimidated by the hundreds of mighty Battle Wolves warriors.","Someone recognized that among the hundreds of people, every one of them was an expert at the seventh Innate Stage or above. There were even a few Divine hall masters among them. The person leading them was the famous deputy leader of the Battle Wolves, Chen Ke.","Many people gasped when they saw this lineup. The Battle Wolves’ strength was indeed far beyond. Just the tip of the iceberg was already far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","However, what was even more strange to them was that one of the deputy leaders, Chen Ke, and the others had come over aggressively, while the other one was kneeling in front of the shop. No one understood what was going on.","“Chen Ke, why are you here?” Liao Deyi instantly spotted Chen Ke.","Chen Ke was the first to see Liao Deyi kneeling here. The two of them were not on good terms. Now that he saw Liao Deyi kneeling here, they could not help but be interested.","“Liao Deyi, this is very elegant of you,” Chen Ke said with a cold smile.","“Chen Ke, what are you doing here?” Liao Deyi said as he looked at Chen Ke coldly.","“Why do you care if I’m here? But I guess there’s no harm in telling you. I heard that someone here is blind and dared to offend the Battle Wolves. I want to see who it is,” Chen Ke said with a cold smile.","Liao Deyi instantly understood why Master Chu had disappeared the moment he heard that he was from the Battle Wolves. He had been wondering why Master Chu, whom he had never met before, was so hostile toward him. Now he understood everything. It was all Chen Ke’s fault.","The only person who could help him was Master Chu. Chen Ke and the others were reckless and dared to cause trouble for Master Chu. Liao Deyi was so angry that he was about to explode.","“So, you’re here to find trouble with Master Chu?” Liao Deyi said coldly.","“What Master Chu? I think his surname is Chu. But it doesn’t matter. Today, I’ll let him know why flowers are red.","“It was you, you b*stard!”","Liao Deyi immediately jumped up from the ground and threw a punch.","In an instant, a terrifying power was released, and the punch directly landed on Chen Ke’s face.","Chen Ke was caught off guard and was instantly sent flying. A few members of the Battle Wolves behind him were unable to dodge in time and were instantly heavily injured.","Chen Ke got up from the ground and stared at Liao Deyi. He shouted, “Liao Deyi, are you crazy?! How dare you hit me!”","“Of course, I dare! I can’t wait to beat you to death!” Liao Deyi said angrily, “Do you know who is inside? Master Chu is the only one who can make the Everlasting Pill. If you dare to get in the way of this matter, I’ll kill you!”","When Liao Deyi said this, his expression was extremely ferocious. No one would doubt that he would do that after seeing him like this.","Chen Ke’s eyes flashed with countless fierce gazes as he said coldly, “I don’t care what Master Chu is. I’m going to kill him today!”","“Chen Ke, are you going to betray the gang?” Liao Deyi asked coldly.","“Liao Deyi, do you think you are still the same as before? Originally, I just wanted to teach him a lesson, but since you said so, he will definitely die today!” Chen Ke grinned as he said this. A terrifying aura was also released from his body. The aura of a seventh-tier Divine instantly erupted.","Compared to Hall Master Liu’s aura, Chen Ke’s strength was much stronger.","Everyone on the street was stunned by this fierce aura.","“Liao Deyi, I’ve been unhappy with you for a long time. Today, I want to see how you’re going to stop me!” Chen Ke shouted.","“All right, then I’ll kill you!” Liao Deyi was also going all out. A terrifying aura burst out. Compared to Chen Ke, it was not inferior at all. In fact, it was even slightly stronger.","“You want to kill me? Interesting. Let’s see if you can do it!” At this moment, a clear voice came from inside the shop."]},{"number":1197,"title":"Chapter 1197 Killing Chen Ke in One Slap","paragraphs":["1197 Killing Chen Ke in One Slap","A slender figure slowly walked out of the shop along with this clear voice. The terrifying power released by the two of them could not even affect him in the slightest. Only his clothes fluttered up and down along with the aura of the two people colliding.","“You are...” Liao Deyi had yet to confirm who the person was.","On the other side, Chen Ke had already made his move. In an instant, his terrifying aura was like Mount Tai pressing down on Chu Yunfan.","“So, you’re Master Chu? Go to hell!”","Chen Ke’s roar shook the entire street.","“You’re so noisy,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Chen Ke instantly rushed toward Chu Yunfan and slapped his hand down.","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He just casually slapped out, and the huge hand of energy was directly slapped into nothingness. Then, his palm smacked Chen Ke’s head.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, Chen Ke’s head exploded like a watermelon. Then, his headless body flew out like a kite with a broken string. Instantly, the entire place was dead silent. Everyone was completely dumbfounded.","What was brutal? This was brutal.","Even the most optimistic person who had estimated Chu Yunfan’s strength didn’t expect Chen Ke, the famous expert and the deputy leader of the Battle Wolves, to be so vulnerable in front of him.","His head was smashed by Chu Yunfan’s slap. He was dead!","It was no different from smashing a fly!","“If the tiger doesn’t show its might, others will think it’s a sick cat,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently as if he had just swatted a fly to death.","It did not look like he had just casually killed a Divine.","He couldn’t even be bothered to look at a person of such a level. After all, even though he was also at the seventh level of the Divine Abilities Stage, his combat strength was enough to completely surpass Chen Ke.","He could not even count how many Divine of this level he had killed. The others feared Chen Ke, but to him, Chen Ke was nothing more than a skeleton in a coffin.","Besides the crowd, the only one who was dumbfounded was Liao Deyi. He had yet to react to what was going on. Whether it was Chen Ke’s sudden attack or Chu Yunfan’s sudden slap, they were all out of his expectations.","After the initial shock, he suddenly felt a chill down his spine. He thought that his strength was still above Chen Ke’s, but that was only slightly stronger. He did not even dare to imagine that Chu Yunfan could kill Chen Ke with a single slap.","What a joke. Chu Yunfan had the ability to kill Chen Ke with one slap so didn’t that mean that he had the ability to kill him with one slap too?","Even the gang leader couldn’t do something so terrifying!","The experts that Chen Ke had brought with him were all dumbfounded. They were so scared that they felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave. They couldn’t even move.","“I’ll give you a small punishment. All of you, kneel!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","Immediately, as if they had received an order, they involuntarily fell to their knees. Hundreds of people knelt on the street in unison. The scene was extremely shocking.","They struggled to get up, but they saw Chu Yunfan casually make a seal. A huge seal word suddenly appeared above them, and this seal word firmly suppressed them. Regardless of whether it was an Innate or a Divine, they were unable to break this seal talisman.","The scene was still completely silent. No one had reacted to this series of changes, whether it was Chu Yunfan’s slap that killed Chen Ke or the casual word “seal” that sealed hundreds of experts.","This kind of strength was undoubtedly far beyond their previous estimation of Chu Yunfan.","This shop owner, this Master Chu that Liao Deyi mentioned, had probably reached an unbelievable level of cultivation.","After doing all this, Chu Yunfan acted as if he had done something insignificant and said to Liao Deyi, “I was originally too lazy to see you, but seeing that you don’t seem to be the same as these people and that you’re sincere, come with me.”","Chu Yunfan turned around and walked into the shop. Liao Deyi finally came back to his senses. He felt as if he had been pardoned. He looked at Chen Ke, who had become a headless corpse, and suddenly felt a chill.","He didn’t know if Master Chu was like what Elder Xu had said. He had reached the acme of perfection in alchemy, but at least in martial arts, he had terrifying skills that he couldn’t see through. This was true.","Normally, if someone dared to kill the deputy leader of the Battle Wolves, it would definitely cause a huge uproar in the entire gang. However, under such circumstances, he did not even dare to think about revenge. That was simply courting death.","Chu Yunfan and Liao Deyi disappeared from everyone’s sight, and everyone finally took a deep breath. They were completely in an uproar. Looking at Chen Ke’s corpse, everyone’s eyes flashed with horror. There was no doubt that in the eyes of many people, the owner of this shop had been equated to a demon from hell.","With such strength, in the entire Conglong City, he would be one of the top experts.","Soon, Chu Yunfan brought Liao Deyi to the reception room of the shop. Chu Yunfan sat down, but Liao Deyi didn’t dare to sit down in front of Chu Yunfan and continued to stand.","If he had softened his attitude before because he had a favor to ask of others, then now, he was truly frightened by Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan had killed Chen Ke, who was about the same strength as him, with one slap. This kind of strength was something he didn’t even dare to imagine.","“I’m Liao Deyi, the deputy leader of the Battle Wolf Gang. Greetings, Master Chu,” Liao Deyi quickly said.","“The one I just killed seemed to be the deputy leader of your gang. It doesn’t matter, right?” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Liao Deyi with a faint smile.","“It’s okay, of course, it’s okay. That guy brought it upon himself!”","Thinking of this, Liao Deyi’s anger rose. Chen Ke clearly knew how important the Everlasting Pill was to the gang leader, but he still wanted to kill Master Chu. His heart was really despicable.","Chen Ke had long been disloyal!","“It’s good that it’s okay. But it doesn’t matter if it’s related. I’ve killed more people than I can count.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Liao Deyi didn’t dare to ignore Chu Yunfan’s words. He was afraid that Chu Yunfan was telling the truth."]},{"number":1198,"title":"Chapter 1198 Critical Situation","paragraphs":["1198 Critical Situation","Although he didn’t know where Chu Yunfan killed the people, it was clear from the way Chu Yunfan was being so casual that it was the truth.","However, he still took a closer look at Chu Yunfan. He was extremely shocked. This time, he was not shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength, but by Chu Yunfan’s age.","Based on his experience, Liao Deyi could tell that Chu Yunfan was definitely in his twenties. When he was in his twenties, he had barely entered the Divine Abilities Stage. Even so, he was still considered a genius and was targeted by the Battle Wolves.","Even the gang leader did not hesitate to take him in as a disciple and train him with all his might. After so many years, their relationship had long been like that of father and son. Otherwise, he would not have knelt down before Chu Yunfan in public.","!!","However, Chu Yunfan was able to kill Divines as easily as eating and drinking at his age. How could there be such a genius and monster in this world?","“Thank you for your understanding, Master Chu,” Liao Deyi quickly said.","“I didn’t want to care at first, but seeing that you’ve already knelt down, I’d like to hear why you’re looking for me,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“I need your help in making the Everlasting Pill, Master Chu,” Liao Deyi said.","If he had some doubts about Master Chu’s strength before, then now he had none. Although the strength of martial arts could not explain anything, it was enough to prove that Master Chu was a person who lived up to his reputation.","He had heard about Chu Yunfan from Elder Xu before this, and he still thought it was an incredible miracle. He had actually become a senior alchemist in a day at such a young age.","He knew what a senior alchemist was. The difficulty of the Alchemist Association producing a senior alchemist was several times greater than the difficulty of producing a peak Divine martial artist.","“The Everlasting Pill? That’s a medicinal pill that can revive the dead. The one in your gang who’s seriously injured must be your leader, correct?”","Chu Yunfan thought about it for a moment and immediately thought of all the points. He was no stranger to the Everlasting Pill. With the effects of this pill, many things were easy to deduce.","“That’s right, it’s our leader.” Liao Deyi did not dare to hide it, but his face revealed a surprised expression. Just from the matter of making the Everlasting Pill, Chu Yunfan could deduce that this matter was related to their gang leader. This ability could be said to be heaven-defying.","“As long as you’re willing to help, we’re willing to pay any price, Master Chu,” Liao Deyi said.","“No problem, but I have a few conditions,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Master Chu, please go ahead. As long as we can do it, we’ll do it even if we have to go through a mountain of knives or a sea of fire,” Liao Deyi said.","“Don’t worry, I don’t need you to go through a mountain of knives or a sea of fire,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “First, I want a refining fee of five million low-grade spirit stones.”","“Done.”","Liao Deyi agreed immediately. A fee of five million low-grade spirit stones was an astronomical price. Even with the wealth of the Battle Wolves, they would feel extremely distressed. However, compared to the gang leader’s injuries, it was nothing.","“Other than that, I also want two Divine monster cores,” Chu Yunfan continued.","“Done,” Liao Deyi promised as he thumped his chest. Compared to five million low-grade spirit stones, the inner cores of two Divine monsters were nothing. “There’s one in our sect right now. I’ll get someone to send it to you immediately.”","“Also, I’ll give you a list of medicinal herbs later. Help me collect them. As for the price, I’ll give it to you according to the market price. I won’t let you suffer a loss,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Thank you, Master Chu. As long as you’re willing to help, leave everything to me,” Liao Deyi said.","“In that case, let’s go,” Chu Yunfan said, “This matter should be done sooner rather than later.”","For Chu Yunfan, there were only a few days left. Naturally, he had to make the most of it.","“Uh, Master Chu, making the Everlasting Pill is no small matter. Don’t you need to prepare? Do you need any assistants?” Liao Deyi asked as he looked at Chu Yunfan carefully.","“What preparations do I need to make to make it?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Liao Deyi was a little stunned. From the time he started preparing the ingredients for the Everlasting Pill, he had understood the difficulty of making it through various means. Even a senior alchemist only had a 30% chance of success. Only an alchemist master could have a 70% chance.","Why did Master Chu make it sound so easy?","However, he had no other choice. The gang leader’s injuries could not wait any longer.","The Battle Wolves’ headquarters was located in a quiet forest in the east of the city. If it wasn’t for Liao Deyi leading the way, Chu Yunfan would never have thought that there was such a base here.","At this moment, the entire base was heavily guarded, and the atmosphere seemed to be filled with a solemn air.","Chu Yunfan and Liao Deyi had just arrived at the base when someone immediately ran up to Liao Deyi and said, “It doesn’t look good, Deputy Liao. The leader is dying!”","“How could this be?” Liao Deyi asked, “Wasn’t he fine before?”","“The doctors said that the gang leader is already an arrow at the end of its flight. He’s like a lamp that has run out of oil,” the man hurriedly said.","“D*mn it, how could this be?!” Liao Deyi was so anxious that he couldn’t even care about Chu Yunfan. He quickly went deeper into the base.","Chu Yunfan followed him at a moderate pace. They soon entered the depths of the base without encountering any obstacles. Soon, he followed Liao Deyi to a bedroom in a courtyard inside the base.","Before Chu Yunfan entered, he could already smell the smell of various decoctions wafting out from the bedroom. This place clearly had been a ward for a long time.","Chu Yunfan looked around. There was a bed in the bedroom, and on the bed lay a skinny old man. At this moment, blood was flowing out of the corner of the old man’s mouth. His face was pale and he looked like he was about to die.","There was a group of people surrounding the old man. Among them, there was a group of martial artists with valiant auras. Each of them was an expert in the Divine Abilities Stage. They were the experts of the Battle Wolves.","On the other side, there were a few doctors.","“How did this happen?!” Liao Deyi asked loudly as he strode in.","“Deputy Liao, we’ve tried our best. We can’t do anything to save the leader unless you can obtain the Everlasting Pill,” one of the physicians said."]},{"number":1199,"title":"Chapter 1199 Saving People, Pill Success","paragraphs":["1199 Saving People, Pill Success","“Then what’s the use of keeping you lot around? We paid a lot of money to invite you here, and this is how you save people?!” Liao Deyi shouted angrily.","The doctors were all silent out of fear but there was a hint of anger on their faces. They were all respected doctors, and yet, they were being yelled at by Liao Deyi.","Pfft!","The leader of the Battle Wolves spat out another mouthful of blood while everyone was arguing.","!!","Everyone was instantly anxious. This time, even Liao Deyi had no way out.","“Let me try.”","Suddenly, when everyone was at a loss, Chu Yunfan stepped forward.","“Master Chu?” Liao Deyi looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. His face flashed with hope, like a drowning man who finally caught a life raft.","The doctors looked at the young man strangely, and their faces were filled with suspicion. How could this young man do something that even they couldn’t?","“I should be able to save him.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“All right. Thank you, Master Chu,” Liao Deyi quickly said. He had no other choice at this time. The other doctors had already sentenced the leader to death. At this time, he could only try his best.","Chu Yunfan immediately took a step forward and used his divine power to force out a long needle from his fingertip. He had finally recovered a little bit of divine power yesterday. Although it was only a little, it was enough.","The long needle condensed from divine power pierced into the leader’s chest.","Chu Yunfan’s movements were accurate and ruthless. He didn’t even think about it and directly plunged in. The doctors all cried out in surprise. Wasn’t this kid just messing around?","Even Liao Deyi was bewildered. Chu Yunfan’s move looked too violent.","However, the strange thing was that the leader, who had been bleeding from the corner of his mouth, stopped bleeding after Chu Yunfan did this.","Then, they saw Chu Yunfan’s dazzling technique. Like a goddess scattering flowers, he pierced the leader’s body with long needles formed by divine power. One by one, a foot-long magic needle pierced the leader’s body.","Looking at it made one’s entire body go numb.","After fifteen minutes, Chu Yunfan finally stopped and heaved a sigh of relief. The leader’s injuries were more serious than he had imagined. He could easily tell that the Battle Wolf leader had already reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. Such a person was at the peak of the world.","And such a person had been forced to the point where he vomited blood and was on the brink of death. One could imagine how badly his body had collapsed. It had basically turned into scorched earth. Even with the powerful recovery abilities of a Divine, he was unable to recover. This was the most terrifying thing.","Liao Deyi, who was watching from the side, heaved a sigh of relief. Although the leader’s injuries hadn’t improved, at least they hadn’t gotten worse and he no longer vomited blood.","“Master Chu, is the leader all better now?” Liao Deyi said.","“Right now, I’m using needles to stabilize his injuries and seal them. However, this situation won’t last long. It can only last for three days at most. Therefore, I have to make the Everlasting Pill within three days,” Chu Yunfan said.","In fact, this kind of injury was not a terminal illness for Chu Yunfan. If his cultivation was still there, he could help the leader heal. However, his current divine power was only enough to form some magical needles. It was impossible to bring the leader back to life.","A good doctor might not necessarily be a good alchemist, but a good alchemist was definitely a doctor with superb medical skills. This was because the pills refined were meant for human consumption. If one did not know the human body like the back of their hand, the pills one made would kill people.","“That’s good, that’s good!” Liao Deyi quickly said. He let out a long sigh of relief. Before this, he felt like the sky was falling and the earth was crumbling. Now, at least Chu Yunfan had saved the leader’s life for a bit.","“Thank you, Master Chu!”","“I’m just taking someone’s money and helping them get out of trouble. I don’t have time to think about it now. Where’s the alchemy lab? I need to start making the pill now.” Chu Yunfan waved his hand.","“I’ll bring you there, Master Chu.”","Liao Deyi quickly led the way and brought them to another lab in the base. At this time, the furnace fire in the lab was already lit, and various medicinal herbs were already piled up like mountains.","Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything else and immediately got to work.","If Liao Deyi still had doubts about Chu Yunfan’s level in the beginning, then now, he had no doubts.","Chu Yunfan’s movements were as smooth as flowing water. This was the first time he saw someone producing a different kind of beauty when making pills. Chu Yunfan’s every move was naturala and without any extra movements.","There were many alchemy apprentices and even full-fledged alchemists in the Battle Wolf Gang, but they were all extremely nervous when it came to making pills, unlike Chu Yunfan, who could do it so easily.","After seeing Chu Yunfan, who looked like he had made pills thousands of times before, Liao Deyi no longer had any thoughts of worry.","Master Chu was even more amazing than Elder Xu of the Alchemist Association had said. Even for a medicinal pill like the Everlasting Pill, Chu Yunfan was still confident.","It was as if he did not even have to look at the pill formula.","The refining process lasted for a full day and night. Chu Yunfan moved from time to time. Behind him, Liao Deyi did not move at all. His eyes were fixed on the alchemic furnace, afraid that Chu Yunfan would fail in the blink of an eye.","In the beginning, he was extremely worried. After all, according to Elder Xu, even Kong Buyi only had a 30% chance of success. However, Chu Yunfan had broken this theory.","Everything he did seemed to have been rehearsed and calculated countless times. There was no mistake at all. All the steps were like flowing water.","Towards the end, Liao Deyi gradually became less nervous. He didn’t know about alchemy, but he could see that as long as Chu Yunfan continued in this matter, there shouldn’t be any possibility of failure.","Finally, a day passed. The entire lab was filled with white smoke, and a rich medicinal fragrance assaulted their noses.","Just by inhaling a few mouthfuls of the medicinal fragrance, Liao Deyi felt that the injuries on his body showed signs of improvement.","“It’s done.”","Chu Yunfan walked to the furnace and opened the lid. A thumb-sized pill was lying quietly inside. He took it out and handed it to Liao Deyi.","“The medicinal pill has been made. Take it.”","“Thank you, Master Chu!” Liao Deyi quickly took the pill.","At this time, he couldn’t care less about being rude. He quickly turned around and rushed to the leader’s bedroom."]},{"number":1200,"title":"Chapter 1200 Ten Days, the Winds Start Up","paragraphs":["1200 Ten Days, the Winds Start Up","Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry. He sat down cross-legged and absorbed the medicinal fragrance in the air.","Soon, the medicinal fragrance was absorbed by Chu Yunfan, and his injuries recovered a little.","He sighed. Although the Everlasting Pill was magical, it was not enough to treat his injuries, because his injuries were worse than the leader’s. There were too many inexplicable spatial powers within him, and it was not easy to get rid of them.","However, it should be very soon. It shouldn’t be long before his strength recovered.","!!","Not long after, there was another burst of hurried footsteps. Liao Deyi rushed back into the lab. Unlike his previous nervous self, his face now revealed a wide smile.","“Master Chu, you’re amazing! After we helped him consume the pill, the leader immediately got better!”","“You must have received guidance from an expert to be able to think of refining the Everlasting Pill, right?” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","“That’s right.” Liao Deyi looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. He didn’t know how Chu Yunfan guessed it.","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. That was a very natural thing. There were many types of healing pills in the world, but there were not many that could treat such a situation. That was why Chu Yunfan said that there should be an expert behind Liao Deyi.","“All right, since your leader is fine now, I’ll be leaving,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Okay, I’ll get someone to deliver your reward later,” Liao Deyi said respectfully.","“Okay.”","Chu Yunfan wasn’t in a hurry. He believed that Liao Deyi wouldn’t dare to go back on the reward. Even if he did, so what? At most, he just had to come here again. But at that time, it wouldn’t be as simple as just a little reward.","When Chu Yunfan returned to the shop, many people had gathered around to watch what was happening. They had heard that many of the Battle Wolves were kneeling in front of the shop.","When they saw Chu Yunfan return, they all looked at him in shock.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care. Anyway, he didn’t use much divine power at that time. At most, he could suppress these people for a few days.","Not long after he returned, Liao Deyi sent the rewards he had promised. Other than the five million low-grade spirit stones, there were also two Divine monster cores.","Other than that, Liao Deyi had heard from somewhere that Chu Yunfan was collecting medicinal herbs to make the Divinity Nourishment Pill. He asked someone to collect them and send them over the next day.","Chu Yunfan didn’t say it on the surface, but he was very satisfied in his heart. Liao Deyi really knew how to behave. Whether it was to repay his kindness or to establish relations with an alchemy master, this matter really made Chu Yunfan very satisfied.","With Liao Deyi’s help, Chu Yunfan quickly gathered the ingredients for the Divinity Nourishment Pill. In the next few days, he spent his time making pills and healing his injuries.","Time passed in the blink of an eye. Finally, it was Situ Miaoyi’s birthday. The Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion, which had been opened on Pill Street, was as crowded as a market.","After the Battle Wolves were taught a lesson, Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion became famous overnight. Due to Chu Yunfan’s powerful strength, many people believed in the quality of this pill shop.","Some people wanted to buy pills to get close to Chu Yunfan, but after that, Chu Yunfan never showed up again so their thoughts fell through.","With the Battle Wolves as an example, they naturally did not dare to be impudent and did not dare to barge in. However, they soon discovered that the quality of the pills sold in Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion was at least 50% better than that of other medicinal stores. There were even many cases where the medicinal effects were twice as good.","Moreover, the price was the same as other similar types of medicinal pills. This made many martial artists ecstatic. This was undoubtedly an extra life.","As a result, the pills in Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion were swept clean the moment they were put on the shelves. The supply was not enough to meet the demand. This situation also caused dissatisfaction in many of the surrounding pill shops. This was stealing their business.","However, Chu Yunfan’s shocking move of slapping Chen Ke to death was very effective. After thinking about it again and again, many people were not prepared to cause trouble with Chu Yunfan.","What a joke. An upper-stage Divine was killed by a single slap. The owner of this shop was so powerful that it made people shudder just thinking about it.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t have that much time to constantly make pills and the supply of pills in Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion was limited. Although he had snatched away the best customers, it wasn’t to the extent that other pill shops couldn’t make profits.","A strange balance was still maintained.","At this moment, in the backyard, Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back. A layer of divine power was vaguely boiling around him. Compared to ten days ago, his strength had recovered a little, and he could mobilize a lot more divine power. He could already form a protective energy shield.","Behind him, Wang Zhao followed respectfully, not daring to be impudent in the slightest.","In these ten days, Wang Zhao had truly witnessed what was called magic, not to mention Chu Yunfan’s terrifying martial arts strength. Even when it came to alchemy, it made Wang Zhao feel like prostrating himself on the ground. He could only refine a few pills per cauldron, and that was already his best effort.","However, Chu Yunfan’s alchemy skills were simply an eye-opener for him. For example, even when Chu Yunfan was making hundreds of ordinary pills in a furnace, he was not afraid of making mistakes.","He had never seen anyone who could make pills so calmly. Refining a few hundred pills was as easy as refining a few. There was no difficulty at all as if he had made pills countless times.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan did not use the alchemic fire unique to alchemists. It was a miracle that he could make hundreds of pills in one furnace without the alchemic fire.","Chu Yunfan only made one batch of pills a day, and then he would stop. This was the fundamental reason why the stocks in Shanhe Alchemy Pavilion had always been in short supply.","Besides Chu Yunfan, Wang Zhao also knew how to refine pills, but compared to Chu Yunfan’s scale, it was nothing.","No matter how tricky the questions were, Chu Yunfan could easily answer them as if he already had a standard answer.","In just a few days, Wang Zhao felt that his level had developed by leaps and bounds. His foundation was very solid, and what he lacked was someone to guide him.","All the difficult problems he had encountered in alchemy over the years had been solved. In Chu Yunfan’s words, it was not difficult for him to take the examination to become a junior alchemist."]}]);
